<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="PSA" style="id">'- Kutu Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Zabuli</para>
  <para style="toc1">Kitabu cha Zabuli</para>
  <para style="toc2">Zabuli</para>
  <para style="toc3">Zab</para>
  <para style="mt2">Kitabu cha Zabuli</para>
  <para style="mt1">Zabuli</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongozi</para>
  <para style="ip">Kitabu cha Zabuli awo mduganyo wa nyila na kupula. Kwa ulonzi wa Kiebulania mbuli ya zabuli kihindukizo chake, “Lwila lwa nhogolwa.” Zabuli nyingi, nyila za kumtogola Imulungu, lakini vivija zabaho aina ziyagwe za zabuli. Ziyagwe kupula ili Imulungu yataze na ziyagwe kuiyalala kulagusa usungu. Kuna nyila za kumgwaa nhogolwa mndewa wa Izilaeli, kuna nyila za kuwafunza wanhu nzewele na gaja golondigwa na Imulungu na vinhu viyagwe. Kitabu cha Zabuli chandikigwa na wanhu wengi na kiduganyigwa kwa miyaka kubanza gana dimoja. Zabuli ziyagwe za umwaka, na zandikigwa mkipindi cha mndewa Daudi. Bibilia yolonga kamba Daudi kandika zabuli nyingi. Zabuli ziyagwe zandikigwa kipindi Wayahudi viwabwelile kulawa kuuhamizo ako Babeli. Wanhu oifunza vinhu otogola kamba mduganyo wa zabuli uvikila uhelelo mwiikaline ya kadatu mbaka ya ikane, Kilisito yang'hali Kuvumbuka. Zabuli zose kwa zose zikala gana dimoja na malongo matano na azo zigoligwa mmafungu matano madodo.</para>
  <para style="ip">Iwe nyila hebu kupula, zabuli zose zandikigwa kwa ushaili. Kutanga ushaili wa Kiebulania otaza kujuwa kitabu cha Zabuli. Kinhu kikulu cha ushaili wa Kiebulania chokemigwa vinhu vichola hamoja. Mwandikaji miyanza mingi kokwika hamoja misitali mibili kwa nzila nyingi. Tanhu lola, kamba msitali wa ichanduso olonga mbuli kamba viili, avo msitali wa kabili olonga kwa nzila zino ndatu, sengine obwelela mbuli ayo viyagwe hebu olonga mbuli zilema acho kilongigwe hebu olonga mbuli ayo kwa kugendelela.</para>
  <para style="ip">Kitabu cha Zabuli acho kitabu kijugwa goya na chonogeligwa mna Ibibilia. Zabuli nyingi zitumika kutambikila mwiing'anda ya Imulungu ako Yelusalemu. Zabuli zotufunza kupula na kumtogola Imulungu yeli Uchanha Ng'hani. Zabuli ya 23 iwahoza mizoyo wanhu wengi wakalile oiyalala. Zabuli ya 51 iwatenda wanhu wengi wazilonge nzambi zao kwa Imulungu na Imulungu yazigelele kumgongo. Zabuli ya 110 igala kugangamala na tamanilo kwa kulonga kwiza kwa Masihi yonda yawe mndewa na mulava nhosa.</para>
  <para style="iot">Mbuli zili mkitabu</para>
  <para style="io">1. Kitabu cha ichanduso cha Zabuli kulawa sula ya 1-41.</para>
  <para style="io">2. Kitabu cha kabili cha Zabuli kulawa sula ya 42-72.</para>
  <para style="io">3. Kitabu cha kadatu cha Zabuli kulawa sula ya 73-89.</para>
  <para style="io">4. Kitabu cha ikane cha Zabuli kulawa sula ya 90-106.</para>
  <para style="io">5. Kitabu cha tano cha Zabuli kulawa sula ya 107-150.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="PSA 1"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 1</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 1:1"/>Kamweda imunhu hacholaga mvitala va iwanhu otenda gehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 1:1">na hakwima bule mnzila ya iwanhu otenda nzambi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 1:1">na hakala bule mvigoda va iwanhu wagewezi,<verse eid="PSA 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 1:2"/>lakini kogadeng'helela malagizo ga Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 1:2">na kogagelegeza imisi na ikilo.<verse eid="PSA 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 1:3"/>Ayo kaigala na biki dihandigwe kumgwazo wa vizanda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 1:3">dolela matunda mkipindi chake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 1:3">mijani yake hainyalaga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 1:3">Kila kinhu kiyotenda chomweda.<verse eid="PSA 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 1:4"/>Iwanhu wehile haweli vivo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 1:4">lakini waigala na mipepe ihembeluswa na beho.<verse eid="PSA 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 1:5"/>Avo iwanhu wehile ogwa kipindi cha nhaguso,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 1:5">na iwanhu wene nzambi honda wawe mumo mumting'hano wa iwanhu wanogile,<verse eid="PSA 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 1:6"/>kwavija Mndewa Imulungu koijuwa inzila ya iwanhu wanogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 1:6">lakini inzila ya iwanhu wehile yohelela mkupotela.<verse eid="PSA 1:6"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="PSA 2"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 2</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 2:1"/>Habali iwanhu wa isi ziyagwe opanga gehile?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:1">Habali iwanhu okala kiseto cha ubozi?<verse eid="PSA 2:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 2:2"/>Iwandewa wa mwiisi waitanda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:2">na iwakulu okala kiseto,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:2">mbuli ya Mndewa Imulungu na mbuli ya ayo iyamsagule, olonga,<verse eid="PSA 2:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 2:3"/>“Leka tukanhe minyololo yao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:3">na tuvitupe ivifungilo vao.”<verse eid="PSA 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 2:4"/>Heyo yokala kuulanga koseka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:4">Mndewa kowabezeli vuwogelegeza.<verse eid="PSA 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 2:5"/>Abaho kolonga na hewo mna ing'hasiliki yake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:5">na kowadumbiza mna ing'hasiliki, kolonga,<verse eid="PSA 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 2:6"/>“Na niye nimwika mndewa wangu uchanha ya Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:6">ulugongo lwangu lung'ala.”<verse eid="PSA 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 2:7"/>Nodipeta lagizo da Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:7">Mndewa Imulungu kanilongela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:7">“Gweye kwa mwanangu, lelo niye nikulela.<verse eid="PSA 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 2:8"/>Nipule na niye nokugwaa iwanhu wa isi zose wawe uhazi wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:8">na isi yose yokuwa yako gweye.<verse eid="PSA 2:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 2:9"/>Kowabena kwa fimbo ya zuma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:9">na kowahonda vihande vihande kamba nongo ya mulumba.”<verse eid="PSA 2:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 2:10"/>Avo sambi, mweye wandewa, muwe na nzewele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:10">tegelezeni vimzumwa, mweye iwakulu wa isi.<verse eid="PSA 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 2:11"/>Mumsang'hanile Mndewa Imulungu kwa kumdumba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:11">na mudeng'helele kwa kugwaya.<verse eid="PSA 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 2:12"/>Mtambikileni imwana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:12">buleavo kogevuzika na kuwabananga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:12">kwavija ng'hasiliki yake yodaha kwaka himahima.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:12">Wamweda wose omkimbilila.<verse eid="PSA 2:12"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="PSA 3"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 3</para>
  <para style="d">(Zabuli ya Daudi mbuli ya kipindi viyamkimbile imwana Abisalomu.)<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:0 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola kitabu cha 2 Samweli 15-17.</char></note></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 3:1"/>Go Mndewa Imulungu, iwanhu onihila wengi ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 3:1">wanhu wengi ondema.<verse eid="PSA 3:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 3:2"/>Wengi onongela, “Haduhu ukombola kumwake kulawa kwa Imulungu.”<verse eid="PSA 3:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 3:3"/>Lakini gweye Mndewa Imulungu kwa ngao yangu kila mwambu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 3:3">kwa ukulu wangu, na konigangamiza.<verse eid="PSA 3:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 3:4"/>Nimulilila Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 3:4">na heyo kanidika kulawa kulugongo lwake lung'ala.<verse eid="PSA 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 3:5"/>Nitambalala na kuwasa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 3:5">nilamuka kabili kwavija Mndewa Imulungu kanidahiza.<verse eid="PSA 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 3:6"/>Siwadumba iwanhu maelufu kwa maelufu onihila wanizunguluke kila mwambu.<verse eid="PSA 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 3:7"/>Go Mndewa Imulungu, winuke!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 3:7">Nihonye gweye Imulungu wangu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 3:7">Gweye kowabena zisaya iwanhu wose onihila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 3:7">kowabena imizino iwanhu wehile.<verse eid="PSA 3:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 3:8"/>Ukombola olawa kwa Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 3:8">ukumweda kwako kukale kwa iwanhu wako.<verse eid="PSA 3:8"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="PSA 4"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 4</para>
  <para style="d">(Zabuli ya Daudi. Kwa kilanja, yatumie nyuzi za bango.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 4:1"/>Gweye Imulungu wa haki yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 4:1">unidike nahakupula.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 4:1">Ving'halile mmagazo, gweye kunitaza.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 4:1">Unyonele bazi na utegeleze kupula kwangu.<verse eid="PSA 4:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 4:2"/>“Mweye iwanhu, mbaka lini ukulu wangu ogalamuka kinyala?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 4:2">Mbaka lini monogelwa na ubozi na kulonga uvizi?”<verse eid="PSA 4:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 4:3"/>Lakini muvijuwe kamba Mndewa Imulungu, kaisagulila iwanhu wake otamanilwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 4:3">Mndewa Imulungu kohulika nahamkema.<verse eid="PSA 4:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 4:4"/>Gwaeni kwa bwembwe na sikumutende nzambi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 4:4">mkale mvisazi venu na mugelegeze mmizoyo yenu.<verse eid="PSA 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 4:5"/>Laveni nhosa zilondigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 4:5">na mumtamanile Mndewa Imulungu.<verse eid="PSA 4:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 4:6"/>Wanhu wengi olonga, “Nani yonda yatulagusile ganogile?”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 4:6">Gweye Mndewa Imulungu utumwemwesele mng'alo wa ikihanga chako.<verse eid="PSA 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 4:7"/>Gweye kuumemeza moyo wangu deng'ho kulu kubanza indiya na divai nyingi iwasengile.<verse eid="PSA 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 4:8"/>Kwa tindiwalo notambalala na kuwasa utulo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 4:8">kwavija gweye wiiyeka Mndewa Imulungu konitenda nikale goya.<verse eid="PSA 4:8"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="PSA 5"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 5</para>
  <para style="d">(Zabuli ya Daudi. Kwa kilanja, yatumie filimbi.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 5:1"/>Utegeleze mbuli zangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:1">gweye Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:1">ulole kugutilila kwangu.<verse eid="PSA 5:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 5:2"/>Utegeleze sauti ya kililo changu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:2">Mndewa wangu na Imulungu wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:2">gweye ayo nikupula.<verse eid="PSA 5:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 5:3"/>Go Mndewa Imulungu, imitondo kotegeleza sauti yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:3">imitondo nokupula abaho nobeta.<verse eid="PSA 5:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 5:4"/>Kwavija gweye huli Imulungu yodeng'helela gehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:4">kumwako haduhu gehile.<verse eid="PSA 5:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 5:5"/>Iwanhu oitapa hawadaha kwima wima kuulongozi wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:5">gweye kowehila wose otenda gehile.<verse eid="PSA 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 5:6"/>Kowabananga wose olonga uvizi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:6">Mndewa Imulungu kowehila wakomaji na wose obunyika wayagwe.<verse eid="PSA 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 5:7"/>Lakini niye kwa unogelo wako hawishaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:7">nokwingila mng'anda yako.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:7">Nogwa kingubanguba kuulongozi wa ng'anda yako ing'ala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:7">kwa kukudumba gweye.<verse eid="PSA 5:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 5:8"/>Go Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:8">unilongoze kwa haki yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:8">mbuli ya awo onihila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:8">unigolosele nzila yako kuulongozi.<verse eid="PSA 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 5:9"/>Kwavija haduhu ukweli mmilomo yao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:9">mizoyo yao imema kubananga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:9">mitundu melo yao kamba panga hadisiligwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:9">milimi yao imema uvizi.<verse eid="PSA 5:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 5:10"/>Gweye Mndewa Imulungu uwakoboze kwa gehile gao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:10">wagwe kwa viseto vao vihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:10">wawinge kunze mbuli ya ukumema kwa gehile gao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:10">kwavija wakulema gweye.<verse eid="PSA 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 5:11"/>Lakini wose okukimbilila gweye wadeng'helele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:11">waleke wagute mizangi ya deng'ho siku zose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:11">Uweke goya wose odinogela twaga jako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:11">ili wadeng'helele mbuli yako.<verse eid="PSA 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 5:12"/>Kwavija gweye Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:12">kowatenda wamwede iwanhu wanogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:12">kowakaliza kwa unogelo wako kamba kwa ngao.<verse eid="PSA 5:12"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="PSA 6"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 6</para>
  <para style="d">(Zabuli ya Daudi. Kwa kilanja, yatumie nyuzi za bango na modeli wa Sheminiti.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 6:1"/>Go Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 6:1">sikuunikomhokele kwa ng'hasiliki yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 6:1">sikuunikoboze kwa kwihilwa kwako.<verse eid="PSA 6:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 6:2"/>Unyonele bazi gweye Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 6:2">kwavija nonyolila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 6:2">Unihonye gweye Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 6:2">kwavija nogaya mbaka mmizege.<verse eid="PSA 6:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 6:3"/>Nogazika ng'hani mmoyo wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 6:3">gweye Mndewa Imulungu kokawa mbaka lini?<verse eid="PSA 6:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 6:4"/>Go Mndewa Imulungu ubwele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 6:4">unihoze moyo wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 6:4">unikombole mbuli ya unogelo wako hawishaga.<verse eid="PSA 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 6:5"/>Haduhu munhu yokukumbuka gweye akuno kafa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 6:5">Nani yodaha kukutogola yahawa ako kuzimu?<verse eid="PSA 6:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 6:6"/>Nidonha kwa kugula kwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 6:6">kila ikilo noludodeza lusazi lwangu kwa kulila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 6:6">noudodeza mkeka wangu kwa mahozi gangu.<verse eid="PSA 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 6:7"/>Meso gangu ganangika kwa usungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 6:7">nodonha mbuli ya awo onihila.<verse eid="PSA 6:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 6:8"/>Segeleni kumwangu, mweye msang'hana gehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 6:8">kwavija Mndewa Imulungu kahulika kililo changu.<verse eid="PSA 6:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 6:9"/>Mndewa Imulungu kahulika kililo changu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 6:9">Mndewa Imulungu katogola kupula kwangu.<verse eid="PSA 6:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 6:10"/>Iwanhu wose onihila wagwe kinyala na wapate magazo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 6:10">wabwele kuchugu himahima kwa kinyala.<verse eid="PSA 6:10"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="PSA 7"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 7</para>
  <para style="d">(Kuiyalala kwa Daudi kwa Mndewa Imulungu mbuli ya Kushi wa kabila da Benjamini.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 7:1"/>Go Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wangu, kumwako gweye nokimbilila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:1">nikombole na umhonye na wose onikweleleza niye.<verse eid="PSA 7:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 7:2"/>Buleavo okwiza kunivamila kamba simba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:2">na onibalula vihande vihande,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:2">na kuduhu munhu wa kunihonya.<verse eid="PSA 7:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 7:3"/>Go Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:3">kamba niye nitenda mbuli ino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:3">kamba nitenda gehile kwa makono gangu,<verse eid="PSA 7:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 7:4"/>kamba nimuliha gehile mbwigangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:4">hebu nimvamila bila ugomvi imunhu yonihila,<verse eid="PSA 7:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 7:5"/>avo ayo yonihila na yanikweleleze na kunigoga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:5">na yawite ugima wangu hasi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:5">na yawike lukuli lwangu mditimbwisi.<verse eid="PSA 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 7:6"/>Go Mndewa Imulungu, winuke mna ing'hasiliki yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:6">winuke mbuli ya kugevuzika kwa iwanhu onihila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:6">lamuka Imulungu wangu, ulaguse haki yako.<verse eid="PSA 7:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 7:7"/>Leka umting'hano wa iwanhu waiting'hane mbuli yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:7">na uchanha yake ukale utawale.<verse eid="PSA 7:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 7:8"/>Go Mndewa Imulungu, uwatagusaga iwanhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:8">Go Mndewa Imulungu, unitaguse kamba haki yangu viili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:8">na kamba vizili nzila zigoloke mgati mmwangu.<verse eid="PSA 7:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 7:9"/>Leka gehile ga iwanhu otenda gehile gavike kuuhelelo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:9">na gweye uwemize iwanhu otenda ganogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:9">gweye ugezaga nzewele na mizoyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:9">gweye Imulungu wa haki.<verse eid="PSA 7:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 7:10"/>Imulungu ayo ngao yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:10">heyo kowakombola iwanhu wene mizoyo inogile.<verse eid="PSA 7:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 7:11"/>Imulungu ayo imsemi wa haki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:11">Imulungu yowagevuzikila iwanhu wehile kila siku.<verse eid="PSA 7:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 7:12"/>Kamba munhu haleka bule nzambi zake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:12">Imulungu konola panga jake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:12">heyo koukwega upinde wake na kolenga.<verse eid="PSA 7:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 7:13"/>Kaitanda silaha igala ifa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:13">kaisongola imisale yake.<verse eid="PSA 7:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 7:14"/>Lola, munhu yehile kagoga inda ya gehile</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:14">na kana inda ya kilozo na kalela uvizi.<verse eid="PSA 7:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 7:15"/>Kahimba simo dingila ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:15">na heyo kagwila mmo mdisimo diyahimbile.<verse eid="PSA 7:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 7:16"/>Kilozo chake kimbwelela mdipala jake mwenyego,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:16">na ago gehile gake gombwelela mdindosi jake.<verse eid="PSA 7:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 7:17"/>Nomgwelela nhogolwa Mndewa Imulungu mbuli ya haki yake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:17">na noditogola twaga da Mndewa Imulungu, yeli Uchanha Ng'hani.<verse eid="PSA 7:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="PSA 8"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 8</para>
  <para style="d">(Zabuli ya Daudi. Kwa kilanja, yatumie modeli wa Gititi.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 8:1"/>Go Mndewa Imulungu, Mndewa wetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 8:1">twaga jako kulu mwiisi yose!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 8:1">Gweye kwika ukulu wako ako uchanha kuulanga.<verse eid="PSA 8:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 8:2"/>Mmilomo ya wana na ving'hele kuikila ngome kwa awo okwihila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 8:2">kuwatenda wanyamale awo okwihila na awo okulema.<verse eid="PSA 8:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 8:3"/>Nahaulola ulanga wako, ayo isang'hano ya vidole vako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 8:3">mbalamwezi na nhondo avo viwikile,<verse eid="PSA 8:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 8:4"/>munhu ayo nani, mbaka umgelegeze?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 8:4">Mwana wa munhu ayo nani, mbaka umulole goya?<verse eid="PSA 8:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 8:5"/>Kumtenda mdodo kubanza iwasenga wa kuulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 8:5">na kumvaza ukulu na nhogolwa.<verse eid="PSA 8:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 8:6"/>Kumtenda yaitawale sang'hano ya makono gako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 8:6">kuvika hasi ya magulu gake vinhu vose,<verse eid="PSA 8:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 8:7"/>ng'hondolo na ng'ombe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 8:7">na vivija iming'onyo ya kumuhulo,<verse eid="PSA 8:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 8:8"/>iwandege wa kuulanga na somba wa mbahali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 8:8">na vose vikogelela mbahali.<verse eid="PSA 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 8:9"/>Go Mndewa Imulungu, Mndewa wetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 8:9">twaga jako kulu mwiisi yose!<verse eid="PSA 8:9"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="PSA 9"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 9</para>
  <para style="d">(Zabuli ya Daudi. Kwa kilanja, yatumie modeli ya lwila lwa, “Ifa ya Mwana wa Kimbigalo.”)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 9:1"/>Nokushukulu Mndewa Imulungu kwa moyo wangu wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:1">nogasimulila gose ga unzonza gautendile.<verse eid="PSA 9:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 9:2"/>Nodeng'helela na kukwinula gweye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:2">noditogola twaga jako, gweye uli Uchanha Ng'hani.<verse eid="PSA 9:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 9:3"/>Iwanhu onihila wabwela kuchugu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:3">waikwala na kupotela kuulongozi wako.<verse eid="PSA 9:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 9:4"/>Kwavija kuigombela haki yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:4">kukala mkigoda chako cha undewa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:4">na kotagusa kamba viilondigwa.<verse eid="PSA 9:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 9:5"/>Kuwakomhokela iwanhu wa isi ziyagwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:5">na kuwabananga iwanhu wehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:5">matwaga gao kugasegesa siku zose na milele.<verse eid="PSA 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 9:6"/>Iwanhu otwihila wabanangwa milele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:6">kugang'ola mabuga gao na wose wasemwigwa.<verse eid="PSA 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 9:7"/>Lakini Mndewa Imulungu kotawala milele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:7">keka kigoda chake cha undewa ili yataguse,<verse eid="PSA 9:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 9:8"/>kowatagusa iwanhu wa mwiisi yose kwa haki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:8">kowatawala iwanhu kamba viilondigwa.<verse eid="PSA 9:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 9:9"/>Mndewa Imulungu ayo ngome ya awo odununzwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:9">heyo ayo ngome mkipindi cha magazo.<verse eid="PSA 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 9:10"/>Wose odijuwa twaga jako okutamanila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:10">kwavija gweye Mndewa Imulungu huwasemwile bule wose okwizila.<verse eid="PSA 9:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 9:11"/>Mtogoleni Mndewa Imulungu, yokala Sayuni!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:11">Walongeleni iwanhu wose sang'hano zake!<verse eid="PSA 9:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 9:12"/>Kwavija ayo yolihaga mbuli ya kwita damu kokumbuka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:12">haisemwile ikililo cha wakiwa.<verse eid="PSA 9:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 9:13"/>Go Mndewa Imulungu, unyonele bazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:13">lola magazo gangu kulawa kwa awo onihila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:13">uninule kulawa mmilango ya ifa,<verse eid="PSA 9:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 9:14"/>ili nizisimulile nhogolwa zako mmilango ya biti Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:14">na kuko nideng'helele ukombola wako.<verse eid="PSA 9:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 9:15"/>Iwanhu wa isi ziyagwe wadumbukila mdisimo diwahimbile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:15">kuna ulwavu waufisile, onzeka magulu gao.<verse eid="PSA 9:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 9:16"/>Mndewa Imulungu kaigubula mwenyego kwa haki yake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:16">iwanhu wehile wagogigwa mna umtego wa sang'hano za makono gao wenyego.<verse eid="PSA 9:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 9:17"/>Iwanhu otenda gehile obwela kuzimu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:17">iwanhu wa isi zose omsemwa Imulungu.<verse eid="PSA 9:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 9:18"/>Lakini ngaengae hawasemwigwa milele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:18">na tamanilo da wakiwa hadisegela milele.<verse eid="PSA 9:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 9:19"/>Go Mndewa Imulungu, winuke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:19">sikuumuleke munhu yehile yahume,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:19">leka iwanhu wa isi zose watagusigwe kuulongozi wako.<verse eid="PSA 9:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 9:20"/>Go Mndewa Imulungu, wagele bwembwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:20">leka iwanhu wa isi zose wajuwe kamba hewo wanhu tu.<verse eid="PSA 9:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="PSA 10"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 10</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 10:1"/>Go Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:1">habali kokwima kutali?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:1">Habali koifisa mna ikipindi cha magazo?<verse eid="PSA 10:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 10:2"/>Mkibuli chake munhu yehile komsaka munhu yonyolila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:2">munhu yonyolila konamatwa mumtego wa munhu yehile.<verse eid="PSA 10:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 10:3"/>Munhu yehile koigodela kusulukila mmoyo wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:3">munhu mmelo komduwila na komuliga Mndewa Imulungu.<verse eid="PSA 10:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 10:4"/>Munhu yehile, koitapa na hamzahila Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:4">heyo kogelegeza, “Haduhu Imulungu.”<verse eid="PSA 10:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 10:5"/>Nzila za munhu yehile zogendelela goya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:5">kumwake heyo nhaguso zako za kutali na magesa gake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:5">na kowabezeli iwanhu omwihila.<verse eid="PSA 10:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 10:6"/>Kogelegeza mmoyo wake, “Haduhu kinhu chonda kingaze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:6">sigaya bule muugima wangu.”<verse eid="PSA 10:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 10:7"/>Mulomo wake umema kuduwila na uvizi na kunanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:7">hakawa kulonga mbuli za kugevuza na gehile.<verse eid="PSA 10:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 10:8"/>Koifisa ili yavamile kuna ivijiji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:8">hanhu ha kinyelegezi kowakoma iwanhu hawatendile dihile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:8">Kokala meso ili yamvamile mkiwa.<verse eid="PSA 10:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 10:9"/>Koifisa kinyelegezi kamba simba yosaka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:9">koifisa ili yamvamile mkiwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:9">Komgoga mkiwa yahamkwesela behi mna ulwavu lwake.<verse eid="PSA 10:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 10:10"/>Mkiwa kovamiligwa na kobwanhigwa hasi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:10">kobwanhigwa kwa usede wa munhu yehile.<verse eid="PSA 10:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 10:11"/>Kolonga mmoyo wake, “Imulungu kaisemwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:11">kaifisa kihanga chake, na halola kinhu!”<verse eid="PSA 10:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 10:12"/>Go Mndewa Imulungu winuke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:12">inula mkono wako uwakoboze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:12">sikuuwasemwe iwanhu odununzwa.<verse eid="PSA 10:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 10:13"/>Habali imunhu yehile yambezeli Imulungu na kulonga mmoyo wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:13">“Honda yanikeme nimpetele zinhendile.”<verse eid="PSA 10:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 10:14"/>Lakini gweye kowalola iwanhu ogaya na kudununzwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:14">na gweye kowataza siku zose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:14">Mkiwa kokutamanila gweye Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:14">gweye kowataza wana wakiwa.<verse eid="PSA 10:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 10:15"/>Uzibene zinguvu za munhu yehile na imunhu yotenda ganyolodoke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:15">ugakoboze gehile gake mbaka sikuugone kabili.<verse eid="PSA 10:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 10:16"/>Mndewa Imulungu ayo Mndewa siku zose na milele!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:16">Iwanhu wa isi obanangigwa wasegele mwiisi yake.<verse eid="PSA 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 10:17"/>Gweye Mndewa Imulungu, kuhulika viyopula imunhu mkiwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:17">komgangamiza na komgwaa nguvu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:17">kotegeleza kililo chake.<verse eid="PSA 10:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 10:18"/>Kowatendela ganogile iwana wakiwa na iwanhu odununzwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:18">ili imunhu yeli ulongo tu sikuyawadumbize iwanhu.<verse eid="PSA 10:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="PSA 11"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 11</para>
  <para style="d">(Kwa kilanja, Zabuli ya Daudi.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 11:1"/>Mndewa Imulungu ayo inimkimbilile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 11:1">habali monongela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 11:1">“Guluka kamba ndege ako kulugongo,<verse eid="PSA 11:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 11:2"/>kwavija lola iwanhu wehile okwega upinde,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 11:2">wawika goya umsale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 11:2">ili wawatowe mdiziza iwanhu wanogile.<verse eid="PSA 11:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 11:3"/>Kamba vandusilo vibanangika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 11:3">imunhu yanogile kotenda choni?”<verse eid="PSA 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 11:4"/>Mndewa Imulungu ka mng'anda yake ing'ala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 11:4">kigoda cha undewa cha Mndewa Imulungu cha kuulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 11:4">kwa meso gake kowalola iwanhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 11:4">na kojuwa gose gotendigwa.<verse eid="PSA 11:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 11:5"/>Mndewa Imulungu, kowageza iwanhu wanogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 11:5">lakini kowehila iwanhu wehile na iwanhu wasede.<verse eid="PSA 11:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 11:6"/>Kowatowela iwanhu wehile mvula ya makala ga moto,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 11:6">moto na mabwe gokwaka na vuke dokuwa fungu jao.<verse eid="PSA 11:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 11:7"/>Kwavija Mndewa Imulungu kotenda ganogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 11:7">konogezwa na ganogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 11:7">iwanhu wanogile ochona kihanga chake.<verse eid="PSA 11:7"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="PSA 12"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 12</para>
  <para style="d">(Zabuli ya Daudi. Kwa kilanja, yatumie nyuzi za bango na modeli wa Sheminiti.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 12:1"/>Tukombole gweye Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 12:1">kwavija iwanhu wa Imulungu opotela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 12:1">kwavija iwanhu otamanilwa wasegela hagati ha iwanhu.<verse eid="PSA 12:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 12:2"/>Kila munhu komvizila miyage,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 12:2">olonga kwa ulonzi wa kutewenza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 12:2">na mizoyo ya utapitapi.<verse eid="PSA 12:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 12:3"/>Gweye Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 12:3">uikanhe imilomo ilonga ulonzi wa kutewenza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 12:3">na imilimi ilonga mbuli za kuitapa,<verse eid="PSA 12:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 12:4"/>iwanhu wose olonga, “Kwa milimi yetu tohuma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 12:4">milomo tunayo, nani yodaha kututawala?”<verse eid="PSA 12:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 12:5"/>Lakini Mndewa Imulungu kolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 12:5">“Kwavija iwanhu wakiwa odununzwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 12:5">ngaengae olila kwa usungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 12:5">sambi nokwiza nowakaliza kamba viwobeta.”<verse eid="PSA 12:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 12:6"/>Mbuli ya Mndewa Imulungu ing'ala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 12:6">ing'ala kamba shaba isunhigwe mna ditanuli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 12:6">ona kamba shaba isunhigwe miyanza saba.<verse eid="PSA 12:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 12:7"/>Gweye Mndewa Imulungu, utukalize,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 12:7">utukalize siku zose na iwanhu wa ulelo uno wihile.<verse eid="PSA 12:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 12:8"/>Iwanhu wehile ozunguluka kila hanhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 12:8">gehile gotogoligwa hagati ha iwanhu.<verse eid="PSA 12:8"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="PSA 13"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 13</para>
  <para style="d">(Kwa kilanja, Zabuli ya Daudi.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 13:1"/>Mbaka lini gweye Mndewa Imulungu, konisemwa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 13:1">Gweye konisemwa milele?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 13:1">Mbaka lini konifisa kihanga chako?<verse eid="PSA 13:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 13:2"/>Mbaka lini nogelegeza?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 13:2">Mbaka lini nokuwa na lusikisiki mmoyo wangu kila siku?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 13:2">Mbaka lini iwanhu onihila odeng'helela magazo gangu?<verse eid="PSA 13:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 13:3"/>Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wangu, ulole na unidike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 13:3">ugamwemwesele meso gangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 13:3">buleavo nowasa utulo wa ifa.<verse eid="PSA 13:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 13:4"/>Sikuuleke iwanhu onihila walonge, “Kahumwa!”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 13:4">Iwanhu onideta sambi wadeng'helele kwavija nigwa.<verse eid="PSA 13:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 13:5"/>Lakini niye noutamanila unogelo wako hawishaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 13:5">moyo wangu odeng'helela ukombola wako.<verse eid="PSA 13:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 13:6"/>Nomwimbila Mndewa Imulungu, kwavija kanitendela ganogile.<verse eid="PSA 13:6"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="PSA 14"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 14</para>
  <para style="d">(Kwa kilanja, Zabuli ya Daudi.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 14:1"/>Mbozi kolonga mmoyo wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 14:1">“Kuduhu Imulungu.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 14:1">Wose wabanangika, osang'hana gehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 14:1">haduhu munhu yotenda ganogile.<verse eid="PSA 14:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 14:2"/>Mndewa Imulungu kowasungulila iwanhu kulawa kuulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 14:2">yalole kamba hana munhu mwene nzewele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 14:2">na kamba hana munhu komzahila Imulungu.<verse eid="PSA 14:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 14:3"/>Wose wahinduka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 14:3">wose wabanangika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 14:3">haduhu yotenda ganogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 14:3">haduhu hata imoja.<verse eid="PSA 14:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 14:4"/>Vino awo otenda gehile wabule nzewele?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 14:4">Owadafuna wanhu zangu kamba magate,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 14:4">na hawamgelegeza Mndewa Imulungu.<verse eid="PSA 14:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 14:5"/>Baho wengilwa na bwembwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 14:5">kwavija Imulungu kahamoja na iwanhu otenda ganogile.<verse eid="PSA 14:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 14:6"/>Modaha kugananga ago goyolonda kutenda imunhu mkiwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 14:6">lakini Mndewa Imulungu ayo yomkaliza.<verse eid="PSA 14:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 14:7"/>Maza ukombola wa Izilaeli wize kulawa Sayuni!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 14:7">Mndewa Imulungu, vonda yabweze ng'hekewa ya wanhu zake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 14:7">Yakobo yadeng'helele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 14:7">Izilaeli yadeng'he.<verse eid="PSA 14:7"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="PSA 15"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 15</para>
  <para style="d">(Zabuli ya Daudi.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 15:1"/>Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 15:1">nani yonda yakale mdihema jako?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 15:1">Nani yonda yakale kulugongo lwako lung'ala?<verse eid="PSA 15:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 15:2"/>Imunhu yokala bila vitala na yotenda ganogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 15:2">na kolonga ukweli mmoyo wake,<verse eid="PSA 15:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 15:3"/>imunhu hadetaga wayagwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 15:3">hamtendela gehile miyage,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 15:3">na hamulonga vihile mbwigake.<verse eid="PSA 15:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 15:4"/>Imunhu yowabezeli wehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 15:4">ila kowatogola iwanhu omdumba Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 15:4">imunhu yovikiza gaja gayaiduwile hata kamba gotenda vinhu vake vipotele.<verse eid="PSA 15:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 15:5"/>Imunhu hakopesha sente na kulonda yabwezeligwe nyingi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 15:5">na imunhu habokela hongo ili yamonele munhu hatendile dihile.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 15:5"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 15:5">Imunhu yotenda ago gose kosigala siku zose.<verse eid="PSA 15:5"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="PSA 16"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 16</para>
  <para style="d">(Lwila lwa Daudi.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 16:1"/>Unikalize gweye Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:1">kwavija kumwako nikukimbilila.<verse eid="PSA 16:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 16:2"/>Nomulongela Mndewa Imulungu, “Gweye kwa Mndewa wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:2">nabule dinogile ila gweye.”<verse eid="PSA 16:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 16:3"/>Iwanhu wang'alile weli mwiisi awo wanogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:3">awo ninogezwa na hewo.<verse eid="PSA 16:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 16:4"/>Lakini iwanhu oitambikila imilungu iyagwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:4">ogaya ng'hani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:4">Nhosa yao ya damu siilava bule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:4">na matwaga gao sigatambula mmulomo wangu.<verse eid="PSA 16:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 16:5"/>Gweye Mndewa Imulungu ayo fungu jangu na kikasi changu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:5">gweye ayo ugoga ugima wangu.<verse eid="PSA 16:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 16:6"/>Zimbaka zangu zibitila hanhu hanogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:6">ona nipata uhazi unogile.<verse eid="PSA 16:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 16:7"/>Nomtogola Mndewa Imulungu, ayo yonigwaa magesa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:7">vivija ikilo moyo wangu onifunza.<verse eid="PSA 16:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 16:8"/>Siku zose nimwika Mndewa Imulungu kuulongozi wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:8">kwavija kaubanzi wangu wa ukudila avo sigwaya bule.<verse eid="PSA 16:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 16:9"/>Avo moyo wangu odeng'helela na lulimi lwangu lotowa lukenze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:9">na lukuli lose lodeng'helela na niye nokala goya.<verse eid="PSA 16:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 16:10"/>Kwavija honda undeke kuzimu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:10">na hundeka niye imunhu wako yotamanilwa nyone kukola.<verse eid="PSA 16:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 16:11"/>Konilagusila nzila ya ugima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:11">kuulongozi wako kuna deng'ho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:11">na mumkono wako wa ukudila kuna ganogile gakalaga milele.<verse eid="PSA 16:11"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="PSA 17"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 17</para>
  <para style="d">(Kupula kwa Daudi.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 17:1"/>Gweye Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:1">utegeleze kitala changu cha haki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:1">utegeleze kililo changu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:1">utegeleze ukupula kwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:1">vinipula bila uvizi.<verse eid="PSA 17:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 17:2"/>Haki yangu na ilawe kumwako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:2">na meso gako galole ganogile.<verse eid="PSA 17:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 17:3"/>Gweye kuujuwa moyo wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:3">kunizila ikilo kunilola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:3">kunigeza na hugonile gehile mgati yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:3">silongile giladi gehile mmulomo wangu.<verse eid="PSA 17:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 17:4"/>Kwa gaja gotendigwa na wanhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:4">niigoga mbuli ya mulomo wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:4">nizilema nzila za awo otenda gehile.<verse eid="PSA 17:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 17:5"/>Magulu gangu gatembela mnzila zako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:5">magulu gangu hagatelebuke bule.<verse eid="PSA 17:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 17:6"/>Nokukema gweye Mndewa Imulungu, kwavija konidika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:6">uhulike kwa gwiti jako na utegeleze gonilonga.<verse eid="PSA 17:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 17:7"/>Lagusa unogelo wako hawishaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:7">gweye ukombolaga iwanhu okukimbilila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:7">kwa mkono wako wa ukudila uwakalize kulawa kwa iwanhu owehila.<verse eid="PSA 17:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 17:8"/>Unikalize kamba imwana wa siso jako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:8">unifise mna imbeho ya mabawa gako,<verse eid="PSA 17:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 17:9"/>sikunyoneke na iwanhu onihila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:9">na awo wanizunguluke.<verse eid="PSA 17:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 17:10"/>Awo wabule bazi mmizoyo yao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:10">wamema mbuli za kuitapa.<verse eid="PSA 17:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 17:11"/>Onikweleleza na kunizunguluka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:11">ozahila nyafasi wanibwanhe hasi.<verse eid="PSA 17:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 17:12"/>Hewo waigala na simba yolonda kuvamila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:12">na kamba mwana wa simba yaifisile ili kuvamila.<verse eid="PSA 17:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 17:13"/>Winuke, Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:13">uwavamile na kuwabwanha hasi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:13">Kwa sime uikombole loho yangu kulawa mmakono ga awo wehile.<verse eid="PSA 17:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 17:14"/>Gweye Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:14">kwa mkono wako unikombole kulawa kwa wanhu awo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:14">iwanhu wa mwiisi ino awo fungu jao da muugima uno.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:14">Uwakoboze ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:14">wanao wapate nhaguso ng'hulu kubanza ayo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:14">Nhaguso ayo igendelele mbaka kwa wazukulu zao.<verse eid="PSA 17:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 17:15"/>Lakini niye nokilola kihanga chako mna ihaki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:15">nahalamuka nokwiguta kihanga chako.<verse eid="PSA 17:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="PSA 18"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 18</para>
  <para style="d">(Zabuli ya Daudi iyamwimbile Mndewa Imulungu mbuli ya kipindi viyakomboligwe kulawa mmakono ga Sauli na wanhu wayagwe omwihila.)<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:0 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola kitabu cha 1 Samweli 23:7-14 na 2 Samweli 22:1-51.</char></note></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 18:1"/>Nokunogela gweye Mndewa Imulungu, nguvu yangu.<verse eid="PSA 18:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 18:2"/>Mndewa Imulungu ayo dibwe jangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:2">na ngome yangu na mkombola wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:2">Imulungu wangu na dibwe jangu dinikimbilile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:2">na ngao ya ukombola wangu na ngome yangu.<verse eid="PSA 18:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 18:3"/>Nomkema Mndewa Imulungu yolondigwa kutogoligwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:3">kanikombola kulawa kwa iwanhu onihila.<verse eid="PSA 18:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 18:4"/>Nzabi za ifa zinizunguluka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:4">ng'humbi ingubika.<verse eid="PSA 18:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 18:5"/>Nzabi za kuzimu zinizingiliza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:5">mitego ya ifa ingoga.<verse eid="PSA 18:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 18:6"/>Mmagazo gangu nimkema Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:6">nimulilila Imulungu wangu yanitaze.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:6">Kulawa mng'anda yake kahulika sauti yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:6">na kililo changu kimvikila mmagwiti gake.<verse eid="PSA 18:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 18:7"/>Aho isi igwaya na kutigisika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:7">imigimbo ya vigongo igwaya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:7">kwavija Imulungu kagevuzika.<verse eid="PSA 18:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 18:8"/>Yosi difililika kulawa mmhula zake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:8">moto usakaza ulawa mmulomo wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:8">makala ga moto gazipuka kulawa kumwake.<verse eid="PSA 18:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 18:9"/>Katula ulanga kahumuluka hasi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:9">mawingu matitu gakala hasi ya magulu gake.<verse eid="PSA 18:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 18:10"/>Kakwela kiumbe kili na mabawa kaguluka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:10">kahumuluka mdibeho kamba ndege.<verse eid="PSA 18:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 18:11"/>Kaigubika ziza kila mwambu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:11">mawingu gazamile gamemile mazi gamzunguluka.<verse eid="PSA 18:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 18:12"/>Kwa mng'alo wake mawingu gasegela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:12">itowa mvula ya mabwe na mimwesa.<verse eid="PSA 18:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 18:13"/>Mndewa Imulungu kaduma kulawa kuulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:13">heyo yeli Uchanha Ng'hani kalava sauti yake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:13">mvula ya mabwe na mabwe gokwaka moto vilagala.<verse eid="PSA 18:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 18:14"/>Katowa misale yake kawaswaswanya iwanhu omwihila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:14">kagala mimwesa kawawinga.<verse eid="PSA 18:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 18:15"/>Abaho hasi kuna ibahali koneka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:15">ichandusilo cha isi kigubuka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:15">gweye Mndewa Imulungu vuukomhoke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:15">kwa ukubuma kwa mhumuzi ya mhula yako.<verse eid="PSA 18:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 18:16"/>Imulungu kagolosa mkono wake kulawa uchanha kangoga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:16">kanivabula kulawa mmazi mengi.<verse eid="PSA 18:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 18:17"/>Kanikombola kulawa kwa wanhu onihila weli na nguvu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:17">na kanihonya kulawa kwa awo onihila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:17">kwavija wakala na nguvu kubanza niye.<verse eid="PSA 18:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 18:18"/>Wanivamila ving'halile mmagazo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:18">lakini Mndewa Imulungu kanitaza.<verse eid="PSA 18:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 18:19"/>Kanigala hanhu hana inyafasi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:19">kanikombola kwavija kaninogela.<verse eid="PSA 18:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 18:20"/>Mndewa Imulungu kanhendela kamba haki yangu viili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:20">kanhunza kwavija makono gangu gabule ubananzi,<verse eid="PSA 18:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 18:21"/>kwavija niikweleleza nzila ya Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:21">na sitendile gehile na kumuleka Imulungu wangu.<verse eid="PSA 18:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 18:22"/>Kwavija malagizo gake gose nigagoga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:22">na mafundizo gake sigalekile.<verse eid="PSA 18:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 18:23"/>Na niye nitelela kuulongozi wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:23">niigomesa sikunitende nzambi.<verse eid="PSA 18:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 18:24"/>Avo Mndewa Imulungu kanitunza kamba vinitendile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:24">kanhunza kwavija makono gangu gabule ubananzi.<verse eid="PSA 18:24"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 18:25"/>Gweye kotamaniligwa kwa wanhu otamaniligwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:25">kwa yelibule kitala koilagusa kwabule kitala.<verse eid="PSA 18:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 18:26"/>Gweye kung'ala kwa waja wang'alile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:26">lakini kwa wanhu otenda gehile kolagusa usede.<verse eid="PSA 18:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 18:27"/>Gweye kowakombola iwanhu wahole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:27">lakini kowahumulusa iwanhu oitapa.<verse eid="PSA 18:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 18:28"/>Kwavija gweye koibwinha taa yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:28">Mndewa Imulungu konimwemwesela mdiziza.<verse eid="PSA 18:28"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 18:29"/>Gweye wahanitaza nodihuma bumbila da wakalizi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:29">kwa Imulungu wangu nodaha kuzumha luwa.<verse eid="PSA 18:29"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 18:30"/>Sang'hano za Imulungu zitelela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:30">imbuli ya Mndewa Imulungu ya kweli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:30">heyo ayo ngao kwa iwanhu wose omkimbilila.<verse eid="PSA 18:30"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 18:31"/>Haduhu yeli Imulungu ila Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:31">haduhu yeli dibwe ila Imulungu wetu.<verse eid="PSA 18:31"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 18:32"/>Imulungu ayo yanigwelele nguvu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:32">na kaitenda nzila yangu itelele.<verse eid="PSA 18:32"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 18:33"/>Kaigangamiza migulu yangu sikuitelebuke kamba ya nhelembo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:33">kanika goya uchanha kunhembeti.<verse eid="PSA 18:33"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 18:34"/>Kogafunza makono gangu kuitowa ng'hondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:34">makono gangu gana nguvu ya kuvedula upinde uli na nguvu.<verse eid="PSA 18:34"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 18:35"/>Kunigwaa ngao yako ya kunikombola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:35">mkono wako wa ukudila unigoga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:35">ukunoga kwako unitenda mkulu.<verse eid="PSA 18:35"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 18:36"/>Kuitanula nzila yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:36">na migulu yangu haitelebuke bule.<verse eid="PSA 18:36"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 18:37"/>Niwakweleleza iwanhu onihila na niwagoga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:37">sibwelile kuchugu mbaka vuwabanangigwe wose.<verse eid="PSA 18:37"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 18:38"/>Niwabwanha hasi na hawadahile kwinuka kabili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:38">wagwa hasi ya magulu gangu.<verse eid="PSA 18:38"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 18:39"/>Gweye kunigwaa nguvu ya kuitowa kung'hondo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:39">Kuwabwanha hasi yangu iwanhu onilema.<verse eid="PSA 18:39"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 18:40"/>Kuwatenda iwanhu onihila wakimbile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:40">na awo onilema niye niwabananga.<verse eid="PSA 18:40"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 18:41"/>Waguta mizangi lakini hakala haduhu munhu yoyose wa kuwataza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:41">wamulilila Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:41">lakini heyo hawedike bule.<verse eid="PSA 18:41"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 18:42"/>Niwahonda wagaluka kamba timbwisi vidihembeluswa na beho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:42">niwabojoga kamba tope da mnzila.<verse eid="PSA 18:42"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 18:43"/>Gweye kunikombola kulawa kwa iwanhu wanivamile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:43">kunitenda niwe mtawala wa isi zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:43">iwanhu siwajuwile wanisang'hanila.<verse eid="PSA 18:43"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="PSA 18:44"/>Wanhu baki weza kumwangu kuno onifugamila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:44">bahaja viwahulike nolonga wanitegeleza.<verse eid="PSA 18:44"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="PSA 18:45"/>Wageni wakala wabule tamanilo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:45">weza kumwangu kulawa mzingome zao akuno ogwaya.<verse eid="PSA 18:45"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="PSA 18:46"/>Mndewa Imulungu kamgima!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 18:46">Yatogoligwe dibwe jangu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:46">Yatogoligwe Imulungu wa ukombola wangu!<verse eid="PSA 18:46"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="PSA 18:47"/>Imulungu ayo yanidahize kuwalihiza gehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:47">na kaweka hasi yangu iwanhu wa isi zose.<verse eid="PSA 18:47"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="PSA 18:48"/>Kanikombola kulawa kwa iwanhu onihila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:48">kaninula uchanha ya awo onilema niye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:48">na kanigala kutali ya iwanhu iwasede.<verse eid="PSA 18:48"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="PSA 18:49"/>Kwa mbuli ayo, nokutogola gweye Mndewa Imulungu hagati ya iwanhu wa isi zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:49">na nokwimba na kulonga twaga jako kulu.<verse eid="PSA 18:49"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="PSA 18:50"/>Imulungu kamgwaa mndewa wake mhumo ng'hulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:50">kalagusa unogelo wake hawishaga kwa ayo iyamsagule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:50">kwa Daudi na ulelo wake milele.<verse eid="PSA 18:50"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="PSA 19"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 19</para>
  <para style="d">(Kwa kilanja, Zabuli ya Daudi.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 19:1"/>Ulanga olonga ukulu wa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:1">na langa da uchanha dosimulila sang'hano ya makono gake.<verse eid="PSA 19:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 19:2"/>Imisi yolonga na imisi iyagwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:2">ikilo yosimulila na ikilo kiyagwe.<verse eid="PSA 19:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 19:3"/>Haduhu kulonga hebu ulonzi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:3">sauti yao haihulikwa,<verse eid="PSA 19:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 19:4"/>ila, sauti yao yenela mwiisi yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:4">na mbuli zao zovika mbaka kuihelela isi yose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:4">Imulungu kadikila zuwa ukazi wake ako kuulanga,<verse eid="PSA 19:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 19:5"/>dolawa kamba mbigalo yodeng'helela kupata mwehe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:5">dodeng'ha kamba imunhu galu viyoitanda kukimbila.<verse eid="PSA 19:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 19:6"/>Dosomoka kulawa kuuhelela ulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:6">na dozunguluka mbaka mwambu uyagwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:6">haduhu kinhu kidaha kuifisa na vuke jake.<verse eid="PSA 19:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 19:7"/>Malagizo ga Mndewa Imulungu gatelela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:7">goideng'heza loho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:7">Amuli za Mndewa Imulungu za ukweli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:7">zomgwaa ubala imunhu yauswelile.<verse eid="PSA 19:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 19:8"/>Nzila za Mndewa Imulungu zinoga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:8">zoudeng'heza moyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:8">lagizo da Mndewa Imulungu ding'ala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:8">dogamwemwesela meso.<verse eid="PSA 19:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 19:9"/>Kumdumba Mndewa Imulungu kunoga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:9">kokala milele.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:9">Malagizo ga Mndewa Imulungu ga kweli</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:9">na gose gana haki.<verse eid="PSA 19:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 19:10"/>Ago ga kusulukila kubanza zahabu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:10">na kubanza zahabu ing'ala ng'hani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:10">Gamulile kubanza uki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:10">kubanza uki unogile.<verse eid="PSA 19:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 19:11"/>Msang'hanaji wako kozumwa kwa gago,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:11">munhu yahagagoga kopata nhunza ng'hulu.<verse eid="PSA 19:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 19:12"/>Nani yodaha kugona gehile gake mwenyego?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:12">Gagele kumgongo gehile gangu sigajuwile.<verse eid="PSA 19:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 19:13"/>Unikalize niye msang'hanaji wako na nzambi zitendagwa giladi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:13">sikuutogole gago ganitawale!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:13">Aho nokuwa ning'ala na nokuwa nabule kitala kikulu.<verse eid="PSA 19:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 19:14"/>Leka mbuli za mulomo wangu na magesa ga nzewele zangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:14">gatogoligwe kuulongozi wako gweye Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:14">dibwe jangu na mkombola wangu!<verse eid="PSA 19:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="PSA 20"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 20</para>
  <para style="d">(Kwa kilanja, Zabuli ya Daudi.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 20:1"/>Mndewa Imulungu yakwidike mna isiku ya magazo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 20:1">Twaga da Imulungu wa Yakobo dikukalize.<verse eid="PSA 20:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 20:2"/>Yakutaze kulawa hanhu hong'ala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 20:2">na yakutaze kulawa kulugongo lwa Sayuni.<verse eid="PSA 20:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 20:3"/>Yazikumbuke sadaka zako zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 20:3">na yazitogole nhosa zako za kusoma moto.<verse eid="PSA 20:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 20:4"/>Yakugwee gaja goulonda mmoyo wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 20:4">na ugavikize gose gougelegeza kutenda.<verse eid="PSA 20:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 20:5"/>Todeng'helela kwa ukombola wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 20:5">tokwinula bendela kuditogola twaga da Imulungu wetu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 20:5">Mndewa Imulungu yakugwee gose guupula.<verse eid="PSA 20:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 20:6"/>Nojuwa Mndewa Imulungu komkombola imndewa iyamsagule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 20:6">komwidika kulawa hanhu hong'ala ako kuulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 20:6">kwa mkono wake wa kudila komgwaa mhumo.<verse eid="PSA 20:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 20:7"/>Iwanhu wayagwe oitapa kwa mituka ya ng'hondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 20:7">na iwanhu wayagwe oitapa kwa falasi wao.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 20:7">Lakini siye toigodela Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wetu.<verse eid="PSA 20:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 20:8"/>Hewo oikwala na kugwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 20:8">lakini siye tokwinuka na kwima.<verse eid="PSA 20:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 20:9"/>Gweye Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 20:9">umuhonye imndewa!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 20:9">Utwidike twahakukema.<verse eid="PSA 20:9"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="PSA 21"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 21</para>
  <para style="d">(Kwa kilanja, Zabuli ya Daudi.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 21:1"/>Go Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 21:1">mndewa kodeng'helela kwa nguvu zako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 21:1">kodeng'helela ng'hani kwavija kumkombola.<verse eid="PSA 21:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 21:2"/>Kumgwelela gaja goyolonda mmoyo wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 21:2">na hugalemile gaja gayapulile kwa mulomo wake.<verse eid="PSA 21:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 21:3"/>Kumwizila na kumgwaa gaja ganogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 21:3">kumvaza taji ya zahabu inogile kupala jake.<verse eid="PSA 21:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 21:4"/>Kakupula ugima na gweye kumgwaa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 21:4">kumtenda yakale siku nyingi siku zose na milele.<verse eid="PSA 21:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 21:5"/>Kapata ukulu kubitila ukombola wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 21:5">gweye kumgwelela ukulu na nhogolwa.<verse eid="PSA 21:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 21:6"/>Kwavija kumtenda yamwede milele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 21:6">komtenda yadeng'he kwavija gweye kwa hamoja na heyo.<verse eid="PSA 21:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 21:7"/>Kwavija mndewa komtamanila Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 21:7">na kubitila unogelo hawishaga wa ayo yeli uchanha ng'hani honda yasegesigwe.<verse eid="PSA 21:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 21:8"/>Mkono wako owazahila iwanhu okwihila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 21:8">mkono wako wa ukudila owazahila iwanhu wose okulema.<verse eid="PSA 21:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 21:9"/>Wahalawila kowabananga kamba tanuli da moto.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 21:9">Mndewa Imulungu kowameza mna ing'hasiliki yake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 21:9">na moto owasakaza.<verse eid="PSA 21:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 21:10"/>Kowabananga iwanhu wa ulelo wao kulawa mwiisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 21:10">na iwana wa hewo kulawa kwa iwanhu.<verse eid="PSA 21:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 21:11"/>Wahalonda kukutendela gehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 21:11">kwa kugelegeza gehile olemelwa.<verse eid="PSA 21:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 21:12"/>Kwavija kowaswaswanya na kowatenda wakimbile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 21:12">kwa upinde wako uuvutile.<verse eid="PSA 21:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 21:13"/>Utogoligwe gweye Mndewa Imulungu, mbuli ya nguvu zako.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 21:13">Siye tokwimba na kuutogola udahi wako.<verse eid="PSA 21:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="PSA 22"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 22</para>
  <para style="d">(Zabuli ya Daudi. Kwa kilanja, yatumie lwila lwa, “Nhelembo wa ulukwili.”)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 22:1"/>Imulungu wangu, Imulungu wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:1">habali kundeka?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:1">Habali kwa kutali na ukombola wangu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:1">Habali kwa kutali na kililo changu?<verse eid="PSA 22:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 22:2"/>Go Imulungu wangu, imisi nolila lakini hunidika bule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:2">ikilo noguta lakini sidaha kubwihila bule.<verse eid="PSA 22:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 22:3"/>Lakini gweye kung'ala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:3">gweye kokala mkigoda kamba mndewa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:3">na kotogoligwa na wanhu wa Izilaeli.<verse eid="PSA 22:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 22:4"/>Kumwako gweye iwahenga zetu watamanila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:4">wakutamanila na gweye kuwakombola.<verse eid="PSA 22:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 22:5"/>Wakulilila gweye, na wakomboligwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:5">kumwako gweye watamanila na hawagwile kinyala bule.<verse eid="PSA 22:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 22:6"/>Lakini niye kamba mng'onyo, sili munhu bule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:6">ndemigwa na kubezigwa na iwanhu.<verse eid="PSA 22:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 22:7"/>Wose onilola oniseka ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:7">oniliga na ominula milomo yao.<verse eid="PSA 22:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 22:8"/>Olonga, “Kamtamanila Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:8">leka Imulungu yamkombole!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:8">Kamba Imulungu komnogela beta yamkombole!”<verse eid="PSA 22:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 22:9"/>Lakini gweye ayo unilavile mmunda wa mamangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:9">kunitenda nikutamanile gweye mmatombo ga mamangu.<verse eid="PSA 22:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 22:10"/>Nikutamanila gweye tangu nileleke.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:10">Tangu nileligwe gweye ayo Imulungu wangu.<verse eid="PSA 22:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 22:11"/>Sikuukale kutali na niye kwavija magazo ga behi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:11">na haduhu munhu yodaha kunitaza.<verse eid="PSA 22:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 22:12"/>Iwanhu wehile wanizunguluka kamba ng'ombe mbigalo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:12">wanimemela kamba ng'ombe mbigalo weli na nguvu kulawa ako Bashani.<verse eid="PSA 22:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 22:13"/>Wagubula milomo yao kamba simba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:13">kobuma na kunipalula.<verse eid="PSA 22:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 22:14"/>Nitika kamba mazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:14">na mizege yangu yose yogedela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:14">moyo wangu kamba uhota,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:14">olumbuka mgati yangu.<verse eid="PSA 22:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 22:15"/>Nguvu za lukuli lwangu zinyala kamba zae,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:15">lulimi lwangu lonata mmulomo wangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:15">Kunileka mna inhimbwisi ya ifa.<verse eid="PSA 22:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 22:16"/>Umbwa wanizunguluka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:16">iwanhu wehile wanizunguluka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:16">wanitobola mmagulu na mmakono.<verse eid="PSA 22:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 22:17"/>Nisigala mizege iyeka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:17">iwanhu onihila onilola na kunisimanga.<verse eid="PSA 22:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 22:18"/>Oigolela viwalo vangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:18">wakibwanhila simbi kiwalo changu.<verse eid="PSA 22:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 22:19"/>Lakini gweye Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:19">sikuukale kutali na niye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:19">Gweye kwa nguvu zangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:19">wize himahima unitaze.<verse eid="PSA 22:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 22:20"/>Uhonye ugima wangu na sime,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:20">uhonye ugima wangu unogile kulawa kwa iwaumbwa wano.<verse eid="PSA 22:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 22:21"/>Nihonye kulawa mdilomo da simba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:21">na ihonye loho yangu kulawa mzimhembe za ng'ombe poli wano.<verse eid="PSA 22:21"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 22:22"/>Nowasimulila ndugu zangu twaga jako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:22">mna umting'hano nokutogola.<verse eid="PSA 22:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 22:23"/>Mweye mumdumba Mndewa Imulungu, mtogoleni!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:23">Mtogoleni mweye iwanhu wa ulelo wa Yakobo!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:23">Mdumbeni Mndewa Imulungu mweye iwanhu wa ulelo wa Izilaeli.<verse eid="PSA 22:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 22:24"/>Kwavija heyo hamwehula wala kumbezeli mkiwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:24">na haifisa kutali na heyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:24">ila komtegeleza yahampula.<verse eid="PSA 22:24"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 22:25"/>Mbuli yako nokutogola mna umting'hano wa iwanhu wengi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:25">nogavikiza gaja ganongile kuulongozi wa awo okudumba.<verse eid="PSA 22:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 22:26"/>Wakiwa oja na kushiba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:26">iwanhu omzahila Mndewa Imulungu omtogola.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:26">Imulungu yawagwee ugima milele.<verse eid="PSA 22:26"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 22:27"/>Uhelelo wa isi yose okumbuka na kumbwelela Mndewa Imulungu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:27">Iwanhu wa isi zose omtambikila,<verse eid="PSA 22:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 22:28"/>kwavija Mndewa Imulungu ayo mndewa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:28">na kowatawala iwanhu wa isi zose.<verse eid="PSA 22:28"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 22:29"/>Iwanhu weli na kibuli mwiisi omtambikila kuulongozi wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:29">iwanhu wose ofa omfugamila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:29">iwanhu wose hawadaha kugoga ugima wao.<verse eid="PSA 22:29"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 22:30"/>Ulelo ukwiza omtambikila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:30">na ulelo onda wize osimuliligwa mbuli za Mndewa.<verse eid="PSA 22:30"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 22:31"/>Osimulila mbuli za haki yake.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:31">Iwanhu wang'hali hawanaleligwa olongeligwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:31">“Mndewa Imulungu ayo yatendile mbuli ayo!”<verse eid="PSA 22:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="PSA 23"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 23</para>
  <para style="d">(Zabuli ya Daudi.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 23:1"/>Mndewa Imulungu ayo msusilaji wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 23:1">niye siswela kinhu.<verse eid="PSA 23:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 23:2"/>Konihumuza mmajani mabisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 23:2">konilongoza behi na mazi gatindiwale.<verse eid="PSA 23:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 23:3"/>Koibwezela nguvu loho yangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 23:3">Konilongoza mnzila inogile mbuli ya twaga jake.<verse eid="PSA 23:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 23:4"/>Nahabita kudikonde da ziza kulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 23:4">sidumba kinhu chochose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 23:4">kwavija gweye Mndewa Imulungu kwa hamoja na niye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 23:4">mkongoja wako na fimbo yako vonikaliza.<verse eid="PSA 23:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 23:5"/>Konitendela nyimwilinyimwili kuulongozi wa iwanhu onihila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 23:5">kunigidila mavuta kudipala jangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 23:5">kikasi changu kukimemeza mbaka chokwitika.<verse eid="PSA 23:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 23:6"/>Kweli kunoga kwako na unogelo wako hawishaga vokuwa hamoja na niye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 23:6">siku zose za ugima wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 23:6">niye nokala mng'anda ya Mndewa Imulungu milele.<verse eid="PSA 23:6"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="PSA 24"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 24</para>
  <para style="d">(Zabuli ya Daudi.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 24:1"/>Isi na vose vili mumo vake Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 24:1">isi yose na wose okala mumo vake heyo.<verse eid="PSA 24:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 24:2"/>Kwavija heyo keka chandusilo chake uchanha ya bahali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 24:2">kasimika chandusilo uchanha ya mizanda ya mazi.<verse eid="PSA 24:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 24:3"/>Nani yonda yakwele kulugongo lwa Mndewa Imulungu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 24:3">Nani yonda yakale mng'anda yake ing'ala?<verse eid="PSA 24:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 24:4"/>Imunhu yeli na makono mazelu na moyo mzelu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 24:4">imunhu havizaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 24:4">na imunhu haiduwila kwa uvizi.<verse eid="PSA 24:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 24:5"/>Munhu ayo kobokela ganogile kulawa kwa Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 24:5">na haki kulawa kwa Imulungu mkombola wake.<verse eid="PSA 24:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 24:6"/>Uno awo ulelo wa iwanhu omkweleleza heyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 24:6">iwanhu ozahila kihanga chako, gweye Imulungu wa Yakobo.<verse eid="PSA 24:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 24:7"/>Vugukeni mweye milango,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 24:7">vugukeni mweye milango ya umwaka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 24:7">ili Mndewa yeli na udahi wose yengile.<verse eid="PSA 24:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 24:8"/>Nani ayo Mndewa yeli na udahi wose?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 24:8">Ayo Mndewa Imulungu, yeli na nguvu na mdaha gose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 24:8">heyo ayo Mndewa Imulungu, hahumwaga kung'hondo.<verse eid="PSA 24:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 24:9"/>Vugukeni mweye milango,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 24:9">vugukeni mweye milango ya umwaka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 24:9">ili Mndewa yeli na udahi wose yengile.<verse eid="PSA 24:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 24:10"/>Nani ayo Mndewa yeli na udahi wose?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 24:10">Ayo Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wa ukulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 24:10">heyo ayo Mndewa Imulungu yeli na udahi wose.<verse eid="PSA 24:10"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 24"/>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="PSA 25"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 25</para>
  <para style="d">(Zabuli ya Daudi.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 25:1"/>Mndewa Imulungu, kumwako noika loho yangu.<verse eid="PSA 25:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 25:2"/>Mndewa Imulungu, kumwako notamanila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:2">sikuunhende nyone kinyala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:2">sikuuwatende awo onihila waniseke nahahumwa.<verse eid="PSA 25:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 25:3"/>Sikuumuleke imunhu yokutamanila yakone kinyala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:3">ila wagwe kinyala wose okulema gweye giladi.<verse eid="PSA 25:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 25:4"/>Unongele nzila zako, gweye Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:4">unifunze ago goulonda.<verse eid="PSA 25:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 25:5"/>Unilongoze mna ikweli yako na unifunze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:5">kwavija gweye ayo Imulungu mkombola wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:5">nokutamanila gweye kila siku.<verse eid="PSA 25:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 25:6"/>Kumbuka bazi jako gweye Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:6">kumbuka unogelo wako hawishaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:6">kwavija avo kunavo tangu mwaka.<verse eid="PSA 25:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 25:7"/>Sikuuzikumbuke nzambi na gehile ga ubwanga wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:7">unikumbuke kamba unogelo wako hawishaga viwili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:7">kwavija gweye Mndewa Imulungu kunoga.<verse eid="PSA 25:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 25:8"/>Mndewa Imulungu kanoga na katelela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:8">avo kowafunza wene nzambi nzila zake.<verse eid="PSA 25:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 25:9"/>Kowalongoza wahole mzimbuli zinogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:9">na kowafunza wahole nzila zake.<verse eid="PSA 25:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 25:10"/>Mndewa Imulungu, kotenda kwa unogelo wake hawishaga na kutamanilwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:10">kwa awo ogoga lagano jake na amuli zake.<verse eid="PSA 25:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 25:11"/>Mbuli ya twaga jako, gweye Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:11">ugele kumgongo nzambi yangu ino kwavija ng'hulu.<verse eid="PSA 25:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 25:12"/>Kila munhu yomdumba Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:12">Mndewa Imulungu komulagusila nzila ya kubita.<verse eid="PSA 25:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 25:13"/>Munhu kamba ayo komweda siku zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:13">na ulelo wake oihazi isi.<verse eid="PSA 25:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 25:14"/>Mndewa Imulungu mbwiga wa awo omdumba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:14">heyo kowakumbusa lagano jake.<verse eid="PSA 25:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 25:15"/>Nomulola Mndewa Imulungu siku zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:15">heyo koilava migulu yangu mumtego.<verse eid="PSA 25:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 25:16"/>Mndewa Imulungu, unilole na unyonele bazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:16">kwavija niye namkiwa na nogaya.<verse eid="PSA 25:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 25:17"/>Unisegesele magazo ga mmoyo wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:17">unisegese mmadununzo.<verse eid="PSA 25:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 25:18"/>Ugalole magazo gangu na madununzo gangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:18">uzigele kumgongo nzambi zangu zose.<verse eid="PSA 25:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 25:19"/>Lola iwanhu onihila viwali wengi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:19">lola viwonihila kwa usede.<verse eid="PSA 25:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 25:20"/>Uulole goya ugima wangu, unikombole nokukimbilila gweye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:20">nokimbilila ukalizi wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:20">sikuutogole nigwe kinyala.<verse eid="PSA 25:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 25:21"/>Ganogile na haki vinikalize,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:21">kwavija nokutamanila gweye.<verse eid="PSA 25:21"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 25:22"/>Imulungu, uwakombole wanhu wako wa Izilaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:22">uwakombole kulawa mmagazo gao gose.<verse eid="PSA 25:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 25"/>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="PSA 26"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 26</para>
  <para style="d">(Zabuli ya Daudi.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 26:1"/>Mndewa Imulungu, uwalihe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 26:1">kwavija nikala bila kitala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 26:1">nikutamanila gweye bila kunyawanyawa.<verse eid="PSA 26:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 26:2"/>Unigeze na kunipima gweye Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 26:2">uulole moyo wangu na nzewele zangu.<verse eid="PSA 26:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 26:3"/>Unogelo wako hawishaga wa kuulongozi wa meso gangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 26:3">nokala mbuli ya kukutamanila.<verse eid="PSA 26:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 26:4"/>Sikala na wanhu wavizi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 26:4">sikala na wanhu watapitapi.<verse eid="PSA 26:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 26:5"/>Noihila miting'hano ya iwanhu wehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 26:5">na sikala na iwanhu wehile.<verse eid="PSA 26:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 26:6"/>Go Mndewa Imulungu, nonawa makono gangu kulagusa sitendile dihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 26:6">nouzunguluka upango wako wa nhosa.<verse eid="PSA 26:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 26:7"/>Nokwimba lwila lwa kukutogola gweye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 26:7">nosimulila sang'hano zako zose za unzonza.<verse eid="PSA 26:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 26:8"/>Mndewa Imulungu, nonogezwa na ng'anda yako aho houkala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 26:8">aho houkala ukulu wako.<verse eid="PSA 26:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 26:9"/>Sikuunibanange hamoja na wene nzambi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 26:9">na sikuunitupe hamoja na awo iwakomaji,<verse eid="PSA 26:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 26:10"/>iwanhu awo watendaga gehile siku zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 26:10">iwanhu wamemile hongo.<verse eid="PSA 26:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 26:11"/>Lakini niye nokala kwa moyo unogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 26:11">unyonele bazi na unikombole.<verse eid="PSA 26:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 26:12"/>Niye nima wima hanhu helibule magazo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 26:12">nomtogola Mndewa Imulungu mumting'hano mkulu.<verse eid="PSA 26:12"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 26"/>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="PSA 27"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 27</para>
  <para style="d">(Zabuli ya Daudi.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 27:1"/>Mndewa Imulungu ayo mulenge wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:1">na ukombola wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:1">niye nimdumbe nani?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:1">Mndewa Imulungu ayo ngome ya ugima wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:1">simdumba munhu yoyose.<verse eid="PSA 27:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 27:2"/>Wanhu wehile wahanivamila ili wanikome,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:2">awo iwanhu onihila oikwala na kugwa.<verse eid="PSA 27:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 27:3"/>Hata wakalizi wahanizunguluka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:3">moyo wangu haudumba kinhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:3">hata nahengila mna ing'hondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:3">ning'hali nokutamanila gweye.<verse eid="PSA 27:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 27:4"/>Mbuli imoja nimpula Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:4">na mbuli ayo noilonda ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:4">nikale mng'anda ya Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:4">siku zose za ugima wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:4">nilole ukunoga kwa Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:4">na nizahile ulongozi wake mng'anda yake.<verse eid="PSA 27:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 27:5"/>Siku ya magazo konifisa mkibanda chake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:5">konifisa mdihema jake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:5">na konika uchanha mdibwe.<verse eid="PSA 27:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 27:6"/>Na niye kwa deng'ho nowalola iwanhu onihila onizunguluka.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:6">Nomulavila nhosa kwa deng'ho mng'anda yake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:6">nomwimbila na kumdeng'helela Mndewa Imulungu.<verse eid="PSA 27:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 27:7"/>Utegeleze gweye Mndewa Imulungu, nokulilila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:7">unyonele bazi na unidike.<verse eid="PSA 27:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 27:8"/>Moyo wangu onilongela, “Izo umkweleleze Imulungu!”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:8">Avo nokwiza kumwako gweye Mndewa Imulungu.<verse eid="PSA 27:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 27:9"/>Sikuuleke kunilola kwa bazi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:9">Sikuundeme kwa ng'hasiliki yako niye msang'hanaji wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:9">gweye ayo unitaza siku zose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:9">Sikuunitupe wala kundeka, Imulungu Mkombola wangu.<verse eid="PSA 27:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 27:10"/>Hata kamba tatangu na mamangu wahanyasa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:10">Mndewa Imulungu konibokela kumwake.<verse eid="PSA 27:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 27:11"/>Unifunze nzila zako gweye Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:11">unilongoze mnzila igoloke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:11">mbuli ya iwanhu onihila.<verse eid="PSA 27:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 27:12"/>Sikuundeke iwanhu onihila wanitende viwolonda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:12">kwavija iwanhu osindila uvizi wanikweleleza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:12">na hewo onikomhokela kwa usede.<verse eid="PSA 27:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 27:13"/>Nojuwa nogona ganogile ga Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:13">mna ikae ya iwanhu wagima.<verse eid="PSA 27:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 27:14"/>Mtamanile Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:14">wamba, ufunye umoyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:14">mbete Mndewa Imulungu!<verse eid="PSA 27:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 27"/>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="PSA 28"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 28</para>
  <para style="d">(Zabuli ya Daudi.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 28:1"/>Nokulilila gweye Mndewa Imulungu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:1">Gweye dibwe da ugima wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:1">sikuuwe kamba mvugu kumwangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:1">Kamba hunitegeleza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:1">nokuwa kamba iwanhu ochola kudisimo da kuzimu.<verse eid="PSA 28:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 28:2"/>Utegeleze kililo changu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:2">unyonele bazi nahakukema unitaze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:2">nahenula makono gangu ako kuing'anda yako ing'ala.<verse eid="PSA 28:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 28:3"/>Sikuunitupe hamoja na iwanhu wehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:3">hamoja na iwanhu otenda gehile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:3">Iwanhu awo olonga na wayao mbuli zinogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:3">kumbe wamema gehile mmizoyo yao.<verse eid="PSA 28:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 28:4"/>Walihe kamba viwasang'hane na kamba viwatendile gehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:4">wagwelele kamba sang'hano ya makono gao viili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:4">uwalihe gaja golondigwa.<verse eid="PSA 28:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 28:5"/>Hewo hawaigelegeza isang'hano ya Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:5">hebu sang'hano ya makono gake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:5">kwa mbuli ayo kowabomola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:5">na hawazenga kabili.<verse eid="PSA 28:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 28:6"/>Yatogolwe Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:6">kwavija kahulika kupula kwangu.<verse eid="PSA 28:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 28:7"/>Mndewa Imulungu ayo nguvu zangu na ngao yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:7">niye nomtamanila heyo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:7">Heyo kanitaza na niye nodeng'helela kwa moyo wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:7">kwa lwila lwangu nomshukulu.<verse eid="PSA 28:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 28:8"/>Mndewa Imulungu ayo nguvu ya wanhu zake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:8">heyo ayo yokimbililwa na mndewa iyamsagule.<verse eid="PSA 28:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 28:9"/>Imulungu uwakombole wanhu zako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:9">uwatende wamwede iwanhu awo weli wako.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:9">Uwasusile na kuwataza milele.<verse eid="PSA 28:9"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 28"/>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="PSA 29"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 29</para>
  <para style="d">(Zabuli ya Daudi.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 29:1"/>Mgweleleni Mndewa Imulungu nhogolwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 29:1">mweye iviumbe wa kuulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 29:1">longeni Mndewa Imulungu kana ukulu na kana nguvu.<verse eid="PSA 29:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 29:2"/>Mgweleleni ukulu Mndewa Imulungu ufaya kwa twaga jake.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 29:2">Mtambikileni hanhu hake hong'ala.<verse eid="PSA 29:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 29:3"/>Sauti ya Mndewa Imulungu yohulikwa mgamazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 29:3">Imulungu mkulu kogala ng'huwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 29:3">sauti ya Mndewa Imulungu yohulikwa mbahali.<verse eid="PSA 29:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 29:4"/>Sauti ya Mndewa Imulungu ina nguvu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 29:4">sauti ya Mndewa Imulungu ibanza ukulu.<verse eid="PSA 29:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 29:5"/>Sauti ya Mndewa Imulungu yobena mielezi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 29:5">Mndewa Imulungu kobena bena mielezi ya Lebanoni.<verse eid="PSA 29:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 29:6"/>Kovitigisa vigongo va Lebanoni kamba mibiki viitigiswa na beho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 29:6">vigongo va Silioni kamba misanze.<verse eid="PSA 29:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 29:7"/>Sauti ya Mndewa Imulungu yolava lumwesa.<verse eid="PSA 29:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 29:8"/>Sauti ya Mndewa Imulungu yotigisa luwala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 29:8">Mndewa Imulungu kotigisa luwala lwa Kadeshi.<verse eid="PSA 29:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 29:9"/>Sauti ya Mndewa Imulungu yotigisa mibiki mikulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 29:9">na yokwanyula mibiki kumuhulo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 29:9">na mng'anda yake wose olonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 29:9">“Ukulu kwa Imulungu!”<verse eid="PSA 29:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 29:10"/>Mndewa Imulungu kotawala masika makulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 29:10">Mndewa Imulungu kotawala kamba Mndewa milele.<verse eid="PSA 29:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 29:11"/>Mndewa Imulungu yawagwee wanhu zake nguvu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 29:11">Mndewa Imulungu yawatendele wanhu zake ganogile na yawagwee tindiwalo.<verse eid="PSA 29:11"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 29"/>
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="PSA 30"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 30</para>
  <para style="d">(Zabuli ya kuipulila ng'anda ya Daudi.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 30:1"/>Gweye Mndewa Imulungu nokutogola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:1">kwavija kunikombola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:1">huwalekile iwanhu onihila waniseke.<verse eid="PSA 30:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 30:2"/>Gweye Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:2">nikulilila unitaze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:2">na gweye kunihonya.<verse eid="PSA 30:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 30:3"/>Mndewa Imulungu, kunikombola kulawa kuzimu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:3">kunigwaa kabili ugima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:3">kunisegesa mna iwanhu ochola kuzimu.<verse eid="PSA 30:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 30:4"/>Mwimbileni nhogolwa Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:4">mweye mutamanila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:4">kumbukeni ukung'ala kwake na kumshukulu.<verse eid="PSA 30:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 30:5"/>Ng'hasiliki yake yokala kwa siku ndodo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:5">kunoga kwake kumwetu kokala siku zose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:5">Kililo chodaha kukala kilo chose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:5">lakini imitondo modeng'ha.<verse eid="PSA 30:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 30:6"/>Niye vinimwedile nilonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:6">“Sidaha ng'o kuhumwa!”<verse eid="PSA 30:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 30:7"/>Kwa ganogile gako gweye Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:7">kunigangamiza kamba kigongo kikulu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:7">Lakini vuifisile kutali na niye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:7">na niye nigwaya.<verse eid="PSA 30:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 30:8"/>Nikulilila gweye Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:8">nikupula gweye Mndewa unitaze.<verse eid="PSA 30:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 30:9"/>“Kopata choni nahafa na kuchola kuzimu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:9">Vino timbwisi da iwanhu wafile dodaha kukugwaa nhogolwa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:9">Vino dodaha kusimulila kutamanila kwako?<verse eid="PSA 30:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 30:10"/>Utegeleze gweye Mndewa Imulungu, na unyonele bazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:10">gweye Mndewa Imulungu, unitaze!”<verse eid="PSA 30:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 30:11"/>Gweye kuhindula kuiyalala kwangu kamba ngoma ya deng'ho.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:11">Kunisegesela giogio jangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:11">kunizungulusila deng'ho.<verse eid="PSA 30:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 30:12"/>Niye nokutogola na sinyamala bule.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:12">Gweye Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wangu nokushukulu milele.<verse eid="PSA 30:12"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 30"/>
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="PSA 31"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 31</para>
  <para style="d">(Kwa kilanja, Zabuli ya Daudi.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 31:1"/>Kumwako gweye Mndewa Imulungu, nokimbilila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:1">sikuundeke ng'o nigwe kinyala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:1">kwa haki yako unikombole.<verse eid="PSA 31:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 31:2"/>Unihulike na unikombole sambi baha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:2">uwe kumwangu kamba dibwe da kukimbilila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:2">ngome ya kunikombola.<verse eid="PSA 31:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 31:3"/>Kwavija gweye ayo dibwe jangu na ngome yangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:3">Mbuli ya twaga jako unilongoze na undole goya.<verse eid="PSA 31:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 31:4"/>Kunilava mna ulwavu wanitegele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:4">kwavija gweye ayo kimbililo da ugima wangu.<verse eid="PSA 31:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 31:5"/>Mmakono gako noika loho yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:5">kunikombola, gweye Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu utamaniligwa.<verse eid="PSA 31:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 31:6"/>Niye nowehila iwanhu otambikila vinyago,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:6">lakini niye nokutamanila gweye Mndewa Imulungu.<verse eid="PSA 31:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 31:7"/>Nodeng'helela na kusekelela unogelo wako hawishaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:7">kwavija gweye konyona vinigaya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:7">kojuwa magazo ga moyo wangu.<verse eid="PSA 31:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 31:8"/>Gweye hunilekile nigeligwe mmakono ga iwanhu onihila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:8">kunimiza hanhu hana inyafasi.<verse eid="PSA 31:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 31:9"/>Go Mndewa Imulungu, unyonele bazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:9">niye nogaya na meso gangu gadonha kwa kugaya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:9">nabule nguvu mulukuli lwangu na mna iloho.<verse eid="PSA 31:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 31:10"/>Ugima wangu udonha kwa lusikisiki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:10">ayo imiyaka yangu kwa kuiyalala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:10">Nabule nguvu mbuli ya kugaya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:10">hata mizege yangu inyala.<verse eid="PSA 31:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 31:11"/>Iwanhu onihila onibezeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:11">sambi nosekigwa na iwanhu weli behi na niye.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:11">Mbwiga zangu onyona kamba kilozo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:11">wahanyona mnzila onikimbila.<verse eid="PSA 31:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 31:12"/>Nisemwigwa kamba munhu yadanganike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:12">niye kamba nongo ibeneke beneke.<verse eid="PSA 31:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 31:13"/>Nohulika wanhu wengi oinyong'onyela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:13">vinhu avo vogala bwembwe kila mwambu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:13">oisasala mbuli yangu, olonda kunikoma.<verse eid="PSA 31:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 31:14"/>Lakini niye nokutamanila gweye, Mndewa Imulungu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:14">Nolonga, “Gweye kwa Imulungu wangu!”<verse eid="PSA 31:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 31:15"/>Ugima wangu wammakono gako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:15">unikombole na iwanhu onihila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:15">unikombole na iwanhu onidununza.<verse eid="PSA 31:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 31:16"/>Unimwemwesele kihanga chako niye msang'hanaji wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:16">unikombole kwa unogelo wako hawishaga.<verse eid="PSA 31:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 31:17"/>Sikuundeke nigwe kinyala gweye Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:17">kwavija niye nokupula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:17">lakini waleke iwanhu wehile wagwe kinyala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:17">waleke wapotele tulu tulu ako kuzimu.<verse eid="PSA 31:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 31:18"/>Ifunge imilomo ya iwanhu awo iwavizi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:18">wanhu awo oitapa na kubezeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:18">awo owabezeli iwanhu wanogile.<verse eid="PSA 31:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 31:19"/>Lola unogelo wako viwili mkulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:19">kuwekila iwanhu okudumba gweye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:19">kutenda avo mbuli ya wose okukimbilila gweye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:19">mgameso ga iwanhu wose.<verse eid="PSA 31:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 31:20"/>Kowafisa hanhu hanogile aho houkala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:20">kutali na magesa gehile ga iwanhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:20">kowakaliza goya mdihema jako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:20">kutali na gehile golawa mmilomo ya wanhu.<verse eid="PSA 31:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 31:21"/>Yatogolwe Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:21">kwavija kanilagusila unogelo wake hawishaga viwili wa unzonza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:21">viwanizunguluke kamba buga divamilwe.<verse eid="PSA 31:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 31:22"/>Na niye nilonga kwa bwembwe jangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:22">“Nitupigwa kutali na meso gako.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:22">Lakini kuihulika sauti ya kupula kwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:22">vinikupulile unyonele bazi.<verse eid="PSA 31:22"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 31:23"/>Mnogeleni Mndewa Imulungu, mweye iwanhu zake wose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:23">Mndewa Imulungu kowalola goya iwanhu omtamanila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:23">lakini kowakoboza kamba viilondigwa iwanhu oigoda.<verse eid="PSA 31:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 31:24"/>Mugangamale na mufunge umoyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:24">mweye mose mumbeta Mndewa Imulungu!<verse eid="PSA 31:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 31"/>
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="PSA 32"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 32</para>
  <para style="d">(Zabuli ya Daudi. Kufunza.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 32:1"/>Kamweda imunhu nzambi zake zigeligwa kumgongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:1">imunhu nzambi zake zisegesigwa kabisa.<verse eid="PSA 32:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 32:2"/>Kamweda imunhu Mndewa Imulungu hagelegeza gehile gake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:2">imunhu yelibule uvizi mmoyo wake.<verse eid="PSA 32:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 32:3"/>Vinikalile sinatogola kamba nhenda nzambi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:3">nikala nidonhile kwa kulila imisi yose.<verse eid="PSA 32:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 32:4"/>Imisi na ikilo mkono wake undemela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:4">nguvu zangu zifonzigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:4">kamba mazi kipindi cha zuwa kali.<verse eid="PSA 32:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 32:5"/>Abaho nizitambula nzambi zangu kumwako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:5">na sigafisile gehile gangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:5">Nilonga, “Nozitogola nzambi zangu kumwako gweye Mndewa Imulungu.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:5">Abaho gweye kuzigela kumgongo nzambi zangu zose.<verse eid="PSA 32:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 32:6"/>Avo, kila imunhu yotamanilwa yakupule gweye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:6">mkipindi cha magazo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:6">mazi ga masika gahenuka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:6">hagamkulula heyo.<verse eid="PSA 32:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 32:7"/>Gweye ayo hanhu hangu ha kuifisila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:7">gweye konikaliza mmagazo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:7">Kunigubika kwa nyila za ukombola.<verse eid="PSA 32:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 32:8"/>Imulungu kolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:8">“Nokufunza na kukulagusila nzila yuulondigwa kubita,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:8">nokuzuma na siso jangu dokulola gweye.<verse eid="PSA 32:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 32:9"/>Sikuuwe mbozi kamba falasi hebu kihongwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:9">awo walemaga kukukwesela gweye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:9">mbaka wakwegigwe kwa nzabi.”<verse eid="PSA 32:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 32:10"/>Iwanhu wehile opata magazo mengi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:10">lakini iwanhu omtamanila Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:10">ozungulukwa na unogelo wake hawishaga.<verse eid="PSA 32:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 32:11"/>Mdeng'heleleni Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:11">deng'heleleni mweye iwanhu wanogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:11">toweni ng'henze za deng'ho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:11">mweye iwanhu muli na mizoyo inogile.<verse eid="PSA 32:11"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 32"/>
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="PSA 33"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 33</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 33:1"/>Mwimbileni Mndewa Imulungu kwa deng'ho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:1">mweye iwanhu wene haki.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:1">Kumtogola Imulungu kowafaya iwanhu wene imizoyo inogile.<verse eid="PSA 33:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 33:2"/>Mtogoleni Mndewa Imulungu kwa bango,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:2">mwimbileni kwa kilimba kili na nzabi longo.<verse eid="PSA 33:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 33:3"/>Mwimbileni lwila lwa sambi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:3">toweni bango na mutowe ng'henze za deng'ho.<verse eid="PSA 33:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 33:4"/>Mbuli ya Mndewa Imulungu ya ukweli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:4">heyo kotamaniligwa mzisang'hano zake zose.<verse eid="PSA 33:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 33:5"/>Imulungu konogezwa na ganogile na haki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:5">isi yose imema unogelo hawishaga wa Mndewa Imulungu.<verse eid="PSA 33:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 33:6"/>Ulanga ulumbigwa kwa mbuli ya Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:6">ivinhu vose vili kuulanga vilumbigwa kwa mhumuzi ya mulomo wake.<verse eid="PSA 33:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 33:7"/>Kagalundiza gamazi ga ibahali kamba kisugulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:7">vidibo va bahali kavika kukanho kamba munhu viyokwika ndiya.<verse eid="PSA 33:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 33:8"/>Isi yose na imdumbe Mndewa Imulungu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:8">Iwanhu wose okala mwiisi wamtogole.<verse eid="PSA 33:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 33:9"/>Kwavija kalonga na isi iwa kuko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:9">kalagiza na isi ilawilila.<verse eid="PSA 33:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 33:10"/>Mndewa Imulungu kohindula mipango ya iwanhu wa isi ziyagwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:10">na kogahindula ago gowolonda.<verse eid="PSA 33:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 33:11"/>Mipango ya Mndewa Imulungu yosigala milele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:11">goyolonda gosigala ulelo mbaka ulelo.<verse eid="PSA 33:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 33:12"/>Imweda isi ayo Imulungu wake ayo Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:12">wamweda iwanhu yawasagule kamba iwanhu zake mwenyego.<verse eid="PSA 33:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 33:13"/>Mndewa Imulungu kolola hasi kulawa kuulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:13">na kowalola iwanhu wose.<verse eid="PSA 33:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 33:14"/>Kulawa hanhu hake hoyokala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:14">kowalola iwanhu wose okala mwiisi.<verse eid="PSA 33:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 33:15"/>Heyo yalumbile mizoyo ya iwanhu wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:15">heyo kojuwa kila kinhu kiwotenda.<verse eid="PSA 33:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 33:16"/>Mndewa hakomboligwa kwavija kana wakalizi wengi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:16">na imunhu galu hohuma kwa nguvu zake nyingi.<verse eid="PSA 33:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 33:17"/>Falasi wa ing'hondo hafaya kinhu ili munhu yahume,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:17">nguvu zake nyingi hazidaha kumkombola munhu.<verse eid="PSA 33:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 33:18"/>Lakini, Mndewa Imulungu kowalola iwanhu omdumba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:18">iwanhu obeta unogelo wake hawishaga,<verse eid="PSA 33:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 33:19"/>heyo kowakombola kulawa mwiiifa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:19">koweka wagima kipindi cha nzala.<verse eid="PSA 33:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 33:20"/>Mizoyo yetu yombetela Mndewa Imulungu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:20">Heyo ayo yotutaza na ngao yetu.<verse eid="PSA 33:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 33:21"/>Todeng'helela kwa mbuli yake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:21">totamanila kwa twaga jake ding'ala.<verse eid="PSA 33:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 33:22"/>Go Mndewa Imulungu, unogelo wako hawishaga ukale na siye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:22">kwavija siye tokutamanila gweye.<verse eid="PSA 33:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 33"/>
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="PSA 34"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 34</para>
  <para style="d">(Zabuli ya Daudi mbuli ya kipindi viyaitendile kana lukwale kuulongozi wa Abimeleki, abaho kawingigwa.)<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">34:0 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola kitabu cha 1 Samweli 21:10-22:1.</char></note></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 34:1"/>Go Mndewa Imulungu, nokutogola siku zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:1">nhogolwa zako zokala mmulomo wangu siku zose.<verse eid="PSA 34:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 34:2"/>Niye nodeng'helela mbuli ya Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:2">wakiwa wahulike na kudeng'helela.<verse eid="PSA 34:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 34:3"/>Mtogoleni Mndewa Imulungu hamoja na niye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:3">wose hamoja tuditogole twaga jake.<verse eid="PSA 34:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 34:4"/>Nimpula Mndewa Imulungu na heyo kanidika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:4">na kanisegesela kudumba kwangu.<verse eid="PSA 34:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 34:5"/>Wanhu omuhindukila Imulungu odeng'helela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:5">na vihanga vao vabule kinyala.<verse eid="PSA 34:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 34:6"/>Mkiwa kamulilila Mndewa Imulungu na heyo kamuhulika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:6">na kamkombola na magazo gake gose.<verse eid="PSA 34:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 34:7"/>Msenga wa Mndewa Imulungu kowakaliza iwanhu wose omdumba Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:7">na kowakombola mmagazo.<verse eid="PSA 34:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 34:8"/>Gezeni mulole Mndewa Imulungu viyanogile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:8">Kamweda imunhu yomkimbilila heyo ili yakale goya.<verse eid="PSA 34:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 34:9"/>Mdumbeni Mndewa Imulungu mweye iwanhu zake wang'alile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:9">kwavija iwanhu omdumba heyo hawaswela kinhu.<verse eid="PSA 34:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 34:10"/>Wana simba oswela kinhu na okona nzala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:10">lakini iwanhu omkweleleza Mndewa Imulungu hawaswela kinhu chochose kinogile.<verse eid="PSA 34:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 34:11"/>Izoni mweye iwana munitegeleze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:11">na niye nowafunza kumdumba Mndewa Imulungu.<verse eid="PSA 34:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 34:12"/>Vino kolonda kudeng'helela ugima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:12">na kukala miyaka mingi na kudeng'helela ganogile?<verse eid="PSA 34:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 34:13"/>Avo, leka kulonga gehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:13">na leka kulonga uvizi.<verse eid="PSA 34:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 34:14"/>Leka gehile, utende ganogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:14">uzahile tindiwalo na udigoge.<verse eid="PSA 34:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 34:15"/>Mndewa Imulungu kowalola iwanhu wanogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:15">na kotegeleza kililo chao,<verse eid="PSA 34:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 34:16"/>lakini kowalema iwanhu otenda gehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:16">kofuta matwaga gao mwiisi.<verse eid="PSA 34:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 34:17"/>Iwanhu wanogile wahamulilila Mndewa Imulungu, heyo kowategeleza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:17">na kowakombola kulawa mmagazo gao gose.<verse eid="PSA 34:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 34:18"/>Mndewa Imulungu kabehi na iwanhu wali na lusikisiki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:18">kowakombola wose wahondigwe mmizoyo.<verse eid="PSA 34:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 34:19"/>Magazo ga imunhu yanogile mengi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:19">lakini Mndewa Imulungu komsegesela gose.<verse eid="PSA 34:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 34:20"/>Kolukaliza lukuli lwake lose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:20">haduhu hata zege jake donda dibenigwe.<verse eid="PSA 34:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 34:21"/>Gehile gomkoma imunhu yotenda gehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:21">iwanhu omwihila mwene haki otagusigwa.<verse eid="PSA 34:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 34:22"/>Mndewa Imulungu kouhonya ugima wa wasang'hanaji wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:22">wose omkimbilila hawatagusigwa.<verse eid="PSA 34:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 34"/>
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="PSA 35"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 35</para>
  <para style="d">(Zabuli ya Daudi.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 35:1"/>Go Mndewa Imulungu, uwaleme iwanhu onilema niye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:1">uwatowe iwanhu onitowa niye.<verse eid="PSA 35:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 35:2"/>Usole ngao yako na kikimilo chako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:2">winuke wize unitaze.<verse eid="PSA 35:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 35:3"/>Ulave mgoha wako na sime jako uwakimile awo onikweleleza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:3">ilongele loho yangu kamba konikombola.<verse eid="PSA 35:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 35:4"/>Waleke wagwe kinyala na wabezigwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:4">awo okweleleza ugima wangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:4">Wabwele kuchugu kwa kinyala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:4">awo ogelegeza gehile kumwangu.<verse eid="PSA 35:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 35:5"/>Waleke wawe kamba mipepe ihembelusigwa na beho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:5">na imsenga wa Mndewa Imulungu yawawinge!<verse eid="PSA 35:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 35:6"/>Leka nzila zao ziwe na ziza na kutelebuka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:6">na msenga wa Mndewa Imulungu yawakweleleze.<verse eid="PSA 35:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 35:7"/>Sitendile dihile ila wanitegela lwavu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:7">sitendile dihile ila wanihimbila simo.<verse eid="PSA 35:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 35:8"/>Leka gehile gampate kwa kusinhukiza.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:8">Leka ulwavu luyategile lumgoge heyo mwenyego,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:8">leka yagwile mumo na yafe.<verse eid="PSA 35:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 35:9"/>Abaho loho yangu yomdeng'helela Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:9">koninula muukombola wake.<verse eid="PSA 35:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 35:10"/>Mizege yangu yose yolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:10">“Go Mndewa Imulungu, nani kamba gweye?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:10">Komkombola mkiwa kulawa kwa ayo yeli na nguvu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:10">komkombola mkiwa na ngaengae kulawa wa ayo yomwibila.”<verse eid="PSA 35:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 35:11"/>Wasindila wa gehile okwima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:11">oniuza mbuli sizijuwile.<verse eid="PSA 35:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 35:12"/>Oniliha gehile hanhu ha ganogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:12">hata loho yangu ina lusikisiki.<verse eid="PSA 35:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 35:13"/>Lakini viwakugule hewo, niye nivala magunia kulagusa kuiyalala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:13">niye nifunga kuja, nipula akuno niidulika pala jangu,<verse eid="PSA 35:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 35:14"/>nhenda avo kamba mbwigangu hebu ndugu yangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:14">Niidulika pala jangu kwa lusikisiki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:14">kamba munhu yomuyalalila mamake.<verse eid="PSA 35:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 35:15"/>Lakini niye vinigwile waiting'hana kunilonga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:15">Waiting'hana kunivamila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:15">wanhu siwajuwile wanivamila bila kuleka,<verse eid="PSA 35:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 35:16"/>bila hishima wanibezeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:16">na wanidafunila meno gao.<verse eid="PSA 35:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 35:17"/>Mbaka lini gweye Mndewa kolola tu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:17">Unikombole kulawa mmagazo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:17">ukombole ugima wangu unogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:17">kulawa kwa iwanhu onivamila kamba simba.<verse eid="PSA 35:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 35:18"/>Nokushukulu mna umting'hano mkulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:18">mna ikibumbila cha wanhu nokutogola.<verse eid="PSA 35:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 35:19"/>Sikuuwaleke iwanhu onihila ng'hani wanilonge vihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:19">awo onihila bila kilamuso wadeng'helele vinigaya.<verse eid="PSA 35:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 35:20"/>Kwavija hawalonga tindiwalo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:20">ila olonga gehile kwa awo iwahole mwiisi.<verse eid="PSA 35:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 35:21"/>Na hewo ogubula milomo yao onilonga vihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:21">olonga, “Amweye! Amweye! Meso getu gona.”<verse eid="PSA 35:21"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 35:22"/>Kona mwenyego gweye Mndewa Imulungu, sikuunyamale!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:22">Sikuuwe kutali na niye!<verse eid="PSA 35:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 35:23"/>Lamuka, ukale meso ili utaguse mbuli ya ayo onihila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:23">Imulungu wangu na Mndewa wangu.<verse eid="PSA 35:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 35:24"/>Unitaguse kwa haki yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:24">gweye Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:24">na sikuuwaleke wanilonge.<verse eid="PSA 35:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 35:25"/>Sikuwalonge mmizoyo yao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:25">Ona, vivo vitulonda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:25">sambi walonge “Tummeza.”<verse eid="PSA 35:25"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 35:26"/>Wagwe kinyala, waumbuke hamoja,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:26">awo odeng'helela mbuli zangu vizichola vihile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:26">Wagwe kinyala na kugaya awo oikweza kumwangu.<verse eid="PSA 35:26"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 35:27"/>Iwanhu odeng'helela haki yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:27">walonge, “Mndewa Imulungu mkulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:27">konogezwa na ukumweda kwa msang'hanaji wake.”<verse eid="PSA 35:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 35:28"/>Lulimi lwangu lolonga haki yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:28">na lolonga nhogolwa zako siku zose.<verse eid="PSA 35:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 35"/>
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="PSA 36"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 36</para>
  <para style="d">(Kwa kilanja, Zabuli ya Daudi msang'hanaji wa Mndewa Imulungu.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 36:1"/>Nzambi yolonga na imunhu yehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:1">mgati mmoyo wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:1">haduhu kumdumba Imulungu mgameso gake.<verse eid="PSA 36:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 36:2"/>Imunhu yehile koinogela mwenyego,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:2">na kogelegeza kamba gehile gake hagajuwigwa na kuduwiligwa.<verse eid="PSA 36:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 36:3"/>Mbuli za mulomo wake ziha na za uvizi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:3">kaleka kugelegeza goya na kutenda ganogile.<verse eid="PSA 36:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 36:4"/>Kogelegeza gehile mulusazi lwake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:4">koika mwenyego mnzila hainogile, hagalema gehile.<verse eid="PSA 36:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 36:5"/>Unogelo wako hawishaga gweye Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:5">uvika mbaka kuulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:5">kotamanilwa mbaka mmawingu.<verse eid="PSA 36:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 36:6"/>Haki yako kamba lugongo lwa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:6">nhaguso yako kamba kidibo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:6">kowakaliza iwanhu na iwanyama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:6">gweye Mndewa Imulungu.<verse eid="PSA 36:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 36:7"/>Unogelo wako hawishaga gweye Mndewa Imulungu, unoga ng'hani!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:7">Wana wa iwanhu okimbilila sisila da mabawa gako.<verse eid="PSA 36:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 36:8"/>Okwiguta ukunona kwa ivinhu va mng'anda yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:8">na kowagwaa king'waji kulawa kuulwanda lwa ganogile gako.<verse eid="PSA 36:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 36:9"/>Kumwako gweye kuna nzasa ya ugima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:9">kudilenge jako tokona mulenge.<verse eid="PSA 36:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 36:10"/>Gendeleza unogelo wako hawishaga kwa awo okujuwa gweye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:10">na haki yako kwa awo wene mizoyo inogile.<verse eid="PSA 36:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 36:11"/>Sikuutogole wanhu oitapa wanivamile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:11">hebu iwanhu wehile wanikimbize.<verse eid="PSA 36:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 36:12"/>Iwanhu otenda gehile wa hasi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:12">wakandamizwa na hawadaha kwinuka.<verse eid="PSA 36:12"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 36"/>
  <chapter number="37" style="c" sid="PSA 37"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 37</para>
  <para style="d">(Zabuli ya Daudi.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 37:1"/>Sikuuigaze mbuli ya iwanhu otenda gehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:1">sikuuwonele migongo iwanhu wehile.<verse eid="PSA 37:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 37:2"/>Kwavija onyala himahima kamba mijani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:2">na ofa kamba minoga mibisi.<verse eid="PSA 37:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 37:3"/>Mtamanile Mndewa Imulungu, na utende ganogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:3">ukale mwiisi na udeng'helele goya ganogile.<verse eid="PSA 37:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 37:4"/>Zahila deng'ho jako kwa Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:4">na heyo kokugwaa gaja gousulukila mmoyo wako.<verse eid="PSA 37:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 37:5"/>Mgwelele Mndewa Imulungu nzila zako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:5">mtamanile heyo, na heyo kokutendela vino.<verse eid="PSA 37:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 37:6"/>Koilava kunze haki yako kamba mulenge,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:6">na haki ya kitala chako kamba zuwa da imisi.<verse eid="PSA 37:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 37:7"/>Ukale tuluu kuulongozi wa Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:7">na umbete kwa kufunga umoyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:7">sikuuigaze mbuli ya imunhu yomweda mnzila yake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:7">na imunhu yogelegeza gehile.<verse eid="PSA 37:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 37:8"/>Sikuugevuzike na uleke ludoko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:8">sikuugevuzike buleavo kotenda gehile.<verse eid="PSA 37:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 37:9"/>Kwavija iwanhu otenda gehile okanhigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:9">lakini iwanhu ombeta Mndewa Imulungu oihazi isi.<verse eid="PSA 37:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 37:10"/>Kwavija kisigala kipindi kidodo iwanhu wehile olawanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:10">kowazahila kuwakalile lakini okuwa kuduhu.<verse eid="PSA 37:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 37:11"/>Lakini iwanhu wahole oihazi isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:11">na odeng'helela mna iditindiwalo kulu.<verse eid="PSA 37:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 37:12"/>Imunhu yehile kogelegeza mbuli ya imunhu mwene haki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:12">na kodafuna meno gake mbuli yake,<verse eid="PSA 37:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 37:13"/>lakini Mndewa komseka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:13">kwavija kolola kamba siku yake yokwiza.<verse eid="PSA 37:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 37:14"/>Iwanhu wehile osomola sime na upinde wao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:14">ili wamkome mkiwa na ngaengae,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:14">na wawachinje iwanhu otenda ganogile.<verse eid="PSA 37:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 37:15"/>Lakini misime yao ingile mmizoyo yao wenyego,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:15">na pinde zao zibeneke.<verse eid="PSA 37:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 37:16"/>Kidodo kiyelinacho mwene haki kinoga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:16">kubanza ivingi viwelinavo iwanhu wehile.<verse eid="PSA 37:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 37:17"/>Kwavija nguvu za iwanhu wehile zobenigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:17">lakini Mndewa Imulungu komgoga mwene haki.<verse eid="PSA 37:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 37:18"/>Mndewa Imulungu koukaliza ugima wa iwanhu wanogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:18">na uhazi wao okala milele,<verse eid="PSA 37:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 37:19"/>zahavika siku zihile hawagwa kinyala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:19">mna zisiku za nzala okuwa na vingi.<verse eid="PSA 37:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 37:20"/>Lakini iwanhu wehile opotela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:20">awo omwihila Mndewa Imulungu onyala kamba maluwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:20">na osegela kamba yosi.<verse eid="PSA 37:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 37:21"/>Iwanhu wehile okopa lakini hawabweza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:21">lakini wene haki olava kwa moyo unogile.<verse eid="PSA 37:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 37:22"/>Kwavija awo otambikilwa na Mndewa Imulungu oihazi isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:22">lakini awo waduwiligwe okanhigwa.<verse eid="PSA 37:22"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 37:23"/>Kamba Mndewa Imulungu yahanogezwa na nzila ya munhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:23">kozikaliza ngayo zake.<verse eid="PSA 37:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 37:24"/>Hamoja kogwa, hasigala hasi siku zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:24">kwavija Mndewa Imulungu komtaza.<verse eid="PSA 37:24"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 37:25"/>Nikala mbwanga, na sambi namvele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:25">lakini sinamona mwene haki kalekigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:25">hebu wanage opula ndiya.<verse eid="PSA 37:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 37:26"/>Siku zose heyo kokopesha kwa moyo unogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:26">wanage okuwa nhunza.<verse eid="PSA 37:26"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 37:27"/>Leka gehile utende ganogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:27">na gweye kokala milele.<verse eid="PSA 37:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 37:28"/>Kwavija Mndewa Imulungu konogezwa na haki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:28">hawaleka iwanhu wake otamanilwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:28">kowakaliza milele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:28">lakini iwana wa iwanhu wehile osegesigwa.<verse eid="PSA 37:28"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 37:29"/>Iwanhu wanogile oihazi isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:29">na okala mwiisi ayo milele.<verse eid="PSA 37:29"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 37:30"/>Mulomo wa imunhu yanogile olonga mbuli za ubala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:30">na lulimi lwake lolonga mbuli za haki.<verse eid="PSA 37:30"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 37:31"/>Malagizo ga Imulungu wake ga mmoyo wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:31">magulu gake hagatelebuka.<verse eid="PSA 37:31"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 37:32"/>Wanhu wehile waifisa kuwavamila wene haki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:32">olonda kuwakoma.<verse eid="PSA 37:32"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 37:33"/>Mndewa Imulungu hamgela imunhu yanogile mmakono ga iwanhu wehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:33">na hamuleka yahumwe yahagaligwa mkitala.<verse eid="PSA 37:33"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 37:34"/>Mtamanile Mndewa Imulungu na ugoge nzila zake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:34">na heyo kokukuza uitawale isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:34">na kowona iwanhu wehile vonda wabanangwe.<verse eid="PSA 37:34"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 37:35"/>Nimona imunhu yehile msede,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:35">kaikweza uchanha ya wose kamba mwelezi wa Lebanoni.<verse eid="PSA 37:35"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 37:36"/>Lakini kalawanya hakoneke kabili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:36">hamoja nimzahila hakoneke kabili.<verse eid="PSA 37:36"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 37:37"/>Muloleni imunhu yelibule kitala na imunhu yanogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:37">kwavija imunhu yodinogela tindiwalo kana siku nyingi za kukala ako kumwande.<verse eid="PSA 37:37"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 37:38"/>Lakini iwanhu wose otenda nzambi obanangwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:38">ugima wa ako kumwande wa awo wehile okanhigwa.<verse eid="PSA 37:38"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 37:39"/>Ukombola wa iwanhu wanogile olawa kwa Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:39">heyo ayo ngome yao mmagazo.<verse eid="PSA 37:39"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 37:40"/>Mndewa Imulungu kowataza na kowakombola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:40">kowakombola kulawa mmakono ga iwanhu wehile na kowalekesa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:40">kwavija hewo wamkimbilila heyo.<verse eid="PSA 37:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 37"/>
  <chapter number="38" style="c" sid="PSA 38"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 38</para>
  <para style="d">(Zabuli ya Daudi. Kopula yakumbukigwe na Imulungu.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 38:1"/>Go Mndewa Imulungu, sikuunizume kwa ng'hasiliki yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:1">sikuunikoboze wahagevuzika.<verse eid="PSA 38:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 38:2"/>Misale yako inihoma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:2">na mkono wako unizila niye kulawa uchanha.<verse eid="PSA 38:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 38:3"/>Haduhu hanhu haholile mulukuli lwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:3">kwavija gweye kugevuzika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:3">haduhu zege digangamale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:3">mbuli ya nzambi yangu.<verse eid="PSA 38:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 38:4"/>Nzambi zangu zinigubika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:4">kamba zigo kulu dimulemelaga munhu.<verse eid="PSA 38:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 38:5"/>Milonda yangu yola na yonung'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:5">mbuli ya ubozi wangu.<verse eid="PSA 38:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 38:6"/>Ninamizwa hasi na kuhumuluswa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:6">imisi yose nozunguluka kuno noiyalala.<verse eid="PSA 38:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 38:7"/>Kigudi changu kimema usungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:7">haduhu ugima mulukuli lwangu.<verse eid="PSA 38:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 38:8"/>Nonyolila na kuhondigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:8">nogutilila mbuli ya usungu uli mmoyo wangu.<verse eid="PSA 38:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 38:9"/>Go Mndewa, vose vinisulukila kuvijuwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:9">kugutilila kwangu kokujuwa goya.<verse eid="PSA 38:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 38:10"/>Moyo wangu odunda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:10">nguvu nabule, hata meso gangu gavulala.<verse eid="PSA 38:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 38:11"/>Mbwiga zangu na wayangu, okala kutali na niye mbuli ya utamu wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:11">iwanhu okala behi na niye okwima kutali.<verse eid="PSA 38:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 38:12"/>Waja ozahila ugima wangu, otega mitego yao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:12">waja olonda niye nilumile onilonga vihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:12">na ogelegeza gehile siku zose.<verse eid="PSA 38:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 38:13"/>Niye na kamba mvugu, sihulika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:13">kamba imunhu bubui hodaha bule kulonga.<verse eid="PSA 38:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 38:14"/>Ona na kamba munhu hahulika, imunhu hedikaga mbuli bule.<verse eid="PSA 38:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 38:15"/>Go Mndewa Imulungu, niye nokubeta gweye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:15">gweye kokwidika gweye Mndewa, Imulungu wangu.<verse eid="PSA 38:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 38:16"/>Kwavija niye nilonga, “Sikuuwaleke wadeng'helele mbuli yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:16">na sambi waitape mbuli ya kugwa kwangu.”<verse eid="PSA 38:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 38:17"/>Kwavija na mmabehi kugwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:17">na usungu wangu onigaza siku zose.<verse eid="PSA 38:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 38:18"/>Nolonga gehile gangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:18">nogazika kwa nzambi yangu.<verse eid="PSA 38:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 38:19"/>Iwanhu onihila wana nguvu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:19">iwanhu onihila bila mbuli yoyose wengi ng'hani.<verse eid="PSA 38:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 38:20"/>Oniliha gehile kwa gaja ganogile ganitendile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:20">onilema nahatenda ganogile.<verse eid="PSA 38:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 38:21"/>Go Mndewa Imulungu, sikuundeke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:21">sikuukale kutali na niye, gweye Imulungu wangu.<verse eid="PSA 38:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 38:22"/>Go Mndewa, Mkombola wangu, wize hima unitaze.<verse eid="PSA 38:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 38"/>
  <chapter number="39" style="c" sid="PSA 39"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 39</para>
  <para style="d">(Zabuli ya Daudi. Kwa kilanja, yatumie modeli wa Yedutuni.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 39:1"/>Nilonga, “Noilola goya, sambi nitende gehile kwa lulimi lwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:1">nofunga mulomo wangu sikunilonge siku zose iwanhu wehile viweli behi na niye.”<verse eid="PSA 39:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 39:2"/>Nikala silonga, ninyamala tuluu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:2">na ning'hali nabule tamanilo na usungu wangu ubanza.<verse eid="PSA 39:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 39:3"/>Moyo upata moto mgati yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:3">vinigelegeze ukwaka moto,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:3">avo nilonga kwa lulimi lwangu.<verse eid="PSA 39:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 39:4"/>“Go Mndewa Imulungu, nilongele ikimambukizo cha ugima wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:4">na siku zangu vizili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:4">na nijuwe avija ugima wangu viwili mguhi.<verse eid="PSA 39:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 39:5"/>Kuutenda ugima wangu mguhi kamba kidole nyomhwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:5">siku zangu za kukala kamba mduhu kinhu kumwako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:5">ugima wa kila munhu kamba mhumuzi.<verse eid="PSA 39:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 39:6"/>Kila munhu kamba nzozi kochola kuno na kuno,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:6">koigaza na vinhu vingi lakini kogaya bule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:6">Kokwika vinhu lakini hajuwa nani yonda yasole.<verse eid="PSA 39:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 39:7"/>Avo, sambi Mndewa, niye nobeta choni?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:7">Niye nokutamanila gweye.<verse eid="PSA 39:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 39:8"/>Nihonye kulawa mzinzambi zangu zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:8">sikuutogole wabozi wanibezeli.<verse eid="PSA 39:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 39:9"/>Niye na bubui, sifungula bule mulomo wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:9">kwavija gweye ayo utendile gano.<verse eid="PSA 39:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 39:10"/>Nisegesele mbalati yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:10">nopotela kwa mikubulo ya makono gako.<verse eid="PSA 39:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 39:11"/>Kowakoboza na kowazuma iwanhu mbuli ya nzambi zao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:11">kounanga utajili wao kamba mbumundu viyonanga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:11">Ugima wa kila munhu kamba mhumuzi.<verse eid="PSA 39:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 39:12"/>Utegeleze kupula kwangu, gweye Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:12">tega gwiti jako uhulike vinilila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:12">sikuunyamale nahalila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:12">niye na kamba mgeni yobita nzila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:12">niye na mbita nzila kamba viwakalile wahenga zangu wose.<verse eid="PSA 39:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 39:13"/>Sikuundole ili niye nideng'helele kidogo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:13">ning'hali sinadanganika na kulawanya.”<verse eid="PSA 39:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 39"/>
  <chapter number="40" style="c" sid="PSA 40"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 40</para>
  <para style="d">(Kwa kilanja, Zabuli ya Daudi.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 40:1"/>Nimbeta Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:1">na heyo kaninamila na kategeleza kulila kwangu.<verse eid="PSA 40:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 40:2"/>Kanilava kulawa mdisimo da kubanangigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:2">kulawa mmatope na utelevu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:2">kanimiza goya uchanha ya dibwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:2">na kanigwaa hanhu hanogile ha kwima.<verse eid="PSA 40:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 40:3"/>Keka lwila lwa sambi mmulomo wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:3">lwila lwa kumtogola Mndewa Imulungu wetu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:3">Wengi wone na wadumbe na wamtamanile Mndewa Imulungu.<verse eid="PSA 40:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 40:4"/>Kamweda imunhu yomtamanila Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:4">yoleka kuwatamanila wene nyodo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:4">awo oukweleleza uvizi.<verse eid="PSA 40:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 40:5"/>Go Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wangu kutenda mbuli za unzonza.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:5">Mbuli ziutwikile haduhu munhu yoyose kamba gweye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:5">maza nilongile na kugasimulila gahandemele.<verse eid="PSA 40:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 40:6"/>Gweye hulonda nhosa na sadaka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:6">lakini kuvugula magwiti gangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:6">nhosa za kusoma moto na nhosa za kusegesa nzambi huzilondile.<verse eid="PSA 40:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 40:7"/>Abaho nilonga, “Lola niye niza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:7">nyandikigwa mna ikitabu cha malagizo.<verse eid="PSA 40:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 40:8"/>Go Mndewa Imulungu, nosulukila kutenda gaja goulonda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:8">malagizo gako gammoyo wangu.”<verse eid="PSA 40:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 40:9"/>Niwapetela iwanhu mbuli ya haki na ukombola wako mumting'hano mkulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:9">sinyamale bule, go Mndewa Imulungu gweye kojuwa.<verse eid="PSA 40:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 40:10"/>Sifisile haki yako mmoyo wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:10">nolonga mbuli ya kutamanilwa kwako na ukombola wako.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:10">Sifisile unogelo wako hawishaga na kutamaniligwa kwako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:10">kuulongozi wa umting'hano wa iwanhu wengi.<verse eid="PSA 40:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 40:11"/>Go Mndewa Imulungu, sikuudikimilize bazi jako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:11">unogelo wako hawishaga na kweli yako siku zose vinikalize.<verse eid="PSA 40:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 40:12"/>Kwavija magazo hagapetigwa ganizunguluka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:12">nzambi zangu zinigoga mbaka sidaha kulola.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:12">Ziwa nyingi kubanza mvili zili mdipala jangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:12">na moyo osinduka mgati mmwangu.<verse eid="PSA 40:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 40:13"/>Go Mndewa Imulungu, utogole kunikombola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:13">go Mndewa Imulungu, wize himahima unitaze.<verse eid="PSA 40:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 40:14"/>Wose ozahila kuusegesa ugima wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:14">wagwe kinyala na kugazwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:14">wose olonda niye nigaye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:14">wabwezigwe kuchugu kwa kinyala.<verse eid="PSA 40:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 40:15"/>Waja okala onisimanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:15">wagazwe mbuli ya kinyala chao.<verse eid="PSA 40:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 40:16"/>Avo wose okuzahila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:16">wadeng'helele na kukemelela mbuli yako.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:16">Waja oulonda ukombola wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:16">walonge siku zose, “Mndewa Imulungu ayo Imkulu!”<verse eid="PSA 40:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 40:17"/>Lakini niye mkiwa na nolonda vinhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:17">Mndewa yanigelegeze.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:17">Gweye ayo mtazaji wangu na mkombola wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:17">go Imulungu, sikuukawe.<verse eid="PSA 40:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 40"/>
  <chapter number="41" style="c" sid="PSA 41"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 41</para>
  <para style="d">(Kwa kilanja, Zabuli ya Daudi.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 41:1"/>Kamweda imunhu yomkumbuka mkiwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:1">Mndewa Imulungu komuhonya siku da magazo gake.<verse eid="PSA 41:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 41:2"/>Mndewa Imulungu komkaliza na kuwika goya ugima wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:2">komtenda yamwede mwiisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:2">na hamgela mmakono ga imunhu yomwihila.<verse eid="PSA 41:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 41:3"/>Mndewa Imulungu komgangamiza yahawasa mulusazi kokugula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:3">muutamu wake komuhonya.<verse eid="PSA 41:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 41:4"/>Niye nilonga, “Go Mndewa Imulungu, nyonela bazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:4">nihonye kwavija niye nikutenda nzambi.”<verse eid="PSA 41:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 41:5"/>Wanhu onihila ogelegeza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:5">“Kodanganika lini, twaga jake dipotele?”<verse eid="PSA 41:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 41:6"/>Kila munhu yokwiza kundola kolonga uvizi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:6">moyo wake okuba gehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:6">abaho kosegela na kogabwililisa kila hanhu.<verse eid="PSA 41:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 41:7"/>Iwanhu wose onihila oinyong'onyela kunilema niye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:7">ogelegeza gehile,<verse eid="PSA 41:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 41:8"/>olonga, “Utamu wihile umgoga, heyo henuka kabili mulusazi.”<verse eid="PSA 41:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 41:9"/>Hata mbwigangu wa kisima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:9">heyo inimtamanila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:9">ayo yajaga ndiya yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:9">hata heyo kononga vihile.<verse eid="PSA 41:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 41:10"/>Lakini gweye, Mndewa Imulungu, unyonele bazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:10">umhonye na niye nowabwezela gehile.<verse eid="PSA 41:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 41:11"/>Avo nojuwa kamba konogezwa na niye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:11">kwavija imunhu yonihila honda yanihume.<verse eid="PSA 41:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 41:12"/>Mna ukunoga kwangu kunigangamiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:12">leka nikale kuulongozi wako milele.<verse eid="PSA 41:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 41:13"/>Yatogolwe Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wa Izilaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:13">kulawa milele mbaka milele.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:13">Ona.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:13">Ona.<verse eid="PSA 41:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 41"/>
  <chapter number="42" style="c" sid="PSA 42"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 42</para>
  <para style="d">(Kwa kilanja, Lwila lwa ulelo wa Kola.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 42:1"/>Kamba mhala viyogasulukila mazi ga ulwanda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:1">vivo vinikusulukila, gweye Mndewa Imulungu.<verse eid="PSA 42:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 42:2"/>Loho yangu yomonela ng'hilu Imulungu, Imulungu yeli mgima.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:2">Lini nochola koneka kuulongozi wa Imulungu?<verse eid="PSA 42:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 42:3"/>Mahozi gagalamuka ndiya yangu imisi na ikilo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:3">akuno iwanhu onongela imisi yose, “Imulungu wako kakwahi?”<verse eid="PSA 42:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 42:4"/>Novikumbuka vinhu vino, nahaigubula loho yangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:4">Vinicholile na wanhu bwando, niwalongoza kuchola mng'anda ya Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:4">tuchola kwa deng'ho na nyila za kumtogola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:4">tuigoga nyimwilinyimwili.<verse eid="PSA 42:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 42:5"/>Loho yangu habali konyuluka?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:5">Habali kuhomba mgati yangu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:5">Mtamanile Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:5">kwavija niye nomtogola kabili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:5">heyo ayo mkombola wangu.<verse eid="PSA 42:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 42:6"/>Imulungu wangu, loho yangu yonyuluka mgati yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:6">avo nokukumbuka gweye mwiisi ya Yolidani na kulugongo lwa Helimoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:6">na kulawa kulugongo lwa Mizali.<verse eid="PSA 42:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 42:7"/>Nigaligwa mgamazi mengi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:7">ng'huta za mazi za behi yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:7">gogala mibulumo iyagwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:7">ng'humbi yako ng'hulu ingubika.<verse eid="PSA 42:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 42:8"/>Mndewa Imulungu kolagusa unogelo wake hawishaga imisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:8">ikilo lwila lwake lwa hamoja na niye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:8">lwila alo lwa kumpula Imulungu wa ugima wangu.<verse eid="PSA 42:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 42:9"/>Nomulongela Imulungu, dibwe jangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:9">“Habali kunisemwa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:9">Habali nigendelele kuiyalala kwa koneligwa na iwanhu onihila?”<verse eid="PSA 42:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 42:10"/>Wanhu onihila oniliga kamba onihonda mizege yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:10">onilonga imisi yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:10">“Imulungu wako kakwahi?”<verse eid="PSA 42:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 42:11"/>Loho yangu habali konyuluka?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:11">Habali kuhomba mgati yangu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:11">Mtamanile Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:11">kwavija niye nomtogola kabili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:11">heyo ayo mkombola wangu na Imulungu wangu.<verse eid="PSA 42:11"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 42"/>
  <chapter number="43" style="c" sid="PSA 43"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 43<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">43:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kwa Kiebulania ino Zabuli ya 42 yogendelela.</char></note></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 43:1"/>Go Imulungu, unitaguse,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 43:1">nigombele mbuli ya iwanhu wa isi hawamdumba Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 43:1">unikombole na iwanhu wavizi na wehile.<verse eid="PSA 43:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 43:2"/>Gweye kwa Imulungu ngome yangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 43:2">Habali kunilema?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 43:2">Habali nigendelele kuiyalala nahoneligwa na iwanhu onihila?<verse eid="PSA 43:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 43:3"/>Nitumile mulenge wako na kweli yako vinilongoze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 43:3">vinigale mbaka kulugongo lwako lung'ala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 43:3">mbaka hanhu houkala.<verse eid="PSA 43:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 43:4"/>Abaho nochola kuupango wa nhosa wa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 43:4">heyo konigwaa deng'ho na konitenda niseke.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 43:4">Nokushukulu kwa bango gweye Imulungu, Imulungu wangu.<verse eid="PSA 43:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 43:5"/>Loho yangu habali konyuluka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 43:5">Habali kuhomba mgati yangu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 43:5">Mtamanile Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 43:5">kwavija niye nomtogola kabili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 43:5">heyo ayo mkombola wangu na Imulungu wangu.<verse eid="PSA 43:5"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 43"/>
  <chapter number="44" style="c" sid="PSA 44"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 44</para>
  <para style="d">(Kwa kilanja, Lwila lwa ulelo wa Kola.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 44:1"/>Go Imulungu, siye tuhulika kwa magwiti getu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:1">iwahenga wetu watulongela gaja gausang'hane kuzisiku zao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:1">ona gaja gausang'hane siku za ako umwaka.<verse eid="PSA 44:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 44:2"/>Kwa mkono wako kuwaswaswanya wanhu wakalile mwiisi ino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:2">na kuwahanda iwahenga zetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:2">kuwabananga wanhu wa isi azo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:2">lakini kuwatenda wahenga zetu wamwede.<verse eid="PSA 44:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 44:3"/>Kwavija siyo kwa sime jao waisola isi ayo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:3">wala siyo mkono wao uwakombole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:3">lakini mkono wako wa ukudila na mng'alo wa ikihanga chako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:3">kwavija kuwanogela.<verse eid="PSA 44:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 44:4"/>Imulungu, gweye kwa Mndewa wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:4">gweye kolagiza mhumo kwa ulelo wa Yakobo.<verse eid="PSA 44:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 44:5"/>Kwa udahi wako towasung'ha kuchugu iwanhu otwihila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:5">kwa twaga jako towabojoga iwanhu otwihila.<verse eid="PSA 44:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 44:6"/>Niye siutamanila upinde wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:6">wala sime jangu hadidaha kunikombola.<verse eid="PSA 44:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 44:7"/>Gweye ayo ututenda tuwahume iwanhu otwihila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:7">wagwe kinyala iwanhu otwihila.<verse eid="PSA 44:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 44:8"/>Kwa Imulungu wetu toitapa imisi yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:8">na siye toditogola twaga jako milele.<verse eid="PSA 44:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 44:9"/>Lakini sambi kutulema na kutugela kinyala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:9">sambi huchola na iwakalizi zetu.<verse eid="PSA 44:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 44:10"/>Kututenda tubwele kuchugu ya iwanhu otwihila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:10">iwanhu otudeta watuboka vinhu vetu.<verse eid="PSA 44:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 44:11"/>Kutuleka tudafunwe kamba ng'hondolo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:11">na kutupwililisa mziisi ziyagwe.<verse eid="PSA 44:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 44:12"/>Kuwachuuza wanhu zako kwa sente ndodo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:12">wala hupatile chochose vuuwachuuze.<verse eid="PSA 44:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 44:13"/>Kututenda kilozo kwa iwanhu okala behi na siye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:13">kututenda tubezigwe na kugewezwa na iwanhu otuzunguluka.<verse eid="PSA 44:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 44:14"/>Kututenda wasekwa hagati ha iwanhu wa isi ziyagwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:14">wanhu wa isi ziyagwe otigisa mapala gao.<verse eid="PSA 44:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 44:15"/>Kinyala changu cha kuulongozi wa wanhu imisi yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:15">kihanga changu kimema kinyala,<verse eid="PSA 44:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 44:16"/>mbuli ya ugewezi wa iwanhu oniliga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:16">na kunilonga vihile mbuli ya imunhu yonihila yolonda kunibwezela.<verse eid="PSA 44:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 44:17"/>Gose gago gatupata,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:17">hamoja hatukusemwile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:17">na hatubenile lagano jako.<verse eid="PSA 44:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 44:18"/>Mizoyo yetu haibwelile kuchugu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:18">wala migulu yetu hailekile nzila yako.<verse eid="PSA 44:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 44:19"/>Lakini kutuhonda na kututenda kae ya mbweha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:19">na kutugubika kwa sisila da ifa.<verse eid="PSA 44:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 44:20"/>Maza tudisemwile twaga da Imulungu wetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:20">hebu kumgolosela makono getu imulungu iyagwe,<verse eid="PSA 44:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 44:21"/>vino Imulungu sambi yajuwe?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:21">Kwavija heyo ayo yagajuwile magesa ga kinyelegezi geli mmoyo.<verse eid="PSA 44:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 44:22"/>Mbuli yako tokomigwa imisi yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:22">siye kamba ng'hondolo ochola kuchinjwa.<verse eid="PSA 44:22"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 44:23"/>Lamuka gweye Mndewa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:23">Habali kowasa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:23">Inuka, sikuutuleme milele.<verse eid="PSA 44:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 44:24"/>Habali kofisa kihanga chako?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:24">Habali koisemwa magazo getu na madununzo getu?<verse eid="PSA 44:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 44:25"/>Tuhumuluswa mbaka mditimbwisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:25">ng'huli zetu zinanahilwa na ulongo.<verse eid="PSA 44:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 44:26"/>Inuka na ututaze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:26">utukombole kwavija unogelo wako hawishaga.<verse eid="PSA 44:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 44"/>
  <chapter number="45" style="c" sid="PSA 45"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 45</para>
  <para style="d">(Kwa kilanja, yatumie modeli ya lwila lwa besa. Lwila lwa ulelo wa Kola, lwila lwa mapenzi.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 45:1"/>Moyo wangu umema magesa ganogile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:1">Nomulongela mndewa mashaili gangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:1">lulimi lwangu kamba kalamu ya mwandikaji yanogile.<verse eid="PSA 45:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 45:2"/>Gweye kunoga kubanza iwanhu wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:2">bazi digidigwa kululimi lwako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:2">avo Imulungu kakutambikila milele.<verse eid="PSA 45:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 45:3"/>Funga sime jako mdihaza jako, gweye mwene nguvu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:3">gweye imkulu na utogoligwa.<verse eid="PSA 45:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 45:4"/>Muukulu wako gendelela kwa kuhuma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:4">mbuli ya kweli na uhole na haki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:4">mkono wako wa ukudila ulaguse mbuli ng'hulu.<verse eid="PSA 45:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 45:5"/>Misale yako ina nhonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:5">yohoma mizoyo ya wanhu omwihila mndewa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:5">wanhu ogwa hasi yako.<verse eid="PSA 45:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 45:6"/>Go Imulungu, kigoda chako cha ukulu chosigala siku zose na milele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:6">fimbo ya undewa wako yokuwa fimbo ya haki.<verse eid="PSA 45:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 45:7"/>Koinogela haki na kogehila gehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:7">avo Imulungu, Imulungu wako kakusagula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:7">kwa kukugwaa deng'ho kubanza wayago wose.<verse eid="PSA 45:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 45:8"/>Viwalo vako vose vonung'hila manemane na udi na mdalasini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:8">kulawa mding'anda da kindewa dihambigwe kwa mhembe zinogile, iwanhu okwimbila kwa bango.<verse eid="PSA 45:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 45:9"/>Wandele wa wandewa wa mumo mna iwatwanzi wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:9">mkono wa ukudila kema mndewa wa ikitwanzi yaihambile zahabu ya Ofili.<verse eid="PSA 45:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 45:10"/>Tegeleza gweye mndele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:10">gelegeza na utege digwiti.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:10">Uwasemwe wanhu wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:10">na iwanhu wa mng'anda ya tatako.<verse eid="PSA 45:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 45:11"/>Mndewa koulonda unovu wako.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:11">Kwavija heyo ayo mkulu wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:11">avo idulike mbaka hasi.<verse eid="PSA 45:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 45:12"/>Wanhu wa Tilo okugalila nhunza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:12">wanhu matajili ozahila unogelo wako.<verse eid="PSA 45:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 45:13"/>Unovu wose wa mndele wa mndewa wa mdigati jake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:13">kiwalo chake kilukigwa kwa nzabi za zahabu.<verse eid="PSA 45:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 45:14"/>Kuno kavala viwalo vihambigwe langi nyingi kolongozwa kwa mndewa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:14">wali wayage omkweleleza na ogaligwa kumwake.<verse eid="PSA 45:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 45:15"/>Olongozwa kwa deng'ho na daba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:15">na okwingila mng'anda ya mndewa.<verse eid="PSA 45:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 45:16"/>Wana wenu osola nyafasi za tata zenu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:16">mowatenda wana wa kindewa mwiisi yose.<verse eid="PSA 45:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 45:17"/>Nokutenda ukumbukwe ulelo wose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:17">Avo wanhu wa isi zose okutogola siku zose na milele.<verse eid="PSA 45:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 45"/>
  <chapter number="46" style="c" sid="PSA 46"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 46</para>
  <para style="d">(Zabuli ya ulelo wa Kola. Kwa kilanja, yatumie modeli wa Alamoti.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 46:1"/>Imulungu kumwetu siye ayo kimbililo na nguvu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 46:1">msaada ukoneka kipindi chose cha magazo.<verse eid="PSA 46:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 46:2"/>Avo hatudumba hata isi yahatigisika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 46:2">na vigongo vahatulika,<verse eid="PSA 46:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 46:3"/>hata kamba mazi gahabuma na kutibuka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 46:3">na vigongo vahamong'onyoligwa kwa ng'humbi yake.<verse eid="PSA 46:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 46:4"/>Kuna lwanda awo miloka yake yodideng'heza dibuga da Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 46:4">hanhu hong'ala aho hoyokala ayo Yeli Uchanha Ng'hani.<verse eid="PSA 46:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 46:5"/>Imulungu kahagati ya dibuga na hadihumuluswa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 46:5">Imulungu koditaza ulukwili na imitondo.<verse eid="PSA 46:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 46:6"/>Wanhu wa isi ziyagwe odumba na oding'huka na undewa ogwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 46:6">heyo kokwinula sauti yake, isi yose yolumbuka.<verse eid="PSA 46:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 46:7"/>Mndewa Imulungu yeli na udahi wose kahamoja na siye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 46:7">Imulungu wa Yakobo ayo ngome yetu.<verse eid="PSA 46:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 46:8"/>Mwize mulole gaja gayatendile Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 46:8">loleni viyaitendile isi vihame.<verse eid="PSA 46:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 46:9"/>Koimiza ng'hondo mbaka kuihelela isi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 46:9">Koubena upinde na koubenabena mgoha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 46:9">koisoma moto mituka.<verse eid="PSA 46:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 46:10"/>“Nyamaleni mjuwe kamba niye ayo Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 46:10">notogolwa hagati ha iwanhu wa isi zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 46:10">notogolwa na isi yose.”<verse eid="PSA 46:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 46:11"/>Mndewa Imulungu yeli na udahi wose kahamoja na siye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 46:11">Imulungu wa Yakobo ayo ngome yetu.<verse eid="PSA 46:11"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 46"/>
  <chapter number="47" style="c" sid="PSA 47"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 47</para>
  <para style="d">(Kwa kilanja, Zabuli ya ulelo wa Kola.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 47:1"/>Toweni madondo, mweye iwanhu wa isi zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 47:1">mtoweleni Imulungu nyangi za deng'ho.<verse eid="PSA 47:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 47:2"/>Kwavija Mndewa Imulungu yeli Uchanha Ng'hani, kodumbiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 47:2">ayo Mndewa imkulu mwiisi yose.<verse eid="PSA 47:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 47:3"/>Kawanamiza iwanhu wa isi ziyagwe hasi yetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 47:3">wanhu wa isi ziyagwe wa hasi ya magulu getu.<verse eid="PSA 47:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 47:4"/>Katusagulila uhazi wetu mbuli yetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 47:4">uli deng'ho da Yakobo, yomnogela.<verse eid="PSA 47:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 47:5"/>Imulungu kakwela uchanha hagati ya nyangi za deng'ho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 47:5">Mndewa Imulungu kahagati ya sauti za mhalati.<verse eid="PSA 47:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 47:6"/>Mwimbileni Imulungu nyila za kumtogola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 47:6">imbeni nhogolwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 47:6">mwimbileni nhogolwa Mndewa wetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 47:6">imbeni nhogolwa.<verse eid="PSA 47:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 47:7"/>Kwavija Imulungu ayo Mndewa wa isi yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 47:7">mwimbileni zabuli za nhogolwa.<verse eid="PSA 47:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 47:8"/>Imulungu kotawala iwanhu wa isi zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 47:8">Imulungu kakala uchanha ya kigoda chake cha undewa king'ala.<verse eid="PSA 47:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 47:9"/>Ivilongozi wa iwanhu wa isi waiting'hana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 47:9">wailumba na iwanhu wa Imulungu wa Abulahamu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 47:9">kwavija wandewa wa mwiisi mwenyego Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 47:9">heyo kenuligwa ng'hani.<verse eid="PSA 47:9"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 47"/>
  <chapter number="48" style="c" sid="PSA 48"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 48</para>
  <para style="d">(Zabuli ya ulelo wa Kola.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 48:1"/>Mndewa Imulungu ayo imkulu na kofaya kutogolwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:1">kudibuga da Imulungu wetu, lugongo lwake lung'ala,<verse eid="PSA 48:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 48:2"/>lunoga na lutali ng'hani, deng'ho da isi yose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:2">Nhembeti za Safoni kamba lugongo lwa Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:2">dibuga da Mndewa Imkulu.<verse eid="PSA 48:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 48:3"/>Imulungu kamzingome zake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:3">kailagusa mwenyego kamba mkalizi.<verse eid="PSA 48:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 48:4"/>Lola iwandewa viwailumbile na kuchola hamoja,<verse eid="PSA 48:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 48:5"/>bahaja viwamone wakanganya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:5">wakimbila kwa bwembwe.<verse eid="PSA 48:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 48:6"/>Wasonga kugwaya kuko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:6">wona usungu kamba wa mtwanzi yolonda kulela.<verse eid="PSA 48:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 48:7"/>Wabanangwa kamba meli ng'hulu za Talishishi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:7">zibenigwe na beho da umwambu wa kudilawila zuwa.<verse eid="PSA 48:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 48:8"/>Kamba vituhulike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:8">vivo vitone kudibuga da Mndewa Imulungu yeli na udahi wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:8">kudibuga da Imulungu wetu, Imulungu kodikaliza milele.<verse eid="PSA 48:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 48:9"/>Go Imulungu, mng'anda yako tougelegeza unogelo wako hawishaga.<verse eid="PSA 48:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 48:10"/>Kamba twaga jako vidijuwika kila hanhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:10">vivo kila munhu yakutogole gweye mbaka kuihelela isi yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:10">mkono wako wa ukudila umemezwa haki.<verse eid="PSA 48:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 48:11"/>Lugongo lwa Sayuni lodeng'helela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:11">vijiji va Yuda vodeng'helela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:11">kwa nhaguso zako.<verse eid="PSA 48:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 48:12"/>Tembeleni Sayuni, zungulukeni kudibuga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:12">muvipete ivilingo vake.<verse eid="PSA 48:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 48:13"/>Gelegezeni ziluwa zake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:13">loleni ngome zake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:13">ili musimulile mbuli zake kwa ulelo ukwiza.<verse eid="PSA 48:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 48:14"/>Kwavija ino Imulungu ayo Imulungu wetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:14">siku zose na milele kokuwa kilongozi wetu.<verse eid="PSA 48:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 48"/>
  <chapter number="49" style="c" sid="PSA 49"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 49</para>
  <para style="d">(Kwa kilanja, Zabuli ya ulelo wa Kola.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 49:1"/>Tegelezeni gano mweye iwanhu wa isi zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:1">Hulikeni mweye mose mkala mwiisi ino.<verse eid="PSA 49:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 49:2"/>Wose, iwakulu na iwadodo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:2">matajili na wakiwa.<verse eid="PSA 49:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 49:3"/>Mulomo wangu olonga mbuli za ubala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:3">magesa gangu golava nzewele.<verse eid="PSA 49:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 49:4"/>Notega gwiti jangu nhegeleze nongezi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:4">notegula kitendawili kwa bango.<verse eid="PSA 49:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 49:5"/>Habali nidumbe siku za magazo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:5">iwanhu wavizi wahanizunguluka?<verse eid="PSA 49:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 49:6"/>Awo otamanila vinhu vao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:6">na oitapa kwa utajili wao.<verse eid="PSA 49:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 49:7"/>Haduhu munhu yoyose yodaha kuugombola ugima wa munhu iyagwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:7">hebu yamlihe Imulungu bei ya ugima wake mwenyego,<verse eid="PSA 49:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 49:8"/>kwavija bei ya ugima ibanza ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:8">na yokala vivo milele,<verse eid="PSA 49:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 49:9"/>ili yakale mgima milele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:9">na sikuyengile mdipanga.<verse eid="PSA 49:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 49:10"/>Avo wose okona kamba iwanhu wabala odanganika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:10">na wabozi na mizozolo vivija opotela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:10">na owalekela iwanhu wayagwe vinhu vao vose.<verse eid="PSA 49:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 49:11"/>Mapanga gao gokuwa ng'anda zao milele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:11">kae za ulelo wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:11">hamoja wakala na migunda ikemigwe kwa matwaga gao.<verse eid="PSA 49:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 49:12"/>Munhu muutajili wake hasigala siku zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:12">heyo kodanganika kamba mng'onyo.<verse eid="PSA 49:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 49:13"/>Kino acho kimambukizo cha awo oitamanila mwenyego,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:13">na awo owakweleleza na onogelwa na ulonzi wao.<verse eid="PSA 49:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 49:14"/>Kamba ng'hondolo ochola kuzimu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:14">na ifa yowalongoza.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:14">Iwanhu wanogile owatawala imitondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:14">na ng'huli zao zokola kudipanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:14">okala kutali na ming'anda yao inogile.<verse eid="PSA 49:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 49:15"/>Lakini Imulungu konigombola kulawa kuzimu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:15">ona konisola kumwake.<verse eid="PSA 49:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 49:16"/>Sambi udumbe munhu yahapata utajili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:16">ukulu wa ng'anda yake wahongezeka,<verse eid="PSA 49:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 49:17"/>kwavija yahadanganika hasola kinhu chochose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:17">ukulu wake hachola nao.<verse eid="PSA 49:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 49:18"/>Hamoja viyakalile mgima kayona kamweda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:18">na iwanhu wamtogola kamba katenda goya,<verse eid="PSA 49:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 49:19"/>kochola kwa iwahenga zake wadanganike mwaka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:19">kuko hawawona umulenge milele.<verse eid="PSA 49:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 49:20"/>Munhu yeli tajili lakini kabule nzewele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:20">kaigala na wang'onyo ofa.<verse eid="PSA 49:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 49"/>
  <chapter number="50" style="c" sid="PSA 50"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 50</para>
  <para style="d">(Zabuli ya Asafu.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 50:1"/>Imulungu mwene nguvu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:1">Mndewa Imulungu kolonga na kuikema isi yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:1">tangu kudilawila zuwa na kudiswela.<verse eid="PSA 50:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 50:2"/>Kulawa Sayuni, hanhu hatelele kwa unovu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:2">Imulungu komwemwesa.<verse eid="PSA 50:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 50:3"/>Imulungu wetu kokwiza na hanyamala bule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:3">moto usakaza omulongolela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:3">akuno kazungulukwa na kukuzumbi.<verse eid="PSA 50:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 50:4"/>Koukema ulanga ukalaga uchanha ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:4">na koikema isi ili vilole vonda yawataguse wanhu zake.<verse eid="PSA 50:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 50:5"/>“Wating'hanizeni iwanhu wangu otamanilwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:5">awo watendile lagano na niye kwa nhosa.”<verse eid="PSA 50:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 50:6"/>Ulanga osimulila haki yake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:6">kwavija Imulungu mwenyego ayo msemi.<verse eid="PSA 50:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 50:7"/>“Tegelezeni mweye wanhu zangu, na niye nolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:7">gweye Izilaeli na niye nowasindila.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:7">Niye ayo Imulungu, Imulungu wenu.<verse eid="PSA 50:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 50:8"/>Sikukomhokela mbuli ya nhosa zako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:8">hebu nhosa zako za kusoma moto.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:8">Siku zose za kuulongozi wangu.<verse eid="PSA 50:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 50:9"/>Siwalonda ng'ombe wa banda jako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:9">hebu mbuzi kulawa kudibumba jako.<verse eid="PSA 50:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 50:10"/>Kwavija kila mnyama wa kumuhulo wangu niye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:10">fugo uchanha ya vigongo elufu wangu niye.<verse eid="PSA 50:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 50:11"/>Nimtanga kila ndege kulugongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:11">nao viumbe weli kukonde wangu niye.<verse eid="PSA 50:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 50:12"/>Maza ng'halile na nzala sambi niwalongele mweye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:12">kwavija isi yose na vose vikala mumo vangu niye.<verse eid="PSA 50:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 50:13"/>Vino, niye noja nyama ya ng'ombe mbigalo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:13">hebu nong'wa damu ya mbuzi?<verse eid="PSA 50:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 50:14"/>Mulavile Imulungu nhosa za kumtogola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:14">na uvikize gaja gaulongile kwa ayo yokala Uchanha Ng'hani.<verse eid="PSA 50:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 50:15"/>Unikeme siku ya magazo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:15">na niye nokuhonya na gweye konitogola.”<verse eid="PSA 50:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 50:16"/>Lakini kwa iwanhu wehile, Imulungu kolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:16">“Gweye kuna haki gani kulonga malagizo gangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:16">na kulonga lagano jangu mmulomo wako?<verse eid="PSA 50:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 50:17"/>Kwavija gweye kulema kuzumwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:17">na kugalema malagizo gangu.<verse eid="PSA 50:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 50:18"/>Uhamona mbavi koilumba na heyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:18">koilumba na wagoni.<verse eid="PSA 50:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 50:19"/>Kuleka mulomo wako ulonge gehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:19">na lulimi lwako lolonga bunyiko.<verse eid="PSA 50:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 50:20"/>Siku zose komdeta ndugu yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:20">na komtendela uchakubimbi mwana wa mamako.<verse eid="PSA 50:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 50:21"/>Gago gose kugatenda na niye ninyamala tuluu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:21">kogizaga niye na kamba gweye.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:21">Lakini niye nokuzuma na nokukomhokela.”<verse eid="PSA 50:21"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 50:22"/>“Gelegezeni gano mweye munisemwaga niye Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:22">ama nowadega vihande vihande,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:22">na haduhu munhu yodaha kuwakombola.<verse eid="PSA 50:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 50:23"/>Imunhu yolava nhosa za kunitogola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:23">ayo iyo yonitegeleza niye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:23">imunhu yokweleleza nzila yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:23">ayo nomulagusila ukombola wangu niye Imulungu.”<verse eid="PSA 50:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 50"/>
  <chapter number="51" style="c" sid="PSA 51"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 51</para>
  <para style="d">(Kwa kilanja. Zabuli ya Daudi viyeshilize kukomhokeligwa na mtula ndagu Natani mbuli ya kutenda ugoni na Batisheba.)<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">51:0 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola kitabu cha 2 Samweli 11.1-12:15.</char></note></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 51:1"/>Go Imulungu, unyonele bazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:1">kamba unogelo wako hawishaga viwili mkulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:1">kamba vidili kulu bazi jako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:1">ugasegese gehile gangu.<verse eid="PSA 51:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 51:2"/>Ugakoshe gehile gangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:2">uzisegese nzambi zangu.<verse eid="PSA 51:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 51:3"/>Kwavija nogatanga gehile gangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:3">na nzambi yangu ya kuulongozi wangu siku zose.<verse eid="PSA 51:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 51:4"/>Kumwako gweye uiyeka nhenda nzambi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:4">na nhenda gehile mgameso gako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:4">avo magesa gako ga haki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:4">nhaguso yako itelela.<verse eid="PSA 51:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 51:5"/>Lola niye nileligwa kamba mwene nzambi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:5">niye na mwene nzambi tangu mamangu viyageligwe inda yangu.<verse eid="PSA 51:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 51:6"/>Gweye konogezwa na kweli ilawa mmoyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:6">mgati mmoyo wangu konifunza ubala.<verse eid="PSA 51:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 51:7"/>Unikoshe kwa bunho da hisopo na niye nong'ala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:7">unikoshe na niye nokuwa mzelu kubanza pamba.<verse eid="PSA 51:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 51:8"/>Unitende nihulike seko na deng'ho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:8">mizege yangu yuuhondile ideng'helele.<verse eid="PSA 51:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 51:9"/>Ukifise kihanga chako sambi ulole nzambi yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:9">na ugafute gehile gangu gose.<verse eid="PSA 51:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 51:10"/>Gweye Imulungu unilumbile moyo ung'alile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:10">uilumbe kabili loho itindiwale mgati mmwangu.<verse eid="PSA 51:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 51:11"/>Sambi unitupe kutali na gweye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:11">sikuunisegesele loho wako yang'alile.<verse eid="PSA 51:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 51:12"/>Unibwezele kabili deng'ho jangu da ukombola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:12">unigwelele loho ya kugoga igako.<verse eid="PSA 51:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 51:13"/>Abaho nowafunza iwanhu wehile nzila zako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:13">na wene nzambi okuhindukila gweye.<verse eid="PSA 51:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 51:14"/>Gweye Imulungu unikombole na nzambi ya kwita damu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:14">gweye Imulungu mkombola wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:14">lulimi lwangu lokwimba haki yako.<verse eid="PSA 51:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 51:15"/>Go Mndewa, fungula mulomo wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:15">na lulimi lwangu lolonga ukulu wako.<verse eid="PSA 51:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 51:16"/>Gweye hunogezwa na nhosa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:16">maza ikalile ivo nahakulavile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:16">gweye hunogezwa na nhosa za kusoma moto.<verse eid="PSA 51:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 51:17"/>Ila nhosa zilondigwa na Imulungu ayo loho ihondeke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:17">na moyo uhondeke na ulongaga ng'hosa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:17">gweye Imulungu huubezeli bule.<verse eid="PSA 51:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 51:18"/>Kwa ganogile gako uitende Sayuni igendelele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:18">uluzenge kabili luwa lwa Yelusalemu.<verse eid="PSA 51:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 51:19"/>Abaho hokuwa na nhosa zitelele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:19">na nhosa zose za kusoma moto zikunogeza ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:19">na ng'ombe mbigalo olavigwa muupango wako wa nhosa.<verse eid="PSA 51:19"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 51"/>
  <chapter number="52" style="c" sid="PSA 52"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 52</para>
  <para style="d">(Kwa kilanja, Zabuli ya Daudi mbuli ya kipindi Doegi Mwedomu viyamcholele Sauli na kumulongela, “Daudi kengila mng'anda ya Ahimeleki.”)<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">52:0 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola kitabu cha 1 Samweli 21:7, 22:9-10.</char></note></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 52:1"/>Gweye zinhu, habali koigodela gehile?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 52:1">Unogelo hawishaga wa Imulungu okala siku zose.<verse eid="PSA 52:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 52:2"/>Gweye utendaga gehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 52:2">lulimi lwako lopanga ubananzi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 52:2">kamba lwembe mkali.<verse eid="PSA 52:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 52:3"/>Konogezwa na gehile kubanza ganogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 52:3">na uvizi kubanza kulonga ukweli.<verse eid="PSA 52:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 52:4"/>Konogezwa na ulonzi wa usede,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 52:4">gweye lulimi lumemile uvizi.<verse eid="PSA 52:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 52:5"/>Imulungu kokuhumulusa hasi milele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 52:5">kokuzomola na kokusegesa kulawa mkibanda chako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 52:5">kokung'ola kulawa mwiisi ya iwanhu weli wagima.<verse eid="PSA 52:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 52:6"/>Wene haki okona na kudumba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 52:6">omseka na kulonga,<verse eid="PSA 52:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 52:7"/>“Ino ayo munhu ija hamtendile Imulungu kamba ngome yake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 52:7">lakini katamanila utajili wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 52:7">kakala galu kwa kuwabananga wayagwe.”<verse eid="PSA 52:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 52:8"/>Lakini niye kamba biki da mzeituni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 52:8">dihandigwe mng'anda ya Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 52:8">noutamanila unogelo hawishaga wa Imulungu ukalaga siku zose na milele.<verse eid="PSA 52:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 52:9"/>Go Imulungu, nokushukulu milele kwa gaja gautendile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 52:9">noditamanila twaga jako kwavija twaga jako dinoga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 52:9">Nokutogola kuulongozi wa iwanhu wako wang'alile.<verse eid="PSA 52:9"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 52"/>
  <chapter number="53" style="c" sid="PSA 53"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 53</para>
  <para style="d">(Zabuli ya Daudi. Kwa kilanja, yatumie modeli wa Mahalati.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 53:1"/>Mbozi kolonga mmoyo wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:1">“Kuduhu Imulungu.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:1">Wose wanangika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:1">otenda gaja gogevuza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:1">haduhu hata imoja yotenda ganogile.<verse eid="PSA 53:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 53:2"/>Imulungu kowasungulila iwanhu hasi kulawa kuulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:2">kolola kamba hana munhu kana nzewele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:2">na komzahila Imulungu.<verse eid="PSA 53:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 53:3"/>Kila munhu kahindukila kutali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:3">wabanangika wose hamoja,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:3">haduhu hata imoja yotenda ganogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:3">ona! hata imoja haduhu.<verse eid="PSA 53:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 53:4"/>Vino, iwanhu otenda gehile hawajuwa bule?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:4">Owaja iwanhu zangu kamba munhu yoja gate,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:4">na hawamgesa Imulungu.<verse eid="PSA 53:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 53:5"/>Avo ogwaya kwa bwembwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:5">hata kamba haduhu kinhu cha kudumba.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:5">Imulungu kaipwililisa imizege ya iwanhu wakuvamile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:5">gweye kowatenda wakone kinyala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:5">kwavija Imulungu kawabezeli.<verse eid="PSA 53:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 53:6"/>Maza ukombola wa Izilaeli wize kulawa Sayuni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:6">Imulungu vonda yawabweze iwafungwa wa wanhu zake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:6">Yakobo yadeng'helele,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 53:6">Izilaeli yasekelele.<verse eid="PSA 53:6"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 53"/>
  <chapter number="54" style="c" sid="PSA 54"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 54</para>
  <para style="d">(Kwa kilanja, yatumie nyuzi za bango. Zabuli ya Daudi mbuli ya kipindi Wazifu viwamcholele Sauli na kumulongela kamba Daudi kaifisa kumwao.)<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">54:0 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola kitabu cha 1 Samweli 23:15-24, 26:1-5.</char></note></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 54:1"/>Gweye Imulungu, nikombole kwa twaga jako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 54:1">unilekese kwa nguvu zako.<verse eid="PSA 54:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 54:2"/>Gweye Imulungu, tegeleza kupula kwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 54:2">uhulike mbuli zinilonga.<verse eid="PSA 54:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 54:3"/>Wanhu baki onivamila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 54:3">wanhu wasede ozahila ugima wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 54:3">iwanhu hawamgesa Imulungu.<verse eid="PSA 54:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 54:4"/>Lakini Imulungu ayo yonitaza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 54:4">Mndewa ayo yougoga ugima wangu.<verse eid="PSA 54:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 54:5"/>Heyo kowabwezela gehile iwanhu onihila niye.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 54:5">Kwa kutamanilwa kwako gweye Imulungu uwabanange.<verse eid="PSA 54:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 54:6"/>Nokulavila nhosa za kulonda mwenyego,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 54:6">Go Mndewa Imulungu, noditogola twaga jako kwavija dinoga.<verse eid="PSA 54:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 54:7"/>Kwavija kanikombola kulawa mmagazo gangu gose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 54:7">meso gangu gona kuhumwa kwa iwanhu onihila.<verse eid="PSA 54:7"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 54"/>
  <chapter number="55" style="c" sid="PSA 55"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 55</para>
  <para style="d">(Zabuli ya Daudi. Kwa kilanja, yatumie nyuzi za bango.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 55:1"/>Gweye Imulungu tegeleza kupula kwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:1">na sikuubezeli ulonzi wangu.<verse eid="PSA 55:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 55:2"/>Nitegeleze na unidike.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:2">Magesa gangu gonigaza na kunyuluka.<verse eid="PSA 55:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 55:3"/>Mbuli ya sauti ya imunhu yonihila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:3">kwa kuloligwa na iwanhu onihila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:3">kwavija ongalila magazo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:3">na oniliga kwa kugevuzika.<verse eid="PSA 55:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 55:4"/>Moyo wangu umema usungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:4">bwembwe da ifa dingubika.<verse eid="PSA 55:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 55:5"/>Bwembwe na kugwaya vinizunguluka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:5">bwembwe kulu dingoga.<verse eid="PSA 55:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 55:6"/>Nilonga, “Maza ng'halile na mabawa kamba njiwa!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:6">Nahaguluke nichole kutali nikabwihile.<verse eid="PSA 55:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 55:7"/>Nahacholile kutali ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:7">nahakalile kuluwala.<verse eid="PSA 55:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 55:8"/>Nahalopole kuchola hanhu hanogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:8">kutali na kukuzumbi na magazo.”<verse eid="PSA 55:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 55:9"/>Go Mndewa, uwabanange iwanhu onihila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:9">na uwatende sikuwaitogolele viwolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:9">kwavija nyona migomvi na ndwagi kudibuga.<verse eid="PSA 55:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 55:10"/>Imisi na ikilo ozunguluka uchanha ya luwa lwake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:10">gehile na magazo va mgati yake.<verse eid="PSA 55:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 55:11"/>Nguvu za ubananzi zosang'hana kudibuga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:11">bwembwe na uvizi havisegela kudigulilo.<verse eid="PSA 55:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 55:12"/>Maza imunhu yonihila yaniligile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:12">nahagelile kumgongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:12">maza imunhu yonihila yainule kumwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:12">nahaifisile sikuyanyone.<verse eid="PSA 55:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 55:13"/>Lakini kumbe gweye miyangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:13">mbwigangu nikutangile ng'hani.<verse eid="PSA 55:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 55:14"/>Ayo tukalile toisekela kimbwiga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:14">vitukalile tochola hamoja na wanhu wayagwe mng'anda ya Imulungu.<verse eid="PSA 55:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 55:15"/>Leka ifa iwezile himahima iwanhu onihila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:15">na wachole kuzimu kuno wang'hali wagima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:15">kwavija gehile ga mgati yao.<verse eid="PSA 55:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 55:16"/>Lakini nomkema Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:16">na Mndewa Imulungu konikombola.<verse eid="PSA 55:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 55:17"/>Imitondo, imisi na ichungulo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:17">nolila kwa magazo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:17">na heyo koihulika sauti yangu.<verse eid="PSA 55:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 55:18"/>Konikombola na nokala goya kulawa kung'hondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:18">hamoja iwanhu wengi onilema.<verse eid="PSA 55:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 55:19"/>Imulungu yotawala kulawa milele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:19">kowahulika na kowakoboza iwanhu onihila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:19">kwavija hawahindula nzila zao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:19">na hawamdumba Imulungu.<verse eid="PSA 55:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 55:20"/>Miyangu kawavamila mbwiga zake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:20">na kabena lagano jake.<verse eid="PSA 55:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 55:21"/>Mbuli zake zamulile kubanza uki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:21">hata ivo mmoyo wake kuna ng'hondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:21">mbuli zake zonyilibuka kubanza mavuta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:21">lakini zokanha kamba sime dinoligwe.<verse eid="PSA 55:21"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 55:22"/>Mdikwe Mndewa Imulungu magazo gako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:22">na heyo kokudahiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:22">hamuleka ng'o imunhu mwene haki yagwe.<verse eid="PSA 55:22"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 55:23"/>Lakini gweye Imulungu kowagala hasi kudisimo da ubananzi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:23">wanhu okwita damu na wehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:23">hawakala wagima nusu ya siku zao.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 55:23"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:23">Lakini niye nokutamanila gweye.<verse eid="PSA 55:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 55"/>
  <chapter number="56" style="c" sid="PSA 56"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 56</para>
  <para style="d">(Kwa kilanja, yatumie modeli wa, “Huwa yalawile kutali yahumule.” Zabuli ya Daudi mbuli ya kipindi viyagogigwe na Wafilisiti ako Gati.)<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">56:0 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola kitabu cha 1 Samweli 21:10-15, 27:1-4.</char></note></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 56:1"/>Gweye Imulungu unyonele bazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:1">kwavija wanhu onivamila ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:1">imisi yose okwengeza kunidununza.<verse eid="PSA 56:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 56:2"/>Awo iwanhu onihila onikweleleza imisi yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:2">onivamila kwa kuitapa kwao.<verse eid="PSA 56:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 56:3"/>Bwembwe dahangoga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:3">nokutamanila gweye.<verse eid="PSA 56:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 56:4"/>Kwa Imulungu kumwake noditogola twaga jake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:4">kwa Imulungu notamanila, sidumba bule.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:4">Imunhu yofa konitenda choni?<verse eid="PSA 56:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 56:5"/>Imisi yose ozihindula mbuli zangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:5">siku zose ogelegeza kunilumiza.<verse eid="PSA 56:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 56:6"/>Oilumba kunitendela gehile na oifisa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:6">olola kila hanhu kunibita,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:6">kuno osulukila kunikoma.<verse eid="PSA 56:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 56:7"/>Gweye Imulungu uwakoboze mna ing'hasiliki yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:7">uwabwanhe iwanhu wa isi ziyagwe.<verse eid="PSA 56:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 56:8"/>Yandika kuiyalala kwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:8">gandike mkitabu chako mahozi gangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:8">Vino gago gakuduhu mkitabu chako cha kumbukumbu?<verse eid="PSA 56:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 56:9"/>Avo iwanhu onihila obwela kuchugu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:9">nahakukema unitaze.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:9">Kwa mbuli ayo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:9">notanga kamba Imulungu ka ubanzi wangu.<verse eid="PSA 56:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 56:10"/>Nomtamanila Imulungu na noitogola mbuli yake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:10">nomtamanila Mndewa Imulungu na noitogola mbuli yake.<verse eid="PSA 56:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 56:11"/>Kwa Imulungu notamanila na sidumba bule.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:11">Imunhu konitenda choni?<verse eid="PSA 56:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 56:12"/>Gweye Imulungu niye niiduwila kumwako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:12">nokulavila sadaka za kukutogola.<verse eid="PSA 56:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 56:13"/>Kwavija kunikombola kulawa mkifo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:13">na kunikaliza sikunigwe hasi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:13">ili nichole kuulongozi wa Imulungu kudilenge da ugima.<verse eid="PSA 56:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 56"/>
  <chapter number="57" style="c" sid="PSA 57"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 57</para>
  <para style="d">(Kwa kilanja, yatumie modeli wa, “Sikuubanange!” Zabuli ya Daudi mbuli ya kipindi viyamkimbile Sauli kuimhango.)<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">57:0 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola kitabu cha 1 Samweli 24.</char></note></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 57:1"/>Unyonele bazi, gweye Imulungu, unyonele bazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:1">kwavija moyo wangu okukimbilila gweye.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:1">Kuna imbeho ya mabawa gako nokimbilila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:1">mbaka kukuzumbi dibite.<verse eid="PSA 57:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 57:2"/>Nomlilila Imulungu yeli uchanha ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:2">Imulungu yovikizaga gaja goyolonda kumwangu.<verse eid="PSA 57:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 57:3"/>Konitaza kulawa kuulanga na konikombola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:3">kowakomhokela iwanhu onikweleleza ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:3">Imulungu kogala unogelo wake hawishaga na kutamanilwa kwake.<verse eid="PSA 57:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 57:4"/>Niye na hagati ya simba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:4">niwasa hagati ya iming'onyo ili na nzala ng'hulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:4">iwanhu meno gao kamba migoha na misale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:4">milimi yao kamba sime dinoligwe.<verse eid="PSA 57:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 57:5"/>Gweye Imulungu, utogolwe uchanha kuulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:5">na isi yose imemezwe ukulu wako.<verse eid="PSA 57:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 57:6"/>Waitegela lwavu migulu yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:6">moyo wangu una lusikisiki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:6">wahimba simo kuulongozi wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:6">lakini wadumbukila mgati yake.<verse eid="PSA 57:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 57:7"/>Gweye Imulungu moyo wangu ugangamala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:7">ona, moyo wangu ugangamala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:7">nokwimba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:7">nokwimba lwila.<verse eid="PSA 57:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 57:8"/>Lamuka gweye loho yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:8">lamuka gweye bango na kilimba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:8">noilamusa imitondo.<verse eid="PSA 57:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 57:9"/>Nokushukulu gweye, Mndewa hagati ha iwanhu wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:9">hagati ya iwanhu wa isi zose nokwimba nhogolwa.<verse eid="PSA 57:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 57:10"/>Kwavija unogelo wako hawishaga okwenela mbaka kuulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:10">na kutamanilwa kwako mbaka mmawingu.<verse eid="PSA 57:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 57:11"/>Gweye Imulungu, utogolwe uchanha kuulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:11">na isi yose imemezwe ukulu wako.<verse eid="PSA 57:11"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 57"/>
  <chapter number="58" style="c" sid="PSA 58"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 58</para>
  <para style="d">(Zabuli ya Daudi. Kwa kilanja, yatumie modeli wa, “Sikuubanange!”)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 58:1"/>Mweye iwatawala, vino molonga kwa haki?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 58:1">Vino motagusa viilondigwa hagati ya iwanhu?<verse eid="PSA 58:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 58:2"/>Bule! Mmizoyo yenu mogelegeza gehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 58:2">kwa makono genu mogala gehile mwiisi.<verse eid="PSA 58:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 58:3"/>Wanhu wehile wainega tangu kuleligwa kwao.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 58:3">Tangu mmunda wapotela na olonga uvizi.<verse eid="PSA 58:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 58:4"/>Sumu yao kamba sumu ya zoka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 58:4">kamba muyombo yasilile magwiti gake,<verse eid="PSA 58:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 58:5"/>ayo hohulika sauti ya mganga yolagula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 58:5">hata mganga yolagula kwa kutowa nyanga.<verse eid="PSA 58:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 58:6"/>Gweye Imulungu ibene imizino mmilomo yao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 58:6">gweye, Mndewa Imulungu uibene misaya ya simba.<verse eid="PSA 58:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 58:7"/>Waleke wasegele kamba mazi gokilima himahima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 58:7">wahakwega upinde misale yao iwe dugi.<verse eid="PSA 58:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 58:8"/>Kamba kola difile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 58:8">kamba king'hele yaleligwe yafile sikuwajone zuwa.<verse eid="PSA 58:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 58:9"/>Nongo zenu hazinapata moto kwa ngodi za miba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 58:9">mibisi hebu inyalile awo okuwa wasegeswa wose.<verse eid="PSA 58:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 58:10"/>Wene haki odeng'helela wahawona wehile obwezelwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 58:10">na oibojoga damu ya iwanhu wehile.<verse eid="PSA 58:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 58:11"/>Avo iwanhu olonga, “Wene haki wana nhunza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 58:11">kweli kauko Imulungu yoitagusa isi.”<verse eid="PSA 58:11"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 58"/>
  <chapter number="59" style="c" sid="PSA 59"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 59</para>
  <para style="d">(Kwa kilanja, yatumie modeli wa, “Sikuubanange!” Zabuli ya Daudi mbuli ya kipindi Sauli viyatumile wanhu wampelembe ili wamkome.)<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">59:0 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola kitabu cha 1 Samweli 19:11-17.</char></note></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 59:1"/>Gweye Imulungu unihonye mmakono ga iwanhu onihila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:1">unikalize kulawa kwa awo onivamila.<verse eid="PSA 59:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 59:2"/>Unikombole kulawa kwa awo otenda gehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:2">na unikombole kulawa kwa awo wetaga damu.<verse eid="PSA 59:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 59:3"/>Lola, oifisa olonda kunikoma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:3">iwanhu wasede ogala migomvi kumwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:3">hamoja niye sitendile nzambi hebu gehile, go Mndewa Imulungu.<verse eid="PSA 59:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 59:4"/>Niye sitendile dihile ila hewo waitanda kunivamila.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 59:4"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:4">Go Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:4">wize unitaze ulole sambi vinili.<verse eid="PSA 59:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 59:5"/>Gweye, Mndewa Imulungu kuna udahi wose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:5">Winuke uwakoboze iwanhu wa isi zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:5">sikuumuleke mgima hata imoja hagati ya awo otenda gehile.<verse eid="PSA 59:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 59:6"/>Kila ichungulo obwela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:6">obwaka kamba umbwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:6">na ozunguluka mgati ya dibuga.<verse eid="PSA 59:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 59:7"/>Galole gaja gowotema kulawa mmilomo yao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:7">otema misime inoligwe mmilimi yao.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:7">Na hewo olonga, “Nani yonda yatuhulike?”<verse eid="PSA 59:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 59:8"/>Lakini gweye, Mndewa Imulungu kowaseka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:8">kowabezeli iwanhu wa isi zose.<verse eid="PSA 59:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 59:9"/>Gweye kwa nguvu yangu nokulola gweye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:9">gweye Imulungu ayo ngome yangu.<verse eid="PSA 59:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 59:10"/>Imulungu wangu kwa unogelwa wake hawishaga konizila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:10">Imulungu konitenda niwalole iwanhu onihila viwohumwa.<verse eid="PSA 59:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 59:11"/>Sikuuwakome,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:11">buleavo iwanhu zangu oisemwa vuuwakoboze.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:11">Kwa udahi wako uwatende tanga nzulule na uwabwanhe hasi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:11">gweye Mndewa ayo ngao yetu.<verse eid="PSA 59:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 59:12"/>Mbuli ya nzambi za milomo yao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:12">na kwa mbuli za milomo yao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:12">waleke wagogwe kwa kuitapa kwao.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:12">Mbuli ya makungu na uvizi wao,<verse eid="PSA 59:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 59:13"/>uwasakaze kwa ng'hasiliki yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:13">uwasakaze mbaka wasegesigwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:13">ili wanhu watange kamba Imulungu ayo yotawala kwa Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:13">na kotawala mbaka kuihelela isi yose.<verse eid="PSA 59:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 59:14"/>Kila ichungulo obwela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:14">obwaka kamba umbwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:14">na ozunguluka mgati ya dibuga.<verse eid="PSA 59:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 59:15"/>Obemhela kuzahila ndiya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:15">kamba hawegute owasilila.<verse eid="PSA 59:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 59:16"/>Lakini niye nokwimba mbuli ya nguvu zako.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:16">Nokwimba kwa sauti imitondo kwa unogelwa wako hawishaga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:16">Kwavija kumwangu niye gweye kwa ngome yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:16">na hanhu ha kukimbilila mwiisiku ya magazo.<verse eid="PSA 59:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 59:17"/>Gweye kwa nguvu zangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:17">niye nokwimbila kwa deng'ho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:17">kwavija Imulungu ayo ngome yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:17">Imulungu umemile unogelwa hawishaga.<verse eid="PSA 59:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 59"/>
  <chapter number="60" style="c" sid="PSA 60"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 60</para>
  <para style="d">(Kwa kilanja yatumie modeli ya lwila lwa, “Besa da Lagano.” Lwila lwa Daudi lwa kufundizila mbuli ya kipindi viyaitowile na Waalamu kulawa Nahalaimu na Soba. Kipindi acho Yoabu viyabwelile kawakoma Waedomu elufu kumi na mbili ako Kubonde da Mkele.)<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">60:0 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola kitabu cha 2 Samweli 8:13, 1 Umwaka 18:12.</char></note></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 60:1"/>Gweye Imulungu kutulema na kutuhonda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:1">gweye kutugevuzikila, avo sambi tubweze kabili.<verse eid="PSA 60:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 60:2"/>Kuitigisa isi na kuitula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:2">uzibe ulwatu kwavija yotigisika.<verse eid="PSA 60:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 60:3"/>Kuwatenda wanhu zako wapate magazo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:3">mbaka hatudaha kugendelela.<verse eid="PSA 60:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 60:4"/>Kusimika bendela kamba kilaguso kwa waja wose okudumba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:4">ili wahonyeke na misale ya iwanhu wehile.<verse eid="PSA 60:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 60:5"/>Wose uwanogela wakombolwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:5">utukombole kwa mkono wako wa ukudila na utwidike.<verse eid="PSA 60:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 60:6"/>Imulungu kalonga kwa kung'ala kwake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:6">“Kwa kuhuma noigola isi ya Shekemu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:6">na nodipima vihande vihande bonde da Sukoti.<verse eid="PSA 60:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 60:7"/>Isi ya Gileadi yangu niye na isi ya Manase yangu niye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:7">isi ya Efulaimu ayo kamba kofia jangu da zuma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:7">Isi ya Yuda ayo kamba fimbo yangu ya utawala.<verse eid="PSA 60:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 60:8"/>Isi ya Moabu ayo kamba bakuli jangu da kunawila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:8">kwa isi ya Edomu notupa kilatu changu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:8">na niye nodeng'helela kwa kuwahuma Wafilisiti.”<verse eid="PSA 60:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 60:9"/>Nani yonda yanigale kudibuga dizungulukwe na luwa lwa mabwe?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:9">Nani yonda yanilongoze mbaka Edomu?<verse eid="PSA 60:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 60:10"/>Gweye, Imulungu siyo gweye utulemile siye?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:10">Gweye Imulungu hucholile na siye kuing'hondo.<verse eid="PSA 60:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 60:11"/>Ututaze mbuli ya iwanhu otwihila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:11">kwavija msaada wa munhu haufaya kinhu.<verse eid="PSA 60:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 60:12"/>Imulungu yahakala na siye tohuma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:12">na heyo kowabojoga hasi iwanhu otwihila.<verse eid="PSA 60:12"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 60"/>
  <chapter number="61" style="c" sid="PSA 61"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 61</para>
  <para style="d">(Zabuli ya Daudi. Kwa kilanja, yatumie nyuzi za bango.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 61:1"/>Gweye Imulungu utegeleze kililo changu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 61:1">uhulike kupula kwangu.<verse eid="PSA 61:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 61:2"/>Kulawa kuuhelelo wa isi nokukema gweye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 61:2">moyo wangu uhasinduka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 61:2">nilongoze hanhu heli na tindiwalo kamba kudibwe dili tali kubanza niye,<verse eid="PSA 61:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 61:3"/>kwavija gweye ayo kimbililo jangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 61:3">gweye ayo ngome yangu na kowagomesa iwanhu onihila.<verse eid="PSA 61:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 61:4"/>Leka nikale mkibanda chako milele.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 61:4">Leka nikimbilile hana imbeho ya mabawa gako.<verse eid="PSA 61:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 61:5"/>Kwavija gweye Imulungu kuhulika kuiduwila kwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 61:5">kunigwaa uhazi hamoja na awo okudumba gweye.<verse eid="PSA 61:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 61:6"/>Umgwelele mndewa siku nyingi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 61:6">miyaka yake iwe kwa ulelo mwingi.<verse eid="PSA 61:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 61:7"/>Yatawale milele kuulongozi wako gweye Imulungu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 61:7">Lagiza unogelo wako hawishaga na kutamanilwa kwako vimkalize.<verse eid="PSA 61:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 61:8"/>Avo niye nodimbila nhogolwa twaga jako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 61:8">nogavikiza gaja ganiiduwile kila siku.<verse eid="PSA 61:8"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 61"/>
  <chapter number="62" style="c" sid="PSA 62"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 62</para>
  <para style="d">(Zabuli ya Daudi. Kwa kilanja, yatumie modeli wa Yedutuni.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 62:1"/>Kwa Imulungu yaiyeka loho yangu yobwihila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:1">ukombola wangu olawa kumwake.<verse eid="PSA 62:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 62:2"/>Heyo yaiyeka ayo dibwe jangu na ukombola wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:2">heyo ayo ngome yangu, niye sigwaya bule.<verse eid="PSA 62:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 62:3"/>Mbaka lini monivamila?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:3">Mbaka lini mweye mose monibwanha hasi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:3">kamba kiwambaza kisonga kubomoka?<verse eid="PSA 62:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 62:4"/>Waitanda kunilagaza kulawa hanhu ha heshima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:4">odeng'helela uvizi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:4">Kwa imilomo yao otambika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:4">lakini mgati mmizoyo yao oduwila.<verse eid="PSA 62:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 62:5"/>Kwa Imulungu yaiyeka loho yangu yobwihila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:5">tamanilo jangu dolawa kumwake.<verse eid="PSA 62:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 62:6"/>Heyo ayo dibwe jangu na ukombola wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:6">heyo ayo ngome yangu niye sigwaya bule.<verse eid="PSA 62:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 62:7"/>Ukombola wangu na ukulu volawa kwa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:7">heyo ayo dibwe da nguvu na kimbililo jangu.<verse eid="PSA 62:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 62:8"/>Mweye wanhu, mtamanileni Imulungu siku zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:8">Ifunhuleni mizoyo yenu kumwake heyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:8">Imulungu ayo kimbililo jetu.<verse eid="PSA 62:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 62:9"/>Iwanhu wose kamba mhumuzi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:9">wose wakulu kwa wadodo hawafaya kinhu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:9">Uhawapima hawavika kilo imoja,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:9">hewo wose wabewe kubanza mhumuzi.<verse eid="PSA 62:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 62:10"/>Sikuutamanile uzulumati,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:10">hebu kwika tamanilo mna ivinhu va ubavi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:10">utajili wako wahongezeka sikuuwike mmoyo wako.<verse eid="PSA 62:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 62:11"/>Mwanza umoja Imulungu kalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:11">miyanza mibili niihulika mbuli ino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:11">kamba udahi wa Imulungu,<verse eid="PSA 62:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 62:12"/>na unogelwa hawishaga wa Mndewa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:12">na heyo komuliha kila munhu kamba viyasang'hane.<verse eid="PSA 62:12"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 62"/>
  <chapter number="63" style="c" sid="PSA 63"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 63</para>
  <para style="d">(Zabuli ya Daudi mbuli ya kipindi viyakalile kuluwala lwa Yuda.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 63:1"/>Go Imulungu, gweye kwa Imulungu wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 63:1">na niye nokuzahila kwa moyo wose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 63:1">Moyo wangu okusulukila kamba munhu mwene ng'hilu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 63:1">nina ng'hilu kamba isi inyalile ilibule mazi.<verse eid="PSA 63:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 63:2"/>Nikona hanhu hako hong'ala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 63:2">nizona nguvu zako na ukulu wako.<verse eid="PSA 63:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 63:3"/>Kwavija unogelo wako hawishaga unoga kubanza ugima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 63:3">na niye nokutogola kwa mulomo wangu.<verse eid="PSA 63:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 63:4"/>Nokutogola ugima wangu wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 63:4">nokwinula makono gangu na nokupula.<verse eid="PSA 63:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 63:5"/>Moyo wangu odeng'helela kamba kuja ndiya inogile ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 63:5">kwa deng'ho nokwimbila nhogolwa.<verse eid="PSA 63:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 63:6"/>Mulusazi lwangu nokukumbuka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 63:6">kilo chose nokugelegeza.<verse eid="PSA 63:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 63:7"/>Kwavija gweye konitaza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 63:7">mmbeho ya mabawa gako nokwimba kwa deng'ho.<verse eid="PSA 63:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 63:8"/>Moyo wangu okugoga gweye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 63:8">mkono wako wa ukudila onidahiza.<verse eid="PSA 63:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 63:9"/>Lakini wose olonda kunikoma niye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 63:9">odumbukila hasi mdisimo da ifa.<verse eid="PSA 63:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 63:10"/>Okomigwa kwa sime,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 63:10">okuwa ndiya ya mbagile.<verse eid="PSA 63:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 63:11"/>Lakini mndewa kodeng'helela kwa Imulungu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 63:11">Wose oiduwila kwa twaga da Imulungu okwinuligwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 63:11">kwavija milomo ya wavizi yogubikwa.<verse eid="PSA 63:11"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 63"/>
  <chapter number="64" style="c" sid="PSA 64"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 64</para>
  <para style="d">(Kwa kilanja, Zabuli ya Daudi.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 64:1"/>Unhegeleze gweye Imulungu, kuiyalala kwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 64:1">ukalize ugima wangu kwa awo onihila.<verse eid="PSA 64:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 64:2"/>Unifise kulawa kwa awo wehile ogelegeza vihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 64:2">unike kutali na mting'hano wa iwanhu otenda gehile.<verse eid="PSA 64:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 64:3"/>Onola milimi yao kamba sime,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 64:3">olava mbuli za usede kamba misale.<verse eid="PSA 64:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 64:4"/>Kulawa kuko kuwaifisile wamvamila munhu yelibule kitala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 64:4">omvamila kwa kusinhukiza bila kudumba.<verse eid="PSA 64:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 64:5"/>Opanga kinhu kimoja kwa magesa gao gehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 64:5">oilumba hanhu ha kufisa mitego yao.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 64:5">Ogelegeza, “Haduhu yodaha kuyona.”<verse eid="PSA 64:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 64:6"/>Otenda njama zao na kulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 64:6">“Tumambukiza mpango uno, nani yojuwa kinhu kino?”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 64:6">Mipango ya kifiso ifisigwa mmoyo wa munhu.<verse eid="PSA 64:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 64:7"/>Lakini Imulungu kowatowa kwa misale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 64:7">na bahaja olagazwa hasi.<verse eid="PSA 64:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 64:8"/>Kowabananga kwa mbuli zao wenyego,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 64:8">wose onda wawone ominula milomo yao kwa kuwabezeli.<verse eid="PSA 64:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 64:9"/>Aho iwanhu wose odumba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 64:9">ogasimulila gayatendile Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 64:9">na ogagelegeza gaja gayatendile.<verse eid="PSA 64:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 64:10"/>Wanhu wanogile wadeng'helele kwa Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 64:10">na wamkimbilile heyo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 64:10">Wanhu wose wanogile omtogola heyo.<verse eid="PSA 64:10"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 64"/>
  <chapter number="65" style="c" sid="PSA 65"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 65</para>
  <para style="d">(Kwa kilanja, Zabuli ya Daudi na lwila.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 65:1"/>Go Imulungu, gweye kofaya kutogoligwa ako Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:1">kumwako gweye iwanhu ogavikiza gaja gawalongile.<verse eid="PSA 65:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 65:2"/>Gweye widikaga kupula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:2">avo wanhu wose okwizila gweye.<verse eid="PSA 65:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 65:3"/>Nzambi nyingi zahatugoga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:3">gweye ayo ugelaga kumgongo gehile getu.<verse eid="PSA 65:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 65:4"/>Kamweda imunhu yumsagule na kumgala behi na gweye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:4">ili yakale kuuluwa lwako.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:4">Siye toshiba ganogile ga ng'anda yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:4">ganogile geli mng'anda yako ing'ala.<verse eid="PSA 65:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 65:5"/>Kwa unzonza kotwidika kwa haki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:5">gweye Imulungu wa ukombola wetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:5">gweye ayo tamanilo da wanhu wose okala kuihelela isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:5">na wanhu okala umwambu wa bahali.<verse eid="PSA 65:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 65:6"/>Gweye ulumbile vigongo kwa udahi wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:6">gweye kuna nguvu zose,<verse eid="PSA 65:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 65:7"/>gweye uzitendaga ng'humbi za bahali zinyamale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:7">na kubuma kwa ng'humbi na ndwagi za iwanhu wa isi zose.<verse eid="PSA 65:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 65:8"/>Wose okala kuihelela isi okanganya vilaguso vako.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:8">Kotenda isi kudilawila zuwa na kudihongela zuwa ideng'he.<verse eid="PSA 65:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 65:9"/>Koitembelela isi na koigelela mazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:9">koitenda imwede,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:9">vizanda va Imulungu vimema mazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:9">kowagwelela ndiya iwanhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:9">kwavija gweye vivo ulondile.<verse eid="PSA 65:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 65:10"/>Kuidodeza miloka yake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:10">na kugatelebusa matuta gake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:10">kovitelebusa kwa luwaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:10">na kuitenda iminoga imwede.<verse eid="PSA 65:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 65:11"/>Kwavija kuimwedeza isi, kuna ndiya nyingi mumsimu wa kusenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:11">kokose kuucholile kuna ndiya nyingi.<verse eid="PSA 65:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 65:12"/>Luwala lumema mijani ya kudimila fugo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:12">vigongo vimema deng'ho.<verse eid="PSA 65:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 65:13"/>Hanhu ha kulugongo hamema fugo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:13">makonde ganogezwa kwa ndiya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:13">vose vokemelela na kwimba kwa deng'ho.<verse eid="PSA 65:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 65"/>
  <chapter number="66" style="c" sid="PSA 66"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 66</para>
  <para style="d">(Kwa kilanja, lwila na Zabuli.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 66:1"/>Mweye wanhu wa isi yose guteni nyangi za deng'ho kwa Imulungu.<verse eid="PSA 66:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 66:2"/>Ditogoleni twaga jake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:2">mumgwee heyo nhogolwa.<verse eid="PSA 66:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 66:3"/>Mulongeleni Imulungu, “Sang'hano zako za unzonza!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:3">Nguvu zako zibanza ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:3">mbaka iwanhu okwihila oidulika na kudumba.<verse eid="PSA 66:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 66:4"/>Iwanhu wa isi yose okutambikila gweye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:4">na okwimbila nhogolwa na oditogola twaga jako.”<verse eid="PSA 66:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 66:5"/>Izoni mulole gaja gayatendile Imulungu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:5">Sang'hano zake za unzonza kwa iwanhu wa mwiisi.<verse eid="PSA 66:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 66:6"/>Kahindula bahali iwa isi inyalile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:6">waloka kwa magulu mgamazi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:6">Avo, siye tomdeng'helela heyo.<verse eid="PSA 66:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 66:7"/>Heyo kotawala kwa udahi wake milele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:7">meso gake kowalola iwanhu wa mwiisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:7">iwanhu omulema sambi wenuke.<verse eid="PSA 66:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 66:8"/>Mtogoleni Imulungu wetu mweye iwanhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:8">longeni sauti ya nhogolwa zake na wayagwe wahulike.<verse eid="PSA 66:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 66:9"/>Heyo katutenda tuwe wagima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:9">na hagalekile magulu getu gatelebuke.<verse eid="PSA 66:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 66:10"/>Kwavija gweye Imulungu kutugeza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:10">kutusunha kamba shaba viisunhigwa mmoto.<verse eid="PSA 66:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 66:11"/>Kutuleka tugogwe muulwavu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:11">kutupapiza mizigo mikulu mmigongo yetu.<verse eid="PSA 66:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 66:12"/>Kuwaleka iwanhu watubojoge,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:12">tugenda mmoto na mmazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:12">lakini kutugala mwiisi ya kumweda.<verse eid="PSA 66:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 66:13"/>Nokwiza mng'anda yako na nhosa za kusoma moto,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:13">nogavikiza gaja ganiiduwile kumwako.<verse eid="PSA 66:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 66:14"/>Gaja ganongile kwa mulomo wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:14">na kuiduwila ving'halile mmagazo.<verse eid="PSA 66:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 66:15"/>Nokulavila nhosa za kusoma moto za wanyama wanenehe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:15">na nhosa za kusoma moto za ng'hondolo mbigalo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:15">nokulavila nhosa za ng'ombe na mbuzi.<verse eid="PSA 66:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 66:16"/>Mwize mtegeleze mweye mose mumdumba Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:16">nowalongela gaja gayatendile muugima wangu.<verse eid="PSA 66:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 66:17"/>Nimulilila kwa mulomo wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:17">na nhogolwa zikala mululimi lwangu.<verse eid="PSA 66:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 66:18"/>Maza nifisile gehile mmoyo wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:18">Mndewa sambi yanitegeleze.<verse eid="PSA 66:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 66:19"/>Lakini Imulungu kanihulika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:19">ona, kanitegeleza vinimpulile.<verse eid="PSA 66:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 66:20"/>Imulungu yatogolwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:20">kwavija handemele bule vinimpulile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:20">hebu kusegesa unogelo wake hawishaga kumwangu.<verse eid="PSA 66:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 66"/>
  <chapter number="67" style="c" sid="PSA 67"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 67</para>
  <para style="d">(Lwila na Zabuli kwa kilanja, yatumie nyuzi za bango.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 67:1"/>Imulungu yatonele bazi na yatutendele ganogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 67:1">yatumwemwesele umulenge wa ikihanga chake.<verse eid="PSA 67:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 67:2"/>Nzila zako zijuwigwe mwiisi yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 67:2">na ukombola wako hagati ya iwanhu wa isi zose.<verse eid="PSA 67:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 67:3"/>Leka iwanhu wakutogole gweye Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 67:3">leka iwanhu wakutogole gweye.<verse eid="PSA 67:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 67:4"/>Leka iwanhu wa isi zose wakwimbile kwa deng'ho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 67:4">kwavija kowatagusa iwanhu kwa haki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 67:4">na kowalongoza iwanhu mwiisi yose.<verse eid="PSA 67:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 67:5"/>Leka iwanhu wakutogole gweye Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 67:5">leka iwanhu wakutogole gweye.<verse eid="PSA 67:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 67:6"/>Isi ilela ng'hani ndiya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 67:6">leka Imulungu, Imulungu wetu yatutende tumwede.<verse eid="PSA 67:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 67:7"/>Imulungu yatutende tumwede,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 67:7">na wanhu wose wa mwiisi wamdumbe heyo.<verse eid="PSA 67:7"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 67"/>
  <chapter number="68" style="c" sid="PSA 68"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 68</para>
  <para style="d">(Kwa kilanja, Zabuli ya Daudi.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 68:1"/>Imulungu kokwinuka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:1">iwanhu omwihila opwililika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:1">na iwanhu omulema omkimbila kutali.<verse eid="PSA 68:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 68:2"/>Kamba yosi vidipwililika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:2">avo waleke wapwililike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:2">kamba uhota vuulumbuka mmoto,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:2">vivo iwanhu wehile vonda walawanye kuulongozi wa Imulungu.<verse eid="PSA 68:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 68:3"/>Lakini iwanhu wanogile wadeng'helele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:3">wadeng'he kuulongozi wa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:3">wadeng'helele na kutowa ng'henze.<verse eid="PSA 68:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 68:4"/>Mwimbileni Imulungu, dimbileni twaga jake.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:4">Mwimbileni ayo yokwendelesha mawingu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:4">twaga jake Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:4">deng'heleleni kuulongozi wake.<verse eid="PSA 68:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 68:5"/>Tata wa iwana wakiwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:5">na mgombela wagane,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:5">Imulungu yokala hanhu hake hong'ala.<verse eid="PSA 68:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 68:6"/>Imulungu kowatenda iwanhu okala waiyeka wawe na hanhu ha kukala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:6">Kowalekesa wafungwa na kowatenda wamwede,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:6">ila iwanhu wehile okala mwiisi inyalile.<verse eid="PSA 68:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 68:7"/>Imulungu vuukalile kuulongozi wa iwanhu wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:7">vuukalile mmwanza ako kuluwala,<verse eid="PSA 68:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 68:8"/>isi itigiswa na ulanga wita mvula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:8">kuulongozi wako gweye, Imulungu wa Sinai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:8">ona kuulongozi wako gweye Imulungu wa Izilaeli.<verse eid="PSA 68:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 68:9"/>Kugala mvula mwingi, gweye Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:9">kuing'weza mazi isi yako inyalile.<verse eid="PSA 68:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 68:10"/>Wanhu zako okala kuko gweye Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:10">kwa kunoga kwako kuwagwaa vinhu wakiwa.<verse eid="PSA 68:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 68:11"/>Mndewa kolagiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:11">watwanzi wengi wagala usenga.<verse eid="PSA 68:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 68:12"/>Iwandewa na iwakalizi zao okimbila.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:12">Watwanzi wetu okala ukae oigolela vibokigwe kung'hondo.<verse eid="PSA 68:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 68:13"/>Hata wanhu owasa mmabumba ga ng'hondolo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:13">opata mabawa ga njiwa gagubikwe kwa shaba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:13">na mitipilo yake kwa zahabu ing'ala.<verse eid="PSA 68:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 68:14"/>Imulungu yeli na udahi wose viyawapwililise iwandewa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:14">ikala kamba balafu ilagala kulugongo lwa Salimoni.<verse eid="PSA 68:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 68:15"/>Gweye lugongo Iutali, lugongo lwa Bashani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:15">gweye lugongo luli na nhembeti nyingi, lugongo lwa Bashani.<verse eid="PSA 68:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 68:16"/>Habali mokona migongo, gweye lugongo luli na nhembeti nyingi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:16">lugongo lwa Imulungu alo lumnogela heyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:16">Mndewa Imulungu kokala kuko milele.<verse eid="PSA 68:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 68:17"/>Mituka ya Imulungu ibanza maelufu longo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:17">maelufu kwa maelufu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:17">Mndewa keza kulawa Sinai mbaka hanhu hake hong'ala.<verse eid="PSA 68:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 68:18"/>Vuukwelile uchanha kukwela hamoja na wafungwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:18">kubokela nhunza kulawa kwa iwanhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:18">hata kulawa kwa awo okulema gweye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:18">ili gweye Mndewa Imulungu ukale kuko.<verse eid="PSA 68:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 68:19"/>Mndewa Imulungu yatogoligwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:19">Siku mbaka siku kotupapila mizigo yetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:19">Imulungu ayo yotukombola.<verse eid="PSA 68:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 68:20"/>Imulungu wetu ayo Imulungu yotukombola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:20">kwa Mndewa Imulungu kuko wili ukombola wa iwanhu wa mwiisi.<verse eid="PSA 68:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 68:21"/>Lakini Imulungu kogahonda mapala ga iwanhu omwihila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:21">mapala ga iwanhu ochola mnzila ya nzambi zao.<verse eid="PSA 68:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 68:22"/>Mndewa, kalonga, “Nowabweza kulawa Bashani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:22">nowabweza kulawa mbahali,<verse eid="PSA 68:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 68:23"/>ili ubojoge magulu gako mwiidamu ya iwanhu okwihila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:23">akuno milimi ya umbwa wako yopata hesa.”<verse eid="PSA 68:23"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 68:24"/>Gweye Imulungu, mwanza wako wa mhumo oneka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:24">mwanza wa Imulungu, Mndewa Imulungu wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:24">olongoza hanhu hake hong'ala.<verse eid="PSA 68:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 68:25"/>Tanhu weza wembaji, abaho watowa bango,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:25">vivija na wali otowa ngoma ndodo.<verse eid="PSA 68:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 68:26"/>Mtogoleni Imulungu kumting'hano mkulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:26">mtogoleni Mndewa Imulungu kumting'hano wa Izilaeli.<verse eid="PSA 68:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 68:27"/>Kabila dodo da Benjamini dowalongoza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:27">na iwatawala wa Yuda na bumbila jao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:27">abaho iwatawala wa Zabuloni na Nafutali.<verse eid="PSA 68:27"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 68:28"/>Gweye Imulungu lagiza udahi wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:28">gweye Imulungu tulagusile nguvu zako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:28">kamba vuutendile ako umwaka.<verse eid="PSA 68:28"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 68:29"/>Mbuli ya ng'anda yako ako Yelusalemu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:29">iwandewa okugalila nhunza.<verse eid="PSA 68:29"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 68:30"/>Mkomhokele munhu yokwihila yeli kamba mnyama yokala kudilolo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:30">heyo kamba bumbila da ng'ombe mbigalo hagati ya ng'ombe wana.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:30">Wabojoge na wakugalile vihande va shaba.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:30">Wapwililise iwanhu wa isi onogelwa na ng'hondo.<verse eid="PSA 68:30"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 68:31"/>Wasenga okwiza kulawa Misili ogala nhunza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:31">Kushi omgalila Imulungu vinhu vao.<verse eid="PSA 68:31"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 68:32"/>Mwimbileni Imulungu, mweye iwandewa wa isi yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:32">mwimbileni nhogolwa Mndewa.<verse eid="PSA 68:32"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 68:33"/>Mwimbileni nhogolwa heyo yakwelile kuulanga wa uchanha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:33">ona ulanga wa milele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:33">heyo koduma kwa sauti ng'hulu.<verse eid="PSA 68:33"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 68:34"/>Longeni ukulu wa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:34">heyo kotawala Izilaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:34">heyo kana udahi ako kuulanga.<verse eid="PSA 68:34"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 68:35"/>Gweye Imulungu kodumbiza ako ihanhu hako hong'ala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:35">Imulungu wa Izilaeli ayo yowagwaa iwanhu zake nguvu na udahi.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 68:35"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:35">Imulungu yatogolwe.<verse eid="PSA 68:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 68"/>
  <chapter number="69" style="c" sid="PSA 69"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 69</para>
  <para style="d">(Zabuli ya Daudi. Kwa kilanja, yatumie modeli ya lwila lwa Besa.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 69:1"/>Gweye Imulungu unikombole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:1">kwavija mazi ganivikila msingo.<verse eid="PSA 69:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 69:2"/>Nodidimila mnhope,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:2">hanhu sidaha kwima wima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:2">nivika mmazi mengi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:2">sika kulu dinigubika.<verse eid="PSA 69:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 69:3"/>Nidonha kukulilila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:3">tundu melo jangu dinyala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:3">Meso gangu gavulala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:3">kwa kukubeta gweye Imulungu wangu.<verse eid="PSA 69:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 69:4"/>Iwanhu onihila bila kilamuso wengi kubanza mvili zangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:4">wengi onivamila kwa mbuli za uvizi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:4">Nolondigwa kubweza kinhu sikibile.<verse eid="PSA 69:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 69:5"/>Gweye Imulungu, gweye kojuwa ubozi wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:5">nzambi zangu hazifisika kumwako.<verse eid="PSA 69:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 69:6"/>Wose okutamanila gweye Mkulu Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:6">sikuwagwe kinyala mbuli yangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:6">Mndewa uli na udahi wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:6">wose okuzahila gweye Imulungu wa Izilaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:6">sikuwagwe kinyala mbuli yangu.<verse eid="PSA 69:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 69:7"/>Kwavija nisitamili kubezeligwa mbuli yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:7">kinyala kigubika kihanga changu.<verse eid="PSA 69:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 69:8"/>Niwa mgeni kwa ndugu zangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:8">niwa mgeni kwa wanage mamangu mwenyego.<verse eid="PSA 69:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 69:9"/>Kwavija unogelwa wangu kwa ng'anda yako osoma mgati mmwangu kamba moto,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:9">maligo ga awo okuliga ganizila.<verse eid="PSA 69:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 69:10"/>Nahalila na kufunga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:10">hewo onibezeli habali nhendile vivo.<verse eid="PSA 69:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 69:11"/>Vinivalile viwalo va gunia kwa kuiyalala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:11">nikala kinhu cha kusekwa na iwanhu.<verse eid="PSA 69:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 69:12"/>Waja okala mmulango onigeweza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:12">iwanhu wakoligwe otunga nyila mbuli yangu.<verse eid="PSA 69:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 69:13"/>Lakini niye nokupula gweye Mndewa Imulungu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:13">Mkipindi kikunogeza, muunogelo wako hawishaga mkulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:13">gweye Imulungu unidike kwa ukombola wako wa kweli.<verse eid="PSA 69:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 69:14"/>Unitaze sikuunileke nididimile mnhope,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:14">nilave mmakono ga awo onihila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:14">ndave kulawa mmazi mengi.<verse eid="PSA 69:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 69:15"/>Sikuundeke nzoligwe na sika kulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:15">hebu nididimile mmazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:15">hebu nimezwe na ifa.<verse eid="PSA 69:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 69:16"/>Gweye Mndewa Imulungu unidike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:16">kwavija unogelo wako hawishaga mkulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:16">unihindukile kamba bazi jako vidili.<verse eid="PSA 69:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 69:17"/>Sikuufise kihanga chako kwa msang'hanaji wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:17">ulopole kunidika kwavija nammagazo.<verse eid="PSA 69:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 69:18"/>Wize behi na unikombole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:18">unigombole kulawa kwa iwanhu onihila.<verse eid="PSA 69:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 69:19"/>Gweye kotanga vindigigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:19">kotanga iwanhu viwongela kinyala na kunibezeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:19">wose onihila gweye kowatanga.<verse eid="PSA 69:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 69:20"/>Awo onibezeli wanibena nguvu na niye nifa umoyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:20">nozahila imunhu wa kunyonela bazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:20">lakini simpatile yoyose wa kunihoza.<verse eid="PSA 69:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 69:21"/>Wanikila sumu mna ndiya yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:21">na ving'halile na ng'hilu wangwaa divai isasile.<verse eid="PSA 69:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 69:22"/>Imeza itandigwe kuulongozi wa hewo iwe mtego,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:22">na wagogwe mzinyimwilinyimwili zao.<verse eid="PSA 69:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 69:23"/>Meso gao gageligwe ziza sikuwalole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:23">na migongo yao iveduke siku zose.<verse eid="PSA 69:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 69:24"/>Uwakutulile ng'hasiliki yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:24">kugevuzika kwako ng'hani kuwapate.<verse eid="PSA 69:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 69:25"/>Kae yao iwe vihame,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:25">sikuyakale munhu yoyose mvibanda vao.<verse eid="PSA 69:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 69:26"/>Kwavija owadununza awo uwadununze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:26">na olonga mbuli ya usungu wa awo uwalumize.<verse eid="PSA 69:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 69:27"/>Walihe gehile kwa gehile gao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:27">sikuuwaleke wailumbe muukombola wako.<verse eid="PSA 69:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 69:28"/>Wasegeswe mkitabu cha wagima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:28">sikuwandikigwe mumsafa wa matwaga ga iwanhu otenda ganogile.<verse eid="PSA 69:28"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 69:29"/>Lakini niye nogaya na nina usungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:29">gweye Imulungu unikombole na unike goya.<verse eid="PSA 69:29"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 69:30"/>Noditogola twaga da Imulungu kwa lwila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:30">na nomtogola kwa kumgwaa nhogolwa.<verse eid="PSA 69:30"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 69:31"/>Mbuli ayo yomnogeza Mndewa Imulungu kubanza ng'ombe mbigalo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:31">kubanza ng'ombe mgima mgima.<verse eid="PSA 69:31"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 69:32"/>Wakiwa ogona gago na kudeng'helela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:32">mweye mumzahila Imulungu mizoyo yenu ipate nguvu.<verse eid="PSA 69:32"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 69:33"/>Mndewa Imulungu kowategeleza ngaengae,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:33">hawasemwa wanhu zake wafungigwe mkifungo.<verse eid="PSA 69:33"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 69:34"/>Ulanga na isi vimtogole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:34">bahali na vose vikalaga mumo.<verse eid="PSA 69:34"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 69:35"/>Kwavija Imulungu kodikombola buga da Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:35">na kogazenga kabili mabuga ga Yuda.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:35">Wanhu zake okala mumo na kutawala.<verse eid="PSA 69:35"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 69:36"/>Wana wa iwasang'hanaji wa Imulungu odihazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:36">na iwanhu wose odinogela twaga jake okala mumo.<verse eid="PSA 69:36"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 69"/>
  <chapter number="70" style="c" sid="PSA 70"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 70</para>
  <para style="d">(Kwa kilanja, Zabuli ya Daudi kopula yakumbukigwe na Imulungu.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 70:1"/>Gweye Imulungu ulopole kunikombola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 70:1">gweye Mndewa Imulungu wize unitaze.<verse eid="PSA 70:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 70:2"/>Wose olonda ugima wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 70:2">wagwe kinyala na wapate lukwale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 70:2">wose olonda gehile gamhate,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 70:2">wabwele kuchugu na wagwe kinyala.<verse eid="PSA 70:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 70:3"/>Waja onibeza, “Amweye! Amweye!”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 70:3">wabwele kuchugu mbuli ya kinyala chao.<verse eid="PSA 70:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 70:4"/>Lakini wose okuzahila gweye wadeng'helele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 70:4">na kusekelela kumwako.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 70:4">Wose ounogela ukombola wako walonge,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 70:4">“Imulungu yatogolwe!”<verse eid="PSA 70:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 70:5"/>Lakini niye na mkiwa na ngaengae,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 70:5">gweye Imulungu wize himahima kumwangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 70:5">Gweye ayo unitazaga na mkombola wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 70:5">gweye Mndewa Imulungu, sikuukawe.<verse eid="PSA 70:5"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 70"/>
  <chapter number="71" style="c" sid="PSA 71"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 71</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 71:1"/>Kumwako gweye Mndewa Imulungu, nikukimbilila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:1">sikuundeke ng'o nigwe kinyala.<verse eid="PSA 71:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 71:2"/>Kwa haki yako unihonye na unikombole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:2">tega gwiti jako utegeleze na unikombole.<verse eid="PSA 71:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 71:3"/>Uwe kumwangu kamba dibwe da kukimbilila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:3">gweye kulagiza niye nikomboligwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:3">kwavija gweye kwa dibwe jangu na ngome yangu.<verse eid="PSA 71:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 71:4"/>Gweye Imulungu unikombole kulawa mmakono ga wanhu wehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:4">kulawa kumikombe ya wanhu wehile na wasede.<verse eid="PSA 71:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 71:5"/>Gweye ayo tamanilo jangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:5">gweye Mkulu Mndewa Imulungu, ayo tamanilo jangu tangu ubwanga wangu.<verse eid="PSA 71:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 71:6"/>Ning'hali sinavumbuka nikutamanila gweye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:6">mmunda wa mamangu gweye ayo nikutamanile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:6">Nokwimbila nyila za kukutogola siku zose.<verse eid="PSA 71:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 71:7"/>Niwa kamba kilozo kwa wanhu wengi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:7">lakini gweye kwa kimbililo jangu da nguvu.<verse eid="PSA 71:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 71:8"/>Mulomo wangu umemezwa nhogolwa zako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:8">nolonga ukulu wako imisi yose.<verse eid="PSA 71:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 71:9"/>Sikuunyase kipindi cha uvele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:9">na sikuundeke nguvu zangu zahahunguka.<verse eid="PSA 71:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 71:10"/>Kwavija iwanhu onihila onideta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:10">waja onisepa opanga gehile ili wanikome.<verse eid="PSA 71:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 71:11"/>Olonga, “Imulungu kamuleka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:11">mzahileni mumgoge,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:11">kwavija haduhu yonda yamkombole!”<verse eid="PSA 71:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 71:12"/>Gweye Imulungu sikuukale kutali na niye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:12">gweye Imulungu wangu wize himahima unhaze.<verse eid="PSA 71:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 71:13"/>Waja onibezeli wabanangwe kwa kinyala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:13">waja olonda kunikoma waumbuke na wagwe kinyala.<verse eid="PSA 71:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 71:14"/>Lakini niye notamanila siku zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:14">nogendelela kukutogola ng'hani.<verse eid="PSA 71:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 71:15"/>Mulomo wangu osimulila haki yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:15">osimulila mbuli zako za ukombola imisi yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:15">kwavija zibanza nzewele zangu.<verse eid="PSA 71:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 71:16"/>Gweye Mkulu Mndewa Imulungu, nokwiza na kulonga mbuli zako ng'hulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:16">nolonga haki yako, yako gweye wiiyeka.<verse eid="PSA 71:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 71:17"/>Gweye Imulungu kunifunza tangu ubwanga wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:17">mbaka lelo nolonga mbuli zako za unzonza.<verse eid="PSA 71:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 71:18"/>Gweye Imulungu, sikuundeke hata nahawa mvele na uhenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:18">mbaka nilonge udahi wako ulelo ukwiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:18">nguvu zako kwa wose okwiza kumwande.<verse eid="PSA 71:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 71:19"/>Gweye Imulungu haki yako ivika mbaka kuulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:19">gweye utendile mbuli ng'hulu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:19">Gweye Imulungu nani kamba gweye?<verse eid="PSA 71:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 71:20"/>Hamoja kunitenda nigaye kwa usungu konibweza kabili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:20">kulawa hasi kuzimu koninula kabili.<verse eid="PSA 71:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 71:21"/>Kowengeza ukulu wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:21">na konihoza moyo kabili.<verse eid="PSA 71:21"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 71:22"/>Gweye Imulungu wangu nokushukulu kwa bango,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:22">mbuli ya kutamanilwa kwako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:22">gweye Ayo Ung'alile wa Izilaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:22">nokwimbila nhogolwa kwa kilimba.<verse eid="PSA 71:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 71:23"/>Mulomo wangu okwimba kwa deng'ho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:23">na loho yangu yokutogola kwavija kunikombola.<verse eid="PSA 71:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 71:24"/>Nolonga mbuli zako za haki imisi yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:24">kwavija waja walondile kunikoma wagwa kinyala na waumbuka.<verse eid="PSA 71:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 71"/>
  <chapter number="72" style="c" sid="PSA 72"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 72</para>
  <para style="d">(Zabuli ya Sulemani.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 72:1"/>Gweye Imulungu, mgwelele nzewele mndewa yataguse kwa haki yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:1">mwana wa mndewa kwa haki yako.<verse eid="PSA 72:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 72:2"/>Kowatagusa wanhu wako kwa haki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:2">iwanhu wako wakiwa kwa haki.<verse eid="PSA 72:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 72:3"/>Vigongo vogala ukumweda kwa iwanhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:3">vigongo vimeme matunda ga haki.<verse eid="PSA 72:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 72:4"/>Kowagombela oneligwe mna iwanhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:4">kowakombola wana wa ngaengae,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:4">wahonde iwanhu owadununza wayagwe.<verse eid="PSA 72:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 72:5"/>Kosigala kamba zuwa na mbalamwezi ulelo wose.<verse eid="PSA 72:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 72:6"/>Kokuwa kamba mvula itowa mumgunda ulimigwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:6">kamba luwaga lutowa mwiisi.<verse eid="PSA 72:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 72:7"/>Kipindi chake wene haki omweda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:7">ukumweda kokuwa kuko mbaka mbalamwezi yahafa.<verse eid="PSA 72:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 72:8"/>Kotawala kulawa bahali mbaka bahali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:8">na kulawa kuulwanda mbaka kuihelela isi.<verse eid="PSA 72:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 72:9"/>Makabila ga kuluwala omfugamila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:9">na iwanhu omwihila ohumwa.<verse eid="PSA 72:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 72:10"/>Wandewa wa Talishishi na iwandewa wa mhwani omgalila nhosa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:10">wandewa wa Sheba na Seba omgalila nhunza.<verse eid="PSA 72:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 72:11"/>Wandewa wose omfugamila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:11">na iwanhu wa isi zose omsang'hanila.<verse eid="PSA 72:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 72:12"/>Heyo komuhonya mkiwa yomulilila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:12">imunhu yoneligwe yelibule munhu wa kumtaza.<verse eid="PSA 72:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 72:13"/>Kowonela bazi wakiwa na ngaengae,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:13">na kowakombola welibule kinhu kulawa mkifo.<verse eid="PSA 72:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 72:14"/>Kowakombola sikuwoneligwe na iwasede,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:14">kwavija ugima wao ubanza kunoga kumwake.<verse eid="PSA 72:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 72:15"/>Heyo yakale mgima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:15">na yabokele zahabu za Sheba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:15">wanhu wampulile kwa Imulungu siku zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:15">na yamwede imisi yose.<verse eid="PSA 72:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 72:16"/>Ndiya imeme mwiisi yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:16">kunhembeti ya vigongo kumeme.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:16">Kuwe na ndiya kamba muhulo wa Lebanoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:16">wanhu mmabuga wamwede kamba mijani ya kubonde.<verse eid="PSA 72:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 72:17"/>Twaga jake disigale milele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:17">na disigale kamba zuwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:17">Iwanhu wa isi zose wamwede kubitila heyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:17">na hewo wamkeme kamweda.<verse eid="PSA 72:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 72:18"/>Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wa Izilaeli yatogolwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:18">heyo yaiyeka yotenda mbuli za unzonza.<verse eid="PSA 72:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 72:19"/>Twaga jake kulu ditogolwe milele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:19">isi yose imeme ukulu wake. Ona, Ona.<verse eid="PSA 72:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 72:20"/>Uno awo uhelelo wa kupula kwa Daudi, imwana wa Yese.<verse eid="PSA 72:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 72"/>
  <chapter number="73" style="c" sid="PSA 73"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 73</para>
  <para style="d">(Zabuli ya Asafu.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 73:1"/>Kweli Imulungu kanoga kwa iwanhu wa Izilaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:1">kwa iwanhu waja mizoyo yao inoga.<verse eid="PSA 73:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 73:2"/>Lakini kumwangu niye, migulu ikala yolonda kutelebuka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:2">mgulu wangu ulonda kutelebuka hanhu aho hanimile.<verse eid="PSA 73:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 73:3"/>Kwavija niwonela migongo iwanhu oitapa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:3">vinyonile ukumweda kwa iwanhu wehile.<verse eid="PSA 73:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 73:4"/>Hewo hawapata magazo mbaka ifa yao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:4">ng'huli zao zineneha na zina nguvu.<verse eid="PSA 73:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 73:5"/>Hawagaya kamba iwanhu wayagwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:5">na hawapata magazo kamba viwopata iwanhu wayagwe.<verse eid="PSA 73:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 73:6"/>Avo kuitapa kwao kamba mkufu wao msingo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:6">kubezeli kamba kiwalo chao.<verse eid="PSA 73:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 73:7"/>Gehile golawa mmizoyo yao ifile ganzi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:7">mipango yao ihile yolawa mmizoyo yao.<verse eid="PSA 73:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 73:8"/>Obezeli na kulonga kwa usede,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:8">oitapa na olonda kuwadununza wayagwe.<verse eid="PSA 73:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 73:9"/>Milomo yao yolonga gehile hata kwa ulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:9">na olonga kwa kuitapa kwa wanhu wayagwe.<verse eid="PSA 73:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 73:10"/>Avo iwanhu zao owahindukila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:10">na hawona kilozo chochose.<verse eid="PSA 73:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 73:11"/>Olonga, “Imulungu kotangaze?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:11">Vino heyo yeli Uchanha Ng'hani kotanga kinhu?”<verse eid="PSA 73:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 73:12"/>Vino, vivo weli wene nzambi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:12">hawagelegeza kinhu siku zose okwengeza utajili.<verse eid="PSA 73:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 73:13"/>Nigaya bule kuwika moyo wangu unogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:13">na kunawa makono gangu sikuniwe na kitala.<verse eid="PSA 73:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 73:14"/>Imisi yose nigazwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:14">nitagusigwa kila imitondo.<verse eid="PSA 73:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 73:15"/>Maza nilongile, “Nolonga vino,”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:15">nahawahinduke wanago.<verse eid="PSA 73:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 73:16"/>Vinigezile kugajuwa gose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:16">gakala ngaga kumwangu kugajuwa,<verse eid="PSA 73:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 73:17"/>mbaka viningile hanhu hong'ala ha Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:17">aho nijuwa uhelelo wao.<verse eid="PSA 73:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 73:18"/>Kweli koweka hanhu hana lungwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:18">kowabwanha hasi kwa ubananzi.<verse eid="PSA 73:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 73:19"/>Lola viwobanangwa himahima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:19">osegeswa kwa bwembwe.<verse eid="PSA 73:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 73:20"/>Kamba nzozi munhu viyolamuka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:20">vivo vuwinuka gweye Mndewa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:20">kowasegesa kamba nzozi.<verse eid="PSA 73:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 73:21"/>Moyo wangu vuugeligwe lusikisiki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:21">na loho yangu viigeligwe usungu,<verse eid="PSA 73:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 73:22"/>nikala mbozi na sijuwile kinhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:22">nikala kamba ng'onyo kumwako.<verse eid="PSA 73:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 73:23"/>Lakini nahamoja na gweye siku zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:23">kunigoga mkono wangu wa ukudila.<verse eid="PSA 73:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 73:24"/>Konilongoza kwa gaja goulonda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:24">abaho konibokela kwa ukulu wako.<verse eid="PSA 73:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 73:25"/>Nani iyagwe inilinayo kuulanga ila gweye?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:25">Mwiisi haduhu kinhu kinisulukila kubanza gweye.<verse eid="PSA 73:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 73:26"/>Lukuli lwangu na moyo wangu vodaha kulemelwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:26">ila Imulungu ayo nguvu ya moyo wangu na fungu jangu milele.<verse eid="PSA 73:26"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 73:27"/>Wose okala kutali na gweye obanangwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:27">kowabananga wose hawakutamanila gweye.<verse eid="PSA 73:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 73:28"/>Kumwangu niye kukala behi na Imulungu kinhu kinogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:28">nimtenda Mkulu Mndewa Imulungu kimbililo jangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:28">nolonga gose gausang'hane.<verse eid="PSA 73:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 73"/>
  <chapter number="74" style="c" sid="PSA 74"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 74</para>
  <para style="d">(Lwila lwa Asafu.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 74:1"/>Gweye Imulungu habali kutulema milele?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:1">Habali ng'hasiliki yako yokwaka kwa ng'hondolo zako?<verse eid="PSA 74:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 74:2"/>Kumbuka iwanhu waugulile tangu umwaka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:2">kumbuka kabila da uhazi wako awo kuwagombola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:2">kumbuka lugongo lwa Sayuni ako kuukalile.<verse eid="PSA 74:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 74:3"/>Hinduka uchole kuvihame vino milele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:3">unanzi uno wa ihanhu hako hong'ala ugaligwe na wanhu okwihila.<verse eid="PSA 74:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 74:4"/>Iwanhu okwihila wabuma kwa mhumo aho ihanhu hako hong'ala hauiting'hane na siye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:4">okwika bendela zao kamba kilaguso cha mhumo.<verse eid="PSA 74:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 74:5"/>Watenda kamba iwanhu osang'hanila mishoka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:5">okanha mibiki.<verse eid="PSA 74:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 74:6"/>Wabena mbao zihambigwe goya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:6">kwa mishoka na nyundo.<verse eid="PSA 74:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 74:7"/>Wahasoma moto hanhu hong'ala mbaka hasi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:7">wahagela dikwe hanhu hodikala twaga jako.<verse eid="PSA 74:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 74:8"/>Walonga mmizoyo yao, “Towahonda kabisa!”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:8">Wahasoma moto kila hanhu hotuiting'hana kukutambikila.<verse eid="PSA 74:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 74:9"/>Hatugweleligwe kilaguso cha unzonza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:9">haduhu watula ndagu wasigale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:9">haduhu munhu vitwili yojuwa mbuli ino yokwisha lini.<verse eid="PSA 74:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 74:10"/>Gweye Imulungu mdetaji kokubezeli mbaka lini?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:10">Vino iwanhu okwihila odiliga twaga jako milele?<verse eid="PSA 74:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 74:11"/>Habali kougomesa mkono wako wa ukudila wa nguvu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:11">Golosa mkono wako uwabanange.<verse eid="PSA 74:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 74:12"/>Lakini gweye Imulungu kwa Mndewa wangu tangu umwaka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:12">gweye kogala ukombola mwiisi.<verse eid="PSA 74:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 74:13"/>Gweye ayo uigolile bahali kwa nguvu zako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:13">kugatula mapala ga iming'onyo mikulu ili mgamazi.<verse eid="PSA 74:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 74:14"/>Gweye ayo utulile pala da Lewiasani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:14">na kumulava kamba ndiya ya viumbe va kuluwala.<verse eid="PSA 74:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 74:15"/>Gweye ayo ufungule mbwibwi na vizanda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:15">vizanda vikalile vokilima siku zose kuvinyaza.<verse eid="PSA 74:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 74:16"/>Imisi yako na vivija ikilo yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:16">gweye kwika zuwa na mbalamwezi.<verse eid="PSA 74:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 74:17"/>Gweye ayo wikile imbaka ya isi yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:17">kutenda msimu wa zuwa kali na masika.<verse eid="PSA 74:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 74:18"/>Kumbuka mdetaji viyakubezeli gweye Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:18">wanhu viwadiligile twaga jako.<verse eid="PSA 74:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 74:19"/>Sikuugale ugima wa njiwa wako kwa iming'onyo ya kumuhulo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:19">sikuuusemwe ugima wa iwanhu wako ogaya milele.<verse eid="PSA 74:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 74:20"/>Dikumbuke lagano jako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:20">hanhu ha ziza ha isi hamema iwanhu ogala ndwagi.<verse eid="PSA 74:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 74:21"/>Sikuutogole iwanhu oneligwe wabwele kuchugu kwa kinyala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:21">wakiwa na welibule kinhu waditogole twaga jako.<verse eid="PSA 74:21"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 74:22"/>Inuka gweye Imulungu uigombele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:22">kumbuka iwanhu wabozi viwokubezeli imisi yose.<verse eid="PSA 74:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 74:23"/>Sikuuisemwe kuguta kwa iwanhu okulema gweye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:23">kubuma kwa iwanhu okwihila kila siku.<verse eid="PSA 74:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 74"/>
  <chapter number="75" style="c" sid="PSA 75"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 75</para>
  <para style="d">(Lwila na Zabuli ya Asafu. Kwa kilanja, yatumie modeli wa, “Sikuubanange.”)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 75:1"/>Gweye Imulungu, tokushukulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 75:1">tokushukulu gweye kwavija twaga jako da behi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 75:1">wanhu osimulila mbuli zako za unzonza.<verse eid="PSA 75:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 75:2"/>Imulungu kolonga, “Nosagula kipindi kinogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 75:2">niye notagusa kwa haki.<verse eid="PSA 75:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 75:3"/>Kipindi isi yose na iwanhu okala mumo yahatigisika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 75:3">niye ayo nigogeleza mhanda zake sikuzilagale.<verse eid="PSA 75:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 75:4"/>Kwa iwanhu oitapa nolonga, ‘Sikumuitape kabili,’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 75:4">kwa iwanhu wehile nolonga, ‘Sikumwinule mhembe zenu.<verse eid="PSA 75:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 75:5"/>Sikumwinule mhembe zenu mbuli ya ulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 75:5">sikumulonge kwa kibuli.’ ”<verse eid="PSA 75:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 75:6"/>Haduhu yoyose yolawa umwambu wa kudilawila zuwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 75:6">hebu umwambu wa kudihongela zuwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 75:6">hebu umwambu wa kuluwala yodaha kumkweza munhu.<verse eid="PSA 75:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 75:7"/>Lakini Imulungu ayo yotagusa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 75:7">komuhumulusa imoja na komkweza iyagwe.<verse eid="PSA 75:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 75:8"/>Mumkono wa Mndewa Imulungu kuna kikasi kimemile divai kali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 75:8">yolava holovu na ihanganyigwa na usongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 75:8">kowagidila iwanhu wehile weli mwiisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 75:8">ong'wa mbaka dwendwe da mwisho.<verse eid="PSA 75:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 75:9"/>Lakini niye nolonga gayasang'hane milele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 75:9">nomwimbila nhogolwa Imulungu wa Yakobo.<verse eid="PSA 75:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 75:10"/>Nguvu za iwanhu wehile nozibena,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 75:10">lakini nguvu za wene haki zokwinuligwa.<verse eid="PSA 75:10"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 75"/>
  <chapter number="76" style="c" sid="PSA 76"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 76</para>
  <para style="d">(Lwila na Zabuli ya Asafu. Kwa kilanja, yatumie nyuzi za bango.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 76:1"/>Ako mwiisi ya Yuda Imulungu kojuwigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 76:1">twaga jake kulu mwiisi ya Izilaeli.<verse eid="PSA 76:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 76:2"/>Kibanda chake kizengigwa ako Salemu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">76:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dino dikala twaga da umwaka da buga da Yelusalemu</char></note>,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 76:2">ukazi wake wa ako Sayuni.<verse eid="PSA 76:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 76:3"/>Ako kabena misale ikwaka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 76:3">kabena ngao na sime na migoha ya ng'hondo.<verse eid="PSA 76:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 76:4"/>Gweye kong'ala kwa mulenge,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 76:4">mwene unovu kubanza vigongo vili na utajili wa wanyama.<verse eid="PSA 76:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 76:5"/>Magalu wabokigwa vinhu vao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 76:5">owasa utulo wa kimambukizo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 76:5">haduhu hata munhu imoja yodaha kuitowa ng'hondo.<verse eid="PSA 76:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 76:6"/>Kwa kukomhokela kwako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 76:6">gweye Imulungu wa Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 76:6">falasi na mtuka wa ng'hondo vikala tuluu.<verse eid="PSA 76:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 76:7"/>Gweye wiiyeka ayo wakudumbigwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 76:7">Nani yodaha kwima kuulongozi wako wahagevuzika?<verse eid="PSA 76:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 76:8"/>Kulawa kuulanga kulonga nhaguso yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 76:8">na isi idumba inyamala tuluu.<verse eid="PSA 76:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 76:9"/>Gweye Mndewa Imulungu vuwinuke kutagusa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 76:9">kuwakombola wose oneligwe mwiisi.<verse eid="PSA 76:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 76:10"/>Ng'hasiliki yako kwa wanhu yogala ukulu kumwako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 76:10">na waja wasigale mwiing'hasiliki yako otenda nyimwilinyimwili.<verse eid="PSA 76:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 76:11"/>Iduwileni kwa Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wenu, na vikizeni gaja gamuiduwile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 76:11">wose omzunguluka heyo wamgalile nhunza, heyo yodumbigwa.<verse eid="PSA 76:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 76:12"/>Heyo kokanha loho za watawala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 76:12">heyo kodumbigwa na iwandewa wa isi yose.<verse eid="PSA 76:12"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 76"/>
  <chapter number="77" style="c" sid="PSA 77"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 77</para>
  <para style="d">(Zabuli ya Asafu. Kwa kilanja, yatumie modeli wa Yedutuni.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 77:1"/>Nomulilila Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:1">nomulilila Imulungu na heyo konihulika.<verse eid="PSA 77:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 77:2"/>Siku da magazo gangu nimzahila Mndewa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:2">ikilo ninula uchanha makono gangu bila kudonha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:2">na moyo wangu ulema kuhozwa.<verse eid="PSA 77:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 77:3"/>Gweye Imulungu nikukumbuka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:3">nilila kwa giogio,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:3">nigelegeza na niye nisinduka.<verse eid="PSA 77:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 77:4"/>Kugatenda meso gangu sikugafing'hilize,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:4">nikala nogaya mbaka ndemelwa kulonga.<verse eid="PSA 77:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 77:5"/>Nigelegeza siku zibitile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:5">na miyaka mingi ibitile.<verse eid="PSA 77:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 77:6"/>Nilonga, “Leka nikumbuke nyila zangu ikilo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:6">leka nigelegeze mmoyo wangu.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:6">Abaho loho yangu izahila.<verse eid="PSA 77:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 77:7"/>“Vino Mndewa kotulema milele?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:7">Vino hatenda ganogile kabili?<verse eid="PSA 77:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 77:8"/>Vino unogelo wake hawishaga usegela milele?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:8">Vino gaja gayalongile hagavikizwa milele?<verse eid="PSA 77:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 77:9"/>Vino Imulungu kaisemwa kona bazi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:9">Vino heyo yahagevuzika kosegesa bazi jake?”<verse eid="PSA 77:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 77:10"/>Abaho nigelegeza, “Kinilumiza acho kino, Imulungu yeli na Uchanha Ng'hani hatenda chochose mbuli yetu.”<verse eid="PSA 77:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 77:11"/>Nozikumbuka sang'hano za Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:11">ona noukumbuka unzonza wako wa umwaka.<verse eid="PSA 77:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 77:12"/>Nozigelegeza sang'hano zako zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:12">na nozigesa mbuli zako ng'hulu.<verse eid="PSA 77:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 77:13"/>Gweye Imulungu, nzila zako zing'ala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:13">Imulungu gani yeli mkulu kamba Imulungu wetu?<verse eid="PSA 77:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 77:14"/>Gweye ayo Imulungu utendaga unzonza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:14">kulagusa ukulu wako hagati ya iwanhu wa isi zose.<verse eid="PSA 77:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 77:15"/>Kwa mkono wako uli na nguvu kuwagombola wanhu wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:15">ulelo wa Yakobo na Yusufu.<verse eid="PSA 77:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 77:16"/>Mazi gakona gweye Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:16">mazi gakona na kukimbila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:16">hasi mwiibahali kugwaya.<verse eid="PSA 77:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 77:17"/>Mawingu geta mazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:17">ulanga uduma na ng'huwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:17">misale yako imwemwesa kila mwambu.<verse eid="PSA 77:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 77:18"/>Ng'huwa yako ihulikigwa mdibeho da kivulavumbi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:18">lumwesa lwako lumwemwesa isi yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:18">isi yose igwaya na kutigisika.<verse eid="PSA 77:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 77:19"/>Nzila yako ibita mbahali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:19">kubita mmazi mengi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:19">hamoja ngayo zako hazoneke.<verse eid="PSA 77:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 77:20"/>Kuwalongoza wanhu zako kamba bumbila da fugo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:20">kwa mkono wa Musa na Haluni.<verse eid="PSA 77:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 77"/>
  <chapter number="78" style="c" sid="PSA 78"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 78</para>
  <para style="d">(Lwila lwa Asafu.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 78:1"/>Mweye wanhu zangu, hulikeni mafundizo gangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:1">tegelezeni mbuli za mulomo wangu.<verse eid="PSA 78:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 78:2"/>Nogubula mulomo wangu kwa mzungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:2">nolonga ulonzi ufisigwe kulawa umwaka,<verse eid="PSA 78:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 78:3"/>gaja gatuhulike na kugatanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:3">gaja gatulongelwe na iwahenga zetu.<verse eid="PSA 78:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 78:4"/>Hatugafisa kwa wanao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:4">towalongela iwanhu wa ulelo ukwiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:4">sang'hano ng'hulu za Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:4">udahi wake na unzonza yautendile.<verse eid="PSA 78:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 78:5"/>Kalava amuli kwa Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:5">na keka malagizo mwiisi ya Izilaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:5">na kawalagiza iwahenga zetu wawafunze wanao,<verse eid="PSA 78:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 78:6"/>ili iwanhu wa ulelo ukwiza wagajuwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:6">hamoja na iwana onda waleligwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:6">na hewo vivija kwa kipindi chao wawalongele wanao.<verse eid="PSA 78:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 78:7"/>Aho okwika tamanilo jao kwa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:7">na hawaisemwa mbuli zake ng'hulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:7">lakini ogagoga malagizo gake.<verse eid="PSA 78:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 78:8"/>Na sikuwaigale na iwahenga zao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:8">wakalile ulelo wa iwanhu wadulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:8">na walema kutegeleza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:8">wanhu hawatamaniligwa kumwake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:8">awo loho zao hazimgogile Imulungu.<verse eid="PSA 78:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 78:9"/>Kamba iwanhu wa Efulaimu hamoja wagoga upinde,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:9">wakimbila siku da ing'hondo.<verse eid="PSA 78:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 78:10"/>Hawadigogile lagano da Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:10">na walema kukala kwa malagizo gake.<verse eid="PSA 78:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 78:11"/>Waisemwa gaja gayawatendele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:11">unzonza yaulaguse kumwao.<verse eid="PSA 78:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 78:12"/>Katenda unzonza mgameso ga iwahenga zao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:12">ako Soani mwiisi ya Misili.<verse eid="PSA 78:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 78:13"/>Kaigola bahali na kawalongoza mbaka wabita,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:13">kagatenda mazi gema kamba kisugulu.<verse eid="PSA 78:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 78:14"/>Kawalongoza kwa wingu imisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:14">na kwa mulenge kulawa mmoto kilo kigima.<verse eid="PSA 78:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 78:15"/>Katula mibwe kuluwala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:15">kawagwaa mazi mengi kamba bahali,<verse eid="PSA 78:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 78:16"/>katenda mbwibwi kulawa mdibwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:16">kagatenda mazi gakilime kamba lwanda.<verse eid="PSA 78:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 78:17"/>Lakini wagendelela kumtendela nzambi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:17">ako kuluwala wamulema ayo yeli Uchanha Ng'hani.<verse eid="PSA 78:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 78:18"/>Wamgeza Imulungu giladi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:18">walonda ndiya waisulukile wenyego.<verse eid="PSA 78:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 78:19"/>Wamdeta Imulungu, walonga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 78:19">“Vino Imulungu kodaha kutanda meza ya ndiya kuluwala?<verse eid="PSA 78:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 78:20"/>Ona, katowa dibwe na mazi galawa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:20">mbwibwi zilava mazi mengi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:20">Lakini heyo vivija kodaha kutugwaa ndiya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:20">hebu kutugwaa nyama?”<verse eid="PSA 78:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 78:21"/>Mndewa Imulungu viyawahulike kagevuzika ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:21">moto wake ukala kwa ulelo wa Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:21">na ng'hasiliki yake iwakila wanhu wa Izilaeli,<verse eid="PSA 78:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 78:22"/>kwavija hawamtamanile Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:22">na hawatogole kamba yahadahile kuwakombola.<verse eid="PSA 78:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 78:23"/>Avo, kalagiza ulanga uli uchanha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:23">na kavugula milango ya kuulanga,<verse eid="PSA 78:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 78:24"/>kawalagazila mana kamba ndiya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:24">kawagwaa ndiya ya kuulanga.<verse eid="PSA 78:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 78:25"/>Wanhu waja ndiya ya wasenga wa kuulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:25">kawagwaa ndiya kamba vuwadahile kuja.<verse eid="PSA 78:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 78:26"/>Kagala beho da umwambu wa kudilawila zuwa kulawa kuulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:26">na kwa udahi wake kadilongoza beho da mwambu wa kusini.<verse eid="PSA 78:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 78:27"/>Kawalagazila nyama kamba timbwisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:27">ndege oguluka kamba msanga wa mwhani.<verse eid="PSA 78:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 78:28"/>Kawatenda wagwe mng'hambi yao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:28">na wazunguluka vibanda vao vose.<verse eid="PSA 78:28"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 78:29"/>Wanhu waja na kusigasa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:29">kwavija kawagwaa kija kiwasulukile.<verse eid="PSA 78:29"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 78:30"/>Wang'hali hawana mambukiza kuja acho kiwasulukile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:30">ndiya viikalile ing'hali mmulomo,<verse eid="PSA 78:30"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 78:31"/>Imulungu kawagevuzikila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:31">kawakoma awo wakalile na nguvu hagati yao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:31">kawabwanha iwabwanga wa Izilaeli.<verse eid="PSA 78:31"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 78:32"/>Hamoja ago gose galawila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:32">hewo wagendelela kutenda nzambi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:32">na hawatamanile unzonza wake.<verse eid="PSA 78:32"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 78:33"/>Avo kazitenda siku zao zilawanye kamba mhumuzi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:33">na miyaka yao ishila mkudumba.<verse eid="PSA 78:33"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 78:34"/>Viyawakomile wamzahila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:34">waleka gehile gao na wambwelela Imulungu kabili kwa mizoyo yao yose.<verse eid="PSA 78:34"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 78:35"/>Wakumbuka kamba Imulungu kalala dibwe jao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:35">Imulungu yeli Uchanha Ng'hani ayo mkombola wao.<verse eid="PSA 78:35"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 78:36"/>Lakini wamvizila kwa milomo yao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:36">walonga uvizi kwa milimi yao,<verse eid="PSA 78:36"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 78:37"/>mizoyo yao haimgogile heyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:37">na hawatamanilwe mdilagano jake.<verse eid="PSA 78:37"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 78:38"/>Hata ivo heyo kakala na bazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:38">kagela kumgongo gehile gao na hawabanange bule.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:38">Miyanza mingi kaikimila ng'hasiliki yake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:38">na haibwinhile ng'hasiliki yake yose.<verse eid="PSA 78:38"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 78:39"/>Kakumbuka kamba hewo wakala wanhu tu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:39">na kamba beho dibita na kulawanya.<verse eid="PSA 78:39"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 78:40"/>Miyanza mingi wamulema kuluwala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:40">na wamgela usungu kudibawe.<verse eid="PSA 78:40"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 78:41"/>Wamgeza Imulungu kabili na kabili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:41">na wamgevuza ayo Yang'alile wa Izilaeli.<verse eid="PSA 78:41"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 78:42"/>Waisemwa nguvu zake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:42">siku viyawakombole kulawa kwa awo wawehile,<verse eid="PSA 78:42"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 78:43"/>siku ayo viyatendile vilaguso vake ako Misili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:43">na unzonza wake ako Soani.<verse eid="PSA 78:43"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="PSA 78:44"/>Kagalusa vizanda vao viwa damu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:44">kawatenda sikuwadahe kung'wa mazi gao.<verse eid="PSA 78:44"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="PSA 78:45"/>Kawagalila mikonzi iwagaze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:45">na mibula iwanange.<verse eid="PSA 78:45"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="PSA 78:46"/>Kailava ndiya yao inangigwe na mbalangulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:46">na migunda yao inangigwe na nzige.<verse eid="PSA 78:46"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="PSA 78:47"/>Kabananga mizabibu yao kwa mvula ya mabwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:47">na mikuyu yao kwa beho kali.<verse eid="PSA 78:47"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="PSA 78:48"/>Kawatowa ng'ombe wao kwa mvula ya mabwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:48">kaitowa fugo yao kwa ng'huwa.<verse eid="PSA 78:48"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="PSA 78:49"/>Kawakutulila ng'hasiliki yake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:49">na ludoko na magazo na madununzo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:49">kwa bumbila da wasenga wa kuulanga wabananzi.<verse eid="PSA 78:49"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="PSA 78:50"/>Kaitendela nzila ng'hasiliki yake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:50">hawahonyeke na ifa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:50">ila kawakoma kwa mitamu.<verse eid="PSA 78:50"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="PSA 78:51"/>Kawakoboza iwana chaudele wose wa Misili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:51">wana chaudele weli mkibanda cha Hamu.<verse eid="PSA 78:51"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="PSA 78:52"/>Lakini kawalava iwanhu zake kamba fugo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:52">kawalongoza kamba ng'hondolo kubitila kuluwala.<verse eid="PSA 78:52"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="PSA 78:53"/>Kawalongoza goya na hawadumbile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:53">ila bahali iwameza iwanhu owehila.<verse eid="PSA 78:53"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="PSA 78:54"/>Kawagala mbaka kuna imbaka ya isi yake ing'alile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:54">ako kuna iisi ya kuvigongo iyasolile kwa nguvu zake.<verse eid="PSA 78:54"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="PSA 78:55"/>Kawawinga iwanhu wa isi ziyagwe kuulongozi wao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:55">na kaigola isi yao kamba uhazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:55">kageka makabila ga Izilaeli mvibanda vao.<verse eid="PSA 78:55"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="PSA 78:56"/>Lakini hewo wamgeza Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:56">na wamulema ayo yeli Uchanha Ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:56">na hawazigogile amuli zake.<verse eid="PSA 78:56"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="PSA 78:57"/>Wahinduka kuyagwe na hawatamaniligwe kamba iwahenga zao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:57">hawatamaniligwe kamba upinde wenye kasolo.<verse eid="PSA 78:57"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="PSA 78:58"/>Wamgevuza Imulungu kwa kuzenga hanhu ha kutambikila imilungu kuvigongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:58">na wamgela migongo kwa kutenda vinyago.<verse eid="PSA 78:58"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="PSA 78:59"/>Imulungu viyawahulike kagevuzika ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:59">kawalema ng'hani Waizilaeli.<verse eid="PSA 78:59"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="PSA 78:60"/>Kadileka dihema ding'alile dikalile ako Shilo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:60">aho haakalile hagati ya iwanhu.<verse eid="PSA 78:60"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="PSA 78:61"/>Katogola disanduku da lagano disoligwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:61">ukulu wake kaugala mmakono ga awo omwihila.<verse eid="PSA 78:61"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="PSA 78:62"/>Kawaleka iwanhu zake wakomigwe kwa sime,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:62">kawagevuzikila ng'hani iwanhu wa uhazi wake.<verse eid="PSA 78:62"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="PSA 78:63"/>Moto uwasakaza iwabwanga wao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:63">iwandele wao hawembiligwe nyila za zengele.<verse eid="PSA 78:63"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="PSA 78:64"/>Iwalava nhosa wao wakomigwa kwa sime,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:64">na ivizuka hawadahile kulila.<verse eid="PSA 78:64"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="PSA 78:65"/>Abaho Mndewa kalamuka kamba munhu yawasile utulo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:65">kamba munhu yoguta mbuli ya kung'wa ugimbi.<verse eid="PSA 78:65"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="PSA 78:66"/>Kawatowa na kawahuma iwanhu omwihila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:66">na kawagela mkinyala cha milele.<verse eid="PSA 78:66"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="PSA 78:67"/>Abaho kadilema hema da Yusufu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:67">hadisagule kabila da Efulaimu,<verse eid="PSA 78:67"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="PSA 78:68"/>lakini kadisagula kabila da Yuda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:68">lugongo lwa Sayuni, alo kalunogela.<verse eid="PSA 78:68"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="PSA 78:69"/>Kazenga hanhu hake hong'ala kamba ulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:69">kamba isi iyailumbile ikale milele.<verse eid="PSA 78:69"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="PSA 78:70"/>Kamsagula Daudi msang'hanaji wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:70">na kamulava kulawa mmabumba ga ng'hondolo,<verse eid="PSA 78:70"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="PSA 78:71"/>kulawa kususila ng'hondolo kamgala yawe msusilaji wa iwanhu wa Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:71">na Izilaeli wanhu wake.<verse eid="PSA 78:71"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="PSA 78:72"/>Na Daudi kawasusila kwa moyo unogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:72">kwa mikono ya ufundi kawalongoza.<verse eid="PSA 78:72"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 78"/>
  <chapter number="79" style="c" sid="PSA 79"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 79</para>
  <para style="d">(Zabuli ya Asafu.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 79:1"/>Go Imulungu, iwanhu wa isi ziyagwe waivamila isi ya uhazi wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:1">waifitiza ng'anda yako ing'ala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:1">waditenda buga da Yelusalemu diwe vihame.<verse eid="PSA 79:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 79:2"/>Walava mitufi ya iwasang'hanaji wako iwe ndiya ya ndege wa kuulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:2">na ng'huli za iwanhu wako ong'ala kwa ming'onyo ya kumuhulo.<verse eid="PSA 79:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 79:3"/>Weta damu yao kamba mazi kuzunguluka buga jose da Yelusalemu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:3">na haduhu munhu yoyose wa kuwazika.<verse eid="PSA 79:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 79:4"/>Tuwa kinhu cha kinyala kwa iwanhu wa behi yetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:4">iwanhu otuzunguluka otuseka kwa bezi na ugewezi.<verse eid="PSA 79:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 79:5"/>Mbaka lini gweye Mndewa Imulungu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:5">Vino gweye kogevuzika milele?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:5">Wivu wako okwaka kamba moto mbaka lini?<verse eid="PSA 79:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 79:6"/>Ita ng'hasiliki yako kwa iwanhu wa isi hawakutogola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:6">mbuli ya undewa wa awo hawadikema twaga jako,<verse eid="PSA 79:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 79:7"/>na kwavija wawananga wanhu wa ulelo wa Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:7">na kuinanga isi ya ukazi wao.<verse eid="PSA 79:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 79:8"/>Sikuuzikumbuke nzambi za wahenga zetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:8">bazi jako ditwizile hima kwavija togaya ng'hani.<verse eid="PSA 79:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 79:9"/>Imulungu mkombola wetu ututaze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:9">mbuli ya ukulu wa twaga jako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:9">tukombole na uzigele kumgongo nzambi zetu mbuli ya twaga jako.<verse eid="PSA 79:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 79:10"/>Habali iwanhu wa isi ziyagwe walonge,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:10">“Ka kwahi Imulungu wenu?”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:10">Mgameso getu walagusile iwanhu wa isi ziyagwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:10">kamba gweye koliha damu itigwe ya iwasang'hanaji wako.<verse eid="PSA 79:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 79:11"/>Kililo cha usungu cha iwafungwa kivike kuulongozi wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:11">kwa nguvu za mkono wako wakalize waja watagusigwe kufa.<verse eid="PSA 79:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 79:12"/>Wabwezele iwanhu wa behi yetu miyanza saba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:12">mbuli ya maligo gawakuligile gweye Mndewa.<verse eid="PSA 79:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 79:13"/>Siye wanhu wako, ng'hondolo wa hanhu ha kudimila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:13">tokushukulu milele, kulawa ulelo mbaka ulelo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:13">na tolonga ng'hogolwa zako.<verse eid="PSA 79:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 79"/>
  <chapter number="80" style="c" sid="PSA 80"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 80</para>
  <para style="d">(Zabuli ya Asafu. Kwa kilanja, yatumie modeli ya lwila lwa Besa.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 80:1"/>Gweye msusilaji wa Izilaeli tutegeleze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:1">gweye umulongoza Yusufu kamba fugo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:1">gweye ukalaga mkigoda cha ukulu hagati ya viumbe wa kuulanga, umwemwese.<verse eid="PSA 80:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 80:2"/>Kuulongozi wa Efulaimu, Benjamini na Manase.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:2">Inula nguvu zako, wize utukombole.<verse eid="PSA 80:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 80:3"/>Gweye Imulungu utubweze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:3">utumwemwesele kihanga chako, ili tukomboligwe.<verse eid="PSA 80:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 80:4"/>Gweye Mndewa Imulungu uli na nguvu zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:4">mbaka lini ng'hasiliki yako yokwaka na kulava yosi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:4">kwa kupula kwa iwanhu zako?<verse eid="PSA 80:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 80:5"/>Kuwadima gate da mahozi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:5">kuwatenda wang'we mahozi bakuli dimemile.<verse eid="PSA 80:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 80:6"/>Kuwatenda iwanhu wa isi zituzunguluke wagombe mbuli ya isi yetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:6">na iwanhu otwihila otuseka.<verse eid="PSA 80:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 80:7"/>Gweye Imulungu uli na Udahi wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:7">utubweze na tumwemwesele kihanga chako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:7">ili siye tukomboligwe.<verse eid="PSA 80:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 80:8"/>Kugala mzabibu kulawa Misili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:8">kowawinga iwanhu wa isi ziyagwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:8">kuuhanda mwiisi yao.<verse eid="PSA 80:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 80:9"/>Kuuhalilila ili ukule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:9">wota na mizizi yake yenela mwiisi yao yose.<verse eid="PSA 80:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 80:10"/>Vigongo vigubikwa kwa sisila jake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:10">matambi gake gagubika mielezi mikulu.<verse eid="PSA 80:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 80:11"/>Matambi gake genela mbaka mmbahali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:11">nzukila zake mbaka kulwanda.<verse eid="PSA 80:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 80:12"/>Mbona kubomola senyenge zake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:12">ili iwanhu obita behi wabawe zabibu zake?<verse eid="PSA 80:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 80:13"/>Nguluwe luwala ounanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:13">na wanyama wa kubonde odimiligwa mumo.<verse eid="PSA 80:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 80:14"/>Tubwelele gweye Imulungu uli na Udahi wose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:14">Lola hasi kulawa kuulanga wone.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:14">Ukalize mzabibu uno,<verse eid="PSA 80:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 80:15"/>kigongi cha mzabibu chuuhandile kwa mkono wako wa ukudila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:15">mwana yumulelile mbuli yako mwenyego.<verse eid="PSA 80:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 80:16"/>Mzabibu wako ukanhigwa na usomigwa moto,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:16">kwa kuwakomhokela wanhu wako obanangwa.<verse eid="PSA 80:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 80:17"/>Mkono wako ukale kwa munhu yokala mkono wako wa ukudila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:17">mwana wa munhu yumulelile mbuli yako mwenyego.<verse eid="PSA 80:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 80:18"/>Abaho hatukuleka kabili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:18">utubwezele loho zetu na todikema twaga jako.<verse eid="PSA 80:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 80:19"/>Gweye Mndewa Imulungu uli na Udahi wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:19">utubweze na tumwemwesele kihanga chako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:19">ili siye tukomboligwe.<verse eid="PSA 80:19"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 80"/>
  <chapter number="81" style="c" sid="PSA 81"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 81</para>
  <para style="d">(Zabuli ya Asafu. Kwa kilanja, yatumie modeli wa Gititi.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 81:1"/>Mwimbileni kwa deng'ho Imulungu yeli na nguvu zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:1">guteni kwa deng'ho kwa Imulungu wa Yakobo.<verse eid="PSA 81:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 81:2"/>Songeni lwila, toweni ngoma ndodo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:2">toweni bango kwa sauti inogile.<verse eid="PSA 81:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 81:3"/>Toweni mhalati mbalamwezi yahema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:3">na kipindi cha mbalamwezi yahakangala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:3">kipindi cha nyimwilinyimwili yetu.<verse eid="PSA 81:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 81:4"/>Dino lagizo kwa Izilaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:4">na lagizo da Imulungu wa Yakobo.<verse eid="PSA 81:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 81:5"/>Kaditenda diwe amuli kwa iwanhu wa Izilaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:5">viwasegele mwiisi ya Misili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:5">kuko kutuhulike ulonzi hatuutangile.<verse eid="PSA 81:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 81:6"/>“Nisegesa mzigo mmaega gao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:6">makono gao gafunguligwa mkigelo.<verse eid="PSA 81:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 81:7"/>Mmagazo gako kunikema na niye nikukombola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:7">nikwidika mmawingu ga kuduma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:7">nikugeza mmazi ga Meliba.<verse eid="PSA 81:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 81:8"/>Mweye wanhu zangu tegelezeni na niye nowazuma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:8">maza mnitegeleze niye mweye Izilaeli.<verse eid="PSA 81:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 81:9"/>Sikumuwe na imulungu iyagwe hagati yenu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:9">sikumumtambikile imulungu iyagwe.<verse eid="PSA 81:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 81:10"/>Niye ayo Mndewa Imulungu wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:10">nikulavile mwiisi ya Misili.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:10">Yahama mulomo wako na niye nokudima.”<verse eid="PSA 81:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 81:11"/>“Lakini wanhu zangu hawalondile kunihulika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:11">Waizilaeli walema kunitegeleza.<verse eid="PSA 81:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 81:12"/>Avo niwaleka muudulu wa mizoyo yao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:12">wakweleleze nzila zao wenyego.<verse eid="PSA 81:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 81:13"/>Maza wanhu wangu wanitegeleze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:13">maza iwanhu wa Izilaeli wahakweleleze nzila zangu,<verse eid="PSA 81:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 81:14"/>nahawagomese iwanhu owehila himahima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:14">na kuhindula mkono wangu kwa awo owehila.<verse eid="PSA 81:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 81:15"/>Waja omwihila Mndewa Imulungu wahaidulike kumwake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:15">na nhaguso yao yahasigale milele.<verse eid="PSA 81:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 81:16"/>Lakini mweye mwahagweleligwe ngano inogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:16">na kushiba kwa uki ulawa kudibwe.”<verse eid="PSA 81:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 81"/>
  <chapter number="82" style="c" sid="PSA 82"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 82</para>
  <para style="d">(Zabuli ya Asafu.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 82:1"/>Imulungu kolongoza mting'hano mkulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 82:1">hagati ya imulungu iyagwe heyo kotagusa.<verse eid="PSA 82:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 82:2"/>Mbaka lini gweye kogendelela kutagusa bila haki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 82:2">na kulagusa unogelo kwa iwanhu otenda gehile?<verse eid="PSA 82:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 82:3"/>Wagombele iwanhu onyolila na iwana wakiwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 82:3">tenda ganogile kwa iwanhu wakiwa na iwanhu obezigwa.<verse eid="PSA 82:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 82:4"/>Mkombole imunhu yonyolila na yelibule kinhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 82:4">wakombole kulawa mmakono ga iwanhu wehile.<verse eid="PSA 82:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 82:5"/>Hewo hawatanga chochose na hawagelegeza chochose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 82:5">Otembela kuziza.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 82:5">Vandusilo vose va haki mwiisi votigiswa.<verse eid="PSA 82:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 82:6"/>“Niye nilonga, ‘Mweye mwa milungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 82:6">mweye mose mwa wana wa ayo yeli Uchanha Ng'hani.’<verse eid="PSA 82:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 82:7"/>Lakini mofa kamba iwanhu wose viwofa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 82:7">molagala kamba mtawala yoyose iyagwe.”<verse eid="PSA 82:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 82:8"/>Gweye Imulungu, inuka uitaguse isi yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 82:8">kwavija isi yose awo uhazi wako.<verse eid="PSA 82:8"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 82"/>
  <chapter number="83" style="c" sid="PSA 83"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 83</para>
  <para style="d">(Lwila na Zabuli ya Asafu.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 83:1"/>Gweye Imulungu, sikuunyamale tuluu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:1">sikuunyamale gweye Imulungu ututaze.<verse eid="PSA 83:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 83:2"/>Lola iwanhu okudeta ogala ndwagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:2">lola iwanhu okwihila okwinula mapala gao.<verse eid="PSA 83:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 83:3"/>Kwa moyo wihile opanga kutenda gehile kwa iwanhu wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:3">opanga kutenda gehile kwa awo uwanogela.<verse eid="PSA 83:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 83:4"/>Olonga, “Izoni, tuwabanange kamba isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:4">ili twaga da Izilaeli sikudikumbukwe kabili.”<verse eid="PSA 83:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 83:5"/>Kwa nzila imoja ogelegeza gehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:5">oilumba mbuli yako,<verse eid="PSA 83:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 83:6"/>wanhu wa Edomu na Waishimaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:6">Wamoabu na Wahagali,<verse eid="PSA 83:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 83:7"/>wanhu wa Gebali na Amoni na Amaleki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:7">na Ufilisiti, hamoja na iwanhu wa Tilo.<verse eid="PSA 83:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 83:8"/>Vivija Ashulu wailumba na hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:8">kuwagwaa nguvu ulelo wa Lutu.<verse eid="PSA 83:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 83:9"/>Uwatendele kamba vuuwatendele Wamidiani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:9">na kamba vuuwatendele Sisela na Yabini ako kuulwanda lwa Kishoni,<verse eid="PSA 83:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 83:10"/>awo wakomigwe ako Endoli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:10">na wakala kamba zalala mwiisi yose.<verse eid="PSA 83:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 83:11"/>Watende iwakulu wao kamba Olebu na Zeebu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:11">na iwatawala wao kamba Zeba na Zalimuna,<verse eid="PSA 83:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 83:12"/>walongile, “Leka tuhasole hanhu ha kudimila ha Imulungu.”<verse eid="PSA 83:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 83:13"/>Gweye Imulungu wangu wahembeluse,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:13">kamba timbwisi da kivula vumbi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:13">kamba mipepe ihembeluswa na beho.<verse eid="PSA 83:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 83:14"/>Kamba moto ulukuza muhulo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:14">hebu kamba lambi da moto dilukuza kigongo,<verse eid="PSA 83:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 83:15"/>avo wakweleleze kwa beho jako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:15">na uwadumbize kwa ng'humbi yako.<verse eid="PSA 83:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 83:16"/>Gubika vihanga vao kwa kinyala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:16">ili wadizahile twaga jako, gweye Mndewa Imulungu.<verse eid="PSA 83:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 83:17"/>Hewo wagwe kinyala na kuwa na bwembwe milele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:17">hewo na wapotele kwa kinyala.<verse eid="PSA 83:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 83:18"/>Waleke wajuwe kamba gweye wiiyeka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:18">gweye twaga jako Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:18">gweye ayo ukalaga Uchanha Ng'hani ya isi yose.<verse eid="PSA 83:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 83"/>
  <chapter number="84" style="c" sid="PSA 84"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 84</para>
  <para style="d">(Kwa kilanja, yatumie modeli wa Gititi. Zabuli ya wanhu wa ulelo wa Kola.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 84:1"/>Gweye Mndewa Imulungu, uli na nguvu zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:1">ako kuukala kunoga ng'hani.<verse eid="PSA 84:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 84:2"/>Moyo wangu osulukila ng'hani ng'anda ya Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:2">moyo wangu na lukuli lwangu vomwimbila Imulungu yeli mgima.<verse eid="PSA 84:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 84:3"/>Hata nhongwa kazenga mvulu ya kuwasa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:3">kinega kazenga kisanza chake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:3">mumo kageka makinda gake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:3">behi na upango wako wa nhosa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:3">gweye Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:3">Mndewa wangu na Imulungu wangu.<verse eid="PSA 84:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 84:4"/>Wamweda iwanhu okala mng'anda yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:4">okutogola gweye siku zose.<verse eid="PSA 84:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 84:5"/>Wamweda iwanhu wene nguvu zako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:5">na nzila za kuchola Sayuni zammo mmizoyo yao.<verse eid="PSA 84:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 84:6"/>Wahabita kubonde da Baka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:6">oditenda hanhu ha nzasa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:6">vivija mvula za vuli zomemeza masimo.<verse eid="PSA 84:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 84:7"/>Ogendelela kulawa nguvu mbaka nguvu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:7">mbaka kila imoja yovika kuulongozi wa Imulungu ako Sayuni.<verse eid="PSA 84:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 84:8"/>Gweye Mndewa Imulungu uli na nguvu zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:8">tegeleza vinikupula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:8">tegeleza gweye Imulungu wa Yakobo.<verse eid="PSA 84:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 84:9"/>Gweye Imulungu umulole mndewa yeli ngao yetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:9">mulole kwa ganogile imunhu yumsagule.<verse eid="PSA 84:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 84:10"/>Siku dimoja kukala kuuluwa lwako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:10">kunoga kubanza kukala siku elufu imoja hanhu hayagwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:10">vinoga nahakuwile mkalizi wa ng'anda ya Imulungu wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:10">kubanza kukala mmahema ga iwanhu wehile.<verse eid="PSA 84:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 84:11"/>Kwavija gweye Mndewa Imulungu ayo zuwa na ngao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:11">Mndewa Imulungu kolava ganogile na ukulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:11">huwanyima kinhu chochose kinogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:11">iwanhu welibule kitala.<verse eid="PSA 84:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 84:12"/>Gweye Mndewa Imulungu uli na nguvu zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:12">kamweda imunhu yokutamanila gweye.<verse eid="PSA 84:12"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 84"/>
  <chapter number="85" style="c" sid="PSA 85"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 85</para>
  <para style="d">(Kwa kilanja, Zabuli ya wanhu wa ulelo wa Kola.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 85:1"/>Gweye Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 85:1">kulagusa ganogile kwa isi yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 85:1">kumbwezela Yakobo ganogile gake.<verse eid="PSA 85:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 85:2"/>Kugela kumgongo nzambi za wanhu zako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 85:2">kuzilohola nzambi zao zose.<verse eid="PSA 85:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 85:3"/>Kuikimila ng'hasiliki yako yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 85:3">kuleka kugevuzika kwako.<verse eid="PSA 85:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 85:4"/>Utubweze kabili gweye Imulungu mkombola wetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 85:4">usegese ng'hasiliki yako kumwetu.<verse eid="PSA 85:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 85:5"/>Vino, kotugevuzikila milele?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 85:5">Kogendeleza ng'hasiliki yako kwa ulelo wetu wose?<verse eid="PSA 85:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 85:6"/>Vino, hutubweza kabili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 85:6">avo iwanhu wako wakudeng'helele?<verse eid="PSA 85:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 85:7"/>Utulagusile unogelo wako hawishaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 85:7">gweye Mndewa Imulungu utugwelele ukombola wako.<verse eid="PSA 85:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 85:8"/>Notegeleza goyolonga Imulungu yeli Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 85:8">kalagiza tindiwalo jake kwa iwanhu zake wang'alile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 85:8">lakini sikuwabwelele ubozi.<verse eid="PSA 85:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 85:9"/>Ona ukombola wake wa behi na awo omdumba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 85:9">ili ukulu wake usigale mwiisi yetu.<verse eid="PSA 85:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 85:10"/>Unogelo hawishaga na kutamanilwa voiting'hana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 85:10">haki na tindiwalo voilamusa kwa kuinonela.<verse eid="PSA 85:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 85:11"/>Kutamanilwa kozuka kulawa mwiisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 85:11">haki yolola hasi kulawa kuulanga.<verse eid="PSA 85:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 85:12"/>Ona, Mndewa Imulungu, kalava kinhu kinogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 85:12">isi yetu yolela ndiya yake.<verse eid="PSA 85:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 85:13"/>Haki yolongola kuulongozi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 85:13">na kutenda nzila kwa kutausa kwake.<verse eid="PSA 85:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 85"/>
  <chapter number="86" style="c" sid="PSA 86"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 86</para>
  <para style="d">(Kupula kwa Daudi.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 86:1"/>Gweye Mndewa Imulungu tegeleza na widike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:1">kwavija niye na mkiwa na ngaengae.<verse eid="PSA 86:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 86:2"/>Kaliza ugima wangu, kwavija niilava kumwako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:2">gweye ayo Imulungu wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:2">mkombole msang'hanaji wako yokutamanila.<verse eid="PSA 86:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 86:3"/>Gweye Mndewa, unyonele bazi niye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:3">kwavija nokukema imisi yose.<verse eid="PSA 86:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 86:4"/>Mgwelele msang'hanaji wako deng'ho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:4">kwavija kumwako gweye Mndewa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:4">nokwinula loho yangu.<verse eid="PSA 86:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 86:5"/>Gweye Mndewa gweye kunoga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:5">na gweye kogela kumgongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:5">kumema unogelo hawishaga kwa iwanhu wose okukema.<verse eid="PSA 86:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 86:6"/>Gweye Mndewa Imulungu, tegeleza vinikupula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:6">tegeleza kililo changu unyonele bazi.<verse eid="PSA 86:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 86:7"/>Mna gamagazo gangu nokukema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:7">kwavija gweye konidika.<verse eid="PSA 86:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 86:8"/>Gweye Mndewa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:8">hagati ya imilungu haduhu kamba gweye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:8">haduhu yotenda kamba gweye.<verse eid="PSA 86:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 86:9"/>Gweye Mndewa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:9">iwanhu wa isi zose ziulumbile okwiza na okutambikila gweye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:9">oditogola twaga jako.<verse eid="PSA 86:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 86:10"/>Kwavija gweye ayo imkulu na kotenda mbuli za kukanganya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:10">gweye wiiyeka ayo Imulungu.<verse eid="PSA 86:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 86:11"/>Gweye Mndewa Imulungu nifunze nzila zako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:11">na niye nochola mnzila yako ya kweli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:11">nigwelele moyo hauigolile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:11">ili ndahe kudidumba twaga jako.<verse eid="PSA 86:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 86:12"/>Gweye Mndewa, Imulungu wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:12">nokushukulu kwa moyo wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:12">noditogola twaga jako milele.<verse eid="PSA 86:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 86:13"/>Kwavija unogelo wako hawishaga mkulu kumwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:13">kunikombola kulawa kuzimu.<verse eid="PSA 86:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 86:14"/>Imulungu iwanhu oitapaga onivamila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:14">bumbila da iwanhu wasede dozahila ugima wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:14">hawakugelegeza gweye.<verse eid="PSA 86:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 86:15"/>Lakini gweye Mndewa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:15">kwa Imulungu umemile bazi na ng'hekewa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:15">hugevuzika himahima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:15">ila kumema unogelo hawishaga na kutamanilwa.<verse eid="PSA 86:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 86:16"/>Nihindukile na nyonele bazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:16">mgwelele msang'hanaji wako nguvu zako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:16">mkombole mwana wa msang'hanaji wako wa kitwanzi.<verse eid="PSA 86:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 86:17"/>Ngwaa kilaguso cha ganogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:17">ili iwanhu onihila wachone na wagwe kinyala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:17">kwavija gweye Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:17">kunitaza na kunihembekeza.<verse eid="PSA 86:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 86"/>
  <chapter number="87" style="c" sid="PSA 87"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 87</para>
  <para style="d">(Zabuli ya wanhu wa ulelo wa Kola.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 87:1"/>Imulungu kazenga buga jake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 87:1">uchanha ya lugongo lwake lung'ala.<verse eid="PSA 87:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 87:2"/>Mndewa Imulungu kodinogela buga da Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 87:2">kubanza kae yose ya Yakobo.<verse eid="PSA 87:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 87:3"/>Mbuli za ukulu zolongwa kumwako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 87:3">gweye buga da Imulungu.<verse eid="PSA 87:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 87:4"/>“Nokwika kumbukumbu da Lahabu na Babeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 87:4">hagati ya iwanhu onitogola niye.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 87:4">Vivija Filisiti na Tilo hamoja na Kushi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 87:4">na niye nolonga, ‘Ino kaleligwa Sayuni.’ ”<verse eid="PSA 87:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 87:5"/>Mbuli ya Sayuni olonga vino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 87:5">“Ino na ija waleligwa mumo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 87:5">na ayo yeli uchanha ng'hani mwenyego kodigwaa nguvu.”<verse eid="PSA 87:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 87:6"/>Mndewa Imulungu kokwandika matwaga ga iwanhu wa isi zose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 87:6">“Ino kaleligwa Sayuni.”<verse eid="PSA 87:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 87:7"/>Vonda watowe bango okwimba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 87:7">“Nzasa zangu zose za kumwako.”<verse eid="PSA 87:7"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 87"/>
  <chapter number="88" style="c" sid="PSA 88"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 88</para>
  <para style="d">(Lwila na Zabuli ya wanhu wa ulelo wa Kola. Kwa kilanja, yatumie modeli wa Mahalati Leanoti. Zabuli ya Hemani Mwezilahi.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 88:1"/>Gweye Mndewa Imulungu unikombole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:1">nilila kuulongozi wako imisi na ikilo.<verse eid="PSA 88:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 88:2"/>Kupula kwangu kuvike kuulongozi wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:2">uhulike ndilo yangu.<verse eid="PSA 88:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 88:3"/>Kwavija zoyo jangu dimema magazo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:3">ugima wangu wabehi kwisha.<verse eid="PSA 88:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 88:4"/>Nipetwa mna iwao ochola kudisimo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:4">sambi nokala kamba munhu yelibule nguvu.<verse eid="PSA 88:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 88:5"/>Nibagulwa hamoja na iwanhu wadanganike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:5">kamba iwanhu wachinjigwe owasa mmapanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:5">awo hawakumbuka chochose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:5">awo walekigwe na ukalizi wako.<verse eid="PSA 88:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 88:6"/>Kunitupa mdisimo dingile gidigidi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:6">kugati kudiziza totolo.<verse eid="PSA 88:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 88:7"/>Ng'hasiliki yako ibanza kumwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:7">kunizola kwa ng'humbi yako.<verse eid="PSA 88:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 88:8"/>Kunibagula na iwambwiga zangu wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:8">na kunitenda ngevuzo kumwao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:8">kunikimilila na sidaha kutoloka.<verse eid="PSA 88:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 88:9"/>Meso gangu gaziza mbuli ya giogio.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:9">Gweye Mndewa Imulungu nokukema kila siku,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:9">nokwinulila gweye makono gangu.<verse eid="PSA 88:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 88:10"/>Vino kowalagusila iwanhu wadanganike unzonza wako?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:10">Vino mizimu yokwinuka na kukugwaa nhogolwa?<verse eid="PSA 88:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 88:11"/>Vino unogelo wako hawishaga olongigwa ako kudipanga?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:11">Vino wanhu osimulila vuutamanilwa ako kuubananzi?<verse eid="PSA 88:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 88:12"/>Vino unzonza wako ojuwigwa kudiziza?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:12">Vino sang'hano zako za haki zojuwigwa mwiisi ya wasemwigwe?<verse eid="PSA 88:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 88:13"/>Lakini nokulilila gweye Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:13">imitondo kupula kwangu kokuvikila gweye.<verse eid="PSA 88:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 88:14"/>Gweye Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:14">habali konilema na kokifisa kihanga chako?<verse eid="PSA 88:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 88:15"/>Tangu ubwanga wangu nigazwa na nilonda kufa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:15">nogaya kwa bwembwe jako na niye nibwela kuchugu.<verse eid="PSA 88:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 88:16"/>Ng'hasiliki yako ibita uchanha yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:16">bwembwe jako dinibananga.<verse eid="PSA 88:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 88:17"/>Imisi yose vonisuwilila kamba mazi mengi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:17">nizungulukwa wose.<verse eid="PSA 88:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 88:18"/>Kuwasegesa mbwiga zangu na awo niwanogela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:18">ziza digalamuka mbwiga zangu wa behi.<verse eid="PSA 88:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 88"/>
  <chapter number="89" style="c" sid="PSA 89"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 89</para>
  <para style="d">(Zabuli ya Etani Mwezilahi.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 89:1"/>Go Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:1">nokwimba unogelo wako hawishaga milele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:1">kwa mulomo wangu nolonga kutamanilwa kwako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:1">ujuwigwe ulelo wose.<verse eid="PSA 89:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 89:2"/>Nolonga kamba unogelo wako hawishaga okala milele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:2">na kutamanilwa kwako kugangamala kamba ulanga.<verse eid="PSA 89:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 89:3"/>Kulonga, “Nitenda lagano na ija inimsagule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:3">niiduwila kwa msang'hanaji wangu Daudi,<verse eid="PSA 89:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 89:4"/>‘Nowimiza ulelo wako milele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:4">na nougangamiza undewa wako ulelo wose.’”<verse eid="PSA 89:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 89:5"/>Gweye Mndewa Imulungu, ulanga otogola unzonza wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:5">vivija kutamanilwa kwako mumting'hano wa iwanhu ong'ala.<verse eid="PSA 89:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 89:6"/>Kwavija nani uchanha kuulanga yoilinga na Mndewa Imulungu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:6">Nani mna iviumbe va kuulanga yalingile kamba Mndewa Imulungu?<verse eid="PSA 89:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 89:7"/>Kumting'hano wa iwanhu wa Imulungu, Imulungu kodumbigwa ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:7">kodumbigwa kubanza wose omzunguluka.<verse eid="PSA 89:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 89:8"/>Gweye Mndewa Imulungu uli na udahi wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:8">nani kamba gweye?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:8">Gweye Mndewa Imulungu, gweye mwene nguvu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:8">na kutamanilwa kwako kokuzunguluka.<verse eid="PSA 89:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 89:9"/>Gweye kotawala bahali imemile ng'humbi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:9">kipindi ng'humbi yake viinuke gweye koihoza.<verse eid="PSA 89:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 89:10"/>Gweye kudihonda dizoka Lahabu kamba imoja wa iwanhu wachinjigwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:10">kwa mkono wako wenye nguvu kuwapwililisa iwanhu okwihila.<verse eid="PSA 89:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 89:11"/>Ulanga wako gweye na isi vivija yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:11">kwika chandusilo mwiisi hamoja na vose vili mumo.<verse eid="PSA 89:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 89:12"/>Kulumba kasikazini na kusini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:12">Lugongo lwa Taboli na Helimoni vokwimba twaga jako kwa deng'ho.<verse eid="PSA 89:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 89:13"/>Mkono wako umema udahi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:13">mkono wako una nguvu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:13">mkono wako wa ukudila otogoligwa.<verse eid="PSA 89:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 89:14"/>Haki na nhaguso acho chandusilo cha kigoda chako cha undewa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:14">unogelo hawishaga na kutamanilwa vokulongolela.<verse eid="PSA 89:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 89:15"/>Wamweda iwanhu oifunza kukutogola kwa deng'ho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:15">otembela mdilenge da kung'ala kwako, gweye Mndewa Imulungu.<verse eid="PSA 89:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 89:16"/>Odeng'helela twaga jako imisi yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:16">odeng'helela mna ihaki yako.<verse eid="PSA 89:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 89:17"/>Kwavija gweye kwa ukulu na nguvu yao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:17">kwa ganogile gako topata mhumo.<verse eid="PSA 89:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 89:18"/>Go Mndewa Imulungu, mkalizi wetu kalawa kumwako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:18">mndewa wetu kolawa kumwako gweye Ung'alile wa Izilaeli.<verse eid="PSA 89:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 89:19"/>Kulonga mkipindi fulani mzinzozi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:19">kwa iwanhu wako otamanilwa kulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:19">“Nimgwaa nguvu digalu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:19">nimwinula mbwanga hagati ya iwanhu.<verse eid="PSA 89:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 89:20"/>Nimpata Daudi msang'hanaji wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:20">nimgidila mavuta gangu gong'ala.<verse eid="PSA 89:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 89:21"/>Ganza jangu domgogeleza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:21">mkono wangu omgela nguvu.<verse eid="PSA 89:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 89:22"/>Haduhu imunhu yomwihila yonda yamuhume,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:22">haduhu munhu yehile yonda yamonele.<verse eid="PSA 89:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 89:23"/>Nowahonda iwanhu omwihila kuulongozi wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:23">na awo omdeta nowabananga.<verse eid="PSA 89:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 89:24"/>Kutamanilwa kwangu na unogelo wangu hawishaga okala hamoja na heyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:24">kwa twaga jangu kopata mhumo ng'hulu.<verse eid="PSA 89:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 89:25"/>Nougangamiza utawala wake na nguvu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:25">kulawa bahali mbaka lwanda.<verse eid="PSA 89:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 89:26"/>Na heyo konikema, ‘Gweye kwa tatangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:26">Imulungu wangu, dibwe da ukombola wangu.’<verse eid="PSA 89:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 89:27"/>Vivija nomsagula yawe chaudele wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:27">yeli mkulu kubanza iwandewa wose wa mwiisi.<verse eid="PSA 89:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 89:28"/>Nowika unogelo wangu hawishaga kumwake milele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:28">na lagano jangu na heyo dogangamala.<verse eid="PSA 89:28"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 89:29"/>Nowika ulelo wake milele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:29">kigoda chake cha undewa kamba ulanga vuukala milele.<verse eid="PSA 89:29"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 89:30"/>Kamba wanage ogaleka malagizo gangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:30">hawagakweleleza mafundizo gangu,<verse eid="PSA 89:30"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 89:31"/>kamba odilema lagizo jangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:31">na ogasemwa gaja ganiwalongele,<verse eid="PSA 89:31"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 89:32"/>noikoboza nzambi yao kwa fimbo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:32">gehile gao kwa kuwatowa.<verse eid="PSA 89:32"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 89:33"/>Lakini siusegesa unogelo wangu hawishaga kumwake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:33">na sileka kutamanilwa kwangu.<verse eid="PSA 89:33"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 89:34"/>Niye sibena lagano jangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:34">na sihindusa dija dilongigwe na mulomo wangu.<verse eid="PSA 89:34"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 89:35"/>Mwanza umoja na kwa siku zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:35">niiduwila kwa kung'ala kwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:35">na niye simvizila Daudi,<verse eid="PSA 89:35"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 89:36"/>kamba ulelo wake osigala milele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:36">na kigoda chake cha ukulu chosigala kuulongozi wangu kamba zuwa.<verse eid="PSA 89:36"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 89:37"/>Chosigala milele kamba mbalamwezi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:37">msindila yotamanilwa kuulanga.”<verse eid="PSA 89:37"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 89:38"/>Lakini sambi gweye kumulema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:38">kumbezeli na kumgevuzikila ayo yuumgidile mavuta gako.<verse eid="PSA 89:38"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 89:39"/>Kudilema lagano jako na msang'hanaji wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:39">na kuifitiza taji yake kuditimbwisi.<verse eid="PSA 89:39"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 89:40"/>Kubomola ng'huta zake zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:40">na ngome zake zose kuzitenda kamba vihame.<verse eid="PSA 89:40"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 89:41"/>Wanhu obita behi wamboka vinhu vake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:41">kagalamka kilozo kwa iwanhu okala behi na heyo.<verse eid="PSA 89:41"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 89:42"/>Kuwagwaa mhumo iwanhu omwihila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:42">kuwatenda iwanhu omdeta wadeng'helele.<verse eid="PSA 89:42"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 89:43"/>Kuhindusa ukali wa sime jake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:43">na humtazile kung'hondo.<verse eid="PSA 89:43"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="PSA 89:44"/>Kumambukiza kuitapa kwake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:44">na kukibwanha kigoda chake cha undewa.<verse eid="PSA 89:44"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="PSA 89:45"/>Kuzihungula siku za ubwanga wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:45">kumgubika kwa kiwalo cha kinyala.<verse eid="PSA 89:45"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="PSA 89:46"/>Mbaka lini gweye Mndewa Imulungu koifisa milele?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:46">Ng'hasiliki yako yokwaka kamba moto mbaka lini?<verse eid="PSA 89:46"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="PSA 89:47"/>Kumbuka ugima wangu vuubita himahima.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:47">Kwa kinhu gani kuwalumba iwanhu wa mwiisi?<verse eid="PSA 89:47"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="PSA 89:48"/>Nani yokala mgima na hafa bule?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:48">Hebu kodaha kuikombola mwenyego mwiiifa?<verse eid="PSA 89:48"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="PSA 89:49"/>Mndewa Imulungu wa kwahi unogelo wako hawishaga wa aho haichanduso,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:49">kwa kutamanilwa kwako kuiduwila kwa Daudi?<verse eid="PSA 89:49"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="PSA 89:50"/>Mndewa Imulungu kumbuka msang'hanaji wako viyolongigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:50">lola vinigela kumgongo kubezeli kwa iwanhu wa isi yose.<verse eid="PSA 89:50"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="PSA 89:51"/>Wanhu wanideta na kunyonela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:51">gweye Mndewa Imulungu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:51">Wanilonga kila kinhu kinhenda niye yuunigidile mavuta gako.<verse eid="PSA 89:51"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="PSA 89:52"/>Mndewa Imulungu yatogolwe, milele.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:52">Ona na Ona.<verse eid="PSA 89:52"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 89"/>
  <chapter number="90" style="c" sid="PSA 90"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 90</para>
  <para style="d">(Kupula kwa Musa, munhu wa Imulungu.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 90:1"/>Go Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:1">gweye kwa kae yetu muulelo wose.<verse eid="PSA 90:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 90:2"/>Vigongo ving'hali havinakoneka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:2">na gweye ung'hali hunalumba isi yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:2">gweye kwa Imulungu kulawa milele mbaka milele.<verse eid="PSA 90:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 90:3"/>Kowabweza iwanhu kuditimbwisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:3">gweye kolonga, “Bweleni kuditimbwisi, mweye iwanhu.”<verse eid="PSA 90:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 90:4"/>Kwavija kumwako miyaka elufu kamba siku imoja ibitile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:4">hebu kamba kuwasilila kilo kimoja.<verse eid="PSA 90:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 90:5"/>Kowasegesa iwanhu muutulo wa ifa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:5">na hewo kamba mijani mibisi ya imitondo.<verse eid="PSA 90:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 90:6"/>Hamoja imitondo yozuka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:6">ichungulo yoholola na kunyala.<verse eid="PSA 90:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 90:7"/>Tubanangwa kwa ng'hasiliki yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:7">na ukali wako otudumbiza.<verse eid="PSA 90:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 90:8"/>Kugeka gehile getu kuulongozi wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:8">nzambi zetu za kinyelegezi zokoneka mumng'alo wako.<verse eid="PSA 90:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 90:9"/>Tukala siku zetu zose hasi ya ng'hasiliki yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:9">twishiliza miyaka yetu kamba mhumuzi.<verse eid="PSA 90:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 90:10"/>Siku zetu za kukala miyaka malongo saba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:10">kamba tuna nguvu tokala miyaka malongo nane,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:10">lakini miyaka yose imema magazo na madununzo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:10">na yobita himahima na siye tolawanya.<verse eid="PSA 90:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 90:11"/>Nani yojuwa nguvu ya ng'hasiliki yako?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:11">Kwihilwa kwako kamba vitulondigwa kukudumba gweye.<verse eid="PSA 90:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 90:12"/>Tufunze kuzipeta siku zetu vinogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:12">ili tupate ubala.<verse eid="PSA 90:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 90:13"/>Gweye Mndewa Imulungu, uwe na bazi!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:13">Kokawa mbaka lini?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:13">Tonele bazi wasang'hanaji wako.<verse eid="PSA 90:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 90:14"/>Imitondo unishibishe unogelo wako hawishaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:14">ili twimbe kwa deng'ho na tudeng'helele siku zose.<verse eid="PSA 90:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 90:15"/>Utudeng'heze kamba zisiku vuutukoboze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:15">kamba miyaka itugazigwe.<verse eid="PSA 90:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 90:16"/>Sang'hano zako zoneke kwa wasang'hanaji wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:16">ukulu wako kwa wanao.<verse eid="PSA 90:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 90:17"/>Utonele bazi gweye Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:17">uzimize sang'hano za makono getu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:17">ona uzimize sang'hano za makono getu.<verse eid="PSA 90:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 90"/>
  <chapter number="91" style="c" sid="PSA 91"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 91</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 91:1"/>Heyo yokala hana uukalizi wa ayo yeli Uchanha Ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:1">yokala kudisisila da ayo yeli na udahi wose.<verse eid="PSA 91:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 91:2"/>Nomulongela Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:2">“Gweye ayo kimbililo jangu na ngome yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:2">Imulungu wangu, nikutamanila.”<verse eid="PSA 91:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 91:3"/>Heyo kokukombola na mtego wa imunhu yosaka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:3">na utamu wa kulokeza ukomaga iwanhu.<verse eid="PSA 91:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 91:4"/>Kokugubika kwa mitipilo yake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:4">hasi ya mabawa gake kopata kimbililo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:4">kutamanilwa kwake kokuwa kamba ngao na zindiko.<verse eid="PSA 91:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 91:5"/>Sikuudumbe vinhu vidumbiza va ikilo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:5">hebu msale ubitaga imisi,<verse eid="PSA 91:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 91:6"/>hebu utamu wa kulokeza uwasepaga iwanhu kudiziza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:6">na utamu ukomaga imisi.<verse eid="PSA 91:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 91:7"/>Kamba iwanhu elufu olagala behi yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:7">iwanhu elufu kumi mwambu wako wa ukudila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:7">lakini gehile hagakukwesela gweye.<verse eid="PSA 91:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 91:8"/>Kolola kwa meso gako mwenyego,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:8">na kokona iwanhu wehile viwokobozwa.<verse eid="PSA 91:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 91:9"/>Kwavija gweye kumtenda Mndewa Imulungu kimbililo jako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:9">na ayo yeli Uchanha Ng'hani kumtenda ukazi wako.<verse eid="PSA 91:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 91:10"/>Avo haduhu gehile gonda gakupate gweye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:10">na mikubulo honda idikwesele hema jako.<verse eid="PSA 91:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 91:11"/>Kwavija Imulungu kowalagiza wasenga zake mbuli yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:11">wakukalize mnzila yako.<verse eid="PSA 91:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 91:12"/>Mmakono gao okugoga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:12">ili sikuuikwale mgulu wako mdibwe.<verse eid="PSA 91:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 91:13"/>Kowakanyaga simba na zoka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:13">mwana simba na nyoka kowahonda kwa magulu.<verse eid="PSA 91:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 91:14"/>Mndewa Imulungu, kolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:14">“Nomkombola ayo yoninogela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:14">nomkaliza kwavija kodijuwa twaga jangu.<verse eid="PSA 91:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 91:15"/>Yahanikema nomwidika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:15">nokuwa hamoja na heyo mmagazo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:15">nomkombola na nomgwaa ukulu.<verse eid="PSA 91:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 91:16"/>Nomgwaa nhunza ya kukala mgima siku nyingi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:16">na nomulagusila ukombola wangu.”<verse eid="PSA 91:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 91"/>
  <chapter number="92" style="c" sid="PSA 92"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 92</para>
  <para style="d">(Zabuli ya siku ya kubwihila.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 92:1"/>Vinoga kumshukulu Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:1">na kudimbila nhogolwa twaga jako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:1">gweye ukalaga Uchanha Ng'hani,<verse eid="PSA 92:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 92:2"/>kuulonga unogelo wako hawishaga imitondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:2">kutamanilwa kwako kipindi cha ikilo,<verse eid="PSA 92:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 92:3"/>kwa kilimba kili na nzabi longo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:3">na kwa sauti ya bango.<verse eid="PSA 92:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 92:4"/>Go Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:4">nogezwa na sang'hano zako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:4">nokwimba kwa deng'ho mbuli ya sang'hano zako.<verse eid="PSA 92:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 92:5"/>Go Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:5">lola vizili ng'hulu sang'hano zako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:5">lola vigeli mazito magesa gako.<verse eid="PSA 92:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 92:6"/>Zozolo hadaha kujuwa kinhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:6">mbozi hadaha kujuwa gano,<verse eid="PSA 92:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 92:7"/>kamba iwanhu wehile odaha kuzuka kamba mijani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:7">wose otenda gehile odaha kugendelela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:7">lakini kimambukizo chao obanangigwa milele.<verse eid="PSA 92:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 92:8"/>Lakini gweye Mndewa Imulungu kwa uchanha milele.<verse eid="PSA 92:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 92:9"/>Gweye Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:9">wanhu okwihila obanangwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:9">wose otenda gehile opwililika.<verse eid="PSA 92:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 92:10"/>Gweye kunisagula kwa kunigidila mavuta ganogile uchanha yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:10">kunigwaa nguvu kamba za ng'ombe poli.<verse eid="PSA 92:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 92:11"/>Meso gangu gawona iwanhu onihila walemelwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:11">magwiti gangu gahulika kubanangwa kwa iwanhu otenda gehile kumwangu.<verse eid="PSA 92:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 92:12"/>Wene haki omweda kamba mtende,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:12">okula kamba mwelezi wa Lebanoni.<verse eid="PSA 92:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 92:13"/>Okuwa kamba mibiki ihandigwe mng'anda ya Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:13">omweda kuing'hambi ya Imulungu wetu.<verse eid="PSA 92:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 92:14"/>Muuvele okuwa wang'hali olela matunda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:14">okuwa wabisi kuno wamema nguvu,<verse eid="PSA 92:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 92:15"/>olonga, “Mndewa Imulungu katelela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:15">heyo ayo dibwe jangu, mmwake mduhu gehile.”<verse eid="PSA 92:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 92"/>
  <chapter number="93" style="c" sid="PSA 93"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 93</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 93:1"/>Mndewa Imulungu kotawala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 93:1">kavala ukulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 93:1">Mndewa Imulungu kavala ukulu na nguvu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 93:1">Isi yose kaika goya, na haitigiswa ng'o.<verse eid="PSA 93:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 93:2"/>Kigoda chako cha ukulu kikala goya tangu umwaka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 93:2">gweye kukala kuko tangu umwaka yose.<verse eid="PSA 93:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 93:3"/>Go Mndewa Imulungu, bahali ilava sauti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 93:3">bahali ibuma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 93:3">bahali ilava sauti ya ng'humbi yake.<verse eid="PSA 93:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 93:4"/>Heyo mkulu kubanza mazi mengi vigobuma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 93:4">heyo mkulu kubanza ng'humbi ya bahali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 93:4">Mndewa Imulungu yokala uchanha ng'hani ayo mkulu.<verse eid="PSA 93:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 93:5"/>Go Mndewa Imulungu, amuli zako zotamanilwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 93:5">kung'ala kwako kogela ulembo mng'anda yako milele.<verse eid="PSA 93:5"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 93"/>
  <chapter number="94" style="c" sid="PSA 94"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 94</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 94:1"/>Go Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:1">Imulungu uwabwezelaga iwanhu gehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:1">gweye Imulungu uwabwezelaga iwanhu gehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:1">umwemwese sambi.<verse eid="PSA 94:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 94:2"/>Inuka gweye uwatagusaga iwanhu wa isi yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:2">uwabwezele gaja golondigwa iwanhu wamemile bezi.<verse eid="PSA 94:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 94:3"/>Mbaka lini iwanhu otenda gehile odeng'helela?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:3">Go Mndewa Imulungu, mbaka lini?<verse eid="PSA 94:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 94:4"/>Ogida mbuli za bezi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:4">wose otenda gehile wamema kuitapa.<verse eid="PSA 94:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 94:5"/>Go Mndewa Imulungu, lola owahonda wanhu zako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:5">owadununza uhazi wako.<verse eid="PSA 94:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 94:6"/>Omkoma mgane na munhu baki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:6">owachinja wana wakiwa.<verse eid="PSA 94:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 94:7"/>Na hewo olonga, “Mndewa Imulungu halola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:7">Imulungu wa Yakobo hajuwa bule.”<verse eid="PSA 94:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 94:8"/>Tegelezeni mweye iwabozi hagati ha iwanhu zangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:8">mweye wabozi lini mokuwa na nzewele?<verse eid="PSA 94:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 94:9"/>Vino ayo yekile gwiti sikuyahulike?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:9">Ayo yalumbile siso sikuyalole?<verse eid="PSA 94:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 94:10"/>Ayo yowazuma iwanhu wa isi yose sikuyakoboze?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:10">Ayo yowafunza iwanhu sikuyajuwe?<verse eid="PSA 94:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 94:11"/>Mndewa Imulungu kogajuwa magesa ga iwanhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:11">kojuwa kamba hagafaya.<verse eid="PSA 94:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 94:12"/>Go Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:12">kamweda imunhu yozumwa na gweye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:12">imunhu yofunzwa kwa malagizo gako.<verse eid="PSA 94:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 94:13"/>Komtenda yabwihile siku za magazo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:13">mbaka simo vonda dihimbigwe mbuli ya iwanhu wehile.<verse eid="PSA 94:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 94:14"/>Kwavija Mndewa Imulungu hawalema wanhu zake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:14">hauleka uhazi wake.<verse eid="PSA 94:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 94:15"/>Nhaguso yokwima kabili kuna ihaki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:15">wose wene mizoyo igoloke oikweleleza.<verse eid="PSA 94:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 94:16"/>Nani yonda yanigombele niye mbuli ya iwanhu wehile?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:16">Nani yonda yanitaze mbuli ya iwanhu wehile?<verse eid="PSA 94:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 94:17"/>Maza Mndewa Imulungu sambi yanitaze himahima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:17">nahakalile tuluu mwiifa.<verse eid="PSA 94:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 94:18"/>Vinongile, “Mgulu wangu otelebuka.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:18">Go Mndewa Imulungu, unogelo wako hawishaga unigoga.<verse eid="PSA 94:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 94:19"/>Ving'halile nogwaya mmoyo wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:19">tamanilo jako dinigwaa deng'ho mmoyo wangu.<verse eid="PSA 94:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 94:20"/>Gweye hudaha kuilumba na watawala olema haki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:20">otunga malagizo ga kugombela gehile.<verse eid="PSA 94:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 94:21"/>Oilumba kuwavamila wene haki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:21">kuwatagusa ifa iwanhu hawatendile gehile.<verse eid="PSA 94:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 94:22"/>Lakini Mndewa Imulungu kawa ngome yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:22">Imulungu wangu kawa dibwe da kuifisila.<verse eid="PSA 94:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 94:23"/>Heyo kowaliha kwa nzambi zao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:23">na kowabananga kwa gehile gao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:23">Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wetu kowabananga.<verse eid="PSA 94:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 94"/>
  <chapter number="95" style="c" sid="PSA 95"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 95</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 95:1"/>Izoni tumwimbile Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 95:1">tumdeng'helele dibwe wa ukombola wetu.<verse eid="PSA 95:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 95:2"/>Tuchole kuulongozi wake kwa nhogolwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 95:2">tumdeng'helele kwa nyila.<verse eid="PSA 95:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 95:3"/>Kwavija Mndewa Imulungu ayo Imulungu mkulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 95:3">na heyo ayo Mndewa mkulu kwa imilungu yose.<verse eid="PSA 95:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 95:4"/>Mmakono gake kagagoga mabonde ga isi yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 95:4">hata kunhembeti ya vigongo vake heyo.<verse eid="PSA 95:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 95:5"/>Bahali yake heyo, heyo kailumba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 95:5">na makono gake galumba isi inyalile.<verse eid="PSA 95:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 95:6"/>Izoni tumtambikile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 95:6">tumfugamile Mndewa Imulungu yatulumbile.<verse eid="PSA 95:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 95:7"/>Kwavija heyo ayo Imulungu wetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 95:7">na siye twa wanhu zake na ng'hondolo wake yotulola goya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 95:7">Vinoga lelo mwahategeleze sauti yake.<verse eid="PSA 95:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 95:8"/>Sikumuitende mizoyo yenu midala kamba vimutendile ako Meliba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 95:8">na kamba vimutendile ako Masa kuluwala.<verse eid="PSA 95:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 95:9"/>Kuko iwahenga zenu wanigeza na wanipima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 95:9">hamoja wazona sang'hano zangu.<verse eid="PSA 95:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 95:10"/>Miyaka malongo mane nyona usungu kwa ulelo awo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 95:10">nilonga, “Wanhu wano mizoyo yao ipotela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 95:10">hawazitangile bule nzila zangu.”<verse eid="PSA 95:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 95:11"/>Avo, niiduwila kwa ng'hasiliki yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 95:11">“Hawengila ng'o hanhu hangu ha kubwihila.”<verse eid="PSA 95:11"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 95"/>
  <chapter number="96" style="c" sid="PSA 96"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 96</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 96:1"/>Mwimbileni Mndewa Imulungu lwila lwa sambi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:1">Mwimbileni Mndewa Imulungu mweye iwanhu wa isi zose.<verse eid="PSA 96:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 96:2"/>Mwimbileni Mndewa Imulungu, ditogoleni twaga jake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:2">longeni ukombola wake kila siku.<verse eid="PSA 96:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 96:3"/>Ulongeni ukulu wake hagati ha wanhu wa isi zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:3">na sang'hano zake za unzonza kwa wanhu wa isi zose.<verse eid="PSA 96:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 96:4"/>Kwavija Mndewa Imulungu ayo imkulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:4">yofaya kutogoligwa kubanza wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:4">heyo wa kudumbigwa kubanza imilungu yose.<verse eid="PSA 96:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 96:5"/>Kwavija imilungu yose ya iwanhu wa isi ziyagwe ayo minyago,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:5">lakini Mndewa Imulungu ayo yalumbile ulanga.<verse eid="PSA 96:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 96:6"/>Ukulu na kung'ala vimzunguluka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:6">nguvu na unovu va hanhu hake hong'ala.<verse eid="PSA 96:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 96:7"/>Mgweleleni nhogolwa Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:7">mweye ng'holo zose za mwiisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:7">mgweleleni Mndewa Imulungu ukulu na nguvu.<verse eid="PSA 96:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 96:8"/>Mgweleleni Mndewa Imulungu ukulu ufaya kwa twaga jake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:8">galeni sadaka na mwingile kuuluwa lwake.<verse eid="PSA 96:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 96:9"/>Mtambikileni Mndewa Imulungu mna ukunoga kwa hanhu hake hong'ala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:9">gwayeni kuulongozi wake mweye iwanhu wa isi yose.<verse eid="PSA 96:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 96:10"/>Longeni mwiisi yose, “Mndewa Imulungu kotawala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:10">ona isi yose igogwa sikuitigisigwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:10">kowatagusa iwanhu kamba viilondigwa!”<verse eid="PSA 96:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 96:11"/>Ulanga udeng'helele na isi ideng'helele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:11">bahali ibume na vose vili mgati yake.<verse eid="PSA 96:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 96:12"/>Migunda ideng'helele na vinhu vose vili mgati yake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:12">abaho mibiki yose ya kumuhulo imbe kwa deng'ho,<verse eid="PSA 96:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 96:13"/>kuulongozi wa Mndewa Imulungu yokwiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:13">ona heyo kokwiza yaitaguse isi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:13">Koitagusa isi yose kamba viilondigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:13">na iwanhu wose kwa kweli yake.<verse eid="PSA 96:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 96"/>
  <chapter number="97" style="c" sid="PSA 97"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 97</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 97:1"/>Mndewa Imulungu kotawala na isi ideng'helele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:1">visiwa videng'helele.<verse eid="PSA 97:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 97:2"/>Mawingu na ziza vomzunguluka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:2">haki na kutagusa avo chanduso cha kigoda chake.<verse eid="PSA 97:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 97:3"/>Moto olongola kuulongozi wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:3">na owasakaza iwanhu omdeta kila mwambu.<verse eid="PSA 97:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 97:4"/>Lumwesa lwake lomwemwesa isi yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:4">isi ilola na igwaya kwa bwembwe.<verse eid="PSA 97:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 97:5"/>Vigongo vilumbuka kamba uhota kuulongozi wa Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:5">kuulongozi wa Mndewa wa isi yose.<verse eid="PSA 97:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 97:6"/>Ulanga olonga haki yake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:6">na wanhu wose wawona ukulu wake.<verse eid="PSA 97:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 97:7"/>Wakone kinyala wose otambikila vinyago,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:7">awo oitapa kwa vinhu havifaya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:7">mweye imilungu yose mfugamileni Mndewa Imulungu.<verse eid="PSA 97:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 97:8"/>Sayuni ihulika na kudeng'helela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:8">mabuga ga Yuda gasekelela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:8">kwa nhaguso zako gweye Mndewa Imulungu.<verse eid="PSA 97:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 97:9"/>Kwavija gweye Mndewa Imulungu ayo ukala uchanha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:9">uchanha ng'hani kubanza isi yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:9">gweye kwa mkulu ng'hani kubanza imilungu yose.<verse eid="PSA 97:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 97:10"/>Mweye mumnogela Mndewa Imulungu, galemeni gehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:10">heyo kozikaliza loho za wanhu zake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:10">na kowakombola kulawa mmakono ga iwanhu wehile.<verse eid="PSA 97:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 97:11"/>Mulenge umwizila mwene haki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:11">na deng'ho dimwizila munhu mwene moyo unogile.<verse eid="PSA 97:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 97:12"/>Mweye wene haki mdeng'heleleni Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:12">na mditogole twaga jake ding'ala.<verse eid="PSA 97:12"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 97"/>
  <chapter number="98" style="c" sid="PSA 98"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 98</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 98:1"/>Mwimbileni Mndewa Imulungu lwila lwa sambi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 98:1">kwavija katenda sang'hano za unzonza.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 98:1">Mkono wake ung'ala umgalila mhumo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 98:1">mkono wake mwenyego wene nguvu.<verse eid="PSA 98:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 98:2"/>Mndewa Imulungu kaugubula ukombola wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 98:2">mgameso ga iwanhu wa isi zose kaigubula haki yake.<verse eid="PSA 98:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 98:3"/>Kaukumbuka unogelo wake hawishaga na kutamanilwa kwake kwa ng'anda ya Izilaeli.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 98:3">Kose kuihelela isi wawona ukombola wa Imulungu wetu.<verse eid="PSA 98:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 98:4"/>Isi yose imdeng'helele Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 98:4">inuleni sauti imbeni kwa deng'ho, imbeni lwila.<verse eid="PSA 98:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 98:5"/>Mtambikileni Mndewa Imulungu lwila kwa bango,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 98:5">imbeni kwa bango na kwa sauti ya lwila.<verse eid="PSA 98:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 98:6"/>Kwa mhalati na ng'ombe sugu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 98:6">Deng'heleleni kuulongozi wa Mndewa Imulungu yeli Mndewa.<verse eid="PSA 98:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 98:7"/>Bahali ibume na vose vikalaga mumo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 98:7">isi yose na awo okala mgati yake.<verse eid="PSA 98:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 98:8"/>Vizanda vitowe makofi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 98:8">vigongo vimbe hamoja kwa deng'ho,<verse eid="PSA 98:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 98:9"/>kuulongozi wa Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 98:9">yokwiza yaitaguse isi yose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 98:9">Koitagusa isi yose kwa haki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 98:9">na iwanhu wose wa mwiisi kamba viilondigwa.<verse eid="PSA 98:9"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 98"/>
  <chapter number="99" style="c" sid="PSA 99"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 99</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 99:1"/>Mndewa Imulungu kotawala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:1">wanhu wa isi zose wagwaye.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:1">Kakala mkigoda cha undewa hagati ya viumbe weli na mabawa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:1">isi itigisike.<verse eid="PSA 99:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 99:2"/>Mndewa Imulungu mkulu ako Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:2">na heyo kauchanha ya iwanhu wa isi yose.<verse eid="PSA 99:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 99:3"/>Wanhu waditogole twaga jake kulu da kudumbiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:3">heyo ayo yong'ala.<verse eid="PSA 99:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 99:4"/>Mndewa kana nguvu na koinogela haki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:4">gweye ayo uitawala haki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:4">kugala nhaguso na haki kwa Izilaeli.<verse eid="PSA 99:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 99:5"/>Mtogoleni Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:5">fugameni hana ikigoda cha magulu gake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:5">heyo ayo yong'ala.<verse eid="PSA 99:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 99:6"/>Musa na Haluni wa hagati ya iwalava nhosa wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:6">na Samweli mna iwao odikema twaga jake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:6">viwamkemile Mndewa Imulungu kawedika.<verse eid="PSA 99:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 99:7"/>Mmhanda ya wingu kakala kolonga na hewo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:7">Wazigoga amuli zake na lagizo diyawagwelele.<verse eid="PSA 99:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 99:8"/>Gweye Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:8">gweye ayo uwedike Waizilaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:8">kumwao kukala Imulungu ugela kumgongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:8">hamoja kugatagusa gehile gao.<verse eid="PSA 99:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 99:9"/>Mtogoleni Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:9">fugameni kulozela kulugongo lwake lung'ala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:9">kwavija Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wetu kong'ala.<verse eid="PSA 99:9"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 99"/>
  <chapter number="100" style="c" sid="PSA 100"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 100</para>
  <para style="d">(Zabuli ya kushukulu.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 100:1"/>Mdeng'heleleni Mndewa Imulungu kwa deng'ho, gweye isi yose.<verse eid="PSA 100:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 100:2"/>Mtambikileni Mndewa Imulungu kwa deng'ho.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 100:2">Izoni kuulongozi wake kuno mokwimba kwa deng'ho.<verse eid="PSA 100:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 100:3"/>Mujuwe kamba Mndewa Imulungu ayo Imulungu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 100:3">Heyo ayo yatulumbile na siye twa wanhu zake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 100:3">twa wanhu zake na ng'hondolo wake odimigwa.<verse eid="PSA 100:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 100:4"/>Ingileni mmilango yake kwa kushukulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 100:4">kuuluwa lwake kwa kumtogola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 100:4">mtogoleni na mdigwelele nhogolwa twaga jake.<verse eid="PSA 100:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 100:5"/>Kwavija Mndewa Imulungu ayo yanogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 100:5">unogelo wake hawishaga okala milele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 100:5">na kutamanilwa kwake ulelo mbaka ulelo.<verse eid="PSA 100:5"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 100"/>
  <chapter number="101" style="c" sid="PSA 101"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 101</para>
  <para style="d">(Zabuli ya Daudi.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 101:1"/>Nokwimba unogelo wako hawishaga na haki yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 101:1">gweye Mndewa Imulungu nokwimbila lwila lwa nhogolwa.<verse eid="PSA 101:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 101:2"/>Noigoga nzila igoloke.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 101:2">Kokwiza lini kumwangu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 101:2">Niye nosang'hana kwa moyo unogile mng'anda yangu.<verse eid="PSA 101:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 101:3"/>Sikwika mgameso gangu mbuli ya gehile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 101:3">Sang'hano ya awo otenda gehile noihila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 101:3">na niye siilumba na hewo bule.<verse eid="PSA 101:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 101:4"/>Moyo wa udulu usegele kumwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 101:4">noinega na kila kinhu kihile.<verse eid="PSA 101:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 101:5"/>Munhu yomdeta miyage niye nomsegesa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 101:5">simuleka imunhu yoitapa na mwene kibuli.<verse eid="PSA 101:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 101:6"/>Nowalola kwa ganogile iwanhu otamanilwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 101:6">ili wakale hamoja na niye.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 101:6">Wanhu weli na mizoyo inogile awo onda wanisang'hanile.<verse eid="PSA 101:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 101:7"/>Chakubimbi hakala bule mng'anda yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 101:7">Imunhu yolonga uvizi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 101:7">honda yeme kuulongozi wa meso gangu.<verse eid="PSA 101:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 101:8"/>Imitondo mbaka imitondo nowabananga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 101:8">wanhu wose wehile mwiisi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 101:8">Nowatenda wainege wose otenda gehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 101:8">okala kutali na buga da Mndewa Imulungu.<verse eid="PSA 101:8"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 101"/>
  <chapter number="102" style="c" sid="PSA 102"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 102</para>
  <para style="d">(Kupula kwa munhu yeli mmagazo na yomulongela Mndewa Imulungu ago gomgaza.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 102:1"/>Gweye Mndewa Imulungu, uhulike vinikupula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:1">kililo changu kikuvikile.<verse eid="PSA 102:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 102:2"/>Sikuufise kihanga chako siku ya magazo gangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:2">utege gwiti jako unihulike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:2">siku nahakukema unidike himahima.<verse eid="PSA 102:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 102:3"/>Kwavija siku zangu zolawanya kamba yosi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:3">na mizege yangu yolukula kamba biwi.<verse eid="PSA 102:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 102:4"/>Moyo wangu utowigwa kamba mijani na kunyala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:4">ona noisemwa kuja ndiya yangu.<verse eid="PSA 102:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 102:5"/>Mbuli ya kuiyalala kwa magazo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:5">mizege yangu iilumba na nyama yangu.<verse eid="PSA 102:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 102:6"/>Nilinga kamba bundi yokala kuluwala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:6">na niigala na bundi yokala kuvihame.<verse eid="PSA 102:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 102:7"/>Nokala meso kamba kinega,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:7">yokala yaiyeka uchanha ya ng'anda.<verse eid="PSA 102:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 102:8"/>Iwanhu onihila onilonga imisi yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:8">awo oiduwila akuno onitambula niye.<verse eid="PSA 102:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 102:9"/>Noiyalala ng'hani na tozi diwa kamba ndiya yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:9">na king'waji changu nikihanganya na mahozi,<verse eid="PSA 102:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 102:10"/>mbuli ya ng'hasiliki yako na kugevuzika kwako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:10">na kwavija kuninula na kunitupa kutali.<verse eid="PSA 102:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 102:11"/>Siku zangu kamba sisila da ichungulo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:11">ona nonyala kamba mijani.<verse eid="PSA 102:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 102:12"/>Lakini gweye Mndewa Imulungu kokala na kutawala milele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:12">na twaga jako dokumbukigwa ulelo mbaka ulelo.<verse eid="PSA 102:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 102:13"/>Gweye mwenyego kokwima na kojonela bazi buga da Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:13">kwavija ayo saa ya kujonela bazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:13">kipindi kikigwe kivika,<verse eid="PSA 102:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 102:14"/>kwavija wasang'hanaji wako oganogela mabwe gake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:14">na wajonela bazi timbwisi jake.<verse eid="PSA 102:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 102:15"/>Abaho iwanhu wa isi zose odidumba twaga da Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:15">na wandewa wose wa mwiisi odumba ukulu wake.<verse eid="PSA 102:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 102:16"/>Mndewa Imulungu vonda yadizenge Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:16">vonda yoneke muukulu wake,<verse eid="PSA 102:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 102:17"/>vonda yalole ukupula kwa iwanhu wakiwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:17">hakubezeli kupula kwao.<verse eid="PSA 102:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 102:18"/>Ulelo onda wize okwandikilwa gago,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:18">wanhu onda walumbigwe omtogola Mndewa Imulungu.<verse eid="PSA 102:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 102:19"/>Kwavija kalola kulawa hanhu hake hong'ala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:19">kulawa kuulanga Mndewa Imulungu kailola isi,<verse eid="PSA 102:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 102:20"/>ili yahulike kililo cha ayo yafungigwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:20">na yawafungulile watagusigwe ifa.<verse eid="PSA 102:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 102:21"/>Wanhu wadilonge twaga da Mndewa Imulungu ako Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:21">nhogolwa zake zolongwa ako Yelusalemu,<verse eid="PSA 102:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 102:22"/>wanhu wa isi ziyagwe na wandewa wahaiting'hana hamoja,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:22">ili wamtambikile Mndewa Imulungu.<verse eid="PSA 102:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 102:23"/>Imulungu kazihungula nguvu zangu mnzila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:23">kazihungula siku zangu za ugima.<verse eid="PSA 102:23"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 102:24"/>Avo nilonga, “Go Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:24">sikuunisegese hagati ha siku zangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:24">gweye Mndewa miyaka yako yogendelela ulelo wose.<verse eid="PSA 102:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 102:25"/>Aho haichanduso kusimika mhanda za isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:25">na ulanga sang'hano ya makono gako.<verse eid="PSA 102:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 102:26"/>Avo vosegela lakini gweye kosigala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:26">vose volala kamba viwalo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:26">na kamba viwalo kovisaula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:26">navo volawanya.<verse eid="PSA 102:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 102:27"/>Lakini gweye kwa vivija,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:27">na miyaka yako yabule uhelelo.<verse eid="PSA 102:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 102:28"/>Wana wa iwasang'hanaji zako osigala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:28">na ulelo wao okala kuulongozi wako.”<verse eid="PSA 102:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 102"/>
  <chapter number="103" style="c" sid="PSA 103"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 103</para>
  <para style="d">(Zabuli ya Daudi.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 103:1"/>Gweye moyo wangu, mtogole Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:1">vose vili mgati yangu ditogoleni twaga jake ding'ala.<verse eid="PSA 103:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 103:2"/>Gweye moyo wangu, mtogole Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:2">sikuuisemwe ganogile gake gose,<verse eid="PSA 103:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 103:3"/>heyo ayo yogela kumgongo gehile gangu gose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:3">na konihonya mitamu yangu yose.<verse eid="PSA 103:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 103:4"/>Kowika ugima wangu kutali na panga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:4">heyo ayo yonizungulusila bazi na unogelo hawishaga,<verse eid="PSA 103:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 103:5"/>heyo konishibisha vinhu vinogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:5">na niye nopata nguvu za ubwanga kamba jola.<verse eid="PSA 103:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 103:6"/>Mndewa Imulungu ayo yotenda kamba viilondigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:6">na kotagusa goya kwa awo okoneligwa.<verse eid="PSA 103:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 103:7"/>Kamulagusila Musa nzila zake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:7">na iwana wa Izilaeli sang'hano zake.<verse eid="PSA 103:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 103:8"/>Mndewa Imulungu kamema bazi na ng'hekewa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:8">hagevuzika himahima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:8">heyo kamema unogelo hawishaga.<verse eid="PSA 103:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 103:9"/>Heyo hakomhoka milele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:9">na hagevuzika milele.<verse eid="PSA 103:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 103:10"/>Heyo hatukoboze kamba viilondigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:10">na hatulihile kamba gehile getu vigali.<verse eid="PSA 103:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 103:11"/>Kamba ulanga viwili uchanha ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:11">vivo viwili unogelo wake hawishaga kwa iwanhu omdumba.<verse eid="PSA 103:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 103:12"/>Kamba mwambu wa kudilawila zuwa viwili kutali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:12">na mwambu wa kudihongela zuwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:12">vivo viyagekile gehile getu kutali na siye.<verse eid="PSA 103:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 103:13"/>Kamba tata viyowonela bazi wanage,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:13">vivo Mndewa Imulungu viyowonela bazi iwanhu omdumba.<verse eid="PSA 103:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 103:14"/>Kwavija heyo katujuwa vitwili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:14">na heyo kokumbuka kamba siye twa timbwisi.<verse eid="PSA 103:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 103:15"/>Lakini munhu siku zake kamba mijani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:15">kamba luwa da kubonde vijalika,<verse eid="PSA 103:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 103:16"/>kwavija beho dobita uchanha yake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:16">najo dolawanya na hanhu hake hahakoneka kabili.<verse eid="PSA 103:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 103:17"/>Ila unogelo hawishaga wa Mndewa Imulungu okala kulawa milele mbaka milele na ochola kwa awo omdumba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:17">na haki yake yokala kwa iwana na wazukulu zao.<verse eid="PSA 103:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 103:18"/>Kwa awo odigoga lagano jake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:18">na okumbuka kugoga malagizo gake.<verse eid="PSA 103:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 103:19"/>Mndewa Imulungu kasimika kigoda chake cha ukulu kuulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:19">na undewa wake ovitawala vinhu vose.<verse eid="PSA 103:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 103:20"/>Mtogoleni Mndewa Imulungu mweye iwasenga zake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:20">mweye muli magalu mudigoga lagizo jake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:20">na moitegeleza sauti ya lagizo jake.<verse eid="PSA 103:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 103:21"/>Mtogoleni Mndewa Imulungu mweye iwakalizi zake wose wa kuulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:21">mweye wasang'hanaji wake musang'hana gomnogeza.<verse eid="PSA 103:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 103:22"/>Mtogoleni Mndewa Imulungu mweye viumbe wake wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:22">mtogoleni kila hanhu hamwili muutawala wake.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:22">Gweye moyo wangu, mtogole Mndewa Imulungu.<verse eid="PSA 103:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 103"/>
  <chapter number="104" style="c" sid="PSA 104"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 104</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 104:1"/>Gweye moyo wangu mtogole Mndewa Imulungu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:1">Gweye Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:1">gweye kwa mkulu ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:1">gweye kuivaza ukulu na nhogolwa.<verse eid="PSA 104:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 104:2"/>Kuvala mulenge kamba kiwalo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:2">kuukunzula ulanga kamba panziya.<verse eid="PSA 104:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 104:3"/>Kazenga ukazi wake uchanha ya mazi ga kuulanga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:3">Kagatenda mawingu kamba mtuka wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:3">kazumha uchanha ya mabawa ga beho.<verse eid="PSA 104:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 104:4"/>Kaditenda beho diwe msenga wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:4">moto na milambi ya moto iwe wasang'hanaji wake.<verse eid="PSA 104:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 104:5"/>Kuisimika isi uchanha ya chandusilo chake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:5">sikuitigisike siku zose na milele.<verse eid="PSA 104:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 104:6"/>Kuigubika isi kwa bahali kamba kiwalo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:6">na mazi gavigubika vigongo.<verse eid="PSA 104:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 104:7"/>Kukomhoka na mazi gakimbila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:7">kwa sauti ya ng'huwa mazi gakilima.<verse eid="PSA 104:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 104:8"/>Gakilima kulawa kuvigongo na gahumuluka kubonde,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:8">mbaka hanhu haulondile.<verse eid="PSA 104:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 104:9"/>Kuchaga imbaka sikugabite,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:9">na sikugabwele kuigubika isi yose.<verse eid="PSA 104:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 104:10"/>Kogala nzasa kubonde,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:10">zobita hagati ya vigongo,<verse eid="PSA 104:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 104:11"/>zomng'weza kila mng'onyo wa kubonde,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:11">mhunda luwala kokanha ng'hilu.<verse eid="PSA 104:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 104:12"/>Kumgwazo okala ndege wa kuulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:12">hagati ya matambi olava sauti zao.<verse eid="PSA 104:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 104:13"/>Kulawa kuulanga wako koving'weza vigongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:13">isi iguta ndiya ya sang'hano yako.<verse eid="PSA 104:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 104:14"/>Koyoteza mijani mbuli ya ng'ombe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:14">minoga mbuli ya munhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:14">ili yapate ndiya kulawa mwiisi ayo,<verse eid="PSA 104:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 104:15"/>na divai imsamhuse munhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:15">na mavuta yaking'aze kihanga chake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:15">na gate dimtende munhu yawe mgima.<verse eid="PSA 104:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 104:16"/>Mibiki ya Mndewa Imulungu nayo ishiba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:16">mielezi ya Lebanoni ayo ihandigwe.<verse eid="PSA 104:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 104:17"/>Mumo ndege ozenga mvulu zao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:17">na nyamkuta kazenga kae mdibiki.<verse eid="PSA 104:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 104:18"/>Kuvigongo vitali kuko kuweli mbuzi luwala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:18">mmihango mumo oifisaga ndezi.<verse eid="PSA 104:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 104:19"/>Kuilumba mbalamwezi mbuli ya vipindi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:19">zuwa dojuwa saa ya kwingila.<verse eid="PSA 104:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 104:20"/>Gweye kogala ziza na yokuwa ikilo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:20">abaho kila mnyama wa kumuhulo kolawa kunze.<verse eid="PSA 104:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 104:21"/>Wana simba ong'ula ozahila ndiya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:21">ozahila ndiya yao kulawa kwa Mndewa Imulungu.<verse eid="PSA 104:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 104:22"/>Zuwa dahalawa olawanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:22">na otambalala mmihango yao.<verse eid="PSA 104:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 104:23"/>Munhu kolawa kochola kuisang'hano,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:23">na kosang'hana mbaka ichungulo.<verse eid="PSA 104:23"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 104:24"/>Gweye Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:24">lola vizili nyingi sang'hano zako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:24">kwa ubala kuvitenda vose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:24">Isi yose imema viumbe vako.<verse eid="PSA 104:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 104:25"/>Bahali ya kuko ng'hulu na ina ugazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:25">mumo vili vitembelaga havidahika kupetwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:25">viumbe vili na ugima vidodo na vikulu.<verse eid="PSA 104:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 104:26"/>Mumo zibita meli ng'hulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:26">mumo yokala somba mkulu yokemigwa Lewiasani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:26">kumulumba yadambwae mumo.<verse eid="PSA 104:26"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 104:27"/>Awo wose okubeta gweye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:27">uwagwelele ndiya yao mkipindi chao.<verse eid="PSA 104:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 104:28"/>Wahawagwelela, hewo okidondola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:28">wahaugolosa mkono wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:28">hewo oshiba ganogile.<verse eid="PSA 104:28"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 104:29"/>Wahakifisa kihanga chako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:29">hewo ogwaya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:29">wahaisegesa mhumuzi yao odanganika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:29">na odibwelela timbwisi jao.<verse eid="PSA 104:29"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 104:30"/>Wahagala loho yako olumbigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:30">na gweye kokibweza kabili kihanga cha isi.<verse eid="PSA 104:30"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 104:31"/>Ukulu wa Mndewa Imulungu osigala milele.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:31">Mndewa Imulungu yaideng'helele sang'hano yake.<verse eid="PSA 104:31"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 104:32"/>Heyo koilola isi, nayo yogwaya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:32">kovikwasa vigongo, navo volava yosi.<verse eid="PSA 104:32"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 104:33"/>Nomwimbila Mndewa Imulungu ugima wangu wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:33">nomtambikila Imulungu wangu vivino vinili mgima.<verse eid="PSA 104:33"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 104:34"/>Go Mndewa Imulungu, unogezwe na kugesa kwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:34">kwavija niye nodeng'helela kukujuwa gweye.<verse eid="PSA 104:34"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 104:35"/>Wanhu wene nzambi wasegeswe mwiisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:35">wanhu otenda gehile sikuwoneke kabili.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 104:35"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:35">Gweye moyo wangu mtogole Mndewa Imulungu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:35">Mtogoleni Mndewa Imulungu.<verse eid="PSA 104:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 104"/>
  <chapter number="105" style="c" sid="PSA 105"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 105</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 105:1"/>Mshukuluni Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:1">dikemeni twaga jake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:1">walongeleni iwanhu wa isi zose sang'hano zake.<verse eid="PSA 105:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 105:2"/>Mwimbileni heyo, mwimbileni nhogolwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:2">walongeleni iwanhu sang'hano zake za unzonza.<verse eid="PSA 105:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 105:3"/>Muigodele twaga jake ding'ala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:3">mizoyo ya awo omzahila Mndewa Imulungu ideng'helele.<verse eid="PSA 105:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 105:4"/>Mzahileni Mndewa Imulungu na nguvu zake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:4">zahileni kihanga chake siku zose.<verse eid="PSA 105:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 105:5"/>Kumbukeni sang'hano zake za unzonza ziyasang'hane,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:5">vilaguso vake na nhaguso ziyalongile.<verse eid="PSA 105:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 105:6"/>Mweye ulelo wa msang'hanaji wake Abulahamu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:6">mweye wanage Yakobo yawasagule.<verse eid="PSA 105:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 105:7"/>Heyo Mndewa Imulungu ayo Imulungu wetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:7">isi yose imema nhaguso zake.<verse eid="PSA 105:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 105:8"/>Kodikumbuka lagano jake milele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:8">mbuli ija yailagize kwa ulelo elufu.<verse eid="PSA 105:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 105:9"/>Lagano diyatendile na Abulahamu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:9">na kuiduwila kwake kwa Isaka.<verse eid="PSA 105:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 105:10"/>Kadigangamiza kwa Yakobo kamba lagizo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:10">na kwa Izilaeli kamba lagano da milele.<verse eid="PSA 105:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 105:11"/>Kalonga, “Nokugwaa gweye isi ya Kanaani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:11">iwe fungu da uhazi wako.”<verse eid="PSA 105:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 105:12"/>Viwakalile iwanhu wadodo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:12">ona wanhu kidogo na wanhu baki mgati yake,<verse eid="PSA 105:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 105:13"/>wakala tanga nzulule kulawa isi mbaka isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:13">kulawa undewa umoja mbaka undewa uyagwe.<verse eid="PSA 105:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 105:14"/>Hamulekile munhu yoyose yawagaze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:14">hata iwandewa kawakomhokela mbuli ya hewo.<verse eid="PSA 105:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 105:15"/>Kalonga, “Sikumuwakwase iwanhu zangu niwasagule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:15">na sikumuwalumize watula ndagu zangu.”<verse eid="PSA 105:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 105:16"/>Mndewa Imulungu kaikema nzala ize mwiisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:16">kainanga ndiya yose waitamanile.<verse eid="PSA 105:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 105:17"/>Kamgala munhu kuulongozi wao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:17">Yusufu kauzigwa muutumwa.<verse eid="PSA 105:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 105:18"/>Wamulumiza magulu gake kwa mhingu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:18">wamfunga mizabi ya mizuma msingo.<verse eid="PSA 105:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 105:19"/>Mbaka mkipindi cha kuvikiza mbuli yake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:19">gayalongile Mndewa Imulungu gamwizila.<verse eid="PSA 105:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 105:20"/>Mndewa wa Misili katuma wanhu wamfungula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:20">imkulu wa iwanhu kamulekesa.<verse eid="PSA 105:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 105:21"/>Kamtenda mkulu mng'anda yake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:21">kawa mwimilizi wa vinhu vake vose.<verse eid="PSA 105:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 105:22"/>Kawalongoza iwakulu zake kamba viyalondile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:22">na kawafunza nzewele iwavele zake.<verse eid="PSA 105:22"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 105:23"/>Izilaeli nayo kengila Misili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:23">Yakobo kawa munhu baki mwiisi ya Hamu.<verse eid="PSA 105:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 105:24"/>Mndewa Imulungu kawatenda iwanhu zake walele ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:24">kawatenda wengi kubanza awo owehila.<verse eid="PSA 105:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 105:25"/>Kawahindula mizoyo wawehile wanhu zake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:25">wawatendela gehile wasang'hanaji zake.<verse eid="PSA 105:25"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 105:26"/>Kamtuma msang'hanaji wake Musa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:26">na Haluni ayo iyamsagule.<verse eid="PSA 105:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 105:27"/>Keka mbuli za unzonza hagati ya hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:27">na katenda unzonza mwiisi ya Hamu.<verse eid="PSA 105:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 105:28"/>Kagala ziza na isi yose ikala ziza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:28">kwavija wailema mbuli yake.<verse eid="PSA 105:28"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 105:29"/>Kagahindula mazi gao gawa damu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:29">kawakoma iwasomba wao.<verse eid="PSA 105:29"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 105:30"/>Isi yao imema mibula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:30">mbaka kudigati da mndewa wao.<verse eid="PSA 105:30"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 105:31"/>Imulungu viyalongile, mikonzi iza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:31">na mhani mwiisi yao yose.<verse eid="PSA 105:31"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 105:32"/>Kawagalila mvula ya mabwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:32">na mimwesa mwiisi yao.<verse eid="PSA 105:32"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 105:33"/>Kaitowa mizabibu yao na mitini yao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:33">kaibena imibiki ili mwiisi yao.<verse eid="PSA 105:33"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 105:34"/>Imulungu viyalongile mbalangulu weza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:34">na nzige hawapetwa.<verse eid="PSA 105:34"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 105:35"/>Waija iminoga yose ya isi yao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:35">waija ndiya ya isi yao.<verse eid="PSA 105:35"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 105:36"/>Kawakoma wana wose wa chaudele wa isi yao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:36">nguvu za ubwanga wao.<verse eid="PSA 105:36"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 105:37"/>Kawalava Waizilaeli akuno wapapa shaba na zahabu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:37">haduhu hata munhu imoja yaikwalile.<verse eid="PSA 105:37"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 105:38"/>Misili ideng'helela viwasegele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:38">kwavija mbuli ya hewo wengilwa bwembwe.<verse eid="PSA 105:38"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 105:39"/>Kakunzula wingu diwa ngubiko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:39">na moto umwemwesa ikilo.<verse eid="PSA 105:39"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 105:40"/>Viwalondile kagala ng'hwale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:40">kawagwaa ndiya ya kuulanga mbaka washiba.<verse eid="PSA 105:40"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 105:41"/>Kadigubula dibwe, mbwibwi ya mazi ilawa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:41">mazi gakilima kuluwala kamba lwanda.<verse eid="PSA 105:41"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 105:42"/>Kwavija kaikumbuka mbuli yake ing'ala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:42">iyamgwelele Abulahamu imsang'hanaji wake.<verse eid="PSA 105:42"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 105:43"/>Kawalava iwanhu zake kwa deng'ho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:43">awo yawasagule kwa nyila za deng'ho.<verse eid="PSA 105:43"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="PSA 105:44"/>Kawagwaa isi za iwanhu wayagwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:44">waihazi sang'hano ya iwenekae,<verse eid="PSA 105:44"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="PSA 105:45"/>ili wagagoge malagizo gake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:45">na kugoga gaja goyolonga.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 105:45"/>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 105:45">Mndewa Imulungu yatogolwe.<verse eid="PSA 105:45"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 105"/>
  <chapter number="106" style="c" sid="PSA 106"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 106</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 106:1"/>Mtogoleni Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:1">Mshukuluni Mndewa Imulungu kwavija kanoga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:1">na unogelo wake hawishaga osigala milele.<verse eid="PSA 106:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 106:2"/>Nani yodaha kuzilonga sang'hano za Mndewa Imulungu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:2">Nani yodaha kuzilonga nhogolwa zake zose?<verse eid="PSA 106:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 106:3"/>Wamweda iwanhu otenda haki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:3">waja otenda ganogile kamba viilondigwa siku zose.<verse eid="PSA 106:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 106:4"/>Gweye Mndewa Imulungu unikumbuke niye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:4">wahawanogela iwanhu zako.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:4">Wahawakombola unitaze,<verse eid="PSA 106:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 106:5"/>ili nigalole ganogile ga waja wauwasagule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:5">na nideng'helele hamoja na iwanhu wa isi yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:5">na kuigoda hamoja na iwanhu wa uhazi wako.<verse eid="PSA 106:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 106:6"/>Tutenda nzambi hamoja na iwahenga zetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:6">tutenda gehile, tubananga.<verse eid="PSA 106:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 106:7"/>Wahenga zetu ako Misili hawagelegeze mbuli zako za unzonza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:7">hawakumbuke ukulu wa unogelo wako hawishaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:7">wakulema kuingema ya bahali ya Shamu.<verse eid="PSA 106:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 106:8"/>Lakini kawakombola mbuli ya twaga jake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:8">kalagusa nguvu zake.<verse eid="PSA 106:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 106:9"/>Kaikomhokela bahali ya Shamu, nayo inyala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:9">kawalongoza mmazi mengi kamba kuluwala.<verse eid="PSA 106:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 106:10"/>Kawakombola na imunhu yowehila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:10">na kawahonya na iwanhu owehila.<verse eid="PSA 106:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 106:11"/>Mazi gawagubika awo owadeta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:11">hasigale hata munhu imoja.<verse eid="PSA 106:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 106:12"/>Abaho wazitogola mbuli zake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:12">wamwimbila nhogolwa zake.<verse eid="PSA 106:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 106:13"/>Lakini wazisemwa sang'hano zake himahima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:13">hawagabetile magesa gake.<verse eid="PSA 106:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 106:14"/>Ako kuluwala wakala osulukila ndiya ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:14">wamgeza Imulungu ako kudibawe.<verse eid="PSA 106:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 106:15"/>Kawagwelela gawalondile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:15">lakini kawagalila utamu.<verse eid="PSA 106:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 106:16"/>Wamonela migongo Musa ako kuing'hambi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:16">na Haluni ayo yong'ala wa Mndewa Imulungu.<verse eid="PSA 106:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 106:17"/>Isi igubuka immeza Datani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:17">igubika mting'hano wa Abilamu.<verse eid="PSA 106:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 106:18"/>Moto ukwaka kwa iwanhu owakweleleza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:18">milambi ya moto iwasakaza iwanhu wehile.<verse eid="PSA 106:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 106:19"/>Watenda kinyago cha ng'ombe ako Holebu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:19">wakitambikila kinyago kilumbuka.<verse eid="PSA 106:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 106:20"/>Wauhindula ukulu wa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:20">kwa kutambikila kinyago cha ng'ombe yajaga mijani.<verse eid="PSA 106:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 106:21"/>Wamsemwa Imulungu, mkombola wao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:21">yatendile vinhu vikulu mwiisi ya Misili.<verse eid="PSA 106:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 106:22"/>Katenda mbuli za unzonza mwiisi ya Hamu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:22">na mbuli ng'hulu mna ibahali ya Shamu.<verse eid="PSA 106:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 106:23"/>Imulungu kalonga kamba kowabananga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:23">ila Musa ayo iyamsagule kema kuulongozi wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:23">na kaikimila ng'hasiliki yake sikuiwanange.<verse eid="PSA 106:23"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 106:24"/>Waibezeli isi ija inogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:24">hawagatogole gaja gayalongile.<verse eid="PSA 106:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 106:25"/>Waiyalala mvibanda vao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:25">hawaitegeleze sauti ya Mndewa Imulungu.<verse eid="PSA 106:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 106:26"/>Abaho kawenulila mkono wake kaiduwila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:26">kamba kowakoma ako kuluwala,<verse eid="PSA 106:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 106:27"/>na kuwapwililisa ulelo wao hagati ya iwanhu wa isi ziyagwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:27">na kuwaswaswanya isi ya kutali.<verse eid="PSA 106:27"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 106:28"/>Wailumba kumtambikila Baali Peoli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:28">wazija zinhosa zilavigwe kwa imilungu ilibule ugima.<verse eid="PSA 106:28"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 106:29"/>Wamgevuza Mndewa Imulungu kwa sang'hano zao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:29">mikubulo igaligwa hagati yao.<verse eid="PSA 106:29"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 106:30"/>Abaho Finehasi kema kagala nhaguso,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:30">mikubulo ikimilwa.<verse eid="PSA 106:30"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 106:31"/>Kagesigwa kamba kana haki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:31">ulelo mbaka ulelo milele.<verse eid="PSA 106:31"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 106:32"/>Wamgevuza hana gamazi ga Meliba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:32">Musa kagaya mbuli ya hewo.<verse eid="PSA 106:32"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 106:33"/>Kwavija wamulema loho wa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:33">kalonga bila kugesa.<verse eid="PSA 106:33"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 106:34"/>Hawawanangile iwanhu wa isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:34">kamba Mndewa Imulungu viyawalagize.<verse eid="PSA 106:34"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 106:35"/>Lakini waihanganya na iwanhu wa isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:35">waifunza kusang'hana mbuli zao.<verse eid="PSA 106:35"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 106:36"/>Wavitambikila vinyago vao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:36">kinhu acho kikala mtego kumwao.<verse eid="PSA 106:36"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 106:37"/>Ona, walava wanao wa kimbigalo na wa ikitwanzi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:37">walava nhosa kwa vinyamkela.<verse eid="PSA 106:37"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 106:38"/>Weta damu ilibule kitala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:38">damu ya wanao wa kimbigalo na wa ikitwanzi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:38">wawalava nhosa kwa vinyago va Kanaani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:38">isi igeligwa dikwe kwa damu.<verse eid="PSA 106:38"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 106:39"/>Avo, wageligwa dikwe kwa sang'hano yao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:39">waleka kutamanilwa kwa Imulungu kamba wagoni.<verse eid="PSA 106:39"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 106:40"/>Avo Mndewa Imulungu kawagevuzikila wanhu zake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:40">kawehila iwanhu wa uhazi wake.<verse eid="PSA 106:40"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 106:41"/>Kawagela mmakono ga iwanhu wa isi ziyagwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:41">awo iwasede wawatawala.<verse eid="PSA 106:41"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 106:42"/>Iwanhu owehila wawonela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:42">na wawatawala kwa nguvu.<verse eid="PSA 106:42"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 106:43"/>Miyanza mingi Imulungu kawakombola wanhu zake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:43">lakini hewo wasagula kumulema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:43">wadidimila mzinzambi zao.<verse eid="PSA 106:43"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="PSA 106:44"/>Lakini kagalola magazo gao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:44">viyahulike kililo chao.<verse eid="PSA 106:44"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="PSA 106:45"/>Mbuli yao kadikumbuka lagano jake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:45">kawonela bazi kamba unogelo wake hawishaga viwili mkulu.<verse eid="PSA 106:45"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="PSA 106:46"/>Kawatenda awo wawagogile wawonele bazi.<verse eid="PSA 106:46"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="PSA 106:47"/>Go Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:47">tukombole, twike hamoja kulawa kwa iwanhu wa isi ziyagwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:47">ili tudishukulu twaga jako ding'ala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:47">na tuzigodele nhogolwa zako.<verse eid="PSA 106:47"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="PSA 106:48"/>Yatogolwe Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wa Izilaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:48">kulawa milele mbaka milele.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:48">Wanhu wose walonge, “Ona!”</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 106:48"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:48">Yatogolwe Mndewa Imulungu.<verse eid="PSA 106:48"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 106"/>
  <chapter number="107" style="c" sid="PSA 107"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 107</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 107:1"/>Mshukuluni Mndewa Imulungu kwavija kanoga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:1">unogelo wake hawishaga okala milele.<verse eid="PSA 107:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 107:2"/>Wanhu wakomboligwe na Mndewa Imulungu walonge vivo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:2">awo yawakombole mmagazo.<verse eid="PSA 107:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 107:3"/>Kawating'haniza kulawa mziisi zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:3">kulawa mwambu wa kudilawila zuwa na kudihongela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:3">kulawa kasikazini na kusini.<verse eid="PSA 107:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 107:4"/>Wakala tanga nzulule kuluwala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:4">hawajone buga da kukala.<verse eid="PSA 107:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 107:5"/>Wona nzala na ng'hilu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:5">mizoyo yao isinduka.<verse eid="PSA 107:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 107:6"/>Wamulilila Mndewa Imulungu mmagazo gao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:6">kawakombola mmadununzo gao.<verse eid="PSA 107:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 107:7"/>Kawalongoza kwa nzila igoloke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:7">mbaka wavika kudibuga da kukala.<verse eid="PSA 107:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 107:8"/>Avo, wamshukulu Mndewa Imulungu kwa unogelo wake hawishaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:8">na unzonza wake kwa iwanhu wose.<verse eid="PSA 107:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 107:9"/>Heyo kodigwaa mazi zoyo dikona ng'hilu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:9">na loho ikona nzala koigwaa ganogile.<verse eid="PSA 107:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 107:10"/>Wayagwe wakala kudiziza na vihame,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:10">wafungwa mmagazo na minyololo,<verse eid="PSA 107:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 107:11"/>kwavija wailema mbuli ya Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:11">wagabezeli magesa ga ayo yeli Uchanha Ng'hani.<verse eid="PSA 107:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 107:12"/>Wadonha kwa sang'hano ngaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:12">wagwa hasi, kuduhu munhu wa kuwataza.<verse eid="PSA 107:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 107:13"/>Wamulilila Mndewa Imulungu mmagazo gao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:13">kawakombola mmadununzo gao.<verse eid="PSA 107:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 107:14"/>Kawalava kudiziza na ukiwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:14">minyololo yao kaibena bena.<verse eid="PSA 107:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 107:15"/>Avo, wamshukulu Mndewa Imulungu kwa unogelo wake hawishaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:15">na unzonza wake kwa iwanhu wose.<verse eid="PSA 107:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 107:16"/>Kwavija kaibena milango ya shaba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:16">kaibena mizuma.<verse eid="PSA 107:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 107:17"/>Wayagwe wakala wabozi mbuli ya nzambi zao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:17">wagazwa kwa gehile gao,<verse eid="PSA 107:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 107:18"/>ndiya ikala usungu kumwao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:18">walonda kudanganika.<verse eid="PSA 107:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 107:19"/>Avo mmagazo gao wamulilila Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:19">heyo kawakombola mmadununzo gao.<verse eid="PSA 107:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 107:20"/>Koituma mbuli yake iwahonye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:20">kowalava mwiiifa yao.<verse eid="PSA 107:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 107:21"/>Avo, wamshukulu Mndewa Imulungu kwa unogelo wake hawishaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:21">na unzonza wake kwa iwanhu wose.<verse eid="PSA 107:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 107:22"/>Wamulavile nhosa za kumshukulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:22">na wazilonge sang'hano zake kwa nyila za deng'ho.<verse eid="PSA 107:22"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 107:23"/>Wayagwe wakala mmwanza mbahali kwa meli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:23">awo wasang'hane mmazi mengi.<verse eid="PSA 107:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 107:24"/>Awo wazona sang'hano za Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:24">na unzonza wake mgamazi mengi.<verse eid="PSA 107:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 107:25"/>Kalonga na kukuzumbi dilawila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:25">ng'humbi ya bahali inuka uchanha.<verse eid="PSA 107:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 107:26"/>Gakwela uchanha kuulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:26">abaho hasi mvidibo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:26">mizoyo yao ilumbuka kwa mbuli ayo.<verse eid="PSA 107:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 107:27"/>Wachola wahembeluka kamba munhu yakoligwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:27">ubala wao wose upotela.<verse eid="PSA 107:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 107:28"/>Wamulilila Mndewa Imulungu mmagazo gao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:28">kawakombola mmadununzo gao.<verse eid="PSA 107:28"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 107:29"/>Kaihoza ng'humbi nayo inyamala tuluu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:29">mazi gasafuke ganyamala.<verse eid="PSA 107:29"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 107:30"/>Avo wadeng'helela kwavija inyamala tuluu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:30">kawagala mbaka kudiloko diwalondile.<verse eid="PSA 107:30"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 107:31"/>Avo, wamshukulu Mndewa Imulungu kwa unogelo wake hawishaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:31">na unzonza wake kwa iwanhu wose.<verse eid="PSA 107:31"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 107:32"/>Wamtogole hagati ha umting'hano wa iwanhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:32">wamgwee ukulu mkitala cha iwavele.<verse eid="PSA 107:32"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 107:33"/>Kavihindula vizanda viwa luwala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:33">na mbwibwi za mazi zigalamuka isi inyalile.<verse eid="PSA 107:33"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 107:34"/>Isi ya matunda mengi igalamuka isi ya mkele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:34">kwa gehile ga awo okala mumo.<verse eid="PSA 107:34"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 107:35"/>Kahindula luwala luwa lamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:35">isi inyalile iwa mazi gokilima.<verse eid="PSA 107:35"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 107:36"/>Kaweka wene nzala kuko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:36">na watenda buga da kukala.<verse eid="PSA 107:36"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 107:37"/>Wahanda mbeyu mmigunda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:37">na vivija mgunda uyagwe wahanda mizabibu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:37">wasenga ndiya na matunda.<verse eid="PSA 107:37"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 107:38"/>Kawatenda wamwede na kongezeka ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:38">na fugo yao haihungule.<verse eid="PSA 107:38"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 107:39"/>Abaho iwanhu wa Imulungu wahunguka na kuhumuluswa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:39">kwavija oneligwa na gehile na wanyunyuwala.<verse eid="PSA 107:39"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 107:40"/>Kawabezeli iwakulu wawadununze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:40">kawawegeza kuluwala hanhu haduhu nzila.<verse eid="PSA 107:40"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 107:41"/>Lakini kawakombola iwanhu mmagazo gao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:41">kawongeza ulelo wao kamba bumbila da ng'hondolo.<verse eid="PSA 107:41"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 107:42"/>Wanhu wanogile viwachone kinhu acho wadeng'helela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:42">lakini wanhu wehile wanyamala tuluu.<verse eid="PSA 107:42"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 107:43"/>Wanhu wene ubala wagalole gago,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:43">na waugelegeze unogelo hawishaga wa Mndewa Imulungu.<verse eid="PSA 107:43"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 107"/>
  <chapter number="108" style="c" sid="PSA 108"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 108</para>
  <para style="d">(Lwila na Zabuli ya Daudi.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 108:1"/>Gweye Imulungu, moyo wangu ugangamala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:1">nokwimba lwila lwa nhogolwa kwa moyo wangu wose.<verse eid="PSA 108:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 108:2"/>Lamuka gweye bango na kilimba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:2">noulamusa imitondo.<verse eid="PSA 108:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 108:3"/>Gweye Mndewa Imulungu nokushukulu hagati ha iwanhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:3">nokwimbila lwila hagati ha iwanhu wa isi zose.<verse eid="PSA 108:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 108:4"/>Kwavija unogelo wako hawishaga uvika mbaka uchanha kuulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:4">na kutamanilwa kwako mbaka mmawingu.<verse eid="PSA 108:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 108:5"/>Gweye Imulungu utogolwe uchanha kuulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:5">na hasi mwiisi ukale ukulu wako.<verse eid="PSA 108:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 108:6"/>Awo wauwanogela wakomboligwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:6">ukombole kwa mkono wako wa ukudila na unidike.<verse eid="PSA 108:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 108:7"/>Imulungu kalonga kwa ukung'ala kwake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:7">“Kwa kuhuma noigola isi ya Shekemu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:7">na nodipima vihande vihande bonde da Sukoti.<verse eid="PSA 108:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 108:8"/>Isi ya Gileadi yangu niye na isi ya Manase yangu niye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:8">isi ya Efulaimu ayo kamba kofia yangu ya zuma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:8">isi ya Yuda ayo kamba fimbo yangu ya utawala.<verse eid="PSA 108:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 108:9"/>Isi ya Moabu ayo kamba bakuli jangu da kunawila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:9">kwa isi ya Edomu notupa kilatu changu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:9">na niye nodeng'helela kwa kuwahuma Wafilisiti.”<verse eid="PSA 108:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 108:10"/>Nani yonda yanigale kudibuga dizungulukwe na luwa lwa mabwe?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:10">Nani yonda yanilongoze mbaka Edomu?<verse eid="PSA 108:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 108:11"/>Gweye, Imulungu siyo gweye utulemile siye?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:11">Gweye Imulungu hucholile na siye kuing'hondo.<verse eid="PSA 108:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 108:12"/>Ututaze mbuli ya iwanhu otwihila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:12">kwavija msaada wa munhu haufaya kinhu.<verse eid="PSA 108:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 108:13"/>Imulungu yahakala na siye tohuma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:13">na heyo kowabojoga hasi iwanhu otwihila.<verse eid="PSA 108:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 108"/>
  <chapter number="109" style="c" sid="PSA 109"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 109</para>
  <para style="d">(Kwa kilanja, Zabuli ya Daudi.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 109:1"/>Gweye Imulungu wa nhogolwa zangu sikuunyamale,<verse eid="PSA 109:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 109:2"/>kwavija wanhu wehile na wavizi onilonga vihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:2">onilonga vihile kwa uvizi.<verse eid="PSA 109:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 109:3"/>Ona, kwa mbuli za kubezeli wanizunguluka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:3">wanilonga vihile bila kitala chochose.<verse eid="PSA 109:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 109:4"/>Oniliha gehile kwa unogelo wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:4">lakini niye nowapulila.<verse eid="PSA 109:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 109:5"/>Waniliha gehile hanhu ha ganogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:5">na wanihila hanhu ha unogelo wangu.<verse eid="PSA 109:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 109:6"/>Mwike msemi yehile mbuli ya imunhu yonihila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:6">na imunhu yomtagusa yeme mkono wake wa ukudila.<verse eid="PSA 109:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 109:7"/>Mkitala yoneke kabananga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:7">na kupula kwake koneke kamba nzambi.<verse eid="PSA 109:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 109:8"/>Siku zake za kukala ziwe ndodo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:8">wimilizi wake usoligwe na munhu iyagwe.<verse eid="PSA 109:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 109:9"/>Wanage wawe wakiwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:9">na mwehe wake yawe mgane.<verse eid="PSA 109:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 109:10"/>Wanage wawe tanga nzulule na wapule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:10">wazahile ndiya kutali na vihame va ng'anda zao.<verse eid="PSA 109:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 109:11"/>Imunhu yomdai yasole vinhu vose viyeli navo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:11">wageni wasole sang'hano ya makono gake.<verse eid="PSA 109:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 109:12"/>Sikuyawe na munhu wa kumonela bazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:12">hebu munhu wa kuwalela wanage wakiwa.<verse eid="PSA 109:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 109:13"/>Ulelo wake wose usegele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:13">twaga jake disemwigwe muulelo wa kabili.<verse eid="PSA 109:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 109:14"/>Gehile ga iwahenga zake gakumbukwe mgameso ga Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:14">na nzambi ya mamake sikuifutigwe.<verse eid="PSA 109:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 109:15"/>Mndewa Imulungu yazikumbuke nzambi zao siku zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:15">na hewo wasemwigwe mwiisi siku zose.<verse eid="PSA 109:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 109:16"/>Kwavija munhu ayo hagesile kuwa na bazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:16">ila kawadununza ngaengae na wakiwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:16">mbaka imunhu yanyunyuwale mmoyo kadanganika.<verse eid="PSA 109:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 109:17"/>Heyo kanogelwa kuduwila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:17">na gago gampate.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:17">Hanogelwe kutambikila wayagwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:17">avo kinhu acho kikale kutali na heyo.<verse eid="PSA 109:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 109:18"/>Kavala makungu kamba kiwalo chake.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:18">Makungu gamwingile mmoyo kamba mazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:18">na kamba mavuta mmizege yake.<verse eid="PSA 109:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 109:19"/>Kumwake iwe kamba kiwalo cha kuigubika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:19">kamba mkwiji yoifunga siku zose.<verse eid="PSA 109:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 109:20"/>Mndewa Imulungu yawalihe gago awo wose onitagusa niye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:20">na awo onibezeli niye.<verse eid="PSA 109:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 109:21"/>Gweye Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:21">unitendele ganogile mbuli ya twaga jako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:21">kwavija unogelo wako hawishaga unoga, avo unikombole.<verse eid="PSA 109:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 109:22"/>Kwavija niye na mkiwa na ngaengae,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:22">moyo wangu olumila mgati yangu.<verse eid="PSA 109:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 109:23"/>Nobita kamba sisila disegelaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:23">nohembeluswa kamba nzige.<verse eid="PSA 109:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 109:24"/>Mavindi gangu gadonha kwa kufunga kuja,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:24">na lukuli lwangu lusoka kwa kuswela mavuta.<verse eid="PSA 109:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 109:25"/>Niwa kinhu cha kubezeli kumwao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:25">wahanyona ominula milomo yao.<verse eid="PSA 109:25"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 109:26"/>Gweye Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wangu nitaze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:26">unikombole kamba unogelo wako hawishaga viwili.<verse eid="PSA 109:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 109:27"/>Waleke wajuwe kamba uno udahi wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:27">gweye Mndewa Imulungu, kutenda mbuli ayo.<verse eid="PSA 109:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 109:28"/>Waleke waduwile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:28">ila gweye unitambikile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:28">Wose onivamila ogwa kinyala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:28">lakini msang'hanaji wako kodeng'helela.<verse eid="PSA 109:28"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 109:29"/>Awo onitagusa ovazwa kinyala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:29">ovala kinyala chao kamba kanzu.<verse eid="PSA 109:29"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 109:30"/>Nomshukulu Mndewa Imulungu kwa mulomo wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:30">ona nomtogola hagati ha umting'hano.<verse eid="PSA 109:30"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 109:31"/>Kwavija kokwima mkono wa ukudila wa mkiwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:31">yamgombele na iwanhu omtagusa.<verse eid="PSA 109:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 109"/>
  <chapter number="110" style="c" sid="PSA 110"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 110</para>
  <para style="d">(Zabuli ya Daudi.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 110:1"/>Mndewa Imulungu komulongela Mndewa wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 110:1">“Kala umwambu wa mkono wangu wa ukudila</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 110:1">mbaka niwatende iwanhu okwihila kigoda cha kwikila magulu gako.”<verse eid="PSA 110:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 110:2"/>Mndewa Imulungu koweneza undewa wako kulawa Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 110:2">uwatawale hagati ya wose okwihila gweye.<verse eid="PSA 110:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 110:3"/>Wanhu zako okwizila kwa kulonda wenyego siku yako ya ng'hondo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 110:3">Kuno kuvala viwalo ving'ala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 110:3">wabwanga zako okwizila kamba tungwe da imitondo.<verse eid="PSA 110:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 110:4"/>Mndewa Imulungu kaiduwila na hagimbula bule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 110:4">“Gweye kwa mulava nhosa milele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 110:4">muulava nhosa wa Melikizedeki.”<verse eid="PSA 110:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 110:5"/>Mndewa ka umwambu wa mkono wako wa ukudila.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 110:5">Kowahonda wandewa siku ya kugevuzika kwake.<verse eid="PSA 110:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 110:6"/>Kowatagusa wanhu wa isi zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 110:6">isi yose yomema mitufi ya wanhu wadanganike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 110:6">kowahonda iwakulu kila hanhu mwiisi.<verse eid="PSA 110:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 110:7"/>Mndewa kong'wa mazi ga lwanda mnzila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 110:7">na kokwinula pala jake kwa mhumo.<verse eid="PSA 110:7"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 110"/>
  <chapter number="111" style="c" sid="PSA 111"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 111</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 111:1"/>Mtogoleni Mndewa Imulungu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 111:1">Nomshukulu Mndewa Imulungu kwa moyo wangu wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 111:1">mumting'hano wa iwanhu weli na mizoyo igoloke.<verse eid="PSA 111:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 111:2"/>Sang'hano za Mndewa Imulungu ukulu bae,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 111:2">wose ozideng'helela ozigelegeza.<verse eid="PSA 111:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 111:3"/>Kila kinhu kiyotenda kimema ukulu na unovu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 111:3">haki yake yosigala milele.<verse eid="PSA 111:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 111:4"/>Katenda sang'hano zake za unzonza zikumbukwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 111:4">Mndewa Imulungu kanoga na kana bazi.<verse eid="PSA 111:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 111:5"/>Kowagwaa ndiya awo omdumba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 111:5">haisemwa ng'o lagano jake.<verse eid="PSA 111:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 111:6"/>Kawalagusila wanhu zake nguvu ya sang'hano zake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 111:6">kawagwaa uhazi wa iwanhu wayagwe uwe wao.<verse eid="PSA 111:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 111:7"/>Sang'hano zake za haki na kweli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 111:7">malagizo gake gose gotamanilwa.<verse eid="PSA 111:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 111:8"/>Malagizo gake gosigala siku zose na milele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 111:8">kagalonga mna ihaki na ukweli.<verse eid="PSA 111:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 111:9"/>Kawakombola wanhu zake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 111:9">katenda nao lagano dikalaga milele.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 111:9">Twaga jake ding'ala na dodumbigwa.<verse eid="PSA 111:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 111:10"/>Kumdumba Mndewa Imulungu acho chandusilo cha ubala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 111:10">wose ogagoga malagizo gake ogweleligwa nzewele.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 111:10">Nhogolwa zake zosigala milele.<verse eid="PSA 111:10"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 111"/>
  <chapter number="112" style="c" sid="PSA 112"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 112</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 112:1"/>Mtogoleni Mndewa Imulungu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 112:1">Kamweda imunhu yomdumba Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 112:1">imunhu yodeng'helela ng'hani kugoga malagizo gake.<verse eid="PSA 112:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 112:2"/>Ulelo wake okuwa na nguvu mwiisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 112:2">wana wa iwanhu wanogile omweda.<verse eid="PSA 112:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 112:3"/>Mng'anda yake kokuwa na mali nyingi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 112:3">haki yake yosigala milele.<verse eid="PSA 112:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 112:4"/>Munhu yanogile komwemweselwa mulenge kuziza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 112:4">munhu mwene bazi na moyo unogile na haki.<verse eid="PSA 112:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 112:5"/>Munhu yokopesha bila kulonda nyongeza, komweda ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 112:5">munhu yotenda sang'hano zake kwa haki.<verse eid="PSA 112:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 112:6"/>Mwene haki halemelwa ng'o,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 112:6">heyo kokumbukwa milele.<verse eid="PSA 112:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 112:7"/>Hadumba yahapata usenga wihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 112:7">moyo wake ugangamala na komtamanila Mndewa Imulungu.<verse eid="PSA 112:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 112:8"/>Moyo wake ugangamala na hadumba kinhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 112:8">na kowona iwanhu omwihila olemelwa.<verse eid="PSA 112:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 112:9"/>Kowagwaa wakiwa vinhu kwa moyo unogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 112:9">haki yake yosigala milele.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 112:9">Heyo kokuwa na nguvu na kotegelezwa.<verse eid="PSA 112:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 112:10"/>Wanhu wehile ogona gago na ogevuzika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 112:10">odafuna meno kwa usungu na ohomba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 112:10">kusulukila kwa munhu yehile hakulawila bule.<verse eid="PSA 112:10"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 112"/>
  <chapter number="113" style="c" sid="PSA 113"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 113</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 113:1"/>Mndewa Imulungu yatogolwe!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 113:1">Mtogoleni Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 113:1">mweye iwasang'hanaji zake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 113:1">ditogoleni twaga da Mndewa Imulungu.<verse eid="PSA 113:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 113:2"/>Twaga da Mndewa Imulungu ditogolwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 113:2">sambi na milele.<verse eid="PSA 113:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 113:3"/>Kulawa kudilawa zuwa mbaka kudiswela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 113:3">twaga da Mndewa Imulungu ditogolwe!<verse eid="PSA 113:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 113:4"/>Kotawala uchanha ya iwanhu wa isi zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 113:4">ukulu wake uvika uchanha kuulanga.<verse eid="PSA 113:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 113:5"/>Nani kamba Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wetu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 113:5">Heyo kakala uchanha kuulanga,<verse eid="PSA 113:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 113:6"/>kolola hasi yalole ulanga na isi.<verse eid="PSA 113:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 113:7"/>Komwinula mkiwa kulawa mmitimbwisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 113:7">na komkweza ngaengae kulawa mdizalala.<verse eid="PSA 113:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 113:8"/>Komwika hamoja na iwakulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 113:8">hamoja na iwakulu wa wanhu zake.<verse eid="PSA 113:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 113:9"/>Komgwaa deng'ho mtwanzi mgumba mng'anda yake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 113:9">komsekeza kwa kumgwaa wana.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 113:9"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 113:9">Mndewa Imulungu yatogolwe.<verse eid="PSA 113:9"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 113"/>
  <chapter number="114" style="c" sid="PSA 114"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 114</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 114:1"/>Wanhu wa Izilaeli viwasegele Misili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 114:1">iwanhu wa ulelo wa Yakobo viwasegele mwiisi ya ugeni,<verse eid="PSA 114:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 114:2"/>Yuda iwa kae ing'ala ya Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 114:2">Izilaeli iwa hanhu hake mwenyego.<verse eid="PSA 114:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 114:3"/>Bahali igona gago ikimbila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 114:3">lwanda lwa Yolidani luleka kukilima!<verse eid="PSA 114:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 114:4"/>Vigongo vizumha kamba ng'hondolo mbigalo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 114:4">visugulu vizumha kamba wana ng'hondolo.<verse eid="PSA 114:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 114:5"/>Gweye bahali iwaze mbaka kokimbila?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 114:5">Na gweye Yolidani habali koleka kukilima?<verse eid="PSA 114:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 114:6"/>Mweye vigongo, habali muzumha kamba ng'hondolo mbigalo?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 114:6">Na mweye visugulu, habali muzumha kamba wana ng'hondolo?<verse eid="PSA 114:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 114:7"/>Gwaya gweye isi yose kuulongozi wa Mndewa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 114:7">gwaya kuulongozi wa Imulungu wa Yakobo,<verse eid="PSA 114:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 114:8"/>heyo kadikwasa dibwe diwa lamba da mazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 114:8">na dibwe dala diwa mbwibwi ya mazi!<verse eid="PSA 114:8"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 114"/>
  <chapter number="115" style="c" sid="PSA 115"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 115</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 115:1"/>Go Mndewa Imulungu, sikututogoligwe siye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:1">ila ditogole twaga jako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:1">mbuli ya unogelo wako hawishaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:1">na mbuli ya kutamanilwa kwako.<verse eid="PSA 115:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 115:2"/>Habali iwanhu wa isi ziyagwe olonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:2">“Imulungu wao kakwahi?”<verse eid="PSA 115:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 115:3"/>Lakini Imulungu wetu ka kuulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:3">kotenda chochose kimnogela.<verse eid="PSA 115:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 115:4"/>Milungu yao itendigwa kwa shaba na zahabu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:4">azo sang'hano za makono ga iwanhu.<verse eid="PSA 115:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 115:5"/>Vina milomo lakini havilonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:5">vina meso lakini havilola,<verse eid="PSA 115:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 115:6"/>vina magwiti lakini havihulika bule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:6">vina mhula lakini havinusa bule,<verse eid="PSA 115:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 115:7"/>vina makono lakini havigoga kinhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:7">vina magulu lakini havigenda bule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:7">havidaha kulava sauti kulawa mmitundu melo yao.<verse eid="PSA 115:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 115:8"/>Wose ovitenda waigala navo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:8">vivija na iwanhu ovitamanila.<verse eid="PSA 115:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 115:9"/>Mweye iwanhu wa Izilaeli, mtamanileni Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:9">heyo ayo yowataza na ngao yenu.<verse eid="PSA 115:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 115:10"/>Mweye ulelo wa Haluni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:10">mtamanileni Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:10">heyo ayo yowataza na ngao yenu.<verse eid="PSA 115:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 115:11"/>Mweye mumdumba Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:11">mtamanileni Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:11">heyo ayo yowataza na ngao yenu.<verse eid="PSA 115:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 115:12"/>Mndewa Imulungu kotukumbuka na kotutenda tumwede,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:12">kowatendela ganogile iwanhu wa Izilaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:12">kowatendela ganogile ulelo wa Haluni.<verse eid="PSA 115:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 115:13"/>Kowatendela ganogile wose omdumba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:13">kowatendela ganogile wakulu na wadodo.<verse eid="PSA 115:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 115:14"/>Mndewa Imulungu yawatende mwengezeke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:14">yawatende mwengezeke mweye na ulelo wenu.<verse eid="PSA 115:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 115:15"/>Mndewa Imulungu yalumbile ulanga na isi yawatendele ganogile.<verse eid="PSA 115:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 115:16"/>Ulanga wake Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:16">ila isi kawagwaa iwanhu.<verse eid="PSA 115:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 115:17"/>Iwanhu wafile hawamtogola Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:17">awo iwanhu ochola mwiisi ya kunyamala tuluu.<verse eid="PSA 115:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 115:18"/>Ila siye tuli wagima tomtogola Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:18">tomtogola sambi na milele.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 115:18"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:18">Mndewa Imulungu yatogolwe.<verse eid="PSA 115:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 115"/>
  <chapter number="116" style="c" sid="PSA 116"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 116</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 116:1"/>Nomnogela Mndewa Imulungu kwavija konihulika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:1">kanihulika vinimpulile yanyonele bazi.<verse eid="PSA 116:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 116:2"/>Kwavija kahinduka yanitegeleze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:2">avo nomkema heyo siku zose za ugima wangu.<verse eid="PSA 116:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 116:3"/>Nzabi za ifa zinizunguluka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:3">bwembwe da ifa dingubika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:3">nimema magazo na usungu.<verse eid="PSA 116:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 116:4"/>Abaho nipula kwa twaga da Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:4">“Go Mndewa Imulungu, chonde mhonye!”<verse eid="PSA 116:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 116:5"/>Mndewa Imulungu kana moyo unogile na kana haki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:5">Imulungu wetu kamema bazi.<verse eid="PSA 116:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 116:6"/>Mndewa Imulungu kowakaliza wanyunyuwale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:6">viwanyonele kanikombola.<verse eid="PSA 116:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 116:7"/>Gweye moyo wangu bwihila kabili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:7">kwavija Mndewa Imulungu kanitendela ganogile.<verse eid="PSA 116:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 116:8"/>Kwavija gweye Mndewa Imulungu kumhonya na ifa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:8">na kuhangusa mahozi gangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:8">kunihonya sikuniikwale mmagulu.<verse eid="PSA 116:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 116:9"/>Notembela kuulongozi wa Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:9">mwiisi ya iwanhu wagima.<verse eid="PSA 116:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 116:10"/>Nimtamanila Mndewa Imulungu vinongile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:10">“Niye nigazika ng'hani.”<verse eid="PSA 116:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 116:11"/>Vivija nilonga kwa bwembwe jangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:11">“Wanhu wose wavizi.”<verse eid="PSA 116:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 116:12"/>Nimbwezele choni Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:12">kwa ganogile gose gayanhendele?<verse eid="PSA 116:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 116:13"/>Nomulavila nhosa ya divai kwa kunikombola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:13">nopula kwa twaga da Mndewa Imulungu.<verse eid="PSA 116:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 116:14"/>Nomvikizila Mndewa Imulungu gaja ganilongile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:14">kuulongozi wa iwanhu wake wose.<verse eid="PSA 116:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 116:15"/>Ifa ya iwanhu omtamanila Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:15">siyo mbuli ndodo mgameso gake.<verse eid="PSA 116:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 116:16"/>Go Mndewa Imulungu, niye na msang'hanaji wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:16">niye msang'hanaji wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:16">mwana wa mtumwa wako, kunifungula nzabi.<verse eid="PSA 116:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 116:17"/>Nokulavila nhosa ya kushukulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:17">na nopula kwa twaga da Mndewa Imulungu.<verse eid="PSA 116:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 116:18"/>Nigavikiza gaja gose ganongile kwa Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:18">kuulongozi wa iwanhu wake wose,<verse eid="PSA 116:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 116:19"/>waiting'hane muuluwa lwa Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:19">mgati yako gweye Yelusalemu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 116:19"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:19">Mndewa Imulungu yatogolwe.<verse eid="PSA 116:19"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 116"/>
  <chapter number="117" style="c" sid="PSA 117"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 117</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 117:1"/>Mweye isi zose mtogoleni Mndewa Imulungu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 117:1">Mweye wanhu wose mwinuleni heyo.<verse eid="PSA 117:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 117:2"/>Kwavija unogelo wake hawishaga kumwetu siye mkulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 117:2">na kutamanilwa kwa Mndewa Imulungu kokala milele!</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 117:2"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 117:2">Mndewa Imulungu yatogolwe.<verse eid="PSA 117:2"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 117"/>
  <chapter number="118" style="c" sid="PSA 118"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 118</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 118:1"/>Mshukuluni Mndewa Imulungu kwavija kanoga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:1">na unogelo wake hawishaga osigala milele.<verse eid="PSA 118:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 118:2"/>Wanhu wa Izilaeli walonge,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:2">“Unogelo wake hawishaga osigala milele.”<verse eid="PSA 118:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 118:3"/>Wanhu wa ulelo wa Haluni walonge,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:3">“Unogelo wake hawishaga osigala milele.”<verse eid="PSA 118:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 118:4"/>Wanhu omdumba Mndewa Imulungu walonge,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:4">“Unogelo wake hawishaga osigala milele.”<verse eid="PSA 118:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 118:5"/>Mmagazo gangu nimpula Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:5">heyo kanihulika na kandekesa.<verse eid="PSA 118:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 118:6"/>Mndewa Imulungu kahamoja na niye, sidumba kinhu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:6">Munhu konitenda choni?<verse eid="PSA 118:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 118:7"/>Mndewa Imulungu kahamoja na niye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:7">heyo konitaza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:7">iwanhu onihila nowona ohumwa.<verse eid="PSA 118:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 118:8"/>Vinoga kumkimbilila Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:8">kubanza kuwatamanila wanhu.<verse eid="PSA 118:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 118:9"/>Vinoga kumkimbilila Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:9">kubanza kuwatamanila iwakulu wa mwiisi ino.<verse eid="PSA 118:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 118:10"/>Iwanhu wa isi zose wanizunguluka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:10">lakini kwa twaga da Mndewa Imulungu niwakanha wose.<verse eid="PSA 118:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 118:11"/>Wanizunguluka kila mwambu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:11">lakini kwa twaga da Mndewa Imulungu niwakanha wose.<verse eid="PSA 118:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 118:12"/>Wanimemela kamba nyuki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:12">lakini wasakazwa kamba miba ilukule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:12">kwa twaga da Mndewa Imulungu niwakanha wose.<verse eid="PSA 118:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 118:13"/>Nisung'higwa kuchugu na nilonda kugwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:13">lakini Mndewa Imulungu kanitaza.<verse eid="PSA 118:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 118:14"/>Mndewa Imulungu ayo nguvu yangu na lwila lwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:14">heyo ayo ukombola wangu.<verse eid="PSA 118:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 118:15"/>Sauti za deng'ho zohulikigwa mvibanda va iwanhu wene haki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:15">“Mkono wa ukudila wa Mndewa Imulungu utenda mbuli ng'hulu!<verse eid="PSA 118:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 118:16"/>Mkono wa ukudila wa Mndewa Imulungu uhuma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:16">mkono wa ukudila wa Mndewa Imulungu utenda mbuli ng'hulu!”<verse eid="PSA 118:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 118:17"/>Sidanganika bule ila nokala mgima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:17">na nogasimulila gaja gayatendile Mndewa Imulungu.<verse eid="PSA 118:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 118:18"/>Mndewa Imulungu kanikoboza ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:18">lakini handekile nife.<verse eid="PSA 118:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 118:19"/>Nivugulileni imilango ya haki ya ng'anda ya Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:19">niye nokwingila na nomshukulu Mndewa Imulungu.<verse eid="PSA 118:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 118:20"/>Uno awo mulango wa Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:20">wanhu wene haki obitila mumo.<verse eid="PSA 118:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 118:21"/>Nokushukulu kwavija kunidika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:21">gweye kwa ukombola wangu.<verse eid="PSA 118:21"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 118:22"/>Dibwe dilemigwe na wazengaji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:22">diwa dibwe kulu da chandusilo.<verse eid="PSA 118:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 118:23"/>Mbuli ayo kaitenda Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:23">na siye yotukanganya.<verse eid="PSA 118:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 118:24"/>Ino ayo siku yaitendile Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:24">tudeng'helele na kusekelela.<verse eid="PSA 118:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 118:25"/>Go Mndewa Imulungu, tukombole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:25">go Mndewa Imulungu, ututende tumwede.<verse eid="PSA 118:25"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 118:26"/>Yamwede ayo yokwiza kwa twaga da Mndewa Imulungu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:26">Kulawa mng'anda ya Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:26">tokugwaa nhogolwa.<verse eid="PSA 118:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 118:27"/>Mndewa Imulungu ayo Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:27">kautenda mulangaza wake umwemwese kumwetu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:27">Gogeni mibunho ya nyimwilinyimwili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:27">muchole mbaka muupango wa nhosa.<verse eid="PSA 118:27"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 118:28"/>Gweye kwa Imulungu wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:28">na niye nokushukulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:28">gweye kwa Imulungu wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:28">na niye nokwinula.<verse eid="PSA 118:28"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 118:29"/>Mshukuluni Mndewa Imulungu kwavija kanoga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:29">na unogelo wake hawishaga osigala milele.<verse eid="PSA 118:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 118"/>
  <chapter number="119" style="c" sid="PSA 119"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 119</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 119:1"/>Wamweda iwanhu okala bila kitala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:1">awo ogagoga malagizo ga Mndewa Imulungu.<verse eid="PSA 119:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 119:2"/>Wamweda iwanhu ozigoga amuli zake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:2">awo omzahila kwa mizoyo yao yose.<verse eid="PSA 119:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 119:3"/>Awo hawatenda gehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:3">okweleleza nzila za Mndewa Imulungu.<verse eid="PSA 119:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 119:4"/>Gweye kutugwaa usi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:4">ili siye tuugoge ng'hani.<verse eid="PSA 119:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 119:5"/>Nolonda nzila zangu zikale goya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:5">nigagoge malagizo gako.<verse eid="PSA 119:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 119:6"/>Abaho niye sigwa kinyala bule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:6">nahagagelegeza malagizo gako gose.<verse eid="PSA 119:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 119:7"/>Nokushukulu kwa moyo unogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:7">nahaifunza nhaguso za haki yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 119:8"/>Nogagoga malagizo gako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:8">sikuundeke hata kidogo.<verse eid="PSA 119:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 119:9"/>Koigendeleza vilihi mbwanga nzila yake ing'ale?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:9">Kwa kutegeleza na kukweleleza mbuli yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 119:10"/>Kwa moyo wangu wose nikuzahila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:10">sikuundeke nyage kutali na malagizo gako.<verse eid="PSA 119:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 119:11"/>Mmoyo wangu niika mbuli yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:11">ili sikunikutende nzambi.<verse eid="PSA 119:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 119:12"/>Go Mndewa Imulungu, utogolwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:12">unifunze malagizo gako.<verse eid="PSA 119:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 119:13"/>Kwa mulomo wangu nolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:13">nhaguso zose za mulomo wako.<verse eid="PSA 119:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 119:14"/>Nodeng'helela kukweleleza amuli zako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:14">kamba munhu kuwa na mali nyingi.<verse eid="PSA 119:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 119:15"/>Noifunza malagizo gako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:15">nogagelegeza goya mafundizo gako.<verse eid="PSA 119:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 119:16"/>Nogadeng'helela malagizo gako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:16">siisemwa mbuli yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 119:17"/>Unitendele ganogile niye msang'hanaji wako vivino vinili mgima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:17">ili niigoge mbuli yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 119:18"/>Ugafumbule meso gangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:18">ili niulole unzonza wa malagizo gako.<verse eid="PSA 119:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 119:19"/>Niye na mgeni hano mwiisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:19">sikuunifise malagizo gako.<verse eid="PSA 119:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 119:20"/>Loho yangu yoluma siku zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:20">kwa kusulukila malagizo gako.<verse eid="PSA 119:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 119:21"/>Gweye kowakomhokela awo oitapaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:21">waduwiligwa iwanhu ogaleka malagizo gako.<verse eid="PSA 119:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 119:22"/>Nisegesele bezi na maligo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:22">kwavija nizigoga amuli zako.<verse eid="PSA 119:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 119:23"/>Hata kamba iwakulu okala kiseto mbuli yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:23">niye msang'hanaji wako nogagelegeza malagizo gako.<verse eid="PSA 119:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 119:24"/>Amuli zako azo deng'ho jangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:24">azo zingwaa magesa.<verse eid="PSA 119:24"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 119:25"/>Loho yangu igogwa na timbwisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:25">unigwelele ugima kamba vuulongile kotenda.<verse eid="PSA 119:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 119:26"/>Nikusimulila nzila zangu na gweye kunidika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:26">nifunze malagizo gako.<verse eid="PSA 119:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 119:27"/>Nifunze avija vilondigwa kugoga nzila zako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:27">na niye nozigelegeza sang'hano zako ng'hulu.<verse eid="PSA 119:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 119:28"/>Nidonha kwa usungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:28">unibwezele nguvu kamba vuulongile kotenda.<verse eid="PSA 119:28"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 119:29"/>Unisegesele nzila za uvizi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:29">unifunze malagizo gako kwa bazi.<verse eid="PSA 119:29"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 119:30"/>Nisagula nzila ya kutamanilwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:30">nigagoga malagizo gako.<verse eid="PSA 119:30"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 119:31"/>Nizifagatila amuli zako gweye Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:31">sikuundeke nigwe kinyala.<verse eid="PSA 119:31"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 119:32"/>Nokweleleza malagizo gako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:32">kwavija konigwaa nzewele ng'hani.<verse eid="PSA 119:32"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 119:33"/>Go Mndewa Imulungu, unifunze kugagoga malagizo gako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:33">na niye nogagoga mbaka kuuhelelo.<verse eid="PSA 119:33"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 119:34"/>Ngwelele nzewele ili nigagoge malagizo gako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:34">nigagoge kwa moyo wangu wose.<verse eid="PSA 119:34"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 119:35"/>Nilongoze mnzila ya malagizo gako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:35">kwavija kulawa mumo nodeng'helela.<verse eid="PSA 119:35"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 119:36"/>Ubidule moyo wangu ukweleleze amuli zako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:36">na sikunilonde uzulumati.<verse eid="PSA 119:36"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 119:37"/>Uhindule meso gangu sikunilole avija havifaya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:37">unigwelele ugima mnzila yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:37"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 119:38"/>Ugavikize gaja gaulongile kwa msang'hanaji wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:38">gaja gouwagwelela waja okudumba.<verse eid="PSA 119:38"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 119:39"/>Unisegesele maligo gonidumba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:39">kwavija malagizo gako ganoga.<verse eid="PSA 119:39"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 119:40"/>Nosulukila kugagoga malagizo gako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:40">unigwelele ugima kwa haki yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:40"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 119:41"/>Go Mndewa Imulungu, unogelo wako hawishaga unizile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:41">unikombole kamba vuulongile,<verse eid="PSA 119:41"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 119:42"/>na niye nomwidika ayo yoniliga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:42">kwavija notamanila mbuli yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:42"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 119:43"/>Unitende nilonge ukweli wako siku zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:43">kwavija notamanila malagizo gako.<verse eid="PSA 119:43"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="PSA 119:44"/>Nogagoga malagizo gako siku zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:44">ona, nogagoga siku zose na milele.<verse eid="PSA 119:44"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="PSA 119:45"/>Na niye notembela kwa nyafasi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:45">kwavija niifunza usi wako.<verse eid="PSA 119:45"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="PSA 119:46"/>Nozilonga amuli zako kuulongozi wa iwandewa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:46">na sikona kinyala bule.<verse eid="PSA 119:46"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="PSA 119:47"/>Na niye nodeng'helela mmalagizo gako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:47">gago niganogela.<verse eid="PSA 119:47"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="PSA 119:48"/>Nosulukila malagizo gako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:48">gago niganogela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:48">na nogagelegeza mafundizo gako.<verse eid="PSA 119:48"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="PSA 119:49"/>Kumbuka mbuli yako kwa msang'hanaji wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:49">kwavija kunigwaa tamanilo.<verse eid="PSA 119:49"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="PSA 119:50"/>Deng'ho jangu mmagazo gangu ajo dino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:50">gaja gaulongile gonigwaa ugima.<verse eid="PSA 119:50"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="PSA 119:51"/>Iwanhu oitapa onibezeli siku zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:51">ila niye sigaleka malagizo gako.<verse eid="PSA 119:51"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="PSA 119:52"/>Go Mndewa Imulungu, nogakumbuka malagizo gako ga umwaka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:52">gago gouhoza moyo wangu.<verse eid="PSA 119:52"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="PSA 119:53"/>Nogevuzika ng'hani mbuli ya iwanhu wehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:53">awo wagalekile malagizo gako.<verse eid="PSA 119:53"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="PSA 119:54"/>Malagizo gako awo lwila wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:54">hohose honda nikale.<verse eid="PSA 119:54"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="PSA 119:55"/>Go Mndewa Imulungu, ikilo nodikumbuka twaga jako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:55">na niye nogagoga malagizo gako.<verse eid="PSA 119:55"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="PSA 119:56"/>Ganogile gano geza kumwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:56">kwavija nigagoga malagizo gako.<verse eid="PSA 119:56"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="PSA 119:57"/>Mndewa Imulungu ayo fungu jangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:57">nolonga kamba noigoga mbuli yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:57"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="PSA 119:58"/>Nikuzahila gweye kwa moyo wangu wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:58">unyonele bazi kamba vuulongile kotenda.<verse eid="PSA 119:58"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="PSA 119:59"/>Nizigelegeza nzila zangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:59">na niye nibwela nikweleleza amuli zako.<verse eid="PSA 119:59"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="PSA 119:60"/>Nilopola na sikawile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:60">kugagoga malagizo gako.<verse eid="PSA 119:60"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="PSA 119:61"/>Hata kamba iwanhu wehile onifunga kwa nzabi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:61">sigasemwa malagizo gako.<verse eid="PSA 119:61"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="PSA 119:62"/>Kilo kikulu nolamuka na nokugwaa nhogolwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:62">mbuli ya nhaguso zako za haki.<verse eid="PSA 119:62"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="PSA 119:63"/>Niye na mbwiga wa wose okudumba gweye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:63">wose okweleleza malagizo gako.<verse eid="PSA 119:63"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="PSA 119:64"/>Go Mndewa Imulungu, isi yose imema unogelo wako hawishaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:64">unifunze malagizo gako.<verse eid="PSA 119:64"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="PSA 119:65"/>Go Mndewa Imulungu, kunitendela ganogile niye msang'hanaji wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:65">kamba vuulongile kotenda.<verse eid="PSA 119:65"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="PSA 119:66"/>Nifunze nzewele na magesa ganogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:66">kwavija notamanila malagizo gako.<verse eid="PSA 119:66"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="PSA 119:67"/>Ning'hali sinadununzwa niye ng'hala nyagile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:67">lakini sambi niigoga mbuli yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:67"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="PSA 119:68"/>Gweye kunoga na kotenda ganogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:68">nifunze malagizo gako.<verse eid="PSA 119:68"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="PSA 119:69"/>Iwanhu oitapa olonga uvizi kumwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:69">lakini niye nogagoga malagizo gako kwa moyo wangu wose.<verse eid="PSA 119:69"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="PSA 119:70"/>Mizoyo yao haigesa ga wanhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:70">lakini niye nodeng'helela malagizo gako.<verse eid="PSA 119:70"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="PSA 119:71"/>Vinoga kumwangu kamba nigazika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:71">avo niifunza malagizo gako.<verse eid="PSA 119:71"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="PSA 119:72"/>Malagizo gako ganoga kumwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:72">kubanza maelufu ga zahabu na shaba.<verse eid="PSA 119:72"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="PSA 119:73"/>Makono gako ganilumba na ganizenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:73">unigwelele nzewele niifunze malagizo gako.<verse eid="PSA 119:73"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="PSA 119:74"/>Wanhu okudumba gweye wanilole na kudeng'helela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:74">kwavija nitamanila mbuli yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:74"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="75" style="v" sid="PSA 119:75"/>Go Mndewa Imulungu, notanga kamba gweye kotagusa kwa haki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:75">kwa kutamanilwa kwako kunikoboza.<verse eid="PSA 119:75"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="76" style="v" sid="PSA 119:76"/>Nopula unogelo wako hawishaga unihoze umoyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:76">kamba vuulongile kwa msang'hanaji wako.<verse eid="PSA 119:76"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="77" style="v" sid="PSA 119:77"/>Bazi jako dinizile ili mhate ugima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:77">kwavija malagizo gako ajo deng'ho jangu.<verse eid="PSA 119:77"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="78" style="v" sid="PSA 119:78"/>Wanhu oitapa wone kinyala kwavija wanideta kwa uvizi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:78">lakini niye nogagelegeza malagizo gako.<verse eid="PSA 119:78"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="79" style="v" sid="PSA 119:79"/>Iwanhu okudumba gweye wanibwelele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:79">awo ozijuwa amuli zako.<verse eid="PSA 119:79"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="80" style="v" sid="PSA 119:80"/>Moyo wangu utelele kwa kugoga malagizo gako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:80">ili sikunigwe kinyala.<verse eid="PSA 119:80"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="81" style="v" sid="PSA 119:81"/>Loho yangu yosulukila ukombola wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:81">notamanila mbuli yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:81"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="82" style="v" sid="PSA 119:82"/>Meso gangu hagalola goya kwa kugabeta gaja gaulongile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:82">nilonga, “Gweye konihoza umoyo lini?”<verse eid="PSA 119:82"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="83" style="v" sid="PSA 119:83"/>Hamoja niwa kamba mfuko wa ng'hwembe unyalile mdiyosi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:83">lakini sigalekile malagizo gako.<verse eid="PSA 119:83"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="84" style="v" sid="PSA 119:84"/>Msang'hanaji wako kokala miyaka mingahi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:84">Lini kowatagusa iwanhu onidununza?<verse eid="PSA 119:84"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="85" style="v" sid="PSA 119:85"/>Wanhu oitapa wanihimbila simo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:85">awo iwanhu hawagakweleleza malagizo gako.<verse eid="PSA 119:85"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="86" style="v" sid="PSA 119:86"/>Malagizo gako gose ga kweli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:86">unitaze kwavija wanhu onigaza bila kitala chochose.<verse eid="PSA 119:86"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="87" style="v" sid="PSA 119:87"/>Wakala behi kunibananga mwiisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:87">ila sigalekile malagizo gako.<verse eid="PSA 119:87"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="88" style="v" sid="PSA 119:88"/>Ukalize ugima wangu kwa unogelo wako hawishaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:88">ili niye nizigoge amuli za mulomo wako.<verse eid="PSA 119:88"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="89" style="v" sid="PSA 119:89"/>Go Mndewa Imulungu, mbuli yako yosigala milele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:89">yosigala milele ako kuulanga.<verse eid="PSA 119:89"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="90" style="v" sid="PSA 119:90"/>Kutamanilwa kwako kosigala ulelo mbaka ulelo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:90">kuika isi hanhu hake nayo yosigala baho.<verse eid="PSA 119:90"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="91" style="v" sid="PSA 119:91"/>Kwa lagizo jako vinhu vose vosigala mbaka lelo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:91">kwavija vinhu vose vokusang'hanila gweye.<verse eid="PSA 119:91"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="92" style="v" sid="PSA 119:92"/>Maza malagizo gako hagakuwile deng'ho jangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:92">baho nahadanganike kwa magazo.<verse eid="PSA 119:92"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="93" style="v" sid="PSA 119:93"/>Milele siisemwa malagizo gako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:93">kwavija kubitila gago kunigwaa ugima.<verse eid="PSA 119:93"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="94" style="v" sid="PSA 119:94"/>Niye wako gweye, unikombole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:94">kwavija nigeza kugoga malagizo gako.<verse eid="PSA 119:94"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="95" style="v" sid="PSA 119:95"/>Wanhu wehile onisepa ili wanikome,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:95">ila niye nozigelegeza amuli zako.<verse eid="PSA 119:95"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="96" style="v" sid="PSA 119:96"/>Nitanga kamba kila kinhu chohuhwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:96">ila malagizo gako hagahuhwa.<verse eid="PSA 119:96"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="97" style="v" sid="PSA 119:97"/>Malagizo gako nogalonda ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:97">nogagelegeza imisi yose.<verse eid="PSA 119:97"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="98" style="v" sid="PSA 119:98"/>Malagizo gako gokala na niye milele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:98">gonigwaa ubala kubanza iwanhu onihila.<verse eid="PSA 119:98"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="99" style="v" sid="PSA 119:99"/>Notanga ng'hani kubanza wose wanifunzile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:99">kwavija nozigelegeza amuli zako.<verse eid="PSA 119:99"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="100" style="v" sid="PSA 119:100"/>Niye na mbala kubanza iwavele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:100">kwavija nogagoga gaja goulonga.<verse eid="PSA 119:100"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="101" style="v" sid="PSA 119:101"/>Niigomesa mwenyego sikunitende gehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:101">ili niigoge mbuli yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:101"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="102" style="v" sid="PSA 119:102"/>Sigalekile malagizo gako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:102">kwavija gweye mwenyego kunifunza.<verse eid="PSA 119:102"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="103" style="v" sid="PSA 119:103"/>Mbuli zako zamulile ng'hani kumwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:103">ona zamulile kubanza uki.<verse eid="PSA 119:103"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="104" style="v" sid="PSA 119:104"/>Kubitila malagizo gako nopata nzewele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:104">avo nogehila gaja ga uvizi.<verse eid="PSA 119:104"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="105" style="v" sid="PSA 119:105"/>Mbuli yako ayo taa ya magulu gangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:105">na mulenge mnzila yangu.<verse eid="PSA 119:105"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="106" style="v" sid="PSA 119:106"/>Niiduwila na nogavikiza gaja ganilongile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:106">kamba nogagoga malagizo gako ga haki.<verse eid="PSA 119:106"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="107" style="v" sid="PSA 119:107"/>Go Mndewa Imulungu, nogaya ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:107">unigwelele ugima kamba vuulongile.<verse eid="PSA 119:107"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="108" style="v" sid="PSA 119:108"/>Go Mndewa Imulungu, utogole kupula kwangu kwa kushukulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:108">na unifunze malagizo gako.<verse eid="PSA 119:108"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="109" style="v" sid="PSA 119:109"/>Ugima wangu wamdizumozumo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:109">lakini sigasemwa malagizo gako.<verse eid="PSA 119:109"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="110" style="v" sid="PSA 119:110"/>Wanhu wehile wanitegela mitego,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:110">ila sigaleka gaja gaulongile.<verse eid="PSA 119:110"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="111" style="v" sid="PSA 119:111"/>Amuli zako awo uhazi wangu milele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:111">ajo deng'ho da moyo wangu.<verse eid="PSA 119:111"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="112" style="v" sid="PSA 119:112"/>Nisagula kulawa mmoyo wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:112">kugagoga malagizo gako milele.<verse eid="PSA 119:112"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="113" style="v" sid="PSA 119:113"/>Nowehila iwanhu watapitapi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:113">ila noganogela malagizo gako.<verse eid="PSA 119:113"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="114" style="v" sid="PSA 119:114"/>Gweye kwa ngao yangu, kumwako nokimbilila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:114">nodika tamanilo jangu mmbuli yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:114"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="115" style="v" sid="PSA 119:115"/>Segeleni kumwangu mweye iwanhu wehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:115">ili nigagoge malagizo ga Imulungu wangu.<verse eid="PSA 119:115"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="116" style="v" sid="PSA 119:116"/>Unigangamize kamba vuulongile na niye nokuwa mgima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:116">sikuutogole mhate kinyala mditamanilo jangu.<verse eid="PSA 119:116"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="117" style="v" sid="PSA 119:117"/>Unigoge ng'hale goya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:117">siku zose nigategeleze malagizo gako.<verse eid="PSA 119:117"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="118" style="v" sid="PSA 119:118"/>Gweye kowalema wose ogaleka malagizo gako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:118">avo ogaya bule kuviza.<verse eid="PSA 119:118"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="119" style="v" sid="PSA 119:119"/>Wanhu wose wehile kuwasegesa kamba mikupi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:119">avo niye nozinogela amuli zako.<verse eid="PSA 119:119"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="120" style="v" sid="PSA 119:120"/>Nogwaya kwa kukudumba gweye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:120">nimema bwembwe kwa nhaguso zako.<verse eid="PSA 119:120"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="121" style="v" sid="PSA 119:121"/>Nitenda ganogile na ga haki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:121">sikuundeke mmakono ga iwanhu onihila.<verse eid="PSA 119:121"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="122" style="v" sid="PSA 119:122"/>Unizamini niye msang'hanaji wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:122">sikuuleke iwanhu oitapa wanyonele.<verse eid="PSA 119:122"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="123" style="v" sid="PSA 119:123"/>Meso gangu gavulala kwa kubeta ukombola wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:123">nobeta uvikize gaja gaulongile.<verse eid="PSA 119:123"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="124" style="v" sid="PSA 119:124"/>Unitendele niye msang'hanaji wako kamba unogelo wako hawishaga viwili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:124">na unifunze malagizo gako.<verse eid="PSA 119:124"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="125" style="v" sid="PSA 119:125"/>Niye na msang'hanaji wako, unigwelele nzewele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:125">ili nizijuwe amuli zako.<verse eid="PSA 119:125"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="126" style="v" sid="PSA 119:126"/>Go Mndewa Imulungu, sambi acho kipindi cha kutenda kinhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:126">kwavija wanhu obena malagizo gako.<verse eid="PSA 119:126"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="127" style="v" sid="PSA 119:127"/>Niye noganogela malagizo gako kubanza zahabu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:127">ona kubanza zahabu ing'ala ng'hani.<verse eid="PSA 119:127"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="128" style="v" sid="PSA 119:128"/>Avo, nogoga malagizo gako gose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:128">nogehila gaja ga uvizi.<verse eid="PSA 119:128"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="129" style="v" sid="PSA 119:129"/>Amuli zako za unzonza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:129">avo nozigoga kwa moyo wose.<verse eid="PSA 119:129"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="130" style="v" sid="PSA 119:130"/>Kusimulila malagizo gako kogala mulenge,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:130">kowagwaa nzewele iwanhu mizozolo.<verse eid="PSA 119:130"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="131" style="v" sid="PSA 119:131"/>Nofungula mulomo na nosulukila kamba umbwa mwene ng'hilu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:131">kwavija nogalonda ng'hani malagizo gako.<verse eid="PSA 119:131"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="132" style="v" sid="PSA 119:132"/>Unibwelele na unyonele bazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:132">kamba vuuwatendela iwanhu odinogela twaga jako.<verse eid="PSA 119:132"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="133" style="v" sid="PSA 119:133"/>Uzigoge hatua zangu kamba vuulongile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:133">sikuutogole gehile ganilongoze.<verse eid="PSA 119:133"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="134" style="v" sid="PSA 119:134"/>Unikombole na uzulumati wa iwanhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:134">ili nigagoge malagizo gako.<verse eid="PSA 119:134"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="135" style="v" sid="PSA 119:135"/>Unimwemwesele kihanga chako niye msang'hanaji wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:135">na unifunze malagizo gako.<verse eid="PSA 119:135"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="136" style="v" sid="PSA 119:136"/>Meso gangu kolava mahozi kamba lwanda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:136">kwavija wanhu hawagagoga malagizo gako.<verse eid="PSA 119:136"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="137" style="v" sid="PSA 119:137"/>Go Mndewa Imulungu, gweye kwa mwene haki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:137">na nhaguso zako za haki.<verse eid="PSA 119:137"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="138" style="v" sid="PSA 119:138"/>Amuli zako zuulavile za haki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:138">na zotamaniligwa ng'hani.<verse eid="PSA 119:138"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="139" style="v" sid="PSA 119:139"/>Unogelo wangu kumwako onitenda nyone usungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:139">kwavija wanhu onihila hawazigelegeza mbuli zako.<verse eid="PSA 119:139"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="140" style="v" sid="PSA 119:140"/>Gaja gaulongile gang'ala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:140">na niye msang'hanaji wako nogalonda ng'hani.<verse eid="PSA 119:140"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="141" style="v" sid="PSA 119:141"/>Niye na mdodo na onibezeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:141">ila sigasemwa malagizo gako.<verse eid="PSA 119:141"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="142" style="v" sid="PSA 119:142"/>Haki yako inoga milele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:142">na malagizo gako ga ukweli.<verse eid="PSA 119:142"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="143" style="v" sid="PSA 119:143"/>Magazo na giogio vingoga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:143">lakini malagizo gako dijo deng'ho jangu.<verse eid="PSA 119:143"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="144" style="v" sid="PSA 119:144"/>Milele amuli zako za haki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:144">unigwelele nzewele ili ng'hale mgima.<verse eid="PSA 119:144"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="145" style="v" sid="PSA 119:145"/>Nokulilila kwa moyo wangu wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:145">unidike gweye Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:145">na niye nogagoga malagizo gako.<verse eid="PSA 119:145"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="146" style="v" sid="PSA 119:146"/>Nokulilila unikombole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:146">na niye nozigoga amuli zako.<verse eid="PSA 119:146"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="147" style="v" sid="PSA 119:147"/>Usiku ung'hali haunakucha nolamuka na nokupula unitaze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:147">notamanila mbuli zako.<verse eid="PSA 119:147"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="148" style="v" sid="PSA 119:148"/>Nokala meso ikilo chose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:148">ili nigelegeze mbuli yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:148"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="149" style="v" sid="PSA 119:149"/>Go Mndewa Imulungu, kwa unogelo wako hawishaga unitegeleze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:149">ukalize ugima wangu kwa haki yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:149"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="150" style="v" sid="PSA 119:150"/>Awo wehile onikwesela behi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:150">ila wakutali na malagizo gako.<verse eid="PSA 119:150"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="151" style="v" sid="PSA 119:151"/>Lakini gweye Mndewa Imulungu kwa behi na niye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:151">na malagizo gako gose ga ukweli.<verse eid="PSA 119:151"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="152" style="v" sid="PSA 119:152"/>Tangu umwaka niifunza amuli zako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:152">azo ziwikile zisigale milele.<verse eid="PSA 119:152"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="153" style="v" sid="PSA 119:153"/>Ulole magazo gangu na unikombole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:153">kwavija sigasemwile malagizo gako.<verse eid="PSA 119:153"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="154" style="v" sid="PSA 119:154"/>Unigombele na unikombole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:154">ukalize ugima wangu kamba vuulongile.<verse eid="PSA 119:154"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="155" style="v" sid="PSA 119:155"/>Wanhu wehile hawakomboligwa ng'o,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:155">kwavija hawageza kugoga malagizo gako.<verse eid="PSA 119:155"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="156" style="v" sid="PSA 119:156"/>Go Mndewa Imulungu, gweye kumema bazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:156">ukalize ugima wangu kamba vuulongile.<verse eid="PSA 119:156"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="157" style="v" sid="PSA 119:157"/>Iwanhu onidununza na onihila wengi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:157">lakini niye sizileka amuli zako.<verse eid="PSA 119:157"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="158" style="v" sid="PSA 119:158"/>Nowalola iwanhu hawatamanilwa na nowehila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:158">kwavija hawagagoga malagizo gako.<verse eid="PSA 119:158"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="159" style="v" sid="PSA 119:159"/>Lola go Mndewa Imulungu, vinigalonda malagizo gako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:159">ukalize ugima wangu kamba unogelo wako hawishaga viwili.<verse eid="PSA 119:159"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="160" style="v" sid="PSA 119:160"/>Gose kwa gose kwa mbuli yako awo ukweli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:160">malagizo gako gose ga haki na gosigala milele.<verse eid="PSA 119:160"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="161" style="v" sid="PSA 119:161"/>Iwakulu wanidununza bila kitala chochose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:161">lakini niye noidumba mbuli yako kwa moyo wangu wose.<verse eid="PSA 119:161"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="162" style="v" sid="PSA 119:162"/>Noideng'helela mbuli yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:162">kamba munhu yapatile kinhu cha bei ng'hulu.<verse eid="PSA 119:162"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="163" style="v" sid="PSA 119:163"/>Nowihila ng'hani uvizi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:163">lakini noganogela malagizo gako.<verse eid="PSA 119:163"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="164" style="v" sid="PSA 119:164"/>Nokutogola miyanza saba kwa siku dimoja,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:164">kwavija malagizo gako ga haki.<verse eid="PSA 119:164"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="165" style="v" sid="PSA 119:165"/>Awo oganogela malagizo gako wamema tindiwalo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:165">haduhu kinhu chonda kiwagwise.<verse eid="PSA 119:165"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="166" style="v" sid="PSA 119:166"/>Go Mndewa Imulungu, nokubeta unikombole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:166">niye nogoga malagizo gako.<verse eid="PSA 119:166"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="167" style="v" sid="PSA 119:167"/>Moyo wangu uzigoga amuli zako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:167">nozinogela kwa moyo wangu wose.<verse eid="PSA 119:167"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="168" style="v" sid="PSA 119:168"/>Nigagoga malagizo gako na amuli zako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:168">gweye kuzijuwa nzila zangu zose.<verse eid="PSA 119:168"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="169" style="v" sid="PSA 119:169"/>Kililo changu kivike kumwako gweye Mndewa Imulungu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:169">Unigwelele nzewele kamba vuulongile.<verse eid="PSA 119:169"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="170" style="v" sid="PSA 119:170"/>Kupula kwangu kuvike kumwako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:170">unikombole kamba vuulongile.<verse eid="PSA 119:170"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="171" style="v" sid="PSA 119:171"/>Nolonga nhogolwa zako siku zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:171">kwavija konifunza malagizo gako.<verse eid="PSA 119:171"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="172" style="v" sid="PSA 119:172"/>Lulimi lwangu lokwimba kwa mbuli yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:172">kwavija malagizo gako gose ga haki.<verse eid="PSA 119:172"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="173" style="v" sid="PSA 119:173"/>Siku zose ulonde kunitaza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:173">kwavija nisagula kugoga mafundizo gako.<verse eid="PSA 119:173"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="174" style="v" sid="PSA 119:174"/>Go Mndewa Imulungu, nosulukila ng'hani unikombole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:174">malagizo gako dijo deng'ho jangu.<verse eid="PSA 119:174"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="175" style="v" sid="PSA 119:175"/>Leka niwe mgima na nikutogole gweye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:175">na malagizo gako ganitaze.<verse eid="PSA 119:175"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="176" style="v" sid="PSA 119:176"/>Niwa tanga nzulule kamba ng'hondolo yagile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:176">wize unizahile niye msang'hanaji wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:176">kwavija sigasemwile malagizo gako.<verse eid="PSA 119:176"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 119"/>
  <chapter number="120" style="c" sid="PSA 120"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 120</para>
  <para style="d">(Lwila lwa kuchola uchanha.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 120:1"/>Mmagazo gangu nimkema Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 120:1">na heyo kanidika.<verse eid="PSA 120:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 120:2"/>Unikombole go Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 120:2">kulawa kwa wanhu wavizi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 120:2">na kulawa kwa iwanhu owabunyika wayao.<verse eid="PSA 120:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 120:3"/>Mweye wanhu wavizi, mugweleligwe choni?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 120:3">Mwengezeligwe choni?<verse eid="PSA 120:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 120:4"/>Imulungu kowatagusa kwa misale mikali ya wakalizi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 120:4">kowatagusa kwa makala ga msagati.<verse eid="PSA 120:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 120:5"/>Nogaya niye kamba nokala Mesheki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 120:5">nokala kamba munhu baki mmahema ga lukolo lwa Kedali.<verse eid="PSA 120:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 120:6"/>Ng'hala nao kwa kipindi kitali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 120:6">waja odihila tindiwalo.<verse eid="PSA 120:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 120:7"/>Niye na munhu wa tindiwalo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 120:7">lakini nahalonga hewo olonda ng'hondo.<verse eid="PSA 120:7"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 120"/>
  <chapter number="121" style="c" sid="PSA 121"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 121</para>
  <para style="d">(Lwila lwa kuchola uchanha.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 121:1"/>Nogenula meso gangu uchanha ndole vigongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 121:1">kutazigwa kwangu kolawa kwahi?<verse eid="PSA 121:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 121:2"/>Kutazigwa kwangu kolawa kwa Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 121:2">yalumbile ulanga na isi yose.<verse eid="PSA 121:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 121:3"/>Honda yakuleke ugwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 121:3">mkalizi wako hakukila bule.<verse eid="PSA 121:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 121:4"/>Kweli mkalizi wa Izilaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 121:4">hakukila wala hawasa.<verse eid="PSA 121:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 121:5"/>Mndewa Imulungu ayo mkalizi wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 121:5">Mndewa Imulungu kokukaliza ubanzi wa mkono wako wa kudila.<verse eid="PSA 121:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 121:6"/>Imisi zuwa honda dikutowe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 121:6">wala mbalamwezi ikilo.<verse eid="PSA 121:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 121:7"/>Mndewa Imulungu kokukaliza na gehile gose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 121:7">koukaliza goya ugima wako.<verse eid="PSA 121:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 121:8"/>Mndewa Imulungu kokukaliza vuulawa na vuukwingila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 121:8">kulawa sambi na milele.<verse eid="PSA 121:8"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 121"/>
  <chapter number="122" style="c" sid="PSA 122"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 122</para>
  <para style="d">(Lwila lwa kuchola uchanha wa Daudi.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 122:1"/>Ndeng'helela viwanilongele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 122:1">“Tuchole mng'anda ya Mndewa Imulungu.”<verse eid="PSA 122:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 122:2"/>Avo, twima mdilango jako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 122:2">gweye Yelusalemu.<verse eid="PSA 122:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 122:3"/>Buga da Yelusalemu dizengwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 122:3">ili wanhu waiting'hane hamoja.<verse eid="PSA 122:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 122:4"/>Mumo amo makabila ga Izilaeli gochola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 122:4">makabila ga Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 122:4">kamba viwalagizwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 122:4">ili waditogole twaga da Mndewa Imulungu.<verse eid="PSA 122:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 122:5"/>Mumo vikigwa vigoda va undewa va nhaguso,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 122:5">vigoda va undewa va ulelo wa Daudi.<verse eid="PSA 122:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 122:6"/>“Dipulileni tindiwalo buga da Yelusalemu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 122:6">Wose okunogela gweye wakale goya.<verse eid="PSA 122:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 122:7"/>Tindiwalo dikale mgati kuluwa lwako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 122:7">usalama ukale mzingome zako!<verse eid="PSA 122:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 122:8"/>Mbuli ya ndugu zangu na mbwiga zangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 122:8">nolonga, ‘Tindiwalo dikale na gweye.’<verse eid="PSA 122:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 122:9"/>Mbuli ya ng'anda ya Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 122:9">‘Nokupulila umwede.’ ”<verse eid="PSA 122:9"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 122"/>
  <chapter number="123" style="c" sid="PSA 123"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 123</para>
  <para style="d">(Lwila lwa kuchola uchanha.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 123:1"/>Nogenula meso gangu kumwako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 123:1">gweye ukala mkigoda cha undewa ako kuulanga.<verse eid="PSA 123:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 123:2"/>Kamba vija meso ga wasang'hanaji vigolola mkono wa mkulu wao ili yapate kinhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 123:2">kamba meso ga msang'hanaji wa ikitwanzi vigolola mkono wa mkulu wake wa ikitwanzi ili yapate kinhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 123:2">vivo meso getu vigomulola Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 123:2">mbaka vonda yatonele bazi.<verse eid="PSA 123:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 123:3"/>Utonele bazi, go Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 123:3">utonele bazi siye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 123:3">kwavija tusitamili va ukutosha bezeli jao.<verse eid="PSA 123:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 123:4"/>Tusitamili bezeli za wanhu wene kibuli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 123:4">na bezeli za wanhu oitapa.<verse eid="PSA 123:4"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 123"/>
  <chapter number="124" style="c" sid="PSA 124"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 124</para>
  <para style="d">(Lwila lwa kuchola uchanha wa Daudi.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 124:1"/>Kamba Mndewa Imulungu hakalile hamoja na siye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 124:1">wanhu wa Izilaeli walonge sambi,<verse eid="PSA 124:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 124:2"/>“Kamba Mndewa Imulungu hakalile hamoja na siye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 124:2">kipindi kija vituvamiligwe na iwanhu otwihila,<verse eid="PSA 124:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 124:3"/>wahatumezile tung'hali wagima.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 124:3">Ng'hasiliki yao viikalile kumwetu,<verse eid="PSA 124:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 124:4"/>twahazoligwe na mazi mengi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 124:4">lwanda lwa mazi lwahatugubike,<verse eid="PSA 124:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 124:5"/>ng'humbi ya mazi yahatugubike!”<verse eid="PSA 124:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 124:6"/>Yatogoligwe Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 124:6">hatulekile tung'walanyuligwe na mizino yao.<verse eid="PSA 124:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 124:7"/>Tuhonyeka kamba ndege mumtego wa msakaji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 124:7">mtego ubeneka na siye tuhonyeka.<verse eid="PSA 124:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 124:8"/>Kutazigwa kwetu kolawa mditwaga da Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 124:8">yalumbile ulanga na isi yose.<verse eid="PSA 124:8"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 124"/>
  <chapter number="125" style="c" sid="PSA 125"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 125</para>
  <para style="d">(Lwila lwa kuchola uchanha.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 125:1"/>Waja omtamanila Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 125:1">waigala na Lugongo lwa Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 125:1">hauguda guda bule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 125:1">okala ngwangwama milele.<verse eid="PSA 125:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 125:2"/>Kamba buga da Yelusalemu vidizungulukwe na vigongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 125:2">vivo Mndewa Imulungu viyowazunguluka wanhu zake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 125:2">sambi na milele.<verse eid="PSA 125:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 125:3"/>Wanhu wehile honda wagendelele kuitawala isi iwagweleligwe wene haki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 125:3">ili wanhu wene haki sikuwatende gehile.<verse eid="PSA 125:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 125:4"/>Go Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 125:4">tenda ganogile kwa waja wanogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 125:4">kwa waja wene mizoyo igoloke.<verse eid="PSA 125:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 125:5"/>Lakini waja ogaluka na kukweleleza nzila zao zihile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 125:5">Mndewa Imulungu kowaswaswanya mnzila za otenda gehile.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 125:5"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 125:5">Tindiwalo dikale na Izilaeli.<verse eid="PSA 125:5"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 125"/>
  <chapter number="126" style="c" sid="PSA 126"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 126</para>
  <para style="d">(Lwila lwa kuchola uchanha.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 126:1"/>Mndewa Imulungu viyawabwezile ako Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 126:1">tona kamba wanhu olota nzozi.<verse eid="PSA 126:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 126:2"/>Baho milomo yetu imema seko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 126:2">na milimi yetu imema nyila za deng'ho.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 126:2">Wanhu wa isi ziyagwe walonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 126:2">“Mndewa Imulungu kawatendela mbuli ng'hulu!”<verse eid="PSA 126:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 126:3"/>Mndewa Imulungu katutendela mbuli ng'hulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 126:3">tudeng'helela kweli.<verse eid="PSA 126:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 126:4"/>Go Mndewa Imulungu, ututende kamba vitukalile umwaka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 126:4">kamba mazi vigokilima mvizanda va Negebu.<verse eid="PSA 126:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 126:5"/>Waja ohanda kwa mahozi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 126:5">osenga kwa nyila za deng'ho.<verse eid="PSA 126:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 126:6"/>Heyo yosola mbeyu za kuhanda akuno kolila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 126:6">kobwela ukae kwa nyila za deng'ho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 126:6">kuno kakapa mgelo wa ndiya.<verse eid="PSA 126:6"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 126"/>
  <chapter number="127" style="c" sid="PSA 127"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 127</para>
  <para style="d">(Lwila lwa kuchola uchanha wa Sulemani.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 127:1"/>Kamba Mndewa Imulungu haizenga ng'anda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 127:1">waja oizenga ogaya bule kusang'hana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 127:1">Kamba Mndewa Imulungu hadikaliza buga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 127:1">awo odikaliza ogaya bule kukala meso.<verse eid="PSA 127:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 127:2"/>Moigaza bule kulamuka ulukwili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 127:2">na kukawa kuwasa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 127:2">mweye muigaza kwa ndiya imuja,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 127:2">Kwavija Imulungu kowagwaa awo yowanogela hata kamba wahawasa.<verse eid="PSA 127:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 127:3"/>Wana awo uhazi kulawa kwa Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 127:3">wana awo nhunza kulawa kumwake.<verse eid="PSA 127:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 127:4"/>Kamba misale mumkono wa galu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 127:4">vivo viweli wana iwolela munhu muubwanga wake.<verse eid="PSA 127:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 127:5"/>Kamweda munhu yeli na misale ayo mingi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 127:5">Honda yahumwe yahalonga na iwanhu omwihila mkitala<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">127:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kwa Kiebulania olonga hadilango da dibuga.</char></note>.<verse eid="PSA 127:5"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 127"/>
  <chapter number="128" style="c" sid="PSA 128"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 128</para>
  <para style="d">(Lwila lwa kuchola uchanha.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 128:1"/>Wamweda iwanhu wose omdumba Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 128:1">waja okala kwa kukweleleza malagizo gake.<verse eid="PSA 128:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 128:2"/>Koja matunda ga sang'hano zako</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 128:2">kodeng'helela na kumweda.<verse eid="PSA 128:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 128:3"/>Mwehe wako kokuwa kamba mzabibu ulela matunda mwiing'anda yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 128:3">wanago okuwa kamba mizukila ya mizeituni oizunguluka meza yako.<verse eid="PSA 128:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 128:4"/>Ona kuno ako ukumweda kwa munhu yomdumba Mndewa Imulungu.<verse eid="PSA 128:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 128:5"/>Mndewa Imulungu yakutendele ganogile kulawa Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 128:5">ugone ganogile ga Yelusalemu siku zose za ugima wako.<verse eid="PSA 128:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 128:6"/>Uwe mgima mbaka wone wazukulu zako.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 128:6"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 128:6">Tindiwalo dikale na Izilaeli.<verse eid="PSA 128:6"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 128"/>
  <chapter number="129" style="c" sid="PSA 129"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 129</para>
  <para style="d">(Lwila lwa kuchola uchanha.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 129:1"/>“Wandununza ng'hani toka muubwanga wangu,”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 129:1">Waizilaeli walonge sambi,<verse eid="PSA 129:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 129:2"/>“Wandununza ng'hani toka muubwanga wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 129:2">lakini hawanihumile bule.<verse eid="PSA 129:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 129:3"/>Wanilumiza mumgongo wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 129:3">kamba walimaji ohimba miloka mitali.<verse eid="PSA 129:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 129:4"/>Lakini Mndewa Imulungu mwene haki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 129:4">kanilekesa kulawa muutumwa.”<verse eid="PSA 129:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 129:5"/>Wageligwe kinyala na wabwezigwe kuchugu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 129:5">wose odihila buga da Sayuni.<verse eid="PSA 129:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 129:6"/>Wawe kamba usoti uchanha ya ng'anda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 129:6">onyala bila kukangala,<verse eid="PSA 129:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 129:7"/>imunhu youkanha hamemeza ganza jake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 129:7">na heyo youkuba hamemeza mkono wake.<verse eid="PSA 129:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 129:8"/>Waja obita behi hawalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 129:8">“Imulungu yakutende umwede.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 129:8">Tokutambikila kwa twaga da Mndewa Imulungu.”<verse eid="PSA 129:8"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 129"/>
  <chapter number="130" style="c" sid="PSA 130"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 130</para>
  <para style="d">(Lwila lwa kuchola uchanha.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 130:1"/>Kulawa mmagazo gangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 130:1">nokulilila go Mndewa Imulungu.<verse eid="PSA 130:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 130:2"/>Go Mndewa Imulungu, uihulike sauti yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 130:2">magwiti gako gahulike kupula kwangu.<verse eid="PSA 130:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 130:3"/>Go Mndewa Imulungu, maza gweye ugapetile gehile getu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 130:3">Go Mndewa, nani yahadahile kwima kuulongozi wako?<verse eid="PSA 130:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 130:4"/>Lakini kumwako kuna kugela kumgongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 130:4">ili gweye udumbigwe.<verse eid="PSA 130:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 130:5"/>Nombeta Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 130:5">loho yangu yombeta heyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 130:5">mna imbuli yake notamanila.<verse eid="PSA 130:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 130:6"/>Loho yangu yombeta Mndewa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 130:6">kubanza wakalizi viwobeta imotondo ivike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 130:6">ona, kubanza wakalizi viwobeta usiku uche.<verse eid="PSA 130:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 130:7"/>Gweye Izilaeli mtamanile Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 130:7">kwavija kwa Mndewa Imulungu kuna unogelo hawishaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 130:7">na kumwake kuna ugombola mkulu.<verse eid="PSA 130:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 130:8"/>Heyo kowagombola wanhu wa Izilaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 130:8">na nzambi zao zose.<verse eid="PSA 130:8"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 130"/>
  <chapter number="131" style="c" sid="PSA 131"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 131</para>
  <para style="d">(Lwila lwa kuchola uchanha wa Daudi.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 131:1"/>Go Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 131:1">nabule moyo wa kibuli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 131:1">niye sili munhu wa kuitapa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 131:1">sisulukila vinhu vikulu ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 131:1">hebu mbuli za kilozo kumwangu.<verse eid="PSA 131:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 131:2"/>Lakini loho yangu itindiwala na kunyamala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 131:2">kamba mwana yafagatiligwe mmhambaga ya mamake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 131:2">vivo loho yangu viitindiwale.<verse eid="PSA 131:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 131:3"/>Gweye Izilaeli, mtamanile Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 131:3">kulawa sambi na milele.<verse eid="PSA 131:3"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 131"/>
  <chapter number="132" style="c" sid="PSA 132"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 132</para>
  <para style="d">(Lwila lwa kuchola uchanha.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 132:1"/>Go Mndewa Imulungu, mkumbuke Daudi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:1">na magazo gake gose gayasitahimili.<verse eid="PSA 132:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 132:2"/>Heyo kaiduwila kwa Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:2">heyo kailagana na heyo mwene udahi wose wa Yakobo.<verse eid="PSA 132:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 132:3"/>“Singila mwiing'anda yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:3">hebu kuwasa mulusazi wangu,<verse eid="PSA 132:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 132:4"/>Sigaleka meso gangu gapate utulo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:4">hebu ng'humbitu zangu kukukila,<verse eid="PSA 132:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 132:5"/>mbaka mhate hanhu mbuli ya Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:5">ukazi mbuli ya heyo yeli na udahi wose wa Yakobo!”<verse eid="PSA 132:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 132:6"/>Tuhulika olonga, “Sanduku da lagano da ako Efulata,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:6">tudivika mmigunda ya Yealimu.”<verse eid="PSA 132:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 132:7"/>Avo tulonga, “Tucholeni mwiing'anda ya Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:7">tukatambike kuulongozi wa kigoda chake cha kwikila magulu.”<verse eid="PSA 132:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 132:8"/>Go Mndewa Imulungu, inuka uchole hanhu hako ha kukala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:8">winuke na sanduku jako da lagano dili na udahi wako.<verse eid="PSA 132:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 132:9"/>Iwalava nhosa zako wavazigwe haki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:9">wanhu wako otamanilwa wembe kwa deng'ho.<verse eid="PSA 132:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 132:10"/>Kwa mbuli ya Daudi msang'hanaji wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:10">sikuumuleme ayo yuumsagule.<verse eid="PSA 132:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 132:11"/>Mndewa Imulungu kaiduwila kwa Daudi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:11">kaiduwila kinhu hakisegesigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:11">“Imoja wa ulelo wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:11">nomtenda yawe mndewa hanhu hako.<verse eid="PSA 132:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 132:12"/>Kamba wanago wahadigoga lagano jangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:12">na amuli ziniwafunza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:12">vivija wanao ohazi undewa wako milele.”<verse eid="PSA 132:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 132:13"/>Kwavija Mndewa Imulungu kaisagula Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:13">kalonda hawe hanhu hake ha kukala.<verse eid="PSA 132:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 132:14"/>Heyo kalonga, “Hano baho hanhu hangu ha kukala milele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:14">hano nokala kuno notawala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:14">kwavija nohalonda.<verse eid="PSA 132:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 132:15"/>Noditendela ganogile kwa kudigwaa ndiya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:15">nowagwaa ndiya wakiwa mbaka wegute.<verse eid="PSA 132:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 132:16"/>Iwalava nhosa zake nowavaza ukombola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:16">na wanhu zake otamanilwa okwimba kwa deng'ho.<verse eid="PSA 132:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 132:17"/>Baho nomtenda imoja wa ulelo wa Daudi yawe mndewa mkulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:17">nitanda taa mbuli ya ayo inimsagule.<verse eid="PSA 132:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 132:18"/>Wanhu omwihila nowavaza kinyala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:18">lakini heyo nomvaza taji ing'ala ng'hani.”<verse eid="PSA 132:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 132"/>
  <chapter number="133" style="c" sid="PSA 133"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 133</para>
  <para style="d">(Lwila lwa kuchola uchanha wa Daudi.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 133:1"/>Lola vivinogile na kunogeza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 133:1">ndugu wahakala hamoja kwa kuigoga.<verse eid="PSA 133:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 133:2"/>Kamba mavuta ganogile vigonyililika mdipala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 133:2">gonyililika mbaka mzindevu za Haluni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 133:2">mbaka mmhindo ya kiwalo chake msingo.<verse eid="PSA 133:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 133:3"/>Kamba tungwe da lugongo lwa Helimoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 133:3">vidigwa uchanha ya vigongo va Sayuni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 133:3">Kwavija kuko Mndewa Imulungu kuyagalagize ganogile gake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 133:3">hata ugima wa milele.<verse eid="PSA 133:3"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 133"/>
  <chapter number="134" style="c" sid="PSA 134"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 134</para>
  <para style="d">(Lwila lwa kuchola uchanha.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 134:1"/>Izoni tumgwee nhogolwa Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 134:1">mweye mose iwasang'hanaji wa Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 134:1">mweye msang'hana ikilo mng'anda ya Mndewa Imulungu.<verse eid="PSA 134:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 134:2"/>Mwinule makono genu kulozela hanhu hang'alile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 134:2">na mumgwee nhogolwa Mndewa Imulungu.<verse eid="PSA 134:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 134:3"/>Mndewa Imulungu, yalumbile ulanga na isi yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 134:3">yawatendele ganogile kulawa Sayuni.<verse eid="PSA 134:3"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 134"/>
  <chapter number="135" style="c" sid="PSA 135"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 135</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 135:1"/>Mgweleleni nhogolwa Mndewa Imulungu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:1">Digweleleni nhogolwa twaga da Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:1">mweye wasang'hanaji wa Mndewa Imulungu mgweleleni nhogolwa.<verse eid="PSA 135:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 135:2"/>Mgweleleni nhogolwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:2">mweye msang'hana mng'anda ya Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:2">mgati muuluwa lwa ng'anda ya Imulungu wetu.<verse eid="PSA 135:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 135:3"/>Mgweleleni nhogolwa Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:3">kwavija Mndewa Imulungu kanoga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:3">dimbileni nhogolwa twaga jake, kwavija donogeza.<verse eid="PSA 135:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 135:4"/>Mndewa Imulungu kamsagula Yakobo kuwa wake mwenyego,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:4">kamsagula Izilaeli kamba kinhu chake kinogile.<verse eid="PSA 135:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 135:5"/>Nojuwa kamba Mndewa Imulungu mkulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:5">na Mndewa wetu mkulu kubanza imilungu yose.<verse eid="PSA 135:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 135:6"/>Mndewa Imulungu kotenda chochose kiyolonda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:6">kuulanga na mwiisi, mwiibahali na mvizanda vose.<verse eid="PSA 135:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 135:7"/>Heyo kogatenda mawingu gakwele uchanha kulawa kuuhelelo wa isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:7">kogala lumwesa hamoja na mvula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:7">na kodibumiza beho kulawa kukanho jake.<verse eid="PSA 135:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 135:8"/>Kawakoma wana wa chaudele ako Misili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:8">wose wana wa chaudele wa wanhu na wanyama.<verse eid="PSA 135:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 135:9"/>Katenda vilaguso na unzonza kumwako, gweye Misili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:9">kwa Falao na wasang'hanaji zake wose.<verse eid="PSA 135:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 135:10"/>Heyo kawatowa wanhu wa isi nyingi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:10">kawakoma wandewa wakalile na nguvu,<verse eid="PSA 135:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 135:11"/>kamba vija kwa Sihoni mndewa wa Waamoli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:11">na Ogu mndewa wa Bashani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:11">na wandewa wose wa Kanaani.<verse eid="PSA 135:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 135:12"/>Kazisola isi zao zose na kawagwelela wanhu zake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:12">kamba uhazi wa wanhu zake wa Izilaeli.<verse eid="PSA 135:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 135:13"/>Go Mndewa Imulungu, twaga jako dokala milele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:13">go Mndewa Imulungu, kokumbukigwa ulelo mbaka ulelo,<verse eid="PSA 135:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 135:14"/>kwavija Mndewa Imulungu kowagombela wanhu zake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:14">na kowonela bazi wasang'hanaji zake.<verse eid="PSA 135:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 135:15"/>Vinyago va isi ziyagwe azo shaba na zahabu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:15">zitendigwe kwa makono ga wanhu.<verse eid="PSA 135:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 135:16"/>Ina milomo lakini hailonga bule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:16">na ina meso lakini hailola bule.<verse eid="PSA 135:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 135:17"/>Ina magwiti lakini haihulika bule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:17">na haidaha kuhumula.<verse eid="PSA 135:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 135:18"/>Wose oitenda waigala navo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:18">na kila imoja yoitamanila.<verse eid="PSA 135:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 135:19"/>Mweye wanhu wa Izilaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:19">mgweleleni nhogolwa Mndewa Imulungu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:19">Mweye ulelo wa Haluni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:19">mgweleleni nhogolwa Mndewa Imulungu.<verse eid="PSA 135:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 135:20"/>Mweye Walawi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:20">mgweleleni nhogolwa Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:20">mweye mumdumba Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:20">mgweleleni nhogolwa Mndewa Imulungu.<verse eid="PSA 135:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 135:21"/>Mgweleleni nhogolwa Mndewa Imulungu kulawa Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:21">mgweleleni nhogolwa heyo yokala Yelusalemu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 135:21"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:21">Mgweleleni nhogolwa Mndewa Imulungu.<verse eid="PSA 135:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 135"/>
  <chapter number="136" style="c" sid="PSA 136"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 136</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 136:1"/>Mshukuluni Mndewa Imulungu kwavija heyo kanoga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:1">unogelo wake hawishaga okala milele.<verse eid="PSA 136:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 136:2"/>Mshukuluni Imulungu wa imilungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:2">unogelo wake hawishaga okala milele.<verse eid="PSA 136:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 136:3"/>Mshukuluni Mndewa wa iwandewa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:3">unogelo wake hawishaga okala milele.<verse eid="PSA 136:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 136:4"/>Heyo yaiyeka iyo yotenda unzonza mkulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:4">unogelo wake hawishaga okala milele.<verse eid="PSA 136:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 136:5"/>Heyo ayo yalumbile ulanga kwa nzewele zake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:5">unogelo wake hawishaga okala milele.<verse eid="PSA 136:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 136:6"/>Heyo ayo yaizengile isi uchanha ya mazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:6">unogelo wake hawishaga okala milele.<verse eid="PSA 136:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 136:7"/>Heyo ayo yalumbile milangaza mikulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:7">unogelo wake hawishaga okala milele.<verse eid="PSA 136:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 136:8"/>Kadilumba zuwa ditawale imisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:8">unogelo wake hawishaga okala milele.<verse eid="PSA 136:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 136:9"/>Kazilumba mbalamwezi na nhondo zitawale ikilo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:9">unogelo wake hawishaga okala milele.<verse eid="PSA 136:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 136:10"/>Heyo ayo yawakomile wana chaudele wa Wamisili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:10">unogelo wake hawishaga okala milele.<verse eid="PSA 136:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 136:11"/>Heyo ayo yawalavile Waizilaeli hagati yao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:11">unogelo wake hawishaga okala milele.<verse eid="PSA 136:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 136:12"/>Katenda avo kwa mkono wake uli na nguvu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:12">unogelo wake hawishaga okala milele.<verse eid="PSA 136:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 136:13"/>Heyo ayo yaigolile bahali ya Shamu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:13">unogelo wake hawishaga okala milele.<verse eid="PSA 136:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 136:14"/>Kawabitiza Waizilaeli hagati ya bahali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:14">unogelo wake hawishaga okala milele.<verse eid="PSA 136:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 136:15"/>Kambwanha Falao hamoja na iwakalizi wake mumo mbahali ya Shamu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:15">unogelo wake hawishaga okala milele.<verse eid="PSA 136:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 136:16"/>Heyo ayo yawalongoze wanhu zake kuluwala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:16">unogelo wake hawishaga okala milele.<verse eid="PSA 136:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 136:17"/>Heyo ayo yawatowile iwandewa weli na nguvu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:17">unogelo wake hawishaga okala milele.<verse eid="PSA 136:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 136:18"/>Heyo ayo yawakomile iwandewa magalu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:18">unogelo wake hawishaga okala milele.<verse eid="PSA 136:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 136:19"/>Kamkoma Sihoni mndewa wa Waamoli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:19">unogelo wake hawishaga okala milele.<verse eid="PSA 136:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 136:20"/>Kamkoma Ogu mndewa wa Bashani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:20">unogelo wake hawishaga okala milele.<verse eid="PSA 136:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 136:21"/>Kaisola isi yao na kawagwaa wanhu zake kamba uhazi wao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:21">unogelo wake hawishaga okala milele.<verse eid="PSA 136:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 136:22"/>Uhazi kwa Waizilaeli wasang'hanaji wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:22">unogelo wake hawishaga okala milele.<verse eid="PSA 136:22"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 136:23"/>Heyo ayo yatukumbuke mkunyunyuwala kwetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:23">unogelo wake hawishaga okala milele.<verse eid="PSA 136:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 136:24"/>Katukombola kulawa kwa iwanhu otwihila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:24">unogelo wake hawishaga okala milele.<verse eid="PSA 136:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 136:25"/>Heyo ayo yokigwaa ndiya kila kiumbe kili na ugima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:25">unogelo wake hawishaga okala milele.<verse eid="PSA 136:25"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 136:26"/>Mshukuluni Imulungu yeli kuulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:26">unogelo wake hawishaga okala milele.<verse eid="PSA 136:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 136"/>
  <chapter number="137" style="c" sid="PSA 137"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 137</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 137:1"/>Mzimbwega mbwega za vizanda va Babeli tukala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 137:1">tulila vituikumbuke Sayuni.<verse eid="PSA 137:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 137:2"/>Mmibiki ya isi ija,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 137:2">tutumbika mabango getu.<verse eid="PSA 137:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 137:3"/>Kwavija awo watugogile, watulonda tuwembile lwila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 137:3">awo otudeta watulonda tuwembile lwila lwa deng'ho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 137:3">walonga, “Twimbileni lwila lumoja mzinyila za Sayuni.”<verse eid="PSA 137:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 137:4"/>Tokwimbaze nyila za Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 137:4">kuno twa mwiisi baki?<verse eid="PSA 137:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 137:5"/>Gweye Yelusalemu nahakusemwa gweye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 137:5">mkono wangu wa ukudila unyale.<verse eid="PSA 137:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 137:6"/>Lulimi lwangu luilumbe na mulomo wangu wa uchanha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 137:6">kamba sikukumbuka gweye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 137:6">kamba sikutenda gweye Yelusalemu deng'ho jangu kulu.<verse eid="PSA 137:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 137:7"/>Go Mndewa Imulungu, sambi uisemwe kiwatendile Waedomu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 137:7">siku dija Yelusalemu viisoligwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 137:7">kumbuka kiwalongile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 137:7">“Dibomoleni buga da Yelusalemu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 137:7">mbaka kuna ichandusilo chake!”<verse eid="PSA 137:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 137:8"/>Gweye Babeli, utagusigwe na kubanangwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 137:8">komweda munhu yonda yakulihe gehile gako gaututendele siye.<verse eid="PSA 137:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 137:9"/>Komweda munhu ija yonda yawasole wanago,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 137:9">na kuwahonda honda uchanha ya dibwe.<verse eid="PSA 137:9"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 137"/>
  <chapter number="138" style="c" sid="PSA 138"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 138</para>
  <para style="d">(Zabuli ya Daudi.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 138:1"/>Go Mndewa Imulungu, nokushukulu kwa moyo wangu wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 138:1">haulongozi wa imilungu nokwimba nhogolwa zako.<verse eid="PSA 138:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 138:2"/>Noidulika mbaka hasi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 138:2">kulozela ng'anda yako ing'alile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 138:2">nodigwaa nhogolwa twaga jako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 138:2">mbuli ya unogelo wako hawishaga na kutamanilwa kwako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 138:2">kwavija kudigwaa ukulu twaga jako na mbuli yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 138:2">kubanza vinhu vose.<verse eid="PSA 138:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 138:3"/>Siku dija dinikulilile, gweye kunidika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 138:3">na kunigangamiza kwa nguvu zako.<verse eid="PSA 138:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 138:4"/>Wandewa wose wa mwiisi wakugwee nhogolwa gweye Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 138:4">kwavija wazihulika mbuli zako ziulongile.<verse eid="PSA 138:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 138:5"/>Wembe mbuli ya sang'hano za Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 138:5">kwavija ukulu wa Mndewa Imulungu mkulu.<verse eid="PSA 138:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 138:6"/>Hamoja Mndewa Imulungu ka uchanha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 138:6">komulola goya munhu yabwezigwe hasi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 138:6">lakini komtanga munhu yoitapa kulawa kutali.<verse eid="PSA 138:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 138:7"/>Hata nahabita mmagazo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 138:7">gweye koukaliza ugima wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 138:7">golosa mkono wako kuikimila ng'hasiliki ya iwanhu onihila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 138:7">kwa mkono wako wa ukudila unikombole.<verse eid="PSA 138:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 138:8"/>Go Mndewa Imulungu, gavikize gaja goulonda kumwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 138:8">unogelo wako hawishaga okala milele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 138:8">sikuuisemwe sang'hano ya makono gako.<verse eid="PSA 138:8"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 138"/>
  <chapter number="139" style="c" sid="PSA 139"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 139</para>
  <para style="d">(Kwa kilanja, Zabuli ya Daudi.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 139:1"/>Go Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:1">gweye kunilola goya vinili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:1">kunjuwa mbaka mgati.<verse eid="PSA 139:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 139:2"/>Gweye kojuwa kukala kwangu na kwinuka kwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:2">gweye kogajuwa magesa gangu kulawa kutali.<verse eid="PSA 139:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 139:3"/>Gweye kojuwa kutembela kwangu na kuhumula kwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:3">gweye kozijuwa nzila zangu zose.<verse eid="PSA 139:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 139:4"/>Ning'hali sinalonga mbuli bule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:4">gweye Mndewa Imulungu kujuwa gose gonilonda kulonga.<verse eid="PSA 139:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 139:5"/>Kila mwambu wangu kwa baho, kuchugu na kuulongozi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:5">kunikila mkono wako kunikaliza.<verse eid="PSA 139:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 139:6"/>Maalifa gako kobanza nzewele zangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:6">makulu ng'hani sidaha kugajuwa.<verse eid="PSA 139:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 139:7"/>Nikimbilile kwahi niinege na loho yako?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:7">Nichole kwahi nikikimbile kihanga chako?<verse eid="PSA 139:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 139:8"/>Kamba nahakwela uchanha kuulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:8">gweye kwa uko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:8">nahachola kuzimu gweye vivija kwa uko.<verse eid="PSA 139:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 139:9"/>Nahaguluka mbaka uhelelo wa mwambu wa kudilawila zuwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:9">hebu nahakala kuuhelelo wa bahali,<verse eid="PSA 139:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 139:10"/>vivija kuko gweye kwa uko konilongoza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:10">mkono wako wa ukudila onigoga goya.<verse eid="PSA 139:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 139:11"/>Kamba nahapulile ziza dinigubike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:11">mulenge unimwemweselaga uwe ziza,<verse eid="PSA 139:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 139:12"/>kumwako kuduhu ziza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:12">ikilo yong'ala kamba imisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:12">kumwako ziza kamba mulenge.<verse eid="PSA 139:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 139:13"/>Kwavija gweye iyo ulumbile mgati yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:13">kunilumba mwiinda ya mamangu.<verse eid="PSA 139:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 139:14"/>Nokushukulu kwavija kunilumba kwa unzonza mkulu na kudumbiza.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:14">Sang'hano zako za unzonza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:14">mbuli ayo noijuwa goya.<verse eid="PSA 139:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 139:15"/>Lukuli lwangu lwabule kifiso kumwako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:15">nilumbigwa hanhu hakifiso,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:15">nilumbigwa kwa ufundi mwiinda ya mamangu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">139:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mwiinda ya mamangu kwa Kiebulania olonga mgati ya isi. </char></note>.<verse eid="PSA 139:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 139:16"/>Meso gako gawona lukuli lwangu lung'hali halunakwisha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:16">na kwandika kila kinhu mkitabu chako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:16">siku zangu zose kuzipanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:16">hata siku ya ichanduso hainakuwa.<verse eid="PSA 139:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 139:17"/>Go Imulungu, magesa gako ganoga ng'hani kumwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:17">na magesa gako hagadahika kupetigwa!<verse eid="PSA 139:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 139:18"/>Kamba nahagapetile mengi kubanza msanga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:18">Nahalamuka ning'hali na hamoja na gweye.<verse eid="PSA 139:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 139:19"/>Go Imulungu, maza uhawakomile awo otenda gehile!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:19">Segeleni kumwangu mweye mwitaga damu!<verse eid="PSA 139:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 139:20"/>Okulonga vihile akuno ogelegeza gehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:20">iwanhu okwihila oditambula bule twaga jako.<verse eid="PSA 139:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 139:21"/>Go Mndewa Imulungu, sikuniwehile awo okwihila gweye?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:21">Sikuniwehile ng'hani awo okulema gweye?<verse eid="PSA 139:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 139:22"/>Wanhu okwihila gweye na niye nowehila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:22">nowehila ng'hani.<verse eid="PSA 139:22"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 139:23"/>Go Imulungu, unilolese, ujuwe moyo wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:23">unigeze, ugajuwe magesa gangu.<verse eid="PSA 139:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 139:24"/>Ulole kamba mgati yangu kuna nzila ikugevuza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:24">unilongoze mwiinzila ikalaga milele.<verse eid="PSA 139:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 139"/>
  <chapter number="140" style="c" sid="PSA 140"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 140</para>
  <para style="d">(Kwa kilanja, Zabuli ya Daudi.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 140:1"/>Go Mndewa Imulungu, ung'hombole na wanhu wehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:1">unikalize na wanhu wasede,<verse eid="PSA 140:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 140:2"/>awo opanga gehile mmizoyo yao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:2">oding'hula ndwagi siku zose.<verse eid="PSA 140:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 140:3"/>Milimi yao oitenda mikali kamba zoka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:3">sumu ya futa ya mmilomo yao.<verse eid="PSA 140:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 140:4"/>Go Mndewa Imulungu, unihonye na makono ga wanhu wehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:4">unikimile na wanhu wasede,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:4">wapangile kunigwisa.<verse eid="PSA 140:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 140:5"/>Weli na kibuli wanitegela mitego kwa kifiso,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:5">na wanzanza nzabi za lwavu lwao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:5">wanikila mitego mwiinzila yangu.<verse eid="PSA 140:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 140:6"/>Go Mndewa Imulungu, nokulongela, “Gweye iyo Imulungu wangu.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:6">Go Mndewa, uhulike kililo changu na unyonele bazi.<verse eid="PSA 140:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 140:7"/>Go Mndewa Imulungu, Mndewa wangu, mkombola wangu mwene nguvu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:7">kunikaliza kipindi chose cha ng'hondo.<verse eid="PSA 140:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 140:8"/>Go Mndewa Imulungu, sikuuwagwelele iwanhu wehile gaja gowosulukila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:8">na sikuuivikize mipango yao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:8">buleavo oitapa.<verse eid="PSA 140:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 140:9"/>Mapala ga awo onizunguluka gagubikwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:9">na magazo golawa mmilomo yao.<verse eid="PSA 140:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 140:10"/>Makala ga moto gawalagalile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:10">wasigwe muumoto mdisimo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:10">na sikuwenuke kabili.<verse eid="PSA 140:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 140:11"/>Awo owadeta wayao sikuwamwede mwiisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:11">gehile gawasake wanhu wasede.<verse eid="PSA 140:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 140:12"/>Nojuwa kamba Mndewa Imulungu kowagombela wakiwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:12">na kowagwaa haki ngaengae.<verse eid="PSA 140:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 140:13"/>Kweli wene haki odigwaa nhogolwa twaga jako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:13">na waja watelele okala kumwako.<verse eid="PSA 140:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 140"/>
  <chapter number="141" style="c" sid="PSA 141"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 141</para>
  <para style="d">(Zabuli ya Daudi.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 141:1"/>Go Mndewa Imulungu, nokukema gweye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:1">wize kumwangu himahima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:1">uhulike sauti yangu nahakukema.<verse eid="PSA 141:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 141:2"/>Kupula kwangu kuvike kuulongozi wako kamba yosi da ubani usomigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:2">kwinula kwangu makono uchanha kuwe kamba nhosa ya ichungulo.<verse eid="PSA 141:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 141:3"/>Go Mndewa Imulungu, ika mkalizi kumulomo wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:3">ika ukalizi mmulomo wangu.<verse eid="PSA 141:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 141:4"/>Sambi uutogolele moyo wangu utende gehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:4">sambi undeke nhende gehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:4">sambi niilumbe na wanhu otenda gehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:4">hebu kuja ndiya mzinyimwilinyimwili zao.<verse eid="PSA 141:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 141:5"/>Vinoga munhu mwene haki yanizume kwa kunikoboza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:5">mbuli ayo ya bazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:5">leka yanikomhokele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:5">mbuli ayo mavuta mdipala jangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:5">pala jangu hadiilema bule.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:5">Lakini kupula kwangu siku zose mbuli ya gehile ga wanhu wehile.<verse eid="PSA 141:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 141:6"/>Watawala zao otupigwa hasi kulawa kumibwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:6">wanhu wehile oifunza kamba mbuli zangu zikala kweli.<verse eid="PSA 141:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 141:7"/>Mizege yao yopwililisigwa kuzimu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:7">kamba ngodi zituligwe vihande vihande!<verse eid="PSA 141:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 141:8"/>Lakini niye nokutamanila gweye Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:8">nokukimbilila gweye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:8">sambi unileke nidanganike.<verse eid="PSA 141:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 141:9"/>Unikalize na mitego iwanitegele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:9">mitego itegigwe na awo otenda gehile.<verse eid="PSA 141:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 141:10"/>Wanhu wehile wanamate mmizavu yao wenyego,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:10">kipindi niye nobita vinogile.<verse eid="PSA 141:10"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 141"/>
  <chapter number="142" style="c" sid="PSA 142"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 142</para>
  <para style="d">(Ulonzi wa Daudi mbuli ya kipindi viyakalile mmhango. Zabuli ya kupula.)<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">142:0 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola kitabu cha 1 Samweli 22:1-2.</char></note></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 142:1"/>Nomulilila Mndewa Imulungu kwa sauti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 142:1">nompula Mndewa Imulungu kwa sauti yangu yanyonele bazi.<verse eid="PSA 142:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 142:2"/>Nogida kuiyalala kwangu kuulongozi wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 142:2">kuulongozi wake nolonga magazo gangu.<verse eid="PSA 142:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 142:3"/>Nahalonda kukanha tamanilo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 142:3">gweye kotanga nzila zangu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 142:3">Mwiinzila inibita wanhu wanitegela mitego.<verse eid="PSA 142:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 142:4"/>Lola mwambu wangu wa ukudila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 142:4">kuduhu hata munhu yonitanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 142:4">nabule hanhu ha kukimbilila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 142:4">kuduhu munhu yonigesa.<verse eid="PSA 142:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 142:5"/>Go Mndewa Imulungu, nokulilila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 142:5">nolonga, “Gweye ayo kimbililo jangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 142:5">gweye ayo fungu jangu hano mwiisi ya wagima.”<verse eid="PSA 142:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 142:6"/>Uhulike kililo changu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 142:6">kwavija niye namdodo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 142:6">nikombole na awo onikweleleza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 142:6">kwavija wana nguvu kubanza niye.<verse eid="PSA 142:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 142:7"/>Undave mkifungo changu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 142:7">ili niditogole twaga jako.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 142:7">Wanhu wene haki wanizunguluke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 142:7">kwavija kunhendela mengi ganogile.<verse eid="PSA 142:7"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 142"/>
  <chapter number="143" style="c" sid="PSA 143"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 143</para>
  <para style="d">(Zabuli ya Daudi.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 143:1"/>Go Mndewa Imulungu, uhulike kupula kwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:1">uhulike kupula kwangu na unyonele bazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:1">mkutamanilwa kwako na haki wize unitaze.<verse eid="PSA 143:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 143:2"/>Sikuumtaguse msang'hanaji wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:2">kwavija kuduhu munhu yokala kuno kana haki kuulongozi wako.<verse eid="PSA 143:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 143:3"/>Munhu yehile koikweleleza loho yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:3">koubwanha hasi ugima wangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:3">Konitenda nikale mdiziza kamba munhu yadanganike toka mwaka.<verse eid="PSA 143:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 143:4"/>Avo, loho yangu yosinduka mgati yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:4">moyo wangu mgati yangu odumba.<verse eid="PSA 143:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 143:5"/>Nizikumbuka siku za umwaka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:5">nogelegeza sang'hano zako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:5">nogesa sang'hano zitendigwe kwa makono gako.<verse eid="PSA 143:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 143:6"/>Nogolosa makono gangu kumwako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:6">loho yangu yokonela ng'hilu kamba isi inyalile.<verse eid="PSA 143:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 143:7"/>Go Mndewa Imulungu, ulopole kunidika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:7">loho yangu yosinduka.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:7">Sikuunifise kihanga chako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:7">buleavo nokuwa kamba awo ohumuluka kuzimu.<verse eid="PSA 143:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 143:8"/>Imitondo unilagusile unogelo wako hawishaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:8">kwavija tamanilo jangu da kumwako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:8">nilagusile nzila yakubita,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:8">kwavija noulava moyo wangu kumwako.<verse eid="PSA 143:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 143:9"/>Go Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:9">unihonye na iwanhu onihila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:9">niye nikukimbilila gweye unifise.<verse eid="PSA 143:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 143:10"/>Unifunze kutenda gaja goulonda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:10">kwavija gweye ayo Imulungu wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:10">Loho wako yanogile yanilongoze mwiinzila igoloke.<verse eid="PSA 143:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 143:11"/>Go Mndewa Imulungu, mbuli ya twaga jako, ukalize ugima wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:11">mbuli ya haki yako, unilave mmagazo.<verse eid="PSA 143:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 143:12"/>Kwa unogelo wako hawishaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:12">uwabanange iwanhu onihila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:12">uwabanange wose onideta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:12">kwavija niye msang'hanaji wako.<verse eid="PSA 143:12"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 143"/>
  <chapter number="144" style="c" sid="PSA 144"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 144</para>
  <para style="d">(Zabuli ya Daudi.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 144:1"/>Yatogoligwe Mndewa Imulungu, dibwe jangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:1">yogagwaa nguvu makono gangu mwiing'hondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:1">na kuvifundiza vidole vangu kuitowa.<verse eid="PSA 144:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 144:2"/>Heyo ayo unogelo wangu hawishaga na ngome yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:2">mkombola wangu na ngome yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:2">ngao yangu inimkimbilile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:2">heyo koweka hasi yangu wanhu wa isi ziyagwe.<verse eid="PSA 144:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 144:3"/>Go Mndewa Imulungu, munhu kinhu gani mbaka umgese?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:3">Munhu kinhu gani mbaka umgelegeze?<verse eid="PSA 144:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 144:4"/>Munhu kaigala na mhumuzi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:4">siku zake kamba sisila vidibita.<verse eid="PSA 144:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 144:5"/>Go Mndewa Imulungu, vugula ulanga uhumuluke hasi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:5">ukwase vigongo vilawe yosi.<verse eid="PSA 144:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 144:6"/>Gala lumwesa, uwapwililise iwanhu okwihila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:6">utowe misale yako uwakimbize.<verse eid="PSA 144:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 144:7"/>Ugolose mkono wako kulawa uchanha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:7">unikombole na unihonye kulawa mmazi mengi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:7">unisegese mmakono ga iwanhu baki,<verse eid="PSA 144:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 144:8"/>awo milomo yao imema uvizi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:8">na awo oiduwila kwa uvizi.<verse eid="PSA 144:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 144:9"/>Go Imulungu, nokwimbila lwila lwa sambi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:9">kwa bango dili na nzabi longo nokwimbila,<verse eid="PSA 144:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 144:10"/>kumwako gweye uwagwaa mhumo wandewa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:10">komkombola msang'hanaji wako Daudi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:10">kulawa mdisime digala ifa.<verse eid="PSA 144:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 144:11"/>Unikombole na unihonye kulawa mmakono ga wanhu baki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:11">awo milomo yao yolonga uvizi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:11">na awo oiduwila kwa uvizi.<verse eid="PSA 144:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 144:12"/>Abaho wanetu muubwanga wao okuwa kamba minoga iloligwe goya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:12">na wandele zetu okuwa kamba mhanda zichongigwe kwa kuhambila goya ng'anda ya kindewa.<verse eid="PSA 144:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 144:13"/>Makanho getu gameme aina zose za ndiya na vinhu vilondigwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:13">Ng'hondolo zetu olela maelufu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:13">olela maelufu kwa maelufu mmigunda,<verse eid="PSA 144:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 144:14"/>ng'ombe zetu opapa mizigo mikulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:14">sikukuwe na ng'hondo, hebu kuhamizigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:14">na sikukuwe na ndilo mzinzila zetu.<verse eid="PSA 144:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 144:15"/>Wamweda wanhu weli vivo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:15">wamweda wanhu awo Mndewa Imulungu, iyo Imulungu wao.<verse eid="PSA 144:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 144"/>
  <chapter number="145" style="c" sid="PSA 145"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 145</para>
  <para style="d">(Lwila lwa nhogolwa lwa Daudi.)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 145:1"/>Nokugwaa nhogolwa, gweye Imulungu wangu na Mndewa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:1">nodigwaa nhogolwa twaga jako siku zose na milele.<verse eid="PSA 145:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 145:2"/>Siku zose nokugwaa nhogolwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:2">nodigwaa nhogolwa twaga jako siku zose na milele.<verse eid="PSA 145:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 145:3"/>Mndewa Imulungu mkulu, na kofaya kutogoligwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:3">ukulu wake haupimigwa.<verse eid="PSA 145:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 145:4"/>Ulelo mbaka ulelo ozisimulila sang'hano zako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:4">wanhu olonga sang'hano zako ng'hulu.<verse eid="PSA 145:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 145:5"/>Olonga mbuli za ukulu wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:5">na niye nozigelegeza sang'hano zako za unzonza.<verse eid="PSA 145:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 145:6"/>Wanhu olonga mbuli zako za kudumbiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:6">na niye nosimulila ukulu wako.<verse eid="PSA 145:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 145:7"/>Osimulila wema wako mkulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:7">na okwimba kwa deng'ho mbuli ya haki yako.<verse eid="PSA 145:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 145:8"/>Mndewa Imulungu kamema bazi na kana moyo unogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:8">hagevuzika hima hima, heyo kamema unogelo hawishaga.<verse eid="PSA 145:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 145:9"/>Mndewa Imulungu kanoga kwa wanhu wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:9">kana bazi kwa viumbe vake vose.<verse eid="PSA 145:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 145:10"/>Go Mndewa Imulungu, vose vuulumbile vokugwaa nhogolwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:10">na wanhu wako otamaniligwa okutambikila.<verse eid="PSA 145:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 145:11"/>Osimulila ukulu wa undewa wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:11">na olonga udahi wako,<verse eid="PSA 145:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 145:12"/>ili wanhu wose wajuwe sang'hano zako ng'hulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:12">na ukulu wa ukunoga wa undewa wako.<verse eid="PSA 145:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 145:13"/>Undewa wako awo undewa ukala milele.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:13">Utawala wako okala ulelo mbaka ulelo.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 145:13"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:13">Mndewa Imulungu kotenda gose gayalongile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:13">na kana bazi kwa sang'hano zake zose.<verse eid="PSA 145:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 145:14"/>Mndewa Imulungu kowenula waja ogwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:14">na kowenula waja ohumwa na mizigo yao.<verse eid="PSA 145:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 145:15"/>Wose meso gao okulola gweye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:15">na gweye kowagwaa ndiya yao mkipindi kilondeka.<verse eid="PSA 145:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 145:16"/>Kokunzula kiganza chako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:16">kokigutiza kila kiumbe kili na ugima.<verse eid="PSA 145:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 145:17"/>Mndewa Imulungu kana haki mnzila zake zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:17">na kotamaniligwa na viumbe vake vose.<verse eid="PSA 145:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 145:18"/>Mndewa Imulungu kabehi na wose omkema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:18">kabehi na wose omkema kwa kweli.<verse eid="PSA 145:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 145:19"/>Kowagwaa gaja gowolonda awo omdumba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:19">heyo kohulika kililo chao na kowakombola.<verse eid="PSA 145:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 145:20"/>Mndewa Imulungu kowakaliza wose omnogela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:20">lakini kowabananga wose otenda gehile.<verse eid="PSA 145:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 145:21"/>Mulomo wangu osimulila nhogolwa za Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:21">viumbe vose vidigwee nhogolwa twaga jake ding'alile siku zose na milele.<verse eid="PSA 145:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 145"/>
  <chapter number="146" style="c" sid="PSA 146"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 146</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 146:1"/>Mtogoleni Mndewa Imulungu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:1">Loho yangu mtogole Mndewa Imulungu,<verse eid="PSA 146:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 146:2"/>Nomgwaa nhogolwa Mndewa Imulungu muugima wangu wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:2">nomwimbila nhogolwa Imulungu wangu siku zose vinikala mgima.<verse eid="PSA 146:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 146:3"/>Sikuwike tamanilo jako kwa iwakulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:3">kwa iwanhu odanganika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:3">hewo hawadaha kumkombola munhu.<verse eid="PSA 146:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 146:4"/>Mhumuzi yahalawa obwela mditimbwisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:4">siku didijo mipango yao yofa.<verse eid="PSA 146:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 146:5"/>Kamweda munhu ija yotazigwa na Imulungu wa Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:5">tamanilo jake da kwa Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wake,<verse eid="PSA 146:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 146:6"/>Heyo yalumbile ulanga na isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:6">bahali na vose vili mumo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:6">Heyo yotamaniligwa milele.<verse eid="PSA 146:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 146:7"/>Heyo kowagwaa haki waja okoneligwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:7">na kowagwaa ndiya weli na nzala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:7">Mndewa Imulungu kowalekesa waja wafungigwe.<verse eid="PSA 146:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 146:8"/>Mndewa Imulungu kowafumbula meso wasuwameso,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:8">Mndewa Imulungu kowenula waja olemelwa na mizigo yao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:8">Mndewa Imulungu kowanogela wene haki.<verse eid="PSA 146:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 146:9"/>Mndewa Imulungu kowakaliza wanhu baki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:9">kowataza wana wakiwa na wagane,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:9">lakini kozibananga nzila za wanhu wehile.<verse eid="PSA 146:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 146:10"/>Mndewa Imulungu kotawala milele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:10">Imulungu wako, gweye Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:10">kotawala ulelo mbaka ulelo.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 146:10"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:10">Mtogoleni Mndewa Imulungu.<verse eid="PSA 146:10"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 146"/>
  <chapter number="147" style="c" sid="PSA 147"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 147</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 147:1"/>Mtogoleni Mndewa Imulungu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:1">Vinoga kumgwaa nhogolwa Imulungu wetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:1">kwavija yonogeza na vivo ilondigwa kumwimbila nhogolwa heyo.<verse eid="PSA 147:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 147:2"/>Mndewa Imulungu kodizenga kabili buga da Yelusalemu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:2">kowabweza Waizilaeli wagaligwe kuuhamizo.<verse eid="PSA 147:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 147:3"/>Kowahonya wahondigwe mizoyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:3">na kovifunga vilonda vao.<verse eid="PSA 147:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 147:4"/>Kopanga nhondo zokuwa nyingahi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:4">na kozigwaa kila imoja twaga jake.<verse eid="PSA 147:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 147:5"/>Mndewa wetu mkulu na kana udahi ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:5">nzewele zake hazidahika kupimigwa.<verse eid="PSA 147:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 147:6"/>Mndewa Imulungu kowenula wahole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:6">lakini kowabwanha hasi mditimbwisi wanhu wehile.<verse eid="PSA 147:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 147:7"/>Mwimbileni Mndewa Imulungu nyila za kumgwaa nhogolwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:7">mtoweleni bango Imulungu wetu.<verse eid="PSA 147:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 147:8"/>Heyo kougubika ulanga kwa mingu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:8">koitowela mvula isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:8">na koteza minoga kuvigongo.<verse eid="PSA 147:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 147:9"/>Kowagwaa wanyama ndiya yao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:9">na kogadima makinda ga bondwa gahalila.<verse eid="PSA 147:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 147:10"/>Heyo halonda nguvu za falasi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:10">na hanogelwa na nguvu za wakalizi,<verse eid="PSA 147:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 147:11"/>lakini konogezwa na wanhu omdumba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:11">wanhu otamanila unogelo wake hawishaga.<verse eid="PSA 147:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 147:12"/>Gweye Yelusalemu, mtogole Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:12">gweye Sayuni, mtogole Imulungu wako.<verse eid="PSA 147:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 147:13"/>Kwavija heyo kaigangamiza mhalalingwe ya mulango wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:13">na kowatendela ganogile wanhu weli mgati yako.<verse eid="PSA 147:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 147:14"/>Kokugwaa tindiwalo mzimbaka zako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:14">kokutenda ushibe kwa ngano inogile.<verse eid="PSA 147:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 147:15"/>Heyo kogala lagizo jake mwiisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:15">na mbuli yake yokimbila hima hima.<verse eid="PSA 147:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 147:16"/>Kokwanzanza seluji kamba mgolole wa sufi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:16">kodipwililisa tungwe kamba tozi.<verse eid="PSA 147:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 147:17"/>Kogala mvula ya mabwe kamba msele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:17">kuduhu munhu yodaha kwima mbuli ya beho jake.<verse eid="PSA 147:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 147:18"/>Koituma mbuli yake navo volumbuka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:18">kogala beho jake na mazi gokilima.<verse eid="PSA 147:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 147:19"/>Komulongela Yakobo mbuli yake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:19">malagizo gake na mafundizo gake kwa Izilaeli.<verse eid="PSA 147:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 147:20"/>Hanatenda vivo kwa wanhu wa isi yoyose iyagwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:20">hewo hawagajuwile malagizo gake.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 147:20"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:20">Mtogoleni Mndewa Imulungu.<verse eid="PSA 147:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 147"/>
  <chapter number="148" style="c" sid="PSA 148"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 148</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 148:1"/>Mtogoleni Mndewa Imulungu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:1">Mtogoleni Mndewa Imulungu kulawa kuulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:1">mtogoleni kuko kuyeli uchanha.<verse eid="PSA 148:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 148:2"/>Mtogoleni heyo, mweye wasenga zake wose wa kuulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:2">mtogoleni heyo, mweye wakalizi wose wa kuulanga.<verse eid="PSA 148:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 148:3"/>Mtogoleni heyo, mweye zuwa na mbalamwezi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:3">mtogoleni heyo, mweye nhondo zose zing'ala.<verse eid="PSA 148:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 148:4"/>Mtogoleni heyo, mweye ulanga wa uchanha ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:4">na mweye mazi geli uchanha ya ulanga.<verse eid="PSA 148:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 148:5"/>Vose viditogole twaga da Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:5">kwavija heyo kalagiza na vose vilumbigwa.<verse eid="PSA 148:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 148:6"/>Heyo kavika hanhu hao siku zose na milele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:6">kalava lagizo hadibenigwa bule.<verse eid="PSA 148:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 148:7"/>Mtogoleni Mndewa Imulungu kulawa mwiisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:7">mweye viumbe vikulu vili mbahali na vidibo va bahali,<verse eid="PSA 148:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 148:8"/>mimwesa na mvula ya mabwe, seluji na kungugu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:8">na kukuzumbi vose vovikiza mbuli yako.<verse eid="PSA 148:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 148:9"/>Mtogoleni heyo, mweye migongo na vigongo vose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:9">mibiki ya matunda na mielezi yose.<verse eid="PSA 148:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 148:10"/>Mtogoleni heyo, mweye wanyama wa kumuhulo na ofugigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:10">na wang'onyo otambala na ndege oguluka.<verse eid="PSA 148:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 148:11"/>Mtogoleni heyo, mweye wandewa wa isi yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:11">na wakulu na watawala wa mwiisi.<verse eid="PSA 148:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 148:12"/>Mtogoleni heyo, mweye wabwanga na wandele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:12">wavele na wana.<verse eid="PSA 148:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 148:13"/>Wose waditogole twaga da Mndewa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:13">kwavija twaga jake diiyeka dijo kulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:13">ukulu wake wa uchanha ya isi na ulanga.<verse eid="PSA 148:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 148:14"/>Heyo kawagwaa wanhu zake nguvu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:14">na nhogolwa kwa wanhu zake wose otamaniligwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:14">wanhu wa Izilaeli weli behi na moyo wake.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 148:14"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:14">Mtogoleni Mndewa Imulungu.<verse eid="PSA 148:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 148"/>
  <chapter number="149" style="c" sid="PSA 149"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 149</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 149:1"/>Mtogoleni Mndewa Imulungu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 149:1">Mwimbileni Mndewa Imulungu lwila lwa sambi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 149:1">mumgwee nhogolwa mumting'hano wa wanhu otamanilwa.<verse eid="PSA 149:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 149:2"/>Waizilaeli wamdeng'helele Mulumba wao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 149:2">wanhu wa Sayuni watowe lukenze kwa Mndewa wao.<verse eid="PSA 149:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 149:3"/>Waditogole twaga jake kwa kuvina,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 149:3">wamwimbile kwa ngoma na bango.<verse eid="PSA 149:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 149:4"/>Kwavija Mndewa Imulungu konogezwa na wanhu zake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 149:4">heyo kowavaza wahole ukombola.<verse eid="PSA 149:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 149:5"/>Wanhu wang'alile wadeng'helele ukulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 149:5">na wembe kwa deng'ho mvisazi vao.<verse eid="PSA 149:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 149:6"/>Wamgwee nhogolwa Imulungu kwa sauti ng'hulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 149:6">mmakono gao wagoge masime gokanha kuno na kuno,<verse eid="PSA 149:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 149:7"/>ili wawabwezele gehile wanhu wa isi ziyagwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 149:7">wawakoboze makabila ga isi,<verse eid="PSA 149:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 149:8"/>wawafunge wandewa zao kwa minyololo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 149:8">na vilongozi zao kwa mhingu za zuma,<verse eid="PSA 149:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 149:9"/>ili kuwatendela nhaguso ilondeka kumwao.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 149:9">Uno awo ukulu wa wanhu otamaniligwa.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 149:9"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 149:9">Mtogoleni Mndewa Imulungu.<verse eid="PSA 149:9"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 149"/>
  <chapter number="150" style="c" sid="PSA 150"/>
  <para style="s">ZABULI YA 150</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 150:1"/>Mtogoleni Mndewa Imulungu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 150:1">Mtogoleni Imulungu hanhu hake hong'ala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 150:1">mtogoleni ako kuulanga wake mkulu.<verse eid="PSA 150:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 150:2"/>Mtogoleni kwa sang'hano zake ng'hulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 150:2">mtogoleni kamba ukulu wake viwili.<verse eid="PSA 150:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 150:3"/>Mtogoleni kwa mbumo wa mhalati,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 150:3">mtogoleni kwa kilimba na bango.<verse eid="PSA 150:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 150:4"/>Mtogoleni kwa ngoma na kuvina,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 150:4">mtogoleni kwa bango da nzabi longo na filimbi.<verse eid="PSA 150:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 150:5"/>Mtogoleni kwa kigoma kilila ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 150:5">mtogoleni kwa ngezi.<verse eid="PSA 150:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 150:6"/>Kila kiumbe kili na ugima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 150:6">kimtogole Mndewa Imulungu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 150:6"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 150:6">Mtogoleni Mndewa Imulungu.<verse eid="PSA 150:6"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 150"/>
</usx>
